析和クリニカルテーミノロジー","ja":"FHIR API AIエージェントはApache Sparkに基づいており、クリニカルテーミノロジー分析を実行","ko":"FHIR API 인공지능 에이전트는 Apache Spark 기반으로 의료 데이터 분석과 クリニカルテーミノロジー 를 지원","es":"Herramientas FHIR API para análisis de datos con Apache Spark, facilitando el uso de FHIR y terminología clínica","fr":"Outils FHIR API pour l''analyse de données avec Apache Spark, facilitant l''utilisation de FHIR et de la terminologie clinique","de":"FHIR API Tools für Datenanalyse mit Apache Spark, erleichtern den Einsatz von FHIR und klinischer Terminologie","pt":"As ferramentas de IA para FHIR API facilitam o uso de FHIR e terminologia clínica na análise de dados, construídas em cima do Apache Spark","ru":"ИИ Агенты для FHIR API облегчают использование FHIR и клинической терминологии в анализе данных, построенные на Apache Spark","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ل FHIR API تسهل استخدام FHIR والترميز السريري في تحليل البيانات، مبنية على Apache Spark","en":"Tools that make it easier to use FHIR and clinical terminology within data analytics, built on Apache Spark."},"definition":{"en":"Tools that make it easier to use FHIR and clinical terminology within data analytics, built on Apache Spark."},"features":{"zh":["基于Apache Spark的医疗数据分析","支持クリニカルテーミノロジー分析","易于使用的FHIR API接口","高性能的数据处理能力","支持多种数据格式"],"ja":["Apache Sparkに基づくクリニカルテーミノロジー分析","FHIR APIの簡単な使用","高性能のデータ処理機能","複数のデータ形式のサポート","医療データ分析のサポート"],"ko":["Apache Spark 기반의 의료 데이터 분석","クリニカルテーミノロジー 분석 지원","쉽게 사용할 수 있는 FHIR API 인터페이스","고성능의 데이터 처리 능력","多种 데이터 형식 지원"],"es":["Integración con Apache Spark","Uso de FHIR y terminología clínica","Análisis de datos de salud","Herramientas para desarrolladores","Compatibilidad con estándares de salud"],"fr":["Intégration avec Apache Spark","Utilisation de FHIR et de la terminologie clinique","Analyse de données de santé","Outils pour développeurs","Compatibilité avec les normes de santé"],"de":["Integration mit Apache Spark","Einsatz von FHIR und klinischer Terminologie","Datenanalyse im Gesundheitswesen","Tools für Entwickler","Kompatibilität mit Gesundheitsstandards"],"pt":["Integração com Apache Spark","Suporte a FHIR e terminologia clínica","Análise de dados clínicos avançada","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos de saúde personalizados","Segurança e conformidade de dados"],"ru":["Интеграция с Apache Spark","Поддержка FHIR и клинической терминологии","Продвинутый анализ клинических данных","Разработка индивидуальных приложений для здравоохранения","Безопасность и соответствие данным"],"ar":["التكامل مع Apache Spark","دعم FHIR والترميز السريري","تحليل البيانات السريرية المتقدم","تطوير تطبيقات الرعاية الصحية المخصصة","أمان وامتثال البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["FHIR API智能工具","医疗数据分析","クリニカルテーミノロジー分析","Apache Spark","如何使用FHIR API","FHIR API安装","FHIR API设置指南"],"ja":["FHIR API AIエージェント","クリニカルテーミノロジー分析","医療データ分析","Apache Spark","FHIR APIの使い方","FHIR APIのインストール","FHIR APIの設定ガイド"],"ko":["FHIR API 인공지능 에이전트","의료 데이터 분석","クリニカルテーミノロジー 분석","Apache Spark","FHIR API 사용법","FHIR API 설치","FHIR API 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas FHIR API","análisis de datos de salud","cómo usar FHIR","qué es FHIR","alternativas a FHIR","FHIR vs HL7","instalación de FHIR API","guía de configuración de FHIR"],"fr":["outils FHIR API","analyse de données de santé","comment utiliser FHIR","qu''est-ce que FHIR","alternatives à FHIR","FHIR vs HL7","installation de FHIR API","guide de configuration de FHIR"],"de":["FHIR API Tools","Datenanalyse im Gesundheitswesen","wie man FHIR verwendet","was ist FHIR","Alternativen zu FHIR","FHIR vs HL7","Installation von FHIR API","Konfigurationsanleitung für FHIR"],"pt":["como usar FHIR API","o que é FHIR API","FHIR API alternativa","FHIR API vs outras ferramentas","instalar FHIR API","guia de configuração FHIR API","análise de dados clínicos com FHIR API","desenvolvimento de aplicativos de saúde com FHIR API"],"ru":["как использовать FHIR API","что такое FHIR API","ИИ Агенты для FHIR API","FHIR API альтернатива","FHIR API vs другие инструменты","установить FHIR API","руководство по настройке FHIR API","анализ клинических данных с FHIR API","разработка приложений для здравоохранения с FHIR API"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام FHIR API","ما هي FHIR API","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ل FHIR API","بديل FHIR API","FHIR API مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت FHIR API","دليل إعداد FHIR API","تحليل البيانات السريرية مع FHIR API","تطوير تطبيقات الرعاية الصحية مع FHIR API"]}},"owner":"aehrc","repo":"pathling","repoPath":"aehrc/pathling","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.943Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fhir-api","description":"Expert guidance for implementing FHIR RESTful API servers and clients following the HL7 FHIR specification. Use this skill when implementing a FHIR server with REST endpoints, building a FHIR client, designing FHIR API routes and handlers, implementing FHIR operations (read, create, update, delete, search, history), working with FHIR bundles, batch requests, or transactions, handling FHIR content negotiation, headers, and versioning, or implementing conditional operations. Trigger keywords include FHIR REST, FHIR API, FHIR server, FHIR client, FHIR endpoint, FHIR operations, RESTful FHIR, implement FHIR.","bodyPreview":"# FHIR REST API implementation\n\nThis skill provides guidance for implementing FHIR RESTful APIs according to the HL7 FHIR specification (R4/R5).\n\n## URL structure\n\nAll FHIR REST URLs follow the pattern:\n\n```\n[base]/[type]/[id]\n```\n\n- `[base]`: Service base URL (e.g., `https://fhir.example.org/r4`)\n- `[type]`: Resource type (e.g., `Patient`, `Observation`)\n- `[id]`: Logical resource ID\n\nURLs are case-sensitive and use UTF-8 encoding.\n\n## Core operations\n\n| Operation         | HTTP     | URL Patte","body":"# FHIR REST API implementation\n\nThis skill provides guidance for implementing FHIR RESTful APIs according to the HL7 FHIR specification (R4/R5).\n\n## URL structure\n\nAll FHIR REST URLs follow the pattern:\n\n```\n[base]/[type]/[id]\n```\n\n- `[base]`: Service base URL (e.g., `https://fhir.example.org/r4`)\n- `[type]`: Resource type (e.g., `Patient`, `Observation`)\n- `[id]`: Logical resource ID\n\nURLs are case-sensitive and use UTF-8 encoding.\n\n## Core operations\n\n| Operation         | HTTP     | URL Pattern                         | Success |\n| ----------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------- | ------- |\n| Read              | GET      | `[base]/[type]/[id]`                | 200     |\n| VRead             | GET      | `[base]/[type]/[id]/_history/[vid]` | 200     |\n| Create            | POST     | `[base]/[type]`                     | 201     |\n| Update            | PUT      | `[base]/[type]/[id]`                | 200/201 |\n| Patch             | PATCH    | `[base]/[type]/[id]`                | 200     |\n| Delete            | DELETE   | `[base]/[type]/[id]`                | 200/204 |\n| Search            | GET/POST | `[base]/[type]?params`              | 200     |\n| History           | GET      | `[base]/[type]/[id]/_history`       | 200     |\n| Capabilities      | GET      | `[base]/metadata`                   | 200     |\n| Batch/Transaction | POST     | `[base]`                            | 200     |\n\nFor detailed specifications of each operation, see [references/operations.md](references/operations.md).\n\n## Content negotiation\n\n### MIME types\n\n| Format | MIME Type                 |\n| ------ | ------------------------- |\n| JSON   | `application/fhir+json`   |\n| XML    | `application/fhir+xml`    |\n| RDF    | `application/fhir+turtle` |\n\nUse the `Accept` header for response format and `Content-Type` for request body format.\n\nThe `_format` query parameter overrides `Accept` when clients cannot set headers.\n\n### FHIR version\n\nSpecify version via MIME type parameter:\n\n```\nAccept: application/fhir+json; fhirVersion=4.0\n```\n\nVersion mappings: 1.0 (R2), 3.0 (R3), 4.0 (R4), 4.3 (R4B), 5.0 (R5).\n\n## Required headers\n\n### Request headers\n\n| Header        | Purpose             | Example                 |\n| ------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Accept        | Response format     | `application/fhir+json` |\n| Content-Type  | Request body format | `application/fhir+json` |\n| If-Match      | Optimistic locking  | `W/\"123\"`               |\n| If-None-Exist | Conditional create  | `identifier=123`        |\n| Prefer        | Return preference   | `return=representation` |\n\n### Response headers\n\n| Header        | Purpose            | Example                         |\n| ------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| ETag          | Version identifier | `W/\"123\"`                       |\n| Location      | New resource URL   | `[base]/Patient/123/_history/1` |\n| Last-Modified | Modification time  | RFC 7231 date                   |\n\n## Versioning and optimistic locking\n\nFHIR uses weak ETags for version tracking:\n\n1. Server returns `ETag: W/\"[versionId]\"` with responses\n2. Client sends `If-Match: W/\"[versionId]\"` with updates\n3. Server returns `412 Precondition Failed` if version mismatch\n\nImplement version-aware updates when `CapabilityStatement.rest.resource.versioning` is `versioned-update`.\n\n## Error handling\n\nReturn `OperationOutcome` resources for all errors:\n\n```json\n{\n    \"resourceType\": \"OperationOutcome\",\n    \"issue\": [\n        {\n            \"severity\": \"error\",\n            \"code\": \"invalid\",\n            \"diagnostics\": \"Patient.birthDate: Invalid date format\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n### Status codes\n\n| Code | Meaning                                |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------- |\n| 400  | Invalid syntax or validation failure   |\n| 404  | Resource not found                     |\n| 409  | Version conflict                       |\n| 410  | Resource deleted                       |\n| 412  | Precondition failed (version mismatch) |\n| 422  | Business rule violation                |\n\n## Prefer header\n\nControl response content with `Prefer`:\n\n| Value                     | Response body        |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `return=minimal`          | Empty (headers only) |\n| `return=representation`   | Full resource        |\n| `return=OperationOutcome` | Validation outcome   |\n\nFor async operations, use `Prefer: respond-async` to get `202 Accepted` with status polling URL.\n\n## Implementation checklist\n\nServer implementations should:\n\n1. Implement CapabilityStatement at `/metadata`\n2. Support content negotiation (JSON at minimum)\n3. Return proper ETags for versioned resources\n4. Include `Location` header on create/update\n5. Return `OperationOutcome` for all errors\n6. Support `_format` parameter fallback\n7. Honour `Prefer` header for response content\n\n## References\n\n- [operations.md](references/operations.md): Detailed operation specifications\n- [search.md](references/search.md): Search parameter and result handling\n- [batch-transaction.md](references/batch-transaction.md): Batch and transaction processing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:10:26.859Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Healthcare Agents needing to implement FHIR RESTful APIs for clinical data exchange.","zh":"非常适合需要实现FHIR RESTful APIs用于临床数据交换的医疗保健代理。","ja":"FHIR RESTful APIを使用した臨床データの交換を実装する必要があるヘルスケアエージェントに最適です。","ko":"临床数据交换을 위한 FHIR RESTful API를 구현해야 하는 헬스케어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de atención médica que necesitan implementar API RESTful de FHIR para el intercambio de datos clínicos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de soins de santé ayant besoin de mettre en œuvre des API RESTful FHIR pour l''échange de données cliniques.","de":"Perfekt für Healthcare-Agents, die FHIR-REST-APIs für den Austausch von klinischen Daten implementieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Saúde que precisam implementar APIs RESTful FHIR para troca de dados clínicos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов здравоохранения, которым необходимо реализовать RESTful API FHIR для обмена клиническими данными.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الصحيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ واجهات برمجة تطبيقات RESTful FHIR لتبادل البيانات السريرية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build compliant FHIR REST APIs using Apache Spark, facilitating standardized clinical data analytics and exchange via the HL7 FHIR specification, including support for FHIR R4 and R5, and handling resources like Patient and Observation.","zh":"使代理能够使用Apache Spark构建兼容FHIR REST API，从而实现标准化的临床数据分析和交换，通过HL7 FHIR规范，包括对FHIR R4和R5的支持，并处理Patient和Observation等资源。","ja":"エージェントがApache Sparkを使用してFHIR REST APIを構築できるようにし、HL7 FHIR仕様を介して標準化された臨床データ分析および交換を可能にし、FHIR R4およびR5をサポートし、PatientやObservationなどのリソースを処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 Apache Spark를 사용하여 FHIR REST API를 구축할 수 있도록 하여 HL7 FHIR 사양을 통해 표준화된 임상 데이터 분석 및 교환을 가능하게 하며 FHIR R4 및 R5를 지원하고 Patient 및 Observation 등의 리소스를 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear API REST de FHIR compatibles utilizando Apache Spark, lo que facilita el análisis y el intercambio de datos clínicos estandarizados a través de la especificación HL7 FHIR, incluyendo soporte para FHIR R4 y R5, y manejo de recursos como Patient y Observation.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des API REST FHIR conformes en utilisant Apache Spark, ce qui facilite l''analyse et l''échange de données cliniques standardisées via la spécification HL7 FHIR, y compris la prise en charge de FHIR R4 et R5, et la gestion de ressources comme Patient et Observation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, mithilfe von Apache Spark konforme FHIR-REST-APIs zu erstellen, was die standardisierte Analyse und den Austausch von klinischen Daten über die HL7-FHIR-Spezifikation erleichtert, einschließlich Unterstützung für FHIR R4 und R5 sowie Handhabung von Ressourcen wie Patient und Observation.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir APIs REST FHIR conformes usando Apache Spark, facilitando a análise e troca de dados clínicos padronizados via especificação HL7 FHIR, incluindo suporte para FHIR R4 e R5, e manipulação de recursos como Paciente e Observação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать соответствующие API REST FHIR, используя Apache Spark, облегчая стандартизированную аналитику и обмен клиническими данными через спецификацию HL7 FHIR, включая поддержку FHIR R4 и R5, а также обработку ресурсов, таких как Пациент и Наблюдение.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء APIs REST FHIR المتوافقة باستخدام Apache Spark، و تسهيل تحليل البيانات السريرية وتبادلها بشكل قياسي عبر مواصفة HL7 FHIR، بما في ذلك دعم FHIR R4 و R5، و معالجة موارد مثل المريض والملاحظة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing FHIR RESTful APIs for electronic health records","Analyzing clinical data using Apache Spark","Validating FHIR resource IDs and URLs"],"zh":["实现电子健康记录的FHIR RESTful API","使用Apache Spark分析临床数据","验证FHIR资源ID和URL"],"ja":["電子ヘルスレコードのFHIR RESTful APIの実装","Apache Sparkを使用した臨床データの分析","FHIRリソースIDおよびURLの検証"],"ko":["전자 건강 기록을 위한 FHIR RESTful API 구현","Apache Spark를 사용한 임상 데이터 분석","FHIR 리소스 ID 및 URL 확인"],"es":["Implementación de API RESTful de FHIR para registros electrónicos de salud","Análisis de datos clínicos utilizando Apache Spark","Validación de IDs y URLs de recursos FHIR"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''API RESTful FHIR pour les dossiers médicaux électroniques","Analyse de données cliniques à l''aide d''Apache Spark","Validation des ID et des URL de ressources FHIR"],"de":["Implementierung von FHIR-REST-APIs für elektronische Gesundheitsakten","Analyse von klinischen Daten mit Apache Spark","Validierung von FHIR-Ressourcen-IDs und -URLs"],"pt":["Implementação de APIs RESTful FHIR para registros eletrônicos de saúde","Análise de dados clínicos usando Apache Spark","Validação de IDs de recursos FHIR e URLs"],"ru":["Реализация RESTful API FHIR для электронных медицинских записей","Анализ клинических данных с помощью Apache Spark","Проверка идентификаторов ресурсов FHIR и URL-адресов"],"ar":["تنفيذ واجهات برمجة تطبيقات RESTful FHIR لسجلات الصحة الإلكترونية","تحليل البيانات السريرية باستخدام Apache Spark","التحقق من معرفات موارد FHIR والعناوين URL"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of HL7 FHIR specification","Case-sensitive and UTF-8 encoding compliance necessary","Apache Spark dependency"],"zh":["需要了解HL7 FHIR规范","需要符合区分大小写和UTF-8编码","依赖Apache Spark"],"ja":["HL7 FHIR仕様の知識が必要","大文字と小文字を区別し、UTF-8エンコードに準拠する必要がある","Apache Sparkに依存する"],"ko":["HL7 FHIR 사양에 대한 지식이 필요","대/소문자 구분 및 UTF-8 인코딩 준수 필요","Apache Spark 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la especificación HL7 FHIR","Cumplimiento de la codificación case-sensitive y UTF-8 necesario","Dependencia de Apache Spark"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de la spécification HL7 FHIR","Conformité à la codage case-sensitive et UTF-8 nécessaire","Dépendance d''Apache Spark"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der HL7-FHIR-Spezifikation","Einhaltung der case-sensitiven und UTF-8-Codierung erforderlich","Abhängigkeit von Apache Spark"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento da especificação HL7 FHIR","Necessária conformidade com codificação sensível a maiúsculas e minúsculas e UTF-8","Dependência do Apache Spark"],"ru":["Требуется знание спецификации HL7 FHIR","Необходимо соблюдение регистрозависимой и UTF-8 кодировки","Зависимость от Apache Spark"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمواصفة HL7 FHIR","الامتثال لحساسية الحروف الكبيرة والصغيرة والترميز UTF-8 ضروري","اعتماد على Apache Spark"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5ec4f887506c74dc0dad984343747526ed812bc07567c061037c408dbaef5dda","qualityScore":36}');
