ils inspirés de shadcn/ui","Utilisation d''ERB pour la création de modèles","Intégration avec Tailwind CSS pour la conception","Prise en charge de Stimulus pour une interaction progressive","Compatibilité avec les projets d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Rails-UI-Komponenten inspiriert von shadcn/ui","Verwendung von ERB für die Erstellung von Vorlagen","Integration mit Tailwind CSS für das Design","Unterstützung für Stimulus für eine progressive Interaktion","Kompatibilität mit KI-Projekten"],"pt":["Componentes de interface do usuário inspirados em shadcn/ui","Uso de ERB para templates","Integração com Tailwind CSS para estilos","Suporte a Stimulus para uma experiência de usuário progressiva"],"ru":["Компоненты пользовательского интерфейса, вдохновленные shadcn/ui","Использование ERB для шаблонов","Интеграция с Tailwind CSS для стилей","Поддержка Stimulus для прогрессивного опыта пользователя"],"ar":["مكونات واجهة المستخدم الملهمة من شادسن/يوي","استخدام إر بي للقوالب","التكامل مع تيلويند سي إس للأسلوب","دعم ستيمولوس لتجربة مستخدم متقدمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Contributing","什么是Shadcn/UI","Rails UI组件","Tailwind CSS教程","Stimulus入门","Contributing安装","Contributing设置指南"],"ja":["Contributingの使い方","Shadcn/UIとは","Rails UIコンポーネント","Tailwind CSSチュートリアル","Stimulusの基礎","Contributingのインストール","Contributingの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Contributing 사용 방법","Shadcn/UI란","Rails UI 컴포넌트","Tailwind CSS 튜토리얼","Stimulus 기초","Contributing 설치","Contributing 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de contribución de AI","componentes UI de Rails","cómo utilizar Rails para la inteligencia artificial","alternativas a shadcn/ui","guía de instalación de Rails para la contribución de AI"," Tailwind CSS en proyectos de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["outils de contribution IA","composants UI Rails","comment utiliser Rails pour l''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à shadcn/ui","guide d''installation de Rails pour la contribution IA","Tailwind CSS dans les projets d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["AI-Beitragstools","Rails-UI-Komponenten","wie man Rails für die KI verwendet","Alternativen zu shadcn/ui","Installationsanleitung für Rails für die AI-Beiträge","Tailwind CSS in KI-Projekten"],"pt":["como usar rails ui","o que é shadcn/ui","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","rails ui vs react","instalar rails ui","guia de configuração do rails ui"],"ru":["как использовать rails ui","что такое shadcn/ui","инструменты ии для разработчиков","rails ui vs react","установить rails ui","руководство по настройке rails ui"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام واجهة المستخدم للريلز","ما هي شادسن/يوي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","واجهة المستخدم للريلز مقابل رياكت","تثبيت واجهة المستخدم للريلز","دليل إعداد واجهة المستخدم للريلز"]}},"owner":"steveclarke","repo":"kiso","repoPath":"steveclarke/kiso","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T01:40:24Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"contributing","description":"Kiso component conventions and development workflow. Points to the right docs for building, reviewing, and shipping components.","bodyPreview":"# Kiso Development\n\nGuidelines for contributing to the Kiso component library.\n\n## Where to find what\n\n| Topic | File |\n|-------|------|\n| **Building a component** | `project/component-creation.md` — full workflow, templates, checklist |\n| **Reviewing a component** | `project/component-review.md` — 12-point checklist, common mistakes |\n| **Design system rules** | `project/design-system.md` — compound variants, tokens, spatial system |\n| **Architecture patterns** | `project/component-strategy.md`","body":"# Kiso Development\n\nGuidelines for contributing to the Kiso component library.\n\n## Where to find what\n\n| Topic | File |\n|-------|------|\n| **Building a component** | `project/component-creation.md` — full workflow, templates, checklist |\n| **Reviewing a component** | `project/component-review.md` — 12-point checklist, common mistakes |\n| **Design system rules** | `project/design-system.md` — compound variants, tokens, spatial system |\n| **Architecture patterns** | `project/component-strategy.md` — ClassVariants, override system |\n| **Testing strategy** | `project/testing-strategy.md` — tier system, E2E requirements |\n| **Docs page template** | `project/component-doc-template.md` — structure and guidelines |\n| **All conventions** | `CLAUDE.md` — framework mindset, naming, code rules |\n\n## Project structure\n\n```\nlib/kiso/themes/              Ruby theme modules (ClassVariants definitions)\napp/views/kiso/components/    ERB partials (rendered via kui() helper)\napp/assets/tailwind/kiso/     engine.css — shipped with gem (fonts + all color tokens)\napp/helpers/kiso/             kui(), kiso_prepare_options() helpers\napp/javascript/controllers/kiso/  Stimulus controllers (namespaced kiso--)\napp/javascript/kiso/utils/    Shared JS utilities (positioning, highlight, focusable)\ntest/components/previews/kiso/  Lookbook previews + templates\nskills/kiso/                  AI skill (update when adding components)\nproject/                      Architecture docs, design system, decisions\ndocs/                         Bridgetown docs site (published documentation)\nlookbook/                     Lookbook dev app (bin/dev → port 4001)\n```\n\n## CSS architecture\n\n**`app/assets/tailwind/kiso/engine.css`** is what the gem ships. It contains\nGeist fonts, all default color tokens (`@theme`), dark mode overrides\n(`.dark {}`), and `@source` directives for Kiso''s views, helpers, and theme\nmodules. **Never put color tokens in the Lookbook''s `application.css`** — they\nbelong in `engine.css` so host apps get them too.\n\nThe `tailwindcss:engines` Rake task (from `tailwindcss-rails` v4) automatically\ndetects any Rails engine with `app/assets/tailwind/{engine_name}/engine.css`\nand generates `app/assets/builds/tailwind/{engine_name}.css`. Kiso''s engine\nname is `kiso`, so the directory must be `app/assets/tailwind/kiso/`.\n\n**Lookbook setup:** `lookbook/app/assets/tailwind/application.css` imports the\nauto-generated engine file and adds Lookbook-specific source paths:\n\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n@import \"../builds/tailwind/kiso.css\";\n\n@source \"../../views\";\n@source \"../../../../test/components/previews\";\n```\n\n## Pull request workflow\n\n**Always include `Closes #N` in the PR body** so GitHub auto-closes the issue\non merge. This is the most commonly missed step.\n\n```bash\n# Create branch\ngit checkout -b feat/{name}-component\n\n# Stage specific files (never git add -A)\ngit add lib/kiso/themes/{name}.rb app/views/kiso/components/...\n\n# Commit\ngit commit -m \"feat: ComponentName component (#N)\"\n\n# Push and create PR\ngit push -u origin feat/{name}-component\ngh pr create --title \"feat: ComponentName component\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n- [what was built]\n\nCloses #N\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] All Lookbook previews render (200)\n- [x] standardrb passes\n- [x] rake test passes\n- [ ] Visual review in Lookbook\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\nbin/dev                         # All services via Overmind (Lookbook :4001 + docs :4000)\nbin/dev -- -l web,css           # Lookbook + Tailwind only (no docs)\nbin/worktree start              # Start on worktree-assigned port\nbin/worktree port               # Show port for current worktree\novermind restart web            # Restart Lookbook server\nbundle exec rake test           # Run Ruby tests\nnpm run test:unit               # Run JS unit tests (Vitest)\nnpm run test:e2e                # Run Playwright E2E tests (needs bin/dev)\nnpm run test:e2e:ui             # Open Playwright GUI\nbundle exec standardrb --fix    # Lint & auto-format Ruby\nnpm run lint                    # Lint JS (oxlint)\nnpm run fmt                     # Format JS (oxfmt)\n```\n\n## Worktree workflow\n\nSee `.claude/skills/worktree/SKILL.md` for the full worktree lifecycle\n(create, start Lookbook, commit, push, PR, cleanup). Key command:\n`bin/worktree start` — starts Lookbook on a deterministic port (4101-4600).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T03:45:28.664Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to integrate with Rails UI components and contribute to open-source libraries using ERB partials and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要与Rails UI组件集成并为使用ERB部分和Tailwind CSS的开源库做出贡献的前端代理。","ja":"Rails UIコンポーネントと統合し、ERBパーシャルとTailwind CSSを使用するオープンソースライブラリに貢献する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Rails UI 컴포넌트와 통합하고 ERB 부분 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하는 오픈소스 라이브러리에 기여해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan integrarse con componentes de interfaz de usuario de Rails y contribuir a bibliotecas de código abierto utilizando particiones ERB y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui doivent intégrer des composants d''interface utilisateur Rails et contribuer à des bibliothèques open source en utilisant des parties ERB et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die sich in Rails-Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten integrieren und zu Open-Source-Bibliotheken mit ERB-Partials und Tailwind CSS beitragen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam integrar-se com componentes UI do Rails e contribuir para bibliotecas de código aberto usando partials ERB e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо интегрироваться с компонентами UI Rails и вносить вклад в открытое программное обеспечение с помощью частей ERB и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى التكامل مع مكونات واجهة المستخدم الريلز والمساهمة في المكتبات مفتوحة المصدر باستخدام أجزاء ERB وتايل ويند سي إس إس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build and review components using a 12-point checklist, adhere to design system rules with compound variants and tokens, and follow architecture patterns defined in component-strategy.md, all utilizing Stimulus for progressive enhancements.","zh":"赋予代理构建和审查组件的能力，使用12点清单，遵循设计系统规则，使用复合变体和令牌，并遵循component-strategy.md中定义的架构模式，所有这些都使用Stimulus进行渐进增强。","ja":"エージェントにコンポーネントを構築してレビューする能力を付与します。12点のチェックリストを使用して、設計システムのルールに従い、複合バリアントとトークンを使用し、component-strategy.mdで定義されたアーキテクチャパターンに従います。すべてこれらの機能はStimulusを使用したプログレッシブエンハンスメントで利用できます。","ko":"에이전트가 컴포넌트를 구축하고 검토할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 12점 체크리스트를 사용하여 디자인 시스템 규칙을 준수하고, 복합 변형 및 토큰을 사용하며, component-strategy.md에서 정의된 아키텍처 패턴을 따르며, 모든 기능을 Stimulus를 사용하여渐进增强 기능을 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y revisar componentes utilizando una lista de verificación de 12 puntos, a adherirse a las reglas del sistema de diseño con variantes compuestas y tokens, y a seguir patrones de arquitectura definidos en component-strategy.md, todo utilizando Stimulus para mejoras progresivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de réviser des composants à l''aide d''une liste de vérification de 12 points, d''adhérer aux règles du système de conception avec des variantes composées et des jetons, et de suivre des modèles d''architecture définis dans component-strategy.md, le tout en utilisant Stimulus pour des améliorations progressives.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Komponenten mit einer 12-Punkte-Checkliste zu erstellen und zu überprüfen, den Regeln des Designsystems mit zusammengesetzten Varianten und Token zu folgen und Architekturmuster zu befolgen, die in component-strategy.md definiert sind, alles unter Verwendung von Stimulus für progressive Verbesserungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir e revisar componentes usando uma lista de verificação de 12 pontos, aderir a regras do sistema de design com variantes compostas e tokens, e seguir padrões de arquitetura definidos em component-strategy.md, tudo utilizando Stimulus para melhorias progressivas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и проверять компоненты с помощью 12-точечного чек-листа, соблюдать правила системы дизайна с составными вариантами и токенами, а также следовать шаблонам архитектуры, определенным в component-strategy.md, все это с использованием Stimulus для постепенных улучшений.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على بناء ومراجعة المكونات باستخدام قائمة مراجعة من 12 نقطة، والالتزام بقواعد نظام التصميم مع المتغيرات المركبة والرموز، واتباع أنماط العمارة المحددة في component-strategy.md، وجميعها باستخدام Stimulus لتحسينات تدريجية."},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom UI components with ERB partials and Tailwind CSS","Reviewing component submissions for adherence to design system rules","Implementing architecture patterns for component development"],"zh":["使用ERB部分和Tailwind CSS构建自定义UI组件","审查组件提交以确保遵守设计系统规则","实施组件开发的架构模式"],"ja":["ERBパーシャルとTailwind CSSを使用してカスタムUIコンポーネントを構築する","設計システムのルールに従っていることを確認するためにコンポーネントの提出物をレビューする","コンポーネント開発のアーキテクチャパターンを実装する"],"ko":["ERB 부분 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 사용자 지정 UI 컴포넌트를 구축하는","디자인 시스템 규칙을 준수하는지 확인하기 위해 컴포넌트 제출물을 검토하는","컴포넌트 개발을 위한 아키텍처 패턴을 구현하는"],"es":["Creación de componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados con particiones ERB y Tailwind CSS","Revisión de envíos de componentes para garantizar el cumplimiento de las reglas del sistema de diseño","Implementación de patrones de arquitectura para el desarrollo de componentes"],"fr":["Création de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés avec des parties ERB et Tailwind CSS","Révision des soumissions de composants pour assurer le respect des règles du système de conception","Mise en œuvre de modèles d''architecture pour le développement de composants"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit ERB-Partials und Tailwind CSS","Überprüfung von Komponenteneinreichungen auf Einhaltung der Designsystemregeln","Implementierung von Architekturmuster für die Komponentenentwicklung"],"pt":["Construção de componentes UI personalizados com partials ERB e Tailwind CSS","Revisão de envios de componentes para aderência às regras do sistema de design","Implementação de padrões de arquitetura para desenvolvimento de componentes"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских компонентов UI с частями ERB и Tailwind CSS","Проверка отправок компонентов на соответствие правилам системы дизайна","Реализация шаблонов архитектуры для разработки компонентов"],"ar":["بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة بأجزاء ERB وتايل ويند سي إس إس","مراجعة إرسال المكونات للامتثال لقواعد نظام التصميم","تنفيذ أنماط العمارة لتطوير المكونات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Rails, ERB, and Tailwind CSS","Limited to contributing to the Kiso component library"],"zh":["需要了解Rails、ERB和Tailwind CSS","仅限于为Kiso组件库做出贡献"],"ja":["Rails、ERB、Tailwind CSSに関する知識が必要","Kisoコンポーネントライブラリへの貢献に限定される"],"ko":["Rails, ERB 및 Tailwind CSS에 대한 지식이 필요","Kiso 컴포넌트 라이브러리에 기여하는 것만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de Rails, ERB y Tailwind CSS","Limitado a contribuir a la biblioteca de componentes Kiso"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Rails, ERB et Tailwind CSS","Limité à contribuer à la bibliothèque de composants Kiso"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Rails, ERB und Tailwind CSS","Begrenzt auf die Mitarbeit an der Kiso-Komponentenbibliothek"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Rails, ERB e Tailwind CSS","Limitado à contribuição para a biblioteca de componentes Kiso"],"ru":["Требует знания Rails, ERB и Tailwind CSS","Ограничен вкладом в библиотеку компонентов Kiso"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ريلز، ERB وتايل ويند سي إس إس","محدود للمساهمة في مكتبة مكونات كيسو"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b4058a142afc312e1a397d9c96c52290bd615b86a2a168037af547043a6f9943","qualityScore":36}');
