anobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of handling complex tasks through a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration."},"features":{"zh":["Ultra-lightweight","Extensible","Personal AI assistant","Robust agent loop","Memory system","Tool integration"],"ja":["Ultra-lightweight","Extensible","Personal AI assistant","Robust agent loop","Memory system","Tool integration"],"ko":["Ultra-lightweight","Extensible","Personal AI assistant","Robust agent loop","Memory system","Tool integration"],"es":["Marco ultra ligero y extensible","Construido con TypeScript","Diseñado para manejar tareas complejas","Integración de herramientas y memoria","Bucle de agente robusto"],"fr":["Cadre ultra léger et extensible","Construit avec TypeScript","Conçu pour gérer des tâches complexes","Intégration d''outils et de mémoire","Boucle d''agent robuste"],"de":["Ultra-leichtes und erweiterbares Framework","Entwickelt mit TypeScript","Entworfen für komplexe Aufgaben","Integration von Tools und Speicher","Robuster Agenten-Loop"],"pt":["Framework de assistente AI pessoal","Construído com TypeScript","Loop de agente robusto","Sistema de memória","Integração de ferramentas"],"ru":["Ультралегкий фреймворк для личного помощника","Построен на TypeScript","Робустный агентский цикл","Система памяти","Интеграция инструментов"],"ar":["إطار عمل خفيف الوزن للوكيل الشخصي الذكاء الاصطناعي","مبني على TypeScript","حلقة وكيل قوية","نظام الذاكرة","تكامل الأدوات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI Agent","AI Tool","TypeScript","Personal AI assistant","Ultra-lightweight","Extensible","Robust agent loop","Memory system","Tool integration"],"ja":["AI Agent","AI Tool","TypeScript","Personal AI assistant","Ultra-lightweight","Extensible","Robust agent loop","Memory system","Tool integration"],"ko":["AI Agent","AI Tool","TypeScript","Personal AI assistant","Ultra-lightweight","Extensible","Robust agent loop","Memory system","Tool integration"],"es":["cómo utilizar baoyu-post-to-x","qué es un Agente AI","alternativa a baoyu-post-to-x","baoyu-post-to-x vs otros agentes AI","instalación de baoyu-post-to-x","guía de configuración de baoyu-post-to-x","desarrollo de agentes AI con TypeScript"],"fr":["comment utiliser baoyu-post-to-x","qu''est-ce qu''un Agent AI","alternative à baoyu-post-to-x","baoyu-post-to-x vs autres agents AI","installation de baoyu-post-to-x","guide de configuration de baoyu-post-to-x","développement d''agents AI avec TypeScript"],"de":["wie man baoyu-post-to-x verwendet","was ist ein AI-Agent","Alternative zu baoyu-post-to-x","baoyu-post-to-x vs andere AI-Agents","Installation von baoyu-post-to-x","Konfigurationsanleitung für baoyu-post-to-x","Entwicklung von AI-Agents mit TypeScript"],"pt":["como usar assistente AI","o que é agente AI","baoyu-post-to-x alternativa","baoyu-post-to-x vs outros agentes","instalar baoyu-post-to-x","guia de configuração do baoyu-post-to-x"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент","что такое ИИ Агент","ИИ Агент baoyu-post-to-x альтернатива","ИИ Агент baoyu-post-to-x vs другие агенты","установить ИИ Агент baoyu-post-to-x","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента baoyu-post-to-x"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي baoyu-post-to-x بديل","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي baoyu-post-to-x مقابل وكلاء آخرين","تثبيت وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي baoyu-post-to-x","دليل إعداد وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي baoyu-post-to-x"]}},"owner":"chengyihua","repo":"nanobot-ts","repoPath":"chengyihua/nanobot-ts","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T12:47:24.659Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-post-to-x","description":"Posts content and articles to X (Twitter). Supports regular posts with images/videos and X Articles (long-form Markdown). Uses real Chrome with CDP to bypass anti-automation. Use when user asks to post to X, tweet, publish to Twitter, or share on X.","bodyPreview":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | P","body":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/x-browser.ts` | Regular posts (text + images) |\n| `scripts/x-video.ts` | Video posts (text + video) |\n| `scripts/x-quote.ts` | Quote tweet with comment |\n| `scripts/x-article.ts` | Long-form article publishing (Markdown) |\n| `scripts/md-to-html.ts` | Markdown → HTML conversion |\n| `scripts/copy-to-clipboard.ts` | Copy content to clipboard |\n| `scripts/paste-from-clipboard.ts` | Send real paste keystroke |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                       Path                       │     Location      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default Chrome profile | Auto-submit preference\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Google Chrome or Chromium\n- `bun` runtime\n- First run: log in to X manually (session saved)\n\n## References\n\n- **Regular Posts**: See `references/regular-posts.md` for manual workflow, troubleshooting, and technical details\n- **X Articles**: See `references/articles.md` for long-form article publishing guide\n\n---\n\n## Regular Posts\n\nText + up to 4 images.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--image <path>` | Image file (repeatable, max 4) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## Video Posts\n\nText + video file.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Check this out!\" --video ./clip.mp4          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Amazing content\" --video ./demo.mp4 --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--video <path>` | Video file (MP4, MOV, WebM) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n**Limits**: Regular 140s max, Premium 60min. Processing: 30-60s.\n\n---\n\n## Quote Tweets\n\nQuote an existing tweet with comment.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"Great insight!\"          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"I agree!\" --submit       # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<tweet-url>` | URL to quote (positional) |\n| `<comment>` | Comment text (positional, optional) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## X Articles\n\nLong-form Markdown articles (requires X Premium).\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md                        # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --cover ./cover.jpg    # With cover\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --submit               # Publish\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<markdown>` | Markdown file (positional) |\n| `--cover <path>` | Cover image |\n| `--title <text>` | Override title |\n| `--submit` | Publish (default: preview) |\n\n**Frontmatter**: `title`, `cover_image` supported in YAML front matter.\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- First run: manual login required (session persists)\n- Always preview before `--submit`\n- Cross-platform: macOS, Linux, Windows\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T13:19:13.730Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Social Media Agents needing to bypass anti-bot detection on Twitter via a real Chrome browser","zh":"非常适合需要通过真实Chrome浏览器绕过Twitter反_bot检测的社交媒体代理","ja":"Twitterでの反ボット検出を回避するために実際のChromeブラウザを使用する必要があるソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適","ko":"트위터에서 반_bot 탐지를 피하기 위해 실제 Chrome 브라우저를 사용해야 하는 소셜 미디어 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Medios Sociales que necesitan evitar la detección anti-bot en Twitter a través de un navegador Chrome real","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Médias Sociaux ayant besoin de contourner la détection anti-bot sur Twitter via un navigateur Chrome réel","de":"Perfekt für Social-Media-Agents, die die Anti-Bot-Erkennung auf Twitter über einen echten Chrome-Browser umgehen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Mídia Social que precisam contornar a detecção anti-bot no Twitter por meio de um navegador Chrome real","ru":"Идеально для социальных медиа-агентов, которым необходимо обходить обнаружение антиботов в Twitter через реальный браузер Chrome","ar":"مثالي لعميل وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية الذي يحتاج إلى تجاوز الكشف عن البرامج الروبوتية على تويتر من خلال متصفح كروم حقيقي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to post text, images, videos, and long-form articles to Twitter using TypeScript, leveraging a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration, while bypassing anti-bot detection through a real Chrome browser","zh":"赋予代理发布文本、图像、视频和长篇文章到Twitter的能力，利用TypeScript、强大的代理循环、内存系统和工具集成，同时通过实际的Chrome浏览器绕过反_bot检测","ja":"TypeScript、強力なエージェントループ、メモリーシステム、ツール統合を利用して、エージェントがテキスト、画像、動画、長文記事をTwitterに投稿できるようにし、実際のChromeブラウザを通じて反ボット検出を回避","ko":"에이전트가 텍스트, 이미지, 비디오 및 긴 형식의 기사를 TypeScript를 사용하여 Twitter에 게시할 수 있도록 하며, 실제 Chrome 브라우저를 통해 반_bot 탐지를 피하는 강력한 에이전트 루프, 메모리 시스템 및 도구 통합을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes para publicar texto, imágenes, videos y artículos de larga extensión en Twitter utilizando TypeScript, aprovechando un bucle de agente robusto, un sistema de memoria y una integración de herramientas, mientras evita la detección anti-bot a través de un navegador Chrome real","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier du texte, des images, des vidéos et des articles de longue forme sur Twitter en utilisant TypeScript, en exploitant une boucle d''agent robuste, un système de mémoire et une intégration d''outils, tout en contournant la détection anti-bot via un navigateur Chrome réel","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Text, Bilder, Videos und lange Artikel auf Twitter mit TypeScript zu veröffentlichen, indem sie einen robusten Agentenloop, ein Memoriesystem und eine Tool-Integration nutzen und dabei die Anti-Bot-Erkennung durch einen echten Chrome-Browser umgehen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a postar texto, imagens, vídeos e artigos longos no Twitter usando TypeScript, aproveitando um loop de agente robusto, sistema de memória e integração de ferramentas, enquanto contorna a detecção anti-bot por meio de um navegador Chrome real","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью публиковать текст, изображения, видео и длинные статьи в Twitter, используя TypeScript, опираясь на прочный агентский цикл, систему памяти и интеграцию инструментов, а также обход обнаружения антиботов через реальный браузер Chrome","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر النصوص والصور وملفات الفيديو والمقالات الطويلة على تويتر باستخدام TypeScript، مستفيدًا من حلقة وكيل قوية ونظام ذاكرة وتكامل أدوات، مع تجاوز الكشف عن البرامج الروبوتية من خلال متصفح كروم حقيقي"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Twitter posts with multimedia content","Publishing long-form articles directly to Twitter","Bypassing anti-bot detection for secure Twitter interactions"],"zh":["使用多媒体内容自动化Twitter帖子","直接将长篇文章发布到Twitter","绕过反_bot检测以实现安全的Twitter交互"],"ja":["マルチメディアコンテンツを使用してTwitterの投稿を自動化する","長文記事を直接Twitterに投稿する","反ボット検出を回避して安全なTwitterのやり取りを行う"],"ko":["멀티미디어 콘텐츠를 사용하여 트위터 게시물을 자동화하는 것","긴 형식의 기사를 직접 트위터에 게시하는 것","반_bot 탐지를 피하여 안전한 트위터 상호 작용을 하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar publicaciones de Twitter con contenido multimedia","Publicar artículos de larga extensión directamente en Twitter","Evitar la detección anti-bot para interacciones seguras en Twitter"],"fr":["Automatiser les publications Twitter avec du contenu multimédia","Publier des articles de longue forme directement sur Twitter","Contourner la détection anti-bot pour des interactions Twitter sécurisées"],"de":["Automatisierung von Twitter-Beiträgen mit Multimedia-Inhalten","Veröffentlichung von langen Artikeln direkt auf Twitter","Umgehung der Anti-Bot-Erkennung für sichere Twitter-Interaktionen"],"pt":["Automatizar postagens do Twitter com conteúdo multimedia","Publicar artigos longos diretamente no Twitter","Contornar a detecção anti-bot para interações seguras no Twitter"],"ru":["Автоматизация публикаций в Twitter с мультимедийным контентом","Публикация длинных статей напрямую в Twitter","Обход обнаружения антиботов для безопасного взаимодействия с Twitter"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في منشورات تويتر مع المحتوى المتعدد","نشر المقالات الطويلة مباشرة على تويتر","تجاوز الكشف عن البرامج الروبوتية من أجل تفاعلات آمنة على تويتر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chrome browser installation","Limited to Twitter platform","TypeScript expertise recommended for customization"],"zh":["需要安装Chrome浏览器","仅限Twitter平台","建议具备TypeScript专业知识以进行自定义"],"ja":["Chromeブラウザのインストールが必要","Twitterプラットフォームのみ","カスタマイズのためにはTypeScriptの専門知識が必要"],"ko":["Chrome 브라우저 설치가 필요함","트위터 플랫폼만 해당함","사용자 정의를 위해 TypeScript 전문 지식이 권장됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del navegador Chrome","Limitado a la plataforma Twitter","Se recomienda experiencia en TypeScript para la personalización"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du navigateur Chrome","Limité à la plateforme Twitter","Une expertise TypeScript est recommandée pour la personnalisation"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des Chrome-Browsers","Begrenzt auf die Twitter-Plattform","TypeScript-Expertise wird für die Anpassung empfohlen"],"pt":["Exige instalação do navegador Chrome","Limitado à plataforma do Twitter","Conhecimento de TypeScript recomendado para perso