dards 설정 가이드","HTML to Markdown 변환기 도구","CommonMark 지원 변환기","고성능 문서 처리 도구"],"es":["conversor html a markdown","herramientas de ai","commonmark","kreuzberg","conversión de documentos","parseo de flujo","ocr","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["convertisseur html en markdown","outils d''ia","commonmark","kreuzberg","conversion de documents","analyse de flux","ocr","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["html zu markdown konverter","ki tools","commonmark","kreuzberg","dokumentenkonvertierung","streaming parsing","ocr","software entwickeln","entwicklertools"],"pt":["conversor HTML para Markdown","ferramentas de IA","CommonMark","extrair dados de documentos","Kreuzberg","conversor de texto","como usar conversor HTML para Markdown","o que é conversor HTML para Markdown"],"ru":["конвертер HTML в Markdown","ИИ агенты","CommonMark","извлекать данные из документов","Kreuzberg","конвертер текста","как использовать конвертер HTML в Markdown","что такое конвертер HTML в Markdown"],"ar":["محول HTML إلى Markdown","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","CommonMark","استخراج البيانات من الوثائق","Kreuzberg","محول النص","كيفية استخدام محول HTML إلى Markdown","ما هو محول HTML إلى Markdown"]}},"owner":"kreuzberg-dev","repo":"html-to-markdown","repoPath":"kreuzberg-dev/html-to-markdown","stars":538,"forks":48,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T07:34:41Z","topics":["hocr","html","html-converter","markdown","markdown-converter","rag","text-extraction","text-processing"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-standards","description":"","bodyPreview":"______________________________________________________________________\n\n## priority: medium\n\n# Git Commit Standards\n\n**Conventional Commits 1.0.0 · Pre-commit hooks enforce quality**\n\n- Commit message format: feat/fix/docs/refactor/test/chore(scope): description\n- Scopes: rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci, docs\n- Example: fix(rust-core): handle nested lists in markdown output\n- Example: feat(py-binding): expose sanitization options to Python API\n- Example: tes","body":"______________________________________________________________________\n\n## priority: medium\n\n# Git Commit Standards\n\n**Conventional Commits 1.0.0 · Pre-commit hooks enforce quality**\n\n- Commit message format: feat/fix/docs/refactor/test/chore(scope): description\n- Scopes: rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci, docs\n- Example: fix(rust-core): handle nested lists in markdown output\n- Example: feat(py-binding): expose sanitization options to Python API\n- Example: test(ts-binding): add parametrized tests for edge cases\n- Commits MUST pass prek hooks: fmt, lint, tests (at min)\n- NEVER include AI signatures in commits; commits authored by humans\n- NEVER force push to main/development; require PR reviews\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:28:16.568Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring strict adherence to Conventional Commits 1.0.0 standards","zh":"非常适合需要严格遵守 Conventional Commits 1.0.0 标准的代码审查智能体","ja":"Conventional Commits 1.0.0 標準への厳格な準拠を必要とするコードレビューエージェントに最適です","ko":"Conventional Commits 1.0.0 표준을 엄격히 준수해야 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 이상적입니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que requieren una adherencia estricta a los estándares de Conventional Commits 1.0.0","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une adhésion stricte aux normes Conventional Commits 1.0.0","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die eine strikte Einhaltung der Conventional Commits 1.0.0-Standards erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem adesão estrita aos padrões Conventional Commits 1.0.0","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, требующих строгого соблюдения стандартов Conventional Commits 1.0.0","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة للرمز الذين يتطلبون اتباع صارم لمعايير الإلتزامات التقليدية 1.0.0"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce high-quality commit messages using pre-commit hooks, ensuring consistency across feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, and chore scopes, while supporting multiple bindings such as rust-core, py-binding, and ts-binding","zh":"使智能体能够使用 pre-commit hooks 强制执行高质量的提交消息，确保 feat、fix、docs、refactor、test 和 chore 等范围的一致性，同时支持多种绑定，如 rust-core、py-binding 和 ts-binding","ja":"pre-commit hooks を使用して高品質のコミットメッセージを強制するエージェントを強化し、feat、fix、docs、refactor、test、chore などのスコープ全体で一貫性を確保します。同時に、rust-core、py-binding、ts-binding などの複数のバインディングをサポートします","ko":"pre-commit hooks를 사용하여 고품질 커밋 메시지를 적용하도록 에이전트를 강화하여 feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore 범위 전반에 걸쳐 일관성을 보장하며, rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding과 같은 여러 바인딩을 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar mensajes de confirmación de alta calidad utilizando ganchos pre-confirmación, garantizando la consistencia en los ámbitos feat, fix, docs, refactor, test y chore, y admitiendo múltiples enlaces como rust-core, py-binding y ts-binding","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des messages de commit de haute qualité en utilisant des hooks pré-commit, garantissant la cohérence dans les étendues feat, fix, docs, refactor, test et chore, tout en prenant en charge plusieurs liaisons telles que rust-core, py-binding et ts-binding","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige Commit-Mitteilungen mithilfe von Pre-Commit-Hooks anzuwenden, wodurch die Konsistenz in den Bereichen feat, fix, docs, refactor, test und chore sichergestellt wird und mehrere Bindings wie rust-core, py-binding und ts-binding unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor mensagens de confirmação de alta qualidade usando ganchos pré-confirmação, garantindo consistência em escopos como feat, fix, docs, refactor, test e chore, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta várias ligações como rust-core, py-binding e ts-binding","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать высококачественные сообщения о фиксации с помощью хуков до фиксации, гарантируя согласованность во всех областях, таких как feat, fix, docs, refactor, test и chore, а также поддерживая несколько привязок, таких как rust-core, py-binding и ts-binding","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض رسائل التأكيد عالية الجودة باستخدام مشابك ما قبل الإلتزام، مما يضمن الاتساق عبر نطاقات مثل feat و fix و docs و refactor و test و chore، مع دعم ربطات متعددة مثل rust-core و py-binding و ts-binding"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit message formatting for consistent repository history","Validating commit scopes to ensure accurate change tracking","Enforcing pre-commit hooks for quality control across various bindings"],"zh":["自动化提交消息格式化，以实现一致的仓库历史记录","验证提交范围以确保准确的变更跟踪","强制执行 pre-commit hooks 以在各种绑定中进行质量控制"],"ja":["一貫したリポジトリ履歴のためのコミットメッセージフォーマットの自動化","正確な変更追跡を確保するためのコミットスコープの検証","様々なバインディング全体での品質管理のための pre-commit hooks の強制"],"ko":["일관된 저장소 기록을 위한 커밋 메시지 형식 지정 자동화","정확한 변경 사항 추적을 보장하기 위한 커밋 범위 검증","다양한 바인딩 전반에 걸친 품질 관리를 위한 pre-commit hooks 적용"],"es":["Automatizar el formato de los mensajes de confirmación para una historia de repositorio coherente","Validar los ámbitos de confirmación para garantizar un seguimiento preciso de los cambios","Aplicar ganchos pre-confirmación para el control de calidad en varios enlaces"],"fr":["Automatiser le formatage des messages de commit pour une histoire de référentiel cohérente","Valider les étendues de commit pour garantir un suivi précis des modifications","Appliquer des hooks pré-commit pour le contrôle qualité sur plusieurs liaisons"],"de":["Automatisierung des Formatierens von Commit-Mitteilungen für eine konsistente Repository-Historie","Validierung der Commit-Bereiche, um eine genaue Änderungsverfolgung sicherzustellen","Anwenden von Pre-Commit-Hooks für die Qualitätskontrolle bei verschiedenen Bindings"],"pt":["Automatizar a formatação de mensagens de confirmação para garantir um histórico de repositório consistente","Validar escopos de confirmação para garantir o acompanhamento preciso de alterações","Impor ganchos pré-confirmação para controle de qualidade em várias ligações"],"ru":["Автоматизировать форматирование сообщений о фиксации для обеспечения согласованной истории репозитория","Проверять области фиксации для обеспечения точного отслеживания изменений","Внедрять хуки до фиксации для контроля качества в различных привязках"],"ar":["تحسين تنسيق رسائل الإلتزام تلقائيا لضمان سجل مستودع متسق","تحقق من نطاقات الإلتزام لضمان تتبع دقيق للتغييرات","فرض مشابك ما قبل الإلتزام للرقابة الجودة عبر ربطات متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires implementation of Conventional Commits 1.0.0 standard","Limited to specific scopes such as rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci, and docs"],"zh":["需要实施 Conventional Commits 1.0.0 标准","仅限于特定范围，如 rust-core、py-binding、ts-binding、rb-binding、php-binding、build、ci 和 docs"],"ja":["Conventional Commits 1.0.0 標準の実装が必要","rust-core、py-binding、ts-binding、rb-binding、php-binding、build、ci、docs などの特定のスコープに限定される"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 1.0.0 표준 구현이 필요함","rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci, docs와 같은 특정 범위로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la implementación del estándar Conventional Commits 1.0.0","Limitado a ámbitos específicos como rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci y docs"],"fr":["Nécessite la mise en œuvre de la norme Conventional Commits 1.0.0","Limité à des étendues spécifiques telles que rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci et docs"],"de":["Erfordert die Implementierung des Conventional Commits 1.0.0-Standards","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Bereiche wie rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci und docs"],"pt":["Exige a implementação do padrão Conventional Commits 1.0.0","Limitado a escopos específicos, como rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci e docs"],"ru":["Требует реализации стандарта Conventional Commits 1.0.0","Ограничен конкретными областями, такими как rust-core, py-binding, ts-binding, rb-binding, php-binding, build, ci и docs"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ معيار الإلتزامات التقليدية 1.0.0","محدود بنطاقات محددة مثل rust-core و py-binding و ts-binding و rb-binding و php-binding و build و ci و docs"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fc8fb9ca20df8e0c13e14c7612ee9ea091e38a8b20ed803d80c5a9c0f47759e0","qualityScore":36}');
