nk","ru":"ИИ Агенты с ReasoningBank и AgentDB","ar":"وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مع ReasoningBank","en":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB"},"description":{"zh":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB是一种基于AI的智能代理，支持多智能体、上下文复合和创意编写","ja":"ReasoningBank with AgentDBは、多智能体、コンテキスト複合、創造的書き込みをサポートするAIベースの智能エージェントです","ko":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB는 멀티 에이전트, 컨텍스트 컴파운드, 창의적 작성을 지원하는 AI 기반의智能 에이전트입니다","es":"ReasoningBank es una plataforma de inteligencia artificial que potencia la creatividad con agentes y tecnologías de vanguardia","fr":"ReasoningBank est une plateforme d''intelligence artificielle qui booste la créativité avec des agents et des technologies de pointe","de":"ReasoningBank ist eine Plattform für künstliche Intelligenz, die die Kreativität mit Agenten und SpitzenTechnologien fördert","pt":"ReasoningBank é uma inteligência viva que overlay em qualquer IA, permitindo a criação de universos inteligentes.","ru":"ReasoningBank - это живая интеллект, который накладывается на любую ИИ, позволяя создавать интеллектуальные вселенные.","ar":"ReasoningBank هو ذكاء حي ي覆ي أي ذكاء اصطناعي، مما يسمح بإنشاء عوالم ذكية.","en":"Living intelligence that overlays any AI. Ten Guardian intelligences, context that compounds, and the creative civilization OS for creators who build universes."},"definition":{"en":"Living intelligence that overlays any AI. Ten Guardian intelligences, context that compounds, and the creative civilization OS for creators who build universes."},"features":{"zh":["支持多智能体","上下文复合","创意编写","基于AI的智能代理","支持Next.js和Vercel AI SDK","使用TypeScript和claude-code"],"ja":["多智能体サポート","コンテキスト複合","創造的書き込み","AIベースの智能エージェント","Next.jsとVercel AI SDKサポート","TypeScriptとclaude-code使用"],"ko":["멀티 에이전트 지원","컨텍스트 컴파운드","창의적 작성을","AI 기반의智能 에이전트","Next.js와 Vercel AI SDK 지원","TypeScript와 claude-code 사용"],"es":["Inteligencia artificial avanzada","Agentes de aprendizaje automático","Tecnologías de vanguardia para la creatividad","Plataforma de orquestación para desarrolladores","Compatibilidad con Claude Code y Vercel AI SDK"],"fr":["Intelligence artificielle avancée","Agents d''apprentissage automatique","Technologies de pointe pour la créativité","Plateforme d''orchestration pour les développeurs","Compatibilité avec Claude Code et Vercel AI SDK"],"de":["Fortgeschrittene künstliche Intelligenz","Agenten für maschinellen Lernen","SpitzenTechnologien für die Kreativität","Plattform für die Orchestrierung von Entwicklern","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code und Vercel AI SDK"],"pt":["Inteligência viva que overlay em qualquer IA","Criação de universos inteligentes","10 inteligências guardiãs","Contexto que compõe","Sistema operacional de civilização criativa"],"ru":["Живая интеллект, которая накладывается на любую ИИ","Создание интеллектуальных вселенных","10 хранителей интеллекта","Контекст, который составляется","Операционная система творческой цивилизации"],"ar":["ذكاء حي يغطي أي ذكاء اصطناعي","إنشاء عوالم ذكية","10 حارس ذكاء","سياق يتشكل","نظام تشغيل للحضارة الإبداعية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","ReasoningBank with AgentDB","多智能体","上下文复合","创意编写","Next.js","Vercel AI SDK","TypeScript","claude-code","如何使用ReasoningBank with AgentDB"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ReasoningBank with AgentDB","多智能体","コンテキスト複合","創造的書き込み","Next.js","Vercel AI SDK","TypeScript","claude-code","ReasoningBank with AgentDBの使い方"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","ReasoningBank with AgentDB","멀티 에이전트","컨텍스트 컴파운드","창의적 작성을","Next.js","Vercel AI SDK","TypeScript","claude-code","ReasoningBank with AgentDB 사용법"],"es":["cómo utilizar agentes de inteligencia artificial","qué es la inteligencia artificial","ReasoningBank vs otros agentes de IA","instalación de ReasoningBank","guía de configuración de ReasoningBank","desarrollo de aplicaciones con ReasoningBank","agentes de inteligencia artificial para la creatividad"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents d''intelligence artificielle","qu''est-ce que l''intelligence artificielle","ReasoningBank vs autres agents d''IA","installation de ReasoningBank","guide de configuration de ReasoningBank","développement d''applications avec ReasoningBank","agents d''intelligence artificielle pour la créativité"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten verwendet","was ist künstliche Intelligenz","ReasoningBank im Vergleich zu anderen KI-Agents","Installation von ReasoningBank","Konfigurationsanleitung für ReasoningBank","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit ReasoningBank","KI-Agenten für die Kreativität"],"pt":["como usar ReasoningBank","o que é ReasoningBank","agentes de IA avançados","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","ReasoningBank vs outros agentes de IA","instalar ReasoningBank","guia de configuração do ReasoningBank"],"ru":["как использовать ReasoningBank","что такое ReasoningBank","передовые ИИ Агенты","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","ReasoningBank vs другие ИИ Агенты","установить ReasoningBank","руководство по настройке ReasoningBank"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ReasoningBank","ما هو ReasoningBank","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدمين","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","ReasoningBank مقابل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الآخرون","تثبيت ReasoningBank","دليل إعداد ReasoningBank"]}},"owner":"frankxai","repo":"arcanea","repoPath":"frankxai/arcanea","stars":3,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T02:23:41Z","topics":["agents","ai","claude-code","creative-ai","creative-writing","intelligence","mcp","multi-agent","next-js","orchestration","prompts","skills","typescript","vercel-ai-sdk","world-building"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ReasoningBank with AgentDB","description":"Implement ReasoningBank adaptive learning with AgentDBs 150x faster vector database. Includes trajectory tracking, verdict judgment, memory distillation, and pattern recognition. Use when building self-learning agents, optimizing decision-making, or implementing experience replay systems.","bodyPreview":"# ReasoningBank with AgentDB\r\n\r\n## What This Skill Does\r\n\r\nProvides ReasoningBank adaptive learning patterns using AgentDB''s high-performance backend (150x-12,500x faster). Enables agents to learn from experiences, judge outcomes, distill memories, and improve decision-making over time with 100% backward compatibility.\r\n\r\n**Performance**: 150x faster pattern retrieval, 500x faster batch operations, <1ms memory access.\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites\r\n\r\n- Node.js 18+\r\n- AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow)\r\n-","body":"# ReasoningBank with AgentDB\r\n\r\n## What This Skill Does\r\n\r\nProvides ReasoningBank adaptive learning patterns using AgentDB''s high-performance backend (150x-12,500x faster). Enables agents to learn from experiences, judge outcomes, distill memories, and improve decision-making over time with 100% backward compatibility.\r\n\r\n**Performance**: 150x faster pattern retrieval, 500x faster batch operations, <1ms memory access.\r\n\r\n## Prerequisites\r\n\r\n- Node.js 18+\r\n- AgentDB v1.0.7+ (via agentic-flow)\r\n- Understanding of reinforcement learning concepts (optional)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Quick Start with CLI\r\n\r\n### Initialize ReasoningBank Database\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Initialize AgentDB for ReasoningBank\r\nnpx agentdb@latest init ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db --dimension 1536\r\n\r\n# Start MCP server for Claude Code integration\r\nnpx agentdb@latest mcp\r\nclaude mcp add agentdb npx agentdb@latest mcp\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Migrate from Legacy ReasoningBank\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Automatic migration with validation\r\nnpx agentdb@latest migrate --source .swarm/memory.db\r\n\r\n# Verify migration\r\nnpx agentdb@latest stats ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Quick Start with API\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nimport { createAgentDBAdapter, computeEmbedding } from ''agentic-flow/reasoningbank'';\r\n\r\n// Initialize ReasoningBank with AgentDB\r\nconst rb = await createAgentDBAdapter({\r\n  dbPath: ''.agentdb/reasoningbank.db'',\r\n  enableLearning: true,      // Enable learning plugins\r\n  enableReasoning: true,      // Enable reasoning agents\r\n  cacheSize: 1000,            // 1000 pattern cache\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Store successful experience\r\nconst query = \"How to optimize database queries?\";\r\nconst embedding = await computeEmbedding(query);\r\n\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  id: '''',\r\n  type: ''experience'',\r\n  domain: ''database-optimization'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\r\n    embedding,\r\n    pattern: {\r\n      query,\r\n      approach: ''indexing + query optimization'',\r\n      outcome: ''success'',\r\n      metrics: { latency_reduction: 0.85 }\r\n    }\r\n  }),\r\n  confidence: 0.95,\r\n  usage_count: 1,\r\n  success_count: 1,\r\n  created_at: Date.now(),\r\n  last_used: Date.now(),\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Retrieve similar experiences with reasoning\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\r\n  domain: ''database-optimization'',\r\n  k: 5,\r\n  useMMR: true,              // Diverse results\r\n  synthesizeContext: true,    // Rich context synthesis\r\n});\r\n\r\nconsole.log(''Memories:'', result.memories);\r\nconsole.log(''Context:'', result.context);\r\nconsole.log(''Patterns:'', result.patterns);\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Core ReasoningBank Concepts\r\n\r\n### 1. Trajectory Tracking\r\n\r\nTrack agent execution paths and outcomes:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Record trajectory (sequence of actions)\r\nconst trajectory = {\r\n  task: ''optimize-api-endpoint'',\r\n  steps: [\r\n    { action: ''analyze-bottleneck'', result: ''found N+1 query'' },\r\n    { action: ''add-eager-loading'', result: ''reduced queries'' },\r\n    { action: ''add-caching'', result: ''improved latency'' }\r\n  ],\r\n  outcome: ''success'',\r\n  metrics: { latency_before: 2500, latency_after: 150 }\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst embedding = await computeEmbedding(JSON.stringify(trajectory));\r\n\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  id: '''',\r\n  type: ''trajectory'',\r\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({ embedding, pattern: trajectory }),\r\n  confidence: 0.9,\r\n  usage_count: 1,\r\n  success_count: 1,\r\n  created_at: Date.now(),\r\n  last_used: Date.now(),\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. Verdict Judgment\r\n\r\nJudge whether a trajectory was successful:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Retrieve similar past trajectories\r\nconst similar = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\r\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\r\n  k: 10,\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Judge based on similarity to successful patterns\r\nconst verdict = similar.memories.filter(m =>\r\n  m.pattern.outcome === ''success'' &&\r\n  m.similarity > 0.8\r\n).length > 5 ? ''likely_success'' : ''needs_review'';\r\n\r\nconsole.log(''Verdict:'', verdict);\r\nconsole.log(''Confidence:'', similar.memories[0]?.similarity || 0);\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 3. Memory Distillation\r\n\r\nConsolidate similar experiences into patterns:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Get all experiences in domain\r\nconst experiences = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\r\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\r\n  k: 100,\r\n  optimizeMemory: true,  // Automatic consolidation\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Distill into high-level pattern\r\nconst distilledPattern = {\r\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\r\n  pattern: ''For N+1 queries: add eager loading, then cache'',\r\n  success_rate: 0.92,\r\n  sample_size: experiences.memories.length,\r\n  confidence: 0.95\r\n};\r\n\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  id: '''',\r\n  type: ''distilled-pattern'',\r\n  domain: ''api-optimization'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\r\n    embedding: await computeEmbedding(JSON.stringify(distilledPattern)),\r\n    pattern: distilledPattern\r\n  }),\r\n  confidence: 0.95,\r\n  usage_count: 0,\r\n  success_count: 0,\r\n  created_at: Date.now(),\r\n  last_used: Date.now(),\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Integration with Reasoning Agents\r\n\r\nAgentDB provides 4 reasoning modules that enhance ReasoningBank:\r\n\r\n### 1. PatternMatcher\r\n\r\nFind similar successful patterns:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\r\n  domain: ''problem-solving'',\r\n  k: 10,\r\n  useMMR: true,  // Maximal Marginal Relevance for diversity\r\n});\r\n\r\n// PatternMatcher returns diverse, relevant memories\r\nresult.memories.forEach(mem => {\r\n  console.log(`Pattern: ${mem.pattern.approach}`);\r\n  console.log(`Similarity: ${mem.similarity}`);\r\n  console.log(`Success Rate: ${mem.success_count / mem.usage_count}`);\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. ContextSynthesizer\r\n\r\nGenerate rich context from multiple memories:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\r\n  domain: ''code-optimization'',\r\n  synthesizeContext: true,  // Enable context synthesis\r\n  k: 5,\r\n});\r\n\r\n// ContextSynthesizer creates coherent narrative\r\nconsole.log(''Synthesized Context:'', result.context);\r\n// \"Based on 5 similar optimizations, the most effective approach\r\n//  involves profiling, identifying bottlenecks, and applying targeted\r\n//  improvements. Success rate: 87%\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 3. MemoryOptimizer\r\n\r\nAutomatically consolidate and prune:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\r\n  domain: ''testing'',\r\n  optimizeMemory: true,  // Enable automatic optimization\r\n});\r\n\r\n// MemoryOptimizer consolidates similar patterns and prunes low-quality\r\nconsole.log(''Optimizations:'', result.optimizations);\r\n// { consolidated: 15, pruned: 3, improved_quality: 0.12 }\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 4. ExperienceCurator\r\n\r\nFilter by quality and relevance:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(queryEmbedding, {\r\n  domain: ''debugging'',\r\n  k: 20,\r\n  minConfidence: 0.8,  // Only high-confidence experiences\r\n});\r\n\r\n// ExperienceCurator returns only quality experiences\r\nresult.memories.forEach(mem => {\r\n  console.log(`Confidence: ${mem.confidence}`);\r\n  console.log(`Success Rate: ${mem.success_count / mem.usage_count}`);\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Legacy API Compatibility\r\n\r\nAgentDB maintains 100% backward compatibility with legacy ReasoningBank:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nimport {\r\n  retrieveMemories,\r\n  judgeTrajectory,\r\n  distillMemories\r\n} from ''agentic-flow/reasoningbank'';\r\n\r\n// Legacy API works unchanged (uses AgentDB backend automatically)\r\nconst memories = await retrieveMemories(query, {\r\n  domain: ''code-generation'',\r\n  agent: ''coder''\r\n});\r\n\r\nconst verdict = await judgeTrajectory(trajectory, query);\r\n\r\nconst newMemories = await distillMemories(\r\n  trajectory,\r\n  verdict,\r\n  query,\r\n  { domain: ''code-generation'' }\r\n);\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Performance Characteristics\r\n\r\n- **Pattern Search**: 150x faster (100µs vs 15ms)\r\n- **Memory Retrieval**: <1ms (with cache)\r\n- **Batch Insert**: 500x faster (2ms vs 1s for 100 patterns)\r\n- **Trajectory Judgment**: <5ms (including retrieval + analysis)\r\n- **Memory Distillation**: <50ms (consolidate 100 patterns)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Advanced Patterns\r\n\r\n### Hierarchical Memory\r\n\r\nOrganize memories by abstraction level:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Low-level: Specific implementation\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  type: ''concrete'',\r\n  domain: ''debugging/null-pointer'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\r\n    embedding,\r\n    pattern: { bug: ''NPE in UserService.getUser()'', fix: ''Add null check'' }\r\n  }),\r\n  confidence: 0.9,\r\n  // ...\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Mid-level: Pattern across similar cases\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  type: ''pattern'',\r\n  domain: ''debugging'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\r\n    embedding,\r\n    pattern: { category: ''null-pointer'', approach: ''defensive-checks'' }\r\n  }),\r\n  confidence: 0.85,\r\n  // ...\r\n});\r\n\r\n// High-level: General principle\r\nawait rb.insertPattern({\r\n  type: ''principle'',\r\n  domain: ''software-engineering'',\r\n  pattern_data: JSON.stringify({\r\n    embedding,\r\n    pattern: { principle: ''fail-fast with clear errors'' }\r\n  }),\r\n  confidence: 0.95,\r\n  // ...\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Multi-Domain Learning\r\n\r\nTransfer learning across domains:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n// Learn from backend optimization\r\nconst backendExperience = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\r\n  domain: ''backend-optimization'',\r\n  k: 10,\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Apply to frontend optimization\r\nconst transferredKnowledge = backendExperience.memories.map(mem => ({\r\n  ...mem,\r\n  domain: ''frontend-optimization'',\r\n  adapted: true,\r\n}));\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## CLI Operations\r\n\r\n### Database Management\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Export trajectories and patterns\r\nnpx agentdb@latest export ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db ./backup.json\r\n\r\n# Import experiences\r\nnpx agentdb@latest import ./experiences.json\r\n\r\n# Get statistics\r\nnpx agentdb@latest stats ./.agentdb/reasoningbank.db\r\n# Shows: total patterns, domains, confidence distribution\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Migration\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Migrate from legacy ReasoningBank\r\nnpx agentdb@latest migrate --source .swarm/memory.db --target .agentdb/reasoningbank.db\r\n\r\n# Validate migration\r\nnpx agentdb@latest stats .agentdb/reasoningbank.db\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Troubleshooting\r\n\r\n### Issue: Migration fails\r\n```bash\r\n# Check source database exists\r\nls -la .swarm/memory.db\r\n\r\n# Run with verbose logging\r\nDEBUG=agentdb:* npx agentdb@latest migrate --source .swarm/memory.db\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Issue: Low confidence scores\r\n```typescript\r\n// Enable context synthesis for better quality\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\r\n  synthesizeContext: true,\r\n  useMMR: true,\r\n  k: 10,\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Issue: Memory growing too large\r\n```typescript\r\n// Enable automatic optimization\r\nconst result = await rb.retrieveWithReasoning(embedding, {\r\n  optimizeMemory: true,  // Consolidates similar patterns\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Or manually optimize\r\nawait rb.optimize();\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Learn More\r\n\r\n- **AgentDB Integration**: node_modules/agentic-flow/docs/AGENTDB_INTEGRATION.md\r\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/ruvnet/agentic-flow/tree/main/packages/agentdb\r\n- **MCP Integration**: `npx agentdb@latest mcp`\r\n- **Website**: https://agentdb.ruv.io\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Category**: Machine Learning / Reinforcement Learning\r\n**Difficulty**: Intermediate\r\n**Estimated Time**: 20-30 minutes\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:39:42.384Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents seeking accelerated adaptive learning and decision-making capabilities with Node.js 18+ and AgentDB v1.0.7+","zh":"适用于高级 AI 代理，寻求加速自适应学习和决策能力，搭配 Node.js 18+ 和 AgentDB v1.0.7+","ja":"Node.js 18+ および AgentDB v1.0.7+ を使用した加速された適応型学習および意思決定機能を備えた高度な AI エージェントに適しています","ko":"Node.js 18+ 및 AgentDB v1.0.7+와 함께 가속화된 적응형 학습 및 의사 결정 기능을 갖춘 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avanzados que buscan un aprendizaje adaptativo acelerado y capacidades de toma de decisiones con Node.js 18+ y AgentDB v1.0.7+","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents IA Avancés qui recherchent un apprentissage adaptatif accéléré et des capacités de prise de décision avec Node.js 18+ et AgentDB v1.0.7+","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents, die ein beschleunigtes adaptives Lernen und Entscheidungskapazitäten mit Node.js 18+ und AgentDB v1.0.7+ suchen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados que buscam aprendizado adaptativo acelerado e capacidades de tomada de decisão com Node.js 18+ e AgentDB v1.0.7+","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых агентов ИИ, стремящихся к ускоренному адаптивному обучению и возможностям принятия решений с Node.js 18+ и AgentDB v1.0.7+","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يسعون إلى تعلم وتحسين القرارات المُسرعة مع Node.js 18+ و AgentDB v1.0.7+"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents with 150x faster pattern retrieval and 500x faster batch operations, utilizing AgentDB''s high-performance backend for enhanced judgment and memory distillation, all while maintaining 100% backward compatibility and sub-1ms memory access","zh":"赋予代理 150 倍更快的模式检索和 500 倍更快的批处理操作，利用 AgentDB 的高性能后端增强判断和记忆提取，同时保持 100% 向后兼容性和低于 1ms 的内存访问","ja":"AgentDB のハイパフォーマンス バックエンドを利用して、エージェントに 150 倍速くパターン検索と 500 倍速くバッチ処理を実行する能力を付与し、100% の下位互換性と 1ms 未満のメモリ アクセスを維持する","ko":"에이전트에게 150배 빠른 패턴 검색과 500배 빠른 배치 처리를 제공하며, AgentDB의 고성능 백엔드를 통해 판단과 기억 추출을增强하며, 100%의 하위 호환성과 1ms 이하의 메모리 접근을 유지합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes con una recuperación de patrones 150 veces más rápida y operaciones por lotes 500 veces más rápidas, utilizando el backend de alto rendimiento de AgentDB para un juicio y una destilación de memoria mejorados, todo mientras mantiene la compatibilidad hacia atrás del 100% y un acceso a la memoria inferior a 1ms","fr":"Équipe les agents d''une récupération de modèles 150 fois plus rapide et d''opérations par lots 500 fois plus rapides, en utilisant le backend haute performance d''AgentDB pour un jugement et une distillation de mémoire améliorés, tout en maintenant une compatibilité descendante de 100% et un accès à la mémoire inférieur à 1ms","de":"Ermächtigt Agents mit einer 150-mal schnelleren Musterwiederherstellung und 500-mal schnelleren Batch-Vorgängen, indem sie die Hochleistungs-Backend von AgentDB für ein verbessertes Urteil und eine Gedächtnisdestillation nutzen, während sie eine 100%ige Abwärtskompatibilität und einen Zugriff auf das Speicher unter 1ms beibehalten","pt":"Habilita agentes com recuperação de padrões 150x mais rápida e operações em lote 500x mais rápidas, utilizando o backend de alto desempenho do AgentDB para julgamento e destilação de memória aprimorados, mantendo 100% de compatibilidade para trás e acesso à memória em menos de 1ms","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью 150-кратного ускорения извлечения закономерностей и 500-кратного ускорения пакетных операций, используя высокопроизводенный бэкэнд AgentDB для улучшения суждения и дистилляции памяти, сохраняя при этом 100% обратной совместимости и доступа к памяти менее 1мс","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استرجاع الأنماط 150 مرة أسرع وعمليات الدفع 