e a React, Python e Node.js"],"ru":["Расширенная навигация для Claude Code","Статистика и анализ производительности","Интеграция с суперспособностями ИИ","Разработка инновационных опыт","Поддержка React, Python и Node.js"],"ar":["تصفح متقدم ل Claude Code","إحصائيات وتحليل الأداء","التكامل مع القدرات الفائقة لذكاء اصطناعي","تطوير تجارب مبتكرة","دعم React و Python و Node.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["nav-stats安装","AI智能代理是什么","如何使用nav-stats","nav-stats和Claude Code","nav-stats替代品","nav-stats教程","AI工具nav-stats","nav-stats设置指南"],"ja":["nav-statsのインストール","AIエージェントとは","nav-statsの使い方","nav-statsとClaude Code","nav-statsの代替","nav-statsチュートリアル","AIエージェントnav-stats","nav-statsのセットアップガイド"],"ko":["nav-stats 설치","AI 에이전트란","nav-stats 사용법","nav-stats와 Claude Code","nav-stats 대체","nav-stats 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트nav-stats","nav-stats 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de AI","qué es nav-stats","alternativas a Claude Code","nav-stats vs otros navegadores","instalación de nav-stats","guía de configuración de nav-stats"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''IA","qu''est-ce que nav-stats","alternatives à Claude Code","nav-stats vs autres navigateurs","installation de nav-stats","guide de configuration de nav-stats"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist nav-stats","Alternativen zu Claude Code","nav-stats vs andere Navigatoren","Installation von nav-stats","Konfigurationsanleitung für nav-stats"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","nav-stats","claude code","desenvolvimento de software","ia para desenvolvedores","como usar nav-stats","o que é nav-stats","nav-stats vs outras ferramentas","instalar nav-stats","guia de configuração do nav-stats"],"ru":["инструменты ии","nav-stats","claude code","разработка программного обеспечения","ии для разработчиков","как использовать nav-stats","что такое nav-stats","nav-stats vs другие инструменты","установить nav-stats","руководство по настройке nav-stats"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","nav-stats","claude code","تطوير البرمجيات","ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام nav-stats","ما هي nav-stats","nav-stats مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت nav-stats","دليل إعداد nav-stats"]}},"owner":"dkyazzentwatwa","repo":"SuperNavigator","repoPath":"dkyazzentwatwa/SuperNavigator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T08:25:24.805Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nav-stats","description":"Display session efficiency report showing token savings, cache performance, and optimization recommendations. Use when user asks show my stats, how efficient am I?, show session metrics, or wants to see Navigators impact.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Navigator Session Statistics Skill\n\nShow real-time efficiency reporting with baseline comparisons, making Navigator''s value quantifiable and shareable.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Says \"show my stats\", \"show session stats\", \"show metrics\"\n- Asks \"how efficient am I?\", \"how much did I save?\"\n- Says \"show my Navigator report\", \"efficiency report\"\n- Wants to see token savings or session performance\n- Says \"show impact\", \"prove Navigator works\"\n\n**DO NOT invoke** if:\n- U","body":"# Navigator Session Statistics Skill\n\nShow real-time efficiency reporting with baseline comparisons, making Navigator''s value quantifiable and shareable.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Says \"show my stats\", \"show session stats\", \"show metrics\"\n- Asks \"how efficient am I?\", \"how much did I save?\"\n- Says \"show my Navigator report\", \"efficiency report\"\n- Wants to see token savings or session performance\n- Says \"show impact\", \"prove Navigator works\"\n\n**DO NOT invoke** if:\n- User just started session (< 5 messages)\n- Navigator not initialized in project\n- User asking about specific metrics only (answer directly)\n\n## Execution Steps\n\n### Step 1: Check Navigator Initialized\n\nVerify Navigator is set up:\n\n```bash\nif [ ! -f \".agent/DEVELOPMENT-README.md\" ]; then\n  echo \"❌ Navigator not initialized in this project\"\n  echo \"Run ''Initialize Navigator'' first\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n### Step 2: Run Enhanced Session Stats\n\nExecute the enhanced session statistics script:\n\n```bash\n# Check if enhanced script exists\nif [ ! -f \"scripts/session-stats.sh\" ]; then\n  echo \"❌ Session stats script not found\"\n  echo \"This feature requires Navigator v3.5.0+\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\n# Run stats script\nbash scripts/session-stats.sh\n```\n\nThis script outputs shell-parseable variables:\n- `BASELINE_TOKENS` - Total size of all .agent/ docs\n- `LOADED_TOKENS` - Actually loaded in session (estimated)\n- `TOKENS_SAVED` - Difference\n- `SAVINGS_PERCENT` - Percentage saved\n- `EFFICIENCY_SCORE` - 0-100 score\n- `CACHE_EFFICIENCY` - From OpenTelemetry\n- `CONTEXT_USAGE_PERCENT` - Estimated context fill\n- `TIME_SAVED_MINUTES` - Estimated time saved\n\n### Step 3: Calculate Efficiency Score\n\nUse predefined function to calculate score:\n\n```bash\n# Extract metrics from session-stats.sh\nsource <(bash scripts/session-stats.sh)\n\n# Calculate efficiency score using predefined function\nEFFICIENCY_SCORE=$(python3 skills/nav-stats/functions/efficiency_scorer.py \\\n  --tokens-saved-percent ${SAVINGS_PERCENT} \\\n  --cache-efficiency ${CACHE_EFFICIENCY} \\\n  --context-usage ${CONTEXT_USAGE_PERCENT})\n```\n\n### Step 4: Format and Display Report\n\nUse predefined function to format visual report:\n\n```bash\n# Generate formatted report\npython3 skills/nav-stats/functions/report_formatter.py \\\n  --baseline ${BASELINE_TOKENS} \\\n  --loaded ${LOADED_TOKENS} \\\n  --saved ${TOKENS_SAVED} \\\n  --savings-percent ${SAVINGS_PERCENT} \\\n  --cache-efficiency ${CACHE_EFFICIENCY} \\\n  --context-usage ${CONTEXT_USAGE_PERCENT} \\\n  --efficiency-score ${EFFICIENCY_SCORE} \\\n  --time-saved ${TIME_SAVED_MINUTES}\n```\n\n**Output Format**:\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║          NAVIGATOR EFFICIENCY REPORT                 ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\n📊 TOKEN USAGE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nDocumentation loaded:        12,000 tokens\nBaseline (all docs):        150,000 tokens\nTokens saved:               138,000 tokens (92% ↓)\n\n💾 CACHE PERFORMANCE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nCache efficiency:              100.0% (perfect)\n\n📈 SESSION METRICS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nContext usage:                      35% (excellent)\nEfficiency score:                94/100 (excellent)\n\n⏱️  TIME SAVED\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nEstimated time saved:          ~42 minutes\n\n💡 WHAT THIS MEANS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nNavigator loaded 92% fewer tokens than loading all docs.\nYour context window is 65% available for actual work.\n\n🎯 RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✅ Excellent efficiency - keep using lazy-loading strategy\n✅ Context usage healthy - plenty of room for work\n\nShare your efficiency: Take a screenshot! #ContextEfficiency\n```\n\n### Step 5: Add Context-Specific Recommendations\n\nBased on efficiency score, provide actionable advice:\n\n**If efficiency_score < 70**:\n```\n⚠️  RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️  Token savings below target (70%+)\n→ Check: Are you loading more docs than needed?\n→ Tip: Use navigator to find docs, don''t load all upfront\n\nRead more: .agent/philosophy/CONTEXT-EFFICIENCY.md\n```\n\n**If context_usage > 80%**:\n```\n⚠️  RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️  Context usage high (80%+)\n→ Consider: Create context marker and compact\n→ Tip: Compact after completing sub-tasks\n\nRead more: .agent/philosophy/ANTI-PATTERNS.md\n```\n\n**If cache_efficiency < 80%**:\n```\n⚠️  RECOMMENDATIONS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️  Cache efficiency low (<80%)\n→ Check: CLAUDE.md properly configured?\n→ Tip: Ensure prompt caching enabled\n\nRead more: .agent/philosophy/PATTERNS.md (Caching pattern)\n```\n\n## Predefined Functions\n\n### `efficiency_scorer.py`\n\nCalculate Navigator efficiency score (0-100) based on:\n- Token savings (40 points)\n- Cache efficiency (30 points)\n- Context usage (30 points)\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\npython3 skills/nav-stats/functions/efficiency_scorer.py \\\n  --tokens-saved-percent 92 \\\n  --cache-efficiency 100 \\\n  --context-usage 35\n```\n\n**Output**: `94` (integer score)\n\n### `report_formatter.py`\n\nFormat efficiency metrics into visual, shareable report.\n\n**Usage**:\n```bash\npython3 skills/nav-stats/functions/report_formatter.py \\\n  --baseline 150000 \\\n  --loaded 12000 \\\n  --saved 138000 \\\n  --savings-percent 92 \\\n  --cache-efficiency 100 \\\n  --context-usage 35 \\\n  --efficiency-score 94 \\\n  --time-saved 42\n```\n\n**Output**: Formatted ASCII report (see Step 4)\n\n## Philosophy Integration\n\n**Context Engineering Principle**: Measurement validates optimization\n\nFrom `.agent/philosophy/PATTERNS.md`:\n> \"Measure to validate. Navigator tracks real metrics, not estimates.\"\n\nThis skill proves:\n- **Token savings** are real (baseline comparison)\n- **Cache efficiency** works (OpenTelemetry data)\n- **Context usage** is healthy (window not overloaded)\n- **Time saved** is quantifiable (6s per 1k tokens)\n\n## User Experience\n\n**User says**: \"Show my stats\"\n\n**Skill displays**:\n1. Visual efficiency report\n2. Clear metrics (tokens, cache, context)\n3. Interpretation (\"What this means\")\n4. Actionable recommendations\n\n**User can**:\n- Screenshot and share (#ContextEfficiency)\n- Understand Navigator''s impact\n- Optimize workflow based on recommendations\n- Validate context engineering principles\n\n## Example Output Scenarios\n\n### Scenario 1: Excellent Efficiency (Score 94)\n\nUser following lazy-loading pattern, cache working perfectly:\n- 92% token savings ✅\n- 100% cache efficiency ✅\n- 35% context usage ✅\n- Score: 94/100\n\n**Recommendation**: Keep it up! Share your efficiency.\n\n### Scenario 2: Fair Efficiency (Score 72)\n\nUser loading too many docs upfront:\n- 65% token savings ⚠️\n- 95% cache efficiency ✅\n- 55% context usage ✅\n- Score: 72/100\n\n**Recommendation**: Review lazy-loading strategy. Load docs on-demand.\n\n### Scenario 3: Poor Efficiency (Score 48)\n\nUser not using Navigator patterns:\n- 45% token savings ❌\n- 70% cache efficiency ⚠️\n- 85% context usage ❌\n- Score: 48/100\n\n**Recommendation**: Read philosophy docs. Consider /nav:compact. Review CLAUDE.md.\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n**After using this skill, users should**:\n- Understand their efficiency score\n- See quantified token savings\n- Know what to improve (if anything)\n- Feel motivated to share results\n\n**Long-term impact**:\n- Users screenshot reports and share\n- \"Navigator saved me 138k tokens\" becomes common\n- Efficiency becomes visible, not abstract\n- Continuous improvement through measurement\n\n---\n\n**This skill makes Navigator''s value tangible and shareable.**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:03:17.339Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced session statistics and efficiency reporting capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级会话统计和效率报告功能的AI代理。","ja":"高度なセッション統計と効率性レポート機能が必要なAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 세션 통계 및 효율성 보고 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan estadísticas de sesión avanzadas y capacidades de informes de eficiencia.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des statistiques de session avancées et des capacités de rapports d''efficacité.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Sitzungsstatistiken und Effizienzberichtsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de estatísticas de sessão avançadas e capacidades de relatórios de eficiência.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуются расширенные статистические данные о сессиях и возможности отчетности об эффективности.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إحصاءات متقدمة للجلسات وقدرات تقارير الفعالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate real-time efficiency reports with baseline comparisons, making their value quantifiable and shareable using libraries like ''p5.js'' and protocols like ''HTTP''.","zh":"赋予代理生成实时效率报告的能力，具有基线比较功能，使其价值可量化和可分享，使用类似''p5.js''的库和''HTTP''的协议。","ja":"エージェントにリアルタイムの効率性レポートを生成する能力を付与し、ベースライン比較機能を提供して、価値を量化および共有できるようにし、''p5.js''のようなライブラリや''HTTP''のようなプロトコルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 실시간 효율성 보고서를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 기준선 비교 기능을 제공하고, ''p5.js''와 같은 라이브러리 및 ''HTTP''와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 가치를 측정하고 공유할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar informes de eficiencia en tiempo real con comparaciones de referencia, lo que hace que su valor sea cuantificable y compartible utilizando bibliotecas como ''p5.js'' y protocolos como ''HTTP''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des rapports d''efficacité en temps réel avec des comparaisons de référence, ce qui rend leur valeur quantifiable et partageable en utilisant des bibliothèques comme ''p5.js'' et des protocoles comme ''HTTP''.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Echtzeit-Effizienzberichte mit Vergleichswerten zu generieren, wodurch ihr Wert messbar und über Bibliotheken wie ''p5.js'' und Protokolle wie ''HTTP'' teilbar wird.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerar relatórios de eficiência em tempo real com comparações de baseline, tornando seu valor quantificável e compartilhável usando bibliotecas como ''p5.js'' e protocolos como ''HTTP''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать отчеты об эффективности в реальном времени с сравнениями базовой линии, что делает их ценность количественной и обменяемой с помощью библиотек như ''p5.js'' и протоколов как ''HTTP''.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد تقارير فعالية في الوقت الفعلي مع مقارنات خط القاعدة ، مما يجعل قيمتهم قابلة للقياس وممكنة المشاركة باستخدام مكتبات مثل ''p5.js'' وبروتوكولات مثل ''HTTP''."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating session statistics reports","Debugging efficiency issues","Automating impact analysis"],"zh":["生成会话统计报告","调试效率问题","自动化影响分析"],"ja":["セッション統計レポートの生成","効率性の問題のデバッグ","影響分析の自動化"],"ko":["세션 통계 보고서 생성","효율성 문제 디버깅","영향 분석 자동화"],"es":["Generar informes de estadísticas de sesión","Depurar problemas de eficiencia","Automatizar el análisis de impacto"],"fr":["Générer des rapports de statistiques de session","Déboguer les problèmes d''efficacité","Automatiser l''analyse d''impact"],"de":["Sitzungsstatistikenberichte generieren","Effizienzprobleme debuggen","Impact-Analyse automatisieren"],"pt":["Gerar relatórios de estatísticas de sessão","Depurar problemas de eficiência","Automatizar análise de impacto"],"ru":["Генерировать отчеты о статистике сессий","Отлаживать проблемы эффективности","Автоматизировать анализ воздействия"],"ar":["توليد تقارير إحصائيات الجلسة","تصحيح أخطاء الفعالية","تأهيل تحليل التأثير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires active session data","Navigator session statistics skill only"],"zh":["需要活动会话数据","导航器会话统计技能仅"],"ja":["アクティブなセッションデータが必要","ナビゲータのセッション統計スキルのみ"],"ko":["액티브 세션 데이터 필요","네비게이터 세션 통계 기술만"],"es":["Requiere datos de sesión activos","Habilidad de estadísticas de sesión de Navigator solo"],"fr":["Nécessite des données de session actives","Compétence de statistiques de session de Navigateur uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt aktive Sitzungsdaten","Nur Navigator-Sitzungsstatistiken-Fähigkeit"],"pt":["Requer dados de sessão ativos","Habilidade de estatísticas de sessão do navegador apenas"],"ru":["Требует активных данных о сессии","Навык статистики сессии браузера только"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات جلسة نشطة","مهارة إحصائيات جلسة المتصفح فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"534fdddf7028538dba06aebd55a07bf26a7587bc151eb4c4ff8737c19678f3c8","qualityScore":36}');
