ung für JavaScript und TypeScript","Einfache Konfiguration mit der Sentry-CLI"],"pt":["Monitoramento de erros em tempo real","Integração com frameworks JavaScript populares","Relatórios detalhados de erros e melhorias","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas","Código aberto e personalizável"],"ru":["Мониторинг ошибок в режиме реального времени","Интеграция с популярными фреймворками JavaScript","Детальные отчеты об ошибках и улучшениях","Поддержка нескольких платформ","Открытый исходный код и настраиваемый"],"ar":["مراقبة الأخطاء في الوقت الفعلي","التكامل مع إطارات جافا سكريبت الشهيرة","تقارير مفصلة عن الأخطاء والتحسينات","دعم منصات متعددة","كود مفتوح ويمكن تخصيصه"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Sentry","JavaScript错误监控","崩溃报告工具","Sentry SDK","Sentry与Bugsnag","Sentry安装","Sentry设置指南"],"ja":["Sentryの使い方","JavaScriptエラーモニタリング","クラッシュレポートツール","Sentry SDK","SentryとBugsnag","Sentryのインストール","Sentryの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Sentry 사용 방법","JavaScript 오류 모니터링","크래시 보고 도구","Sentry SDK","Sentry와 Bugsnag","Sentry 설치","Sentry 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de monitorización de errores","SDK de Sentry para JavaScript","cómo usar upgrade-otel","alternativas a upgrade-otel","upgrade-otel vs Sentry","instalación de upgrade-otel","guía de configuración de upgrade-otel"],"fr":["outils de surveillance des erreurs","SDK Sentry pour JavaScript","comment utiliser upgrade-otel","alternatives à upgrade-otel","upgrade-otel vs Sentry","installation d''upgrade-otel","guide de configuration d''upgrade-otel"],"de":["Tools für die Fehlerüberwachung","Offizielles Sentry-SDK für JavaScript","wie man upgrade-otel verwendet","Alternativen zu upgrade-otel","upgrade-otel vs Sentry","Installation von upgrade-otel","Konfigurationsanleitung für upgrade-otel"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para JavaScript","como usar upgrade-otel","o que é upgrade-otel","upgrade-otel vs sentry","instalar upgrade-otel","guia de configuração do upgrade-otel","erros e melhorias em aplicações JavaScript","monitoramento de erros em tempo real"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для JavaScript","как использовать upgrade-otel","что такое upgrade-otel","upgrade-otel vs sentry","установить upgrade-otel","руководство по настройке upgrade-otel","ошибки и улучшения в приложениях JavaScript","мониторинг ошибок в режиме реального времени"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لجافا سكريبت","كيفية استخدام أداة Upgrade-otel","ما هي أداة Upgrade-otel","أداة Upgrade-otel مقابل سينتري","تثبيت أداة Upgrade-otel","دليل إعداد أداة Upgrade-otel","الأخطاء والتحسينات في تطبيقات جافا سكريبت","مراقبة الأخطاء في الوقت الفعلي"]}},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"sentry-javascript","repoPath":"getsentry/sentry-javascript","stars":8596,"forks":1754,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T01:25:16Z","topics":["angular","crash-reporting","ember","error-monitoring","hacktoberfest","javascript","javascript-client","nextjs","node","raven","react","sdk","sentry","sentry-client","tag-production","team-sdk-javascript","team-web-frontend","typescript","vue"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upgrade-otel","description":"Upgrade OpenTelemetry instrumentations across the Sentry JavaScript SDK. Use when bumping OTel instrumentation packages to their latest versions.","bodyPreview":"# Upgrading OpenTelemetry Instrumentations\n\n**All upgrades must be free of breaking changes.** Read each changelog before proceeding.\n\n## 1. `packages/**`\n\nUpgrade in this order:\n\n1. **`@opentelemetry/instrumentation`** to latest. Check changelog: `https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/blob/main/experimental/CHANGELOG.md`\n2. **All `@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*` packages.** Check each changelog: `https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js-contrib/blob/main/packages/instru","body":"# Upgrading OpenTelemetry Instrumentations\n\n**All upgrades must be free of breaking changes.** Read each changelog before proceeding.\n\n## 1. `packages/**`\n\nUpgrade in this order:\n\n1. **`@opentelemetry/instrumentation`** to latest. Check changelog: `https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/blob/main/experimental/CHANGELOG.md`\n2. **All `@opentelemetry/instrumentation-*` packages.** Check each changelog: `https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js-contrib/blob/main/packages/instrumentation-{name}/CHANGELOG.md`\n3. **Third-party instrumentations** (currently `@prisma/instrumentation`). Check their changelogs.\n\n**STOP** if any upgrade introduces breaking changes — fail with the reason.\n\n## 2. `dev-packages/**`\n\n- If an app depends on `@opentelemetry/instrumentation` >= `0.200.x`, upgrade to latest.\n- If an app depends on `@opentelemetry/instrumentation-http` >= `0.200.x`, upgrade to latest.\n\nSame rule: no breaking changes allowed.\n\n## 3. Regenerate lock file\n\n```bash\nyarn install\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:16:09.644Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript SDK Maintenance Agents handling OpenTelemetry dependency upgrades.","zh":"非常适合处理 OpenTelemetry 依赖项升级的 JavaScript SDK 维护 Agent。","ja":"OpenTelemetry の依存関係アップグレードを扱う JavaScript SDK メンテナンス Agent に最適です。","ko":"OpenTelemetry 종속성 업그레이드를 처리하는 JavaScript SDK 유지보수 Agent에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de mantenimiento de SDK de JavaScript que manejan actualizaciones de dependencias de OpenTelemetry.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de maintenance de SDK JavaScript gérant les mises à niveau des dépendances OpenTelemetry.","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript-SDK-Wartungsagenten, die OpenTelemetry-Abhängigkeits-Upgrades verwalten.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Manutenção de SDK JavaScript que lidam com atualizações de dependência do OpenTelemetry.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обслуживания JavaScript SDK, которые обрабатывают обновления зависимостей OpenTelemetry.","ar":"مثالي لعميل صيانة SDK JavaScript الذي يتعامل مع تحديثات الإعتماد المفتوح"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables systematic upgrading of OpenTelemetry instrumentation packages while preventing breaking changes. Provides critical changelog analysis for @opentelemetry/instrumentation and all @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* packages, ensuring version compatibility across JavaScript SDK ecosystems.","zh":"支持对 OpenTelemetry instrumentation 包进行系统化升级，同时防止破坏性变更。为 @opentelemetry/instrumentation 及所有 @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* 包提供关键的变更日志分析，确保 JavaScript SDK 生态系统中的版本兼容性。","ja":"破壊的変更を防止しながら、OpenTelemetry instrumentation パッケージの体系的なアップグレードを可能にします。@opentelemetry/instrumentation および全ての @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* パッケージに対する重要な変更ログ分析を提供し、JavaScript SDK エコシステム全体でのバージョン互換性を保証します。","ko":"파괴적 변경을 방지하면서 OpenTelemetry instrumentation 패키지의 체계적인 업그레이드를 가능하게 합니다. @opentelemetry/instrumentation 및 모든 @opentelemetry/instrumentation-* 패키지에 대한 중요한 변경 로그 분석을 제공하여 JavaScript SDK 생태계 전반의 버전 호환성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite la actualización sistemática de paquetes de instrumentación de OpenTelemetry mientras evita cambios de ruptura. Proporciona un análisis crítico del registro de cambios para @opentelemetry/instrumentation y todos los paquetes @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*, asegurando la compatibilidad de versiones en los ecosistemas de SDK de JavaScript.","fr":"Permet la mise à niveau systématique des packages d''instrumentation OpenTelemetry tout en évitant les changements de rupture. Fournit une analyse critique du journal des modifications pour @opentelemetry/instrumentation et tous les packages @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*, garantissant la compatibilité des versions à travers les écosystèmes de SDK JavaScript.","de":"Ermöglicht die systematische Aktualisierung von OpenTelemetry-Instrumentierungs-Paketen, während Änderungen, die zu Fehlern führen, verhindert werden. Bietet eine kritische Analyse des Änderungsprotokolls für @opentelemetry/instrumentation und alle @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*-Pakete, um die Versionskompatibilität in JavaScript-SDK-Ökosystemen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Permite o upgrade sistemático de pacotes de instrumentação do OpenTelemetry, enquanto impede alterações quebradas. Fornece análise crítica do registro de alterações para @opentelemetry/instrumentation e todos os pacotes @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*, garantindo a compatibilidade de versão em todos os ecossistemas do SDK JavaScript.","ru":"Позволяет систематически обновлять пакеты инструментирования OpenTelemetry, не допуская разрывных изменений. Обеспечивает критический анализ журнала изменений для @opentelemetry/instrumentation и всех пакетов @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*, гарантируя совместимость версий в всех экосистемах JavaScript SDK.","ar":"السماح بترقية منهجية لحزم أدوات القياس المفتوحة، في حين منع التغييرات الكاسرة. يوفر تحليل سجل التغييرات الحرج لـ @opentelemetry/instrumentation وجميع حزم @opentelemetry/instrumentation-*، مما يضمن توافق الإصدار عبر جميع بيئات SDK JavaScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating dependency version checks","Validating changelog compatibility","Sequencing package upgrade order","Preventing breaking changes in SDK updates"],"zh":["自动化依赖项版本检查","验证变更日志兼容性","排序包升级顺序","防止 SDK 更新中的破坏性变更"],"ja":["依存関係バージョンチェックの自動化","変更ログの互換性検証","パッケージアップグレード順序の決定","SDK 更新における破壊的変更の防止"],"ko":["종속성 버전 확인 자동화","변경 로그 호환성 검증","패키지 업그레이드 순서 결정","SDK 업데이트 시 파괴적 변경 방지"],"es":["Automatización de controles de versiones de dependencias","Validación de la compatibilidad del registro de cambios","Secuenciación del orden de actualización de paquetes","Prevención de cambios de ruptura en actualizaciones de SDK"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications de version de dépendances","Validation de la compatibilité du journal des modifications","Séquencement de l''ordre de mise à niveau des packages","Prévention des changements de rupture dans les mises à jour de SDK"],"de":["Automatisierung von Abhängigkeitsversionen-Checks","Validierung der Änderungsprotokoll-Kompatibilität","Sequenzierung der Paket-Aktualisierungsreihenfolge","Verhinderung von änderungen, die zu Fehlern führen, bei SDK-Updates"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de versão de dependência","Validar compatibilidade de changelog","Sequenciar ordem de upgrade de pacote","Prevenir alterações quebradas em atualizações de SDK"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки версий зависимостей","Проверять совместимость журнала изменений","Последовательно обновлять пакеты","Предотвращать разрывные изменения при обновлении SDK"],"ar":["تأتمت التحقق من إصدارات الإعتماد","تحقق من توافق سجل التغييرات","ترتيب تحديث الحزم بالتسلسل","منع التغييرات الكاسرة في تحديثات SDK"]},"limitations":{"en":["JavaScript/Node.js ecosystems only","Requires access to GitHub changelogs","Limited to OpenTelemetry instrumentation packages"],"zh":["仅限 JavaScript/Node.js 生态系统","需要访问 GitHub 变更日志","仅限于 OpenTelemetry instrumentation 包"],"ja":["JavaScript/Node.js エコシステムのみ","GitHub の変更ログへのアクセスが必要","OpenTelemetry instrumentation パッケージに限定"],"ko":["JavaScript/Node.js 생태계만 해당","GitHub 변경 로그에 대한 액세스 필요","OpenTelemetry instrumentation 패키지로만 제한됨"],"es":["Solo ecosistemas JavaScript/Node.js","Requiere acceso a los registros de cambios de GitHub","Limitado a paquetes de instrumentación de OpenTelemetry"],"fr":["Seulement les écosystèmes JavaScript/Node.js","Nécessite un accès aux journaux des modifications GitHub","Limité aux packages d''instrumentation OpenTelemetry"],"de":["Nur JavaScript/Node.js-Ökosysteme","Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub-Änderungsprotokolle","Begrenzt auf OpenTelemetry-Instrumentierungs-Pakete"],"pt":["Apenas ecossistemas JavaScript/Node.js","Requer acesso a changelogs do GitHub","Limitado a pacotes de instrumentação do OpenTelemetry"],"ru":["Только экосистемы JavaScript/Node.js","Требует доступа к журналам изменений GitHub","Ограничен пакетами инструментирования OpenTelemetry"],"ar":["بيئات جافا سكريبت/نود فقط","يتطلب الوصول إلى سجلات التغييرات الخاصة بجيت هاب","محدود بحزم أدوات القياس المفتوحة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e0d1bfbd5f40ba422b929d5364307fb66a9785aad5e953f5642f561c3e904f1e","qualityScore":35}');
