e.js"],"fr":["Implémentation minimaliste d''OAuth","Simplification de l''autorisation pour abstratium","Intégration avec des projets de développement","Compatibilité avec des flux et des exigences personnalisés","Utilisation de technologies comme React, Python et Node.js"],"de":["Minimale Implementierung von OAuth","Vereinfachung der Autorisierung für abstratium","Integration mit Entwicklungsprojekten","Kompatibilität mit benutzerdefinierten Flows und Anforderungen","Verwendung von Technologien wie React, Python und Node.js"],"pt":["Implementação minimalista de servidor de autorização OAuth","Suporte a fluxos e requisitos específicos","Integração com abstratium","Segurança e autenticação","Flexibilidade e personalização"],"ru":["Минимальная реализация сервера авторизации OAuth","Поддержка конкретных потоков и требований","Интеграция с abstratium","Безопасность и аутентификация","Гибкость и настройка"],"ar":["تنفيذ مينيمال لخادم تأمين أوفث","دعم تدفقات ومتطلبات محددة","إدماج مع abstratium","أمان وتأكييد","مرونة وتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用run-tests","什么是OAuth授权服务器","run-tests替代品","run-tests与其他工具的比较","run-tests安装指南","run-tests设置教程","OAuth授权服务器实现","abstratium集成"],"ja":["run-testsの使用方法","OAuth認可サーバーとは","run-testsの代替","run-testsと他のツールの比較","run-testsのインストールガイド","run-testsの設定チュートリアル","OAuth認可サーバーの実装","abstratiumの統合"],"ko":["run-tests 사용 방법","OAuth 인증 서버란","run-tests 대체","run-tests와 다른 도구 비교","run-tests 설치 가이드","run-tests 설정 튜토리얼","OAuth 인증 서버 구현","abstratium 통합"],"es":["cómo usar run-tests","qué es OAuth","alternativas a run-tests","run-tests vs otros agentes de AI","instalación de run-tests","guía de configuración de run-tests","desarrollo de proyectos con run-tests"],"fr":["comment utiliser run-tests","qu''est-ce que OAuth","alternatives à run-tests","run-tests vs autres outils d''IA","installation de run-tests","guide de configuration de run-tests","développement de projets avec run-tests"],"de":["wie man run-tests verwendet","was ist OAuth","alternativen zu run-tests","run-tests vs andere KI-Tools","installation von run-tests","konfigurationsanleitung für run-tests","entwicklung von projekten mit run-tests"],"pt":["como usar o skill run-tests","o que é servidor de autorização OAuth","alternativas ao skill run-tests","skill run-tests vs outros","instalar skill run-tests","guia de configuração do skill run-tests","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com skill run-tests","segurança e autenticação com skill run-tests"],"ru":["как использовать навык run-tests","что такое сервер авторизации OAuth","альтернативы навыку run-tests","навык run-tests vs другие","установка навыка run-tests","руководство по настройке навыка run-tests","разработка приложений с навыком run-tests","безопасность и аутентификация с навыком run-tests"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مهارة run-tests","ما هو خادم تأمين أوفث","بديلات لمهارة run-tests","مهارة run-tests مقابل الأخرى","تثبيت مهارة run-tests","دليل إعداد مهارة run-tests","تطوير التطبيقات مع مهارة run-tests","أمان وتأكييد مع مهارة run-tests"]}},"owner":"abstratium-dev","repo":"abstrauth","repoPath":"abstratium-dev/abstrauth","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.867Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"run-tests","description":"Runs unit and integration tests, Angular tests, and optionally also E2E tests.","bodyPreview":"# Run Tests\n\n## When to use this skill\nUse this skill when the user needs to run tests.\n\n## How to run tests\n1. Use `mvn test -DskipTests -DskipITs` to run just the Angular frontend tests.\n2. Use `mvn test` to run unit and integration tests of the Quarkus backend, as well as the Angular frontend tests.\n3. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=true PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx playwright test` in the `e2e-tests` directory to run the \"signup\" e2e tests.\n4. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=false PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx play","body":"# Run Tests\n\n## When to use this skill\nUse this skill when the user needs to run tests.\n\n## How to run tests\n1. Use `mvn test -DskipTests -DskipITs` to run just the Angular frontend tests.\n2. Use `mvn test` to run unit and integration tests of the Quarkus backend, as well as the Angular frontend tests.\n3. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=true PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx playwright test` in the `e2e-tests` directory to run the \"signup\" e2e tests.\n4. Use `ALLOW_SIGNUP=false PLAYWRIGHT_HTML_OPEN=never npx playwright test` in the `e2e-tests` directory to run the \"nosignup\" e2e tests.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:51:33.219Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring automated testing with Maven and Playwright","zh":"适用于需要使用Maven和Playwright进行自动化测试的DevOps代理","ja":"MavenとPlaywrightを使用した自動テストを必要とするDevOpsエージェントに適しています","ko":"Maven 및 Playwright를 사용한 자동 테스트가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren pruebas automatizadas con Maven y Playwright","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant des tests automatisés avec Maven et Playwright","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die automatisierte Tests mit Maven und Playwright benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agents DevOps que exigem testes automatizados com Maven e Playwright","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих автоматизированного тестирования с помощью Maven и Playwright","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل DevOps التي تتطلب اختبارًا آليًا مع Maven و Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run comprehensive tests using Maven for unit and integration tests, and Playwright for end-to-end tests, including OAuth authorization server validation and Angular frontend testing","zh":"赋予代理运行使用Maven进行单元和集成测试，以及使用Playwright进行端到端测试的能力，包括OAuth授权服务器验证和Angular前端测试","ja":"エージェントにMavenを使用したユニットと統合テスト、およびPlaywrightを使用したエンドツーエンドテスト（OAuth認証サーバーの検証とAngularフロントエンドテストを含む）を実行する能力を付与します","ko":"에이전트가 Maven을 사용한 단위 및 통합 테스트 및 Playwright를 사용한 엔드 투 엔드 테스트(OAuth 인증 서버 검증 및 Angular 프론트엔드 테스트 포함)를 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar pruebas exhaustivas utilizando Maven para pruebas unitarias e de integración, y Playwright para pruebas de extremo a extremo, incluida la validación del servidor de autorización OAuth y las pruebas de frontend de Angular","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests complets en utilisant Maven pour les tests unitaires et d''intégration, et Playwright pour les tests de bout en bout, y compris la validation du serveur d''autorisation OAuth et les tests de frontend Angular","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, umfassende Tests durchzuführen, indem Maven für Unit- und Integrationstests und Playwright für End-to-End-Tests, einschließlich OAuth-Autorisierungsserver-Validierung und Angular-Frontend-Tests, verwendet wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes abrangentes usando Maven para testes de unidade e integração, e Playwright para testes de ponta a ponta, incluindo validação do servidor de autorização OAuth e teste de frontend Angular","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять комплексные тесты, используя Maven для модульных и интеграционных тестов, и Playwright для тестов конца в конец, включая проверку сервера авторизации OAuth и тестирование frontend Angular","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تشغيل اختبارات شاملة باستخدام Maven للاختبارات الوحدوية والتكاملية، وباستخدام Playwright للاختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية، بما في ذلك التحقق من خادم مصادقة OAuth واختبار واجهة المستخدم الأمامية Angular"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Quarkus backend tests","Running Angular frontend tests with Maven","Debugging end-to-end tests using Playwright"],"zh":["自动化Quarkus后端测试","使用Maven运行Angular前端测试","使用Playwright调试端到端测试"],"ja":["Quarkusバックエンドテストの自動化","Mavenを使用したAngularフロントエンドテストの実行","Playwrightを使用したエンドツーエンドテストのデバッグ"],"ko":["Quarkus 백엔드 테스트 자동화","Maven을 사용한 Angular 프론트엔드 테스트 실행","Playwright를 사용한 엔드 투 엔드 테스트 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de backend de Quarkus","Ejecutar pruebas de frontend de Angular con Maven","Depurar pruebas de extremo a extremo con Playwright"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de backend Quarkus","Exécuter les tests de frontend Angular avec Maven","Déboguer les tests de bout en bout avec Playwright"],"de":["Automatisierung von Quarkus-Backend-Tests","Ausführen von Angular-Frontend-Tests mit Maven","Debuggen von End-to-End-Tests mit Playwright"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de backend Quarkus","Executar testes de frontend Angular com Maven","Depurar testes de ponta a ponta usando Playwright"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тесты бэкенда Quarkus","Выполнять тесты фронтенда Angular с помощью Maven","Отлаживать тесты конца в конец, используя Playwright"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبارات backend Quarkus","تشغيل اختبارات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية Angular مع Maven","تصحيح اختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية باستخدام Playwright"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Maven installation","Limited to specific test environments (e.g., Quarkus, Angular, Playwright)"],"zh":["需要Maven安装","仅限于特定的测试环境（例如Quarkus，Angular，Playwright）"],"ja":["Mavenのインストールが必要","特定のテスト環境（例：Quarkus、Angular、Playwright）に限定される"],"ko":["Maven 설치가 필요함","특정 테스트 환경(예: Quarkus, Angular, Playwright)로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Maven","Limitado a entornos de prueba específicos (por ejemplo, Quarkus, Angular, Playwright)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Maven","Limité à des environnements de test spécifiques (par exemple, Quarkus, Angular, Playwright)"],"de":["Benötigt Maven-Installation","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Testumgebungen (z.B. Quarkus, Angular, Playwright)"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Maven","Limitado a ambientes de teste específicos (por exemplo, Quarkus, Angular, Playwright)"],"ru":["Требует установки Maven","Ограничен конкретными тестовыми средами (например, Quarkus, Angular, Playwright)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Maven","محدود بالبيئات الاختبارية المحددة (على سبيل المثال Quarkus و Angular و Playwright)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"caa388b7aa4d7608c429cec8690409913b3361c17d74f92de383988850fe2ccf","qualityScore":35}');
