スや個人データを簡単に管理し、効率化するためのツールです","ko":"CRM 동기화 AI 에이전트는 비즈니스 또는 개인데이터를 간단하게 관리하고 효율성을 높이는 도구입니다","es":"crm-sync es una herramienta de Inteligencia Artificial que actúa como una segunda cerebro para tus necesidades comerciales o personales","fr":"crm-sync est un outil d''Intelligence Artificielle qui agit comme un deuxième cerveau pour vos besoins commerciaux ou personnels","de":"crm-sync ist ein KI-Tool, das als zweites Gehirn für Ihre geschäftlichen oder persönlichen Bedürfnisse dient","pt":"A ferramenta de sincronização CRM é uma solução inovadora que ajuda a gerenciar contatos e leads de forma eficiente","ru":"ИИ Агент для синхронизации CRM - это инновационное решение, которое помогает эффективно управлять контактами и лидами","ar":"أداة تزامن CRM هي حل متقدم يساعد في إدارة الاتصالات والعملاء بفعالية","en":"A second brain for your business or personal needs"},"definition":{"en":"A second brain for your business or personal needs"},"features":{"zh":["自动同步数据","支持多种数据格式","高效的数据管理","安全可靠的数据存储","易于使用的界面"],"ja":["自動でデータを同期","様々なデータ形式をサポート","効率的なデータ管理","安全で信頼できるデータストレージ","使いやすいインターフェース"],"ko":["자동으로 데이터를 동기화","다양한 데이터 형식을 지원","효율적인 데이터 관리","안전하고 신뢰할 수 있는 데이터 저장","사용하기 쉬운 인터페이스"],"es":["Sincronización automática de datos","Análisis de datos avanzado con Inteligencia Artificial","Integración con herramientas de productividad","Seguridad de datos de nivel empresarial","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva"],"fr":["Synchronisation automatique des données","Analyse de données avancée avec l''Intelligence Artificielle","Intégration avec des outils de productivité","Sécurité des données de niveau entreprise","Interface utilisateur intuitive"],"de":["Automatische Datensynchronisation","Erweiterte Datenanalyse mit KI","Integration mit Produktivitätstools","Unternehmenssicherheit für Daten","Intuitive Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Integração com plataformas de CRM","Sincronização automática de contatos e leads","Análise de dados e relatórios personalizados","Integração com ferramentas de marketing e vendas","Segurança e privacidade de dados garantidas"],"ru":["Интеграция с платформами CRM","Автоматическая синхронизация контактов и лидов","Анализ данных и индивидуальные отчеты","Интеграция с инструментами маркетинга и продаж","Гарантия безопасности и конфиденциальности данных"],"ar":["التكامل مع منصات إدارة علاقات العملاء","التزامن التلقائي للاتصالات والعملاء","تحليل البيانات وتقارير مخصصة","التكامل مع أدوات التسويق والمبيعات","ضمان أمان وسرية البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CRM 同步工具","AI 工具","数据管理","效率提高","CRM 同步 AI 工具教程","如何使用 CRM 同步工具","CRM 同步工具与其他工具的比较","CRM 同步工具安装指南"],"ja":["CRM 同期ツール","AI エージェント","データ管理","効率化","CRM 同期 AI エージェントの使い方","CRM 同期ツールの比較","CRM 同期ツールのインストールガイド","CRM 同期 AI エージェントのセットアップ"],"ko":["CRM 동기화 도구","AI 에이전트","데이터 관리","효율성 향상","CRM 동기화 AI 에이전트 사용법","CRM 동기화 도구 비교","CRM 동기화 도구 설치 가이드","CRM 동기화 AI 에이전트 설정"],"es":["herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial","crm-sync alternativa","crm-sync vs otros","cómo usar crm-sync","instalación de crm-sync","guía de configuración de crm-sync"],"fr":["outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","alternative à crm-sync","crm-sync vs autres","comment utiliser crm-sync","installation de crm-sync","guide de configuration de crm-sync"],"de":["KI-Tools","crm-sync Alternative","crm-sync vs andere","wie man crm-sync verwendet","Installation von crm-sync","Einrichtungsanleitung für crm-sync"],"pt":["ferramenta de sincronização CRM","como usar ferramenta de sincronização CRM","o que é ferramenta de sincronização CRM","ferramenta de sincronização CRM alternative","ferramenta de sincronização CRM vs outras ferramentas","instalar ferramenta de sincronização CRM","guia de configuração da ferramenta de sincronização CRM"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для синхронизации CRM","как использовать ИИ Агент для синхронизации CRM","что такое ИИ Агент для синхронизации CRM","ИИ Агент для синхронизации CRM альтернатива","ИИ Агент для синхронизации CRM vs другие инструменты","установить ИИ Агент для синхронизации CRM","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента для синхронизации CRM"],"ar":["أداة تزامن CRM","كيفية استخدام أداة تزامن CRM","ما هي أداة تزامن CRM","أداة تزامن CRM بديلة","أداة تزامن CRM مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أداة تزامن CRM","دليل إعداد أداة تزامن CRM"]}},"owner":"brainqub3","repo":"brainqub3","repoPath":"brainqub3/brainqub3","stars":10,"forks":11,"updatedAt":"2026-02-07T19:18:14Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"crm-sync","description":"Sync leads from Zoho CRM into the local SQLite database. Fetches all leads, performs upserts with change detection, and maintains full audit history.","bodyPreview":"# crm-sync (CRM Lead Sync)\n\nSynchronise leads from Zoho CRM into the local SQLite database.\n\n## Database\n\n- **Path**: `raw/crm/crm.db`\n- **Schema**: `scripts/crm/db_schema.sql`\n\n### Tables\n\n**leads** (current state):\n- id (TEXT PRIMARY KEY) - Zoho record ID\n- first_name, last_name, company, email, phone, lead_source, description\n- created_at, updated_at - local timestamps\n- zoho_modified_time - Modified_Time from Zoho\n\n**leads_history** (audit trail):\n- All lead fields plus captured_at and chang","body":"# crm-sync (CRM Lead Sync)\n\nSynchronise leads from Zoho CRM into the local SQLite database.\n\n## Database\n\n- **Path**: `raw/crm/crm.db`\n- **Schema**: `scripts/crm/db_schema.sql`\n\n### Tables\n\n**leads** (current state):\n- id (TEXT PRIMARY KEY) - Zoho record ID\n- first_name, last_name, company, email, phone, lead_source, description\n- created_at, updated_at - local timestamps\n- zoho_modified_time - Modified_Time from Zoho\n\n**leads_history** (audit trail):\n- All lead fields plus captured_at and change_type (''insert'', ''update'', ''delete'')\n\n**sync_log** (sync metadata):\n- started_at, completed_at, records_fetched, records_inserted, records_updated, status, error_message\n\n## Procedure\n\n### Step 1: Initialise Database\n\nEnsure the database exists with correct schema:\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p raw/crm\nsqlite3 raw/crm/crm.db < scripts/crm/db_schema.sql\n```\n\n### Step 2: Start Sync Log\n\n```bash\nsqlite3 raw/crm/crm.db \"INSERT INTO sync_log (started_at, status) VALUES (datetime(''now''), ''running''); SELECT last_insert_rowid();\"\n```\n\nSave the returned ID for later update.\n\n### Step 3: Fetch Leads from Zoho\n\nUse `mcp__zoho-crm__ZohoCRM_Get_Records`:\n- module: \"Leads\"\n- fields: \"id,First_Name,Last_Name,Company,Email,Phone,Lead_Source,Description,Modified_Time\"\n\nHandle pagination if more than one page of results.\n\n### Step 4: Upsert Each Lead\n\nFor each lead returned from Zoho:\n\n**4a. Check if exists:**\n```bash\nsqlite3 raw/crm/crm.db \"SELECT id, zoho_modified_time FROM leads WHERE id = ''{lead_id}'';\"\n```\n\n**4b. If new lead** (not in database):\n```bash\nsqlite3 raw/crm/crm.db \"\nINSERT INTO leads (id, first_name, last_name, company, email, phone, lead_source, description, created_at, updated_at, zoho_modified_time)\nVALUES (''{id}'', ''{first_name}'', ''{last_name}'', ''{company}'', ''{email}'', ''{phone}'', ''{lead_source}'', ''{description}'', datetime(''now''), datetime(''now''), ''{modified_time}'');\n\nINSERT INTO leads_history (lead_id, first_name, last_name, company, email, phone, lead_source, description, captured_at, change_type)\nVALUES (''{id}'', ''{first_name}'', ''{last_name}'', ''{company}'', ''{email}'', ''{phone}'', ''{lead_source}'', ''{description}'', datetime(''now''), ''insert'');\n\"\n```\n\n**4c. If existing and Zoho version is newer** (compare zoho_modified_time):\n```bash\nsqlite3 raw/crm/crm.db \"\n-- Capture old version to history\nINSERT INTO leads_history (lead_id, first_name, last_name, company, email, phone, lead_source, description, captured_at, change_type)\nSELECT id, first_name, last_name, company, email, phone, lead_source, description, datetime(''now''), ''update''\nFROM leads WHERE id = ''{id}'';\n\n-- Update the lead\nUPDATE leads SET\n  first_name = ''{first_name}'',\n  last_name = ''{last_name}'',\n  company = ''{company}'',\n  email = ''{email}'',\n  phone = ''{phone}'',\n  lead_source = ''{lead_source}'',\n  description = ''{description}'',\n  updated_at = datetime(''now''),\n  zoho_modified_time = ''{modified_time}''\nWHERE id = ''{id}'';\n\"\n```\n\n**4d. If unchanged** (same or older zoho_modified_time): Skip.\n\n### Step 5: Update Sync Log\n\nOn success:\n```bash\nsqlite3 raw/crm/crm.db \"\nUPDATE sync_log SET\n  completed_at = datetime(''now''),\n  records_fetched = {fetched},\n  records_inserted = {inserted},\n  records_updated = {updated},\n  status = ''completed''\nWHERE id = {sync_id};\n\"\n```\n\nOn failure:\n```bash\nsqlite3 raw/crm/crm.db \"\nUPDATE sync_log SET\n  completed_at = datetime(''now''),\n  status = ''failed'',\n  error_message = ''{error}''\nWHERE id = {sync_id};\n\"\n```\n\n### Step 6: Report Results\n\nOutput a summary:\n- Records fetched\n- New leads inserted\n- Existing leads updated\n- Unchanged (skipped)\n- Any errors\n\n## Field Mapping\n\n| Zoho Field     | Database Column      |\n|----------------|----------------------|\n| id             | id                   |\n| First_Name     | first_name           |\n| Last_Name      | last_name            |\n| Company        | company              |\n| Email          | email                |\n| Phone          | phone                |\n| Lead_Source    | lead_source          |\n| Description    | description          |\n| Modified_Time  | zoho_modified_time   |\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- If MCP credentials are missing: Report what''s needed\n- If API rate limits hit: Wait and retry, or report partial progress\n- If database errors occur: Log to sync_log with error_message\n- Always update sync_log status even on failure\n\n## Privacy\n\n- Do not display full email addresses or phone numbers in output\n- Show redacted summaries unless user explicitly requests full details\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:35:03.637Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Business Automation Agents needing seamless Zoho CRM and SQLite database integration.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝集成Zoho CRM和SQLite数据库的商业自动化代理。","ja":"Zoho CRMとSQLiteデータベースのシームレスな統合を必要とするビジネスオートメーションエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Zoho CRM과 SQLite 데이터베이스의 무결점 통합이 필요한 비즈니스 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización Empresarial que necesitan una integración fluida con Zoho CRM y la base de datos SQLite.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation commerciale nécessitant une intégration transparente de Zoho CRM et de la base de données SQLite.","de":"Perfekt für Geschäftsanwendungs-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine nahtlose Integration von Zoho CRM und SQLite-Datenbank benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Negócios que necessitam de integração perfeita com o Zoho CRM e o banco de dados SQLite.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бизнес-автоматизации, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция с Zoho CRM и базой данных SQLite.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة الأعمال التي تحتاج إلى التكامل السلس بين Zoho CRM وقاعدة بيانات SQLite."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to synchronize leads from Zoho CRM into a local SQLite database, leveraging SQL queries and database schema management with scripts like db_schema.sql, while tracking lead history and updates through tables like leads and leads_history.","zh":"赋予代理人将Zoho CRM的线索同步到本地SQLite数据库的能力，利用SQL查询和脚本（如db_schema.sql）进行数据库架构管理，同时通过leads和leads_history等表格跟踪线索历史和更新。","ja":"Zoho CRMからのリードをローカルのSQLiteデータベースに同期するエージェントをEmpowerし、SQLクエリやスクリプト（db_schema.sqlなど）によるデータベーススキーマ管理を可能にし、同時にリードの履歴や更新をleadsやleads_historyなどのテーブルで追跡します。","ko":"에이전트가 Zoho CRM의 리드를 로컬 SQLite 데이터베이스에 동기화할 수 있도록 강화하고, SQL 쿼리 및 스크립트(db_schema.sql 等)를 사용한 데이터베이스 스키마 관리가 가능하며, 동시에 leads 및 leads_history 등의 테이블을 통해 리드의 기록 및 업데이트를 추적합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a sincronizar prospectos de Zoho CRM con una base de datos SQLite local, aprovechando consultas SQL y gestión de esquema de base de datos con scripts como db_schema.sql, mientras rastrea el historial y las actualizaciones de los prospectos a través de tablas como leads y leads_history.","fr":"Autorise les agents à synchroniser les prospects de Zoho CRM avec une base de données SQLite locale, en exploitant les requêtes SQL et la gestion du schéma de base de données avec des scripts comme db_schema.sql, tout en suivant l''historique et les mises à jour des prospects via des tables comme leads et leads_history.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Leads von Zoho CRM in eine lokale SQLite-Datenbank zu synchronisieren, indem SQL-Abfragen und Datenbankschemaverwaltung mit Skripten wie db_schema.sql genutzt werden, während die Historie und Aktualisierungen der Leads über Tabellen wie leads und leads_history nachverfolgt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a sincronizar leads do Zoho CRM para um banco de dados SQLite local, aproveitando consultas SQL e gerenciamento de esquema de banco de dados com scripts como db_schema.sql, além de acompanhar o histórico e atualizações de leads por meio de tabelas como leads e leads_history.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью синхронизировать лиды из Zoho CRM в локальную базу данных SQLite, используя запросы SQL и управление схемой базы данных с помощью скриптов, таких как db_schema.sql, а также отслеживать историю и обновления лидов через таблицы, такие как leads и leads_history.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من مزامنة قوائم العملاء من Zoho CRM مع قاعدة بيانات SQLite محلية، واستخدام استفسارات SQL وإدارة مخطط قاعدة البيانات مع سكريبتات مثل db_schema.sql، بالإضافة إلى تتبع تاريخ وتحديثات قائمة العملاء من خلال جداول مثل leads وleads_history."},"useCases":{"en":["Synchronizing Zoho CRM leads with local databases","Tracking lead updates and modifications through audit trails","Analyzing lead sources and demographics using SQL queries"],"zh":["将Zoho CRM的线索与本地数据库同步","通过审计跟踪跟踪线索更新和修改","使用SQL查询分析线索来源和人口统计"],"ja":["Zoho CRMのリードをローカルデータベースと同期する","監査トレイルを通じてリードの更新や変更を追跡する","SQLクエリを使用してリードのソースや人口統計を分析する"],"ko":["Zoho CRM의 리드를 로컬 데이터베이스와 동기화하는 것","감사 추적을 통해 리드의 업데이트와 수정을 추적하는 것","SQL 쿼리를 사용하여 리드의 출처 및 인구 통계를 분석하는 것"],"es":["Sincronización de prospectos de Zoho CRM con bases de datos locales","Seguimiento de actualizaciones y modificaciones de prospectos a través de auditorías","Análisis de fuentes y demografía de prospectos utilizando consultas SQL"],"fr":["Synchronisation des prospects de Zoho CRM avec des bases de données locales","Suivi des mises à jour et des modifications de prospects via des audits","Analyse des sources et de la démographie des prospects à l''aide de requêtes SQL"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Leads von Zoho CRM mit lokalen Datenbanken","Nachverfolgung von Lead-Aktualisierungen und -Änderungen über Audit-Protokolle","Analyse von Lead-Quellen und -Demografie mit Hilfe von SQL-Abfragen"],"pt":["Sincronizar leads do Zoho CRM com bancos de dados locais","Acompanhar atualizações e modificações de leads por meio de registros de auditoria","Analizar fontes e demografia de leads usando consultas SQL"],"ru":["Синхронизировать лиды Zoho CRM с локальными базами данных","Отслеживать обновления и изменения лидов через аудиторские трейлы","Анализировать источники и демографию лидов с помощью запросов SQL"],"ar":["مزامنة قوائم العملاء من Zoho CRM مع قواعد بيانات محلية","تتبع تحديثات وتعديلات قائمة العملاء من خلال سجلات التدقيق","تحليل مصادر وديمغرافية قائمة العملاء باستخدام استفسارات SQL"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Zoho CRM access","SQLite database compatibility only","Dependent on scripts like db_schema.sql for schema management"],"zh":["需要Zoho CRM的访问权限","仅兼容SQLite数据库","依赖于脚本（如db_schema.sql）进行架构管理"],"ja":["Zoho CRMへのアクセスが必要","SQLiteデータベースのみと互換性がある","スキーマ管理にはスクリプト（db_schema.sqlなど）への依存"],"ko":["Zoho CRM에 대한 액세스 권한이 필요함","SQLite 데이터베이스만과 호환됨","스키마 관리에는 스크립트(db_schema.sql 등)에 대한 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Zoho CRM","Compatibilidad solo con base de datos SQLite","Dependiente de scripts como db_schema.sql para la gestión del esquema"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Zoho CRM","Compatibilité uniquement avec la base de données SQLite","Dépendant de scripts comme db_schema.sql pour la gestion du schéma"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Zoho CRM","Kompatibilität nur mit SQLite-Datenbank","Abhängig von Skripten wie db_schema.sql für die Schemaverwaltung"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao Zoho CRM","Compatibilidade apenas com banco de dados SQLite","Dependente de scripts como db_schema.sql para gerenciamento de esquema"],"ru":["Требует доступа к Zoho CRM","Совместимость только с базой данных SQLite","Зависит от скриптов, таких как db_schema.sql, для управления схемой"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى Zoho CRM","التوافق مع قاعدة بيانات SQLite فقط","يعتمد على سكريبتات مثل db_schema.sql لإدارة مخطط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7adca2a73636fdef2fbf6fb85ab6eb9c6b7ce1bc7f95eb2d90d5b72bddf76fba","qualityScore":34}');
