 mit KI","Integration mit LifeOS Programme","Verbesserung der Effizienz in Arbeitsabläufen","Unterstützung für Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js"],"pt":["Otimização de desenvolvimento de programas","Integração com plataforma LifeOS","Melhoria da eficiência e produtividade","Ferramenta de IA para desenvolvedores","Suporte à construção de programas personalizados"],"ru":["Оптимизация разработки программ","Интеграция с платформой LifeOS","Повышение эффективности и производительности","Инструмент ИИ для разработчиков","Поддержка создания индивидуальных программ"],"ar":["تحسين تطوير البرامج","التكامل مع منصة LifeOS","تحسين الكفاءة والإنتاجية","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين","دعم إنشاء برامج مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 close-build","什么是 close-build","close-build 代替方案","close-build 安装","close-build 设置指南","LifeOS Programme 教程","React 和 close-build","Node.js 和 close-build"],"ja":["close-build の使用方法","close-build とは","close-build の代替","close-build のインストール","close-build の設定ガイド","LifeOS Programme のチュートリアル","React と close-build","Node.js と close-build"],"ko":["close-build 사용법","close-build 이란","close-build 대체方案","close-build 설치","close-build 설정 가이드","LifeOS Programme 튜토리얼","React 및 close-build","Node.js 및 close-build"],"es":["cómo usar close-build","qué es close-build","herramientas de AI para desarrollo","close-build vs otras herramientas de AI","guía de instalación de close-build","configuración de close-build para LifeOS Programme"],"fr":["comment utiliser close-build","qu''est-ce que close-build","outils d''IA pour le développement","close-build vs d''autres outils d''IA","guide d''installation de close-build","configuration de close-build pour LifeOS Programme"],"de":["wie man close-build verwendet","was ist close-build","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","close-build vs andere KI-Tools","Installationsanleitung für close-build","Konfiguration von close-build für LifeOS Programme"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","close-build","lifeos programme","desenvolvimento de programas","otimização de desenvolvimento","como usar close-build","o que é close-build","alternative ao close-build","close-build vs outros"],"ru":["инструменты ии","close-build","lifeos programme","разработка программ","оптимизация разработки","как использовать close-build","что такое close-build","альтернатива close-build","close-build vs другие"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","close-build","برنامج lifeos","تطوير البرامج","تحسين التطوير","كيفية استخدام close-build","ما هي close-build","بديل close-build","close-build مقابل autres"]}},"owner":"marcusglee11","repo":"LifeOS","repoPath":"marcusglee11/LifeOS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T21:18:45Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"close-build","description":"Use when a branch is ready to close. Closure gates (tests, doc stewardship) are enforced automatically by the PreToolUse hook on git merge/push. This skill handles merge orchestration, cleanup, and the final report.","bodyPreview":"# Close Build\n\nMerge to main and clean up. Closure gates run automatically via the PreToolUse hook.\n\n## Default behavior\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/close_build.py\n```\n\nThis runs:\n- squash merge to `main`,\n- local cleanup (branch delete + active context clear).\n\nNote: targeted closure tests and doc stewardship are enforced by the\n`.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` PreToolUse hook on `git merge`/`git push`.\nThey no longer need to be invoked manually.\n\n## Dry run (gates only)\n\n```bash\npytho","body":"# Close Build\n\nMerge to main and clean up. Closure gates run automatically via the PreToolUse hook.\n\n## Default behavior\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/close_build.py\n```\n\nThis runs:\n- squash merge to `main`,\n- local cleanup (branch delete + active context clear).\n\nNote: targeted closure tests and doc stewardship are enforced by the\n`.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` PreToolUse hook on `git merge`/`git push`.\nThey no longer need to be invoked manually.\n\n## Dry run (gates only)\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/closure_gate.py\n```\n\nUse to check gate status without merge/cleanup. Returns JSON verdict.\n\n## No cleanup mode\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/close_build.py --no-cleanup\n```\n\nUse when you need to keep branch/context after merge.\n\n## Git worktree constraint\n\nRun `close_build.py` (and underlying `closure_pack.py`) from the **worktree directory**, not the primary repo.\n\nWhen `main` is already checked out in the primary worktree, the script\ndetects this automatically (via `git branch --show-current` on the repo root)\nand skips the `checkout main` step. The merge proceeds against the primary\nworktree''s `main` directly.\n\nIf you accidentally run from the primary repo on a scoped branch, it hard-blocks\nwith `ISOLATION_REQUIRED`. Recover in one command:\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/workflow/start_build.py --recover-primary\n```\n\n## Report contract (strict)\n\nOutput must use this section order:\n\n1. `Branch`\n2. `Commits`\n3. `Test Results`\n4. `What Was Done`\n5. `What Remains`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T04:00:51.876Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Git-based AI Agents requiring automated merge and cleanup capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要自动合并和清理功能的基于 Git 的 AI 代理。","ja":"Git ベースの AI エージェントが自動マージとクリーンアップ機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"自動 병합 및 정리 기능이 필요한 Git 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Git que requieren capacidades de fusión y limpieza automatizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Git nécessitant des capacités de fusion et de nettoyage automatisées.","de":"Ideal für Git-basierte KI-Agents, die automatisierte Merge- und Bereinigungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Git que requerem capacidades de mesclagem e limpeza automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Git, требующих автоматических возможностей слияния и очистки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إيه آي القائم على جيت الذي يتطلب قدرات دمج وتنظيف آلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate squash merges to the main branch, perform local cleanup, and enforce targeted closure tests via the PreToolUse hook, utilizing Python scripts and Git hooks.","zh":"赋予代理自动执行压缩合并到主分支、执行本地清理和通过 PreToolUse hook 强制执行目标闭合测试的能力，利用 Python 脚本和 Git hooks。","ja":"エージェントに主ブランチへの自動スッッシュマージ、ローカルクリーニング、PreToolUse hook経由でのターゲットクロージャーテストの適用を実行する能力を付与し、Python スクリプトと Git hooks を利用します。","ko":"에이전트에게 자동으로 메인 브랜치에 스쿼시 병합을 수행하고, 로컬 정리 및 PreToolUse hook를 통해 대상 폐쇄 테스트를 강제하는 기능을 부여하며, Python 스크립트와 Git hooks를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las fusiones de squash en la rama principal, realizar una limpieza local y aplicar pruebas de cierre dirigidas a través del hook PreToolUse, utilizando scripts de Python y hooks de Git.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les fusions de squash sur la branche principale, d''effectuer un nettoyage local et d''appliquer des tests de fermeture ciblés via le hook PreToolUse, en utilisant des scripts Python et des hooks Git.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Squash-Merges zum Hauptzweig zu automatisieren, eine lokale Bereinigung durchzuführen und gezielte Abschlusstests über den PreToolUse-Hook durchzuführen, indem Python-Skripte und Git-Hooks verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a mesclagem de squash para a branch principal, realizar limpeza local e aplicar testes de fechamento direcionados via hook PreToolUse, utilizando scripts Python e hooks Git.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции слияния в основную ветку, выполнять локальную очистку и обеспечивать нацеленные тесты закрытия через хук PreToolUse, используя скрипты Python и хуки Git.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من توفير آلي لدمج السكواتش إلى الفرع الرئيسي، وإجراء تنظيف محلي، وفرض اختبارات إغلاق مستهدفة عبر كروك PreToolUse، باستخدام سكريبتات بايثون وكروكات جيت."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating merge and cleanup processes for Git repositories","Enforcing closure tests and documentation stewardship via PreToolUse hooks","Streamlining branch management with automated branch deletion"],"zh":["自动化 Git 存储库的合并和清理过程","通过 PreToolUse hooks 强制执行闭合测试和文档管理","使用自动分支删除简化分支管理"],"ja":["Git リポジトリのマージとクリーンアッププロセスの自動化","PreToolUse hooks 経由でのクロージャーテストとドキュメント管理の適用","自動ブランチ削除を使用したブランチ管理の簡素化"],"ko":["Git 저장소의 병합 및 정리 프로세스를 자동화하는 것","PreToolUse hooks를 통해 폐쇄 테스트 및 문서 관리를 강제하는 것","자동 브랜치 삭제를 사용하여 브랜치 관리를 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar procesos de fusión y limpieza para repositorios Git","Aplicar pruebas de cierre y gestión de documentación a través de hooks PreToolUse","Optimizar la gestión de ramas con eliminación de ramas automatizada"],"fr":["Automatiser les processus de fusion et de nettoyage pour les référentiels Git","Appliquer des tests de fermeture et une gestion de documentation via des hooks PreToolUse","Optimiser la gestion des branches avec une suppression de branches automatisée"],"de":["Automatisierung von Merge- und Bereinigungsprozessen für Git-Repositorys","Durchführung von Abschlusstests und Dokumentationsverwaltung über PreToolUse-Hooks","Optimierung der Verwaltung von Zweigen mit automatisierter Zweiglöschung"],"pt":["Automatizar processos de mesclagem e limpeza para repositórios Git","Aplicar testes de fechamento e gestão de documentação via hooks PreToolUse","Otimizar gerenciamento de branch com exclusão de branch automatizada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процессы слияния и очистки для репозиториев Git","Обеспечивать тесты закрытия и управление документацией через хуки PreToolUse","Оптимизировать управление ветками с автоматическим удалением веток"],"ar":["توفير آلي لعملية الدمج والتنظيف لمخازن جيت","تطبيق اختبارات الإغلاق وحراسة الوثائق عبر كروكات PreToolUse","تبسيط إدارة الفروع مع حذف الفروع الآلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3 and Git installation","Limited to Git-based version control systems","Dependent on `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` hook for automated closure tests"],"zh":["需要 Python 3 和 Git 安装","仅限 Git 基础的版本控制系统","依赖于 `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` hook 进行自动闭合测试"],"ja":["Python 3 と Git のインストールが必要","Git ベースのバージョン管理システムのみ","自動クロージャーテストに `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` hook 依存"],"ko":["Python 3 및 Git 설치가 필요함","Git 기반의 버전 관리 시스템만 해당함","자동 폐쇄 테스트에 `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` hook에 의존"],"es":["Requiere Python 3 y instalación de Git","Limitado a sistemas de control de versiones basados en Git","Dependiente del hook `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` para pruebas de cierre automatizadas"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3 et installation de Git","Limité aux systèmes de contrôle de version basés sur Git","Dépendant du hook `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` pour des tests de fermeture automatisés"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3 und Git-Installation","Begrenzt auf Git-basierte Versionskontrollsysteme","Abhängig vom Hook `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` für automatisierte Abschlusstests"],"pt":["Exige Python 3 e instalação do Git","Limitado a sistemas de controle de versão baseados em Git","Dependente do hook `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` para testes de fechamento automatizados"],"ru":["Требует Python 3 и установки Git","Ограничен системами контроля версий на основе Git","Зависит от хука `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` для автоматических тестов закрытия"],"ar":["يتطلب بايثون 3 وتركيب جيت","محدود بنظم تحكم الإصدار القائمة على جيت","يعتمد على كروك `.claude/hooks/close-build-gate.sh` لاختبارات الإغلاق الآلية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b16067dc94546daac78ec1f294a858956459d8941e95ea340d8b1d55d88cb01d","qualityScore":34}');
