Specialistのインストール","Firebase Test Lab Specialistの設定ガイド","GCP VPNプロジェクト","個人VPNプロジェクトの構築"],"ko":["Firebase Test Lab Specialist 사용 방법","Firebase Test Lab Specialist란","Firebase Test Lab Specialist 대안","Firebase Test Lab Specialist vs 다른 도구","Firebase Test Lab Specialist 설치","Firebase Test Lab Specialist 설정 가이드","GCP VPN 프로젝트","개인 VPN 프로젝트 구축"],"es":["cómo crear un proyecto VPN personal","Firebase Test Lab especialista","GCP y Firebase","mejora de la seguridad de aplicaciones","pruebas y depuración de aplicaciones","herramientas de GCP","alternativas a Firebase Test Lab","instalación de Firebase Test Lab"],"fr":["comment créer un projet VPN personnel","spécialiste de Firebase Test Lab","GCP et Firebase","amélioration de la sécurité des applications","tests et débogage d''applications","outils GCP","alternatives à Firebase Test Lab","installation de Firebase Test Lab"],"de":["wie man ein persönliches VPN-Projekt erstellt","Firebase Test Lab Spezialist","GCP und Firebase","Verbesserung der Sicherheit von Anwendungen","Tests und Fehlerbehebung von Anwendungen","GCP-Tools","Alternativen zu Firebase Test Lab","Installation von Firebase Test Lab"],"pt":["como usar Firebase Test Lab","o que é Firebase Test Lab","Firebase Test Lab vs Appium","instalar Firebase Test Lab","guia de configuração do Firebase Test Lab","melhores práticas para Firebase Test Lab","Firebase Test Lab para aplicativos móveis","Firebase Test Lab para aplicativos web","otimização de desempenho com Firebase Test Lab"],"ru":["как использовать Firebase Test Lab","что такое Firebase Test Lab","Firebase Test Lab vs Appium","установка Firebase Test Lab","руководство по настройке Firebase Test Lab","лучшие практики для Firebase Test Lab","Firebase Test Lab для мобильных приложений","Firebase Test Lab для веб-приложений","оптимизация производительности с помощью Firebase Test Lab"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام معمل الاختبار فيirebase","ما هو معمل الاختبار فيirebase","معمل الاختبار فيirebase مقابل Appium","تثبيت معمل الاختبار فيirebase","دليل إعداد معمل الاختبار فيirebase","أفضل الممارسات لمعمل الاختبار فيirebase","معمل الاختبار فيirebase للتطبيقات المتنقلة","معمل الاختبار فيirebase للتطبيقات الويب","تحسين الأداء باستخدام معمل الاختبار فيirebase"]}},"owner":"dawink5674","repo":"sovereign-vpn-core","repoPath":"dawink5674/sovereign-vpn-core","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T00:40:18Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Firebase Test Lab Specialist","description":"Automated Android testing via Firebase Test Lab — robo tests, instrumentation tests, device matrix configuration, and test result analysis.","bodyPreview":"# Firebase Test Lab Specialist\n\n## Overview\n\nFirebase Test Lab is the primary testing mechanism for the Dragon Scale VPN project. It runs tests on real and virtual Android devices in Google''s cloud infrastructure, providing screenshots, logs, video recordings, and crash reports.\n\n**Primary Test Device:** Pixel 10 Pro Fold (codename `rango`, API 36, physical device)\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### 1. Running Robo Tests (No Test Code Required)\n\nRobo tests automatically crawl the app UI and detect crashes,","body":"# Firebase Test Lab Specialist\n\n## Overview\n\nFirebase Test Lab is the primary testing mechanism for the Dragon Scale VPN project. It runs tests on real and virtual Android devices in Google''s cloud infrastructure, providing screenshots, logs, video recordings, and crash reports.\n\n**Primary Test Device:** Pixel 10 Pro Fold (codename `rango`, API 36, physical device)\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### 1. Running Robo Tests (No Test Code Required)\n\nRobo tests automatically crawl the app UI and detect crashes, layout issues, and ANRs.\n\n```bash\n# Primary: Pixel 10 Pro Fold (user''s actual device)\ngcloud firebase test android run --type=robo \\\n  --app=dragon-scale-vpn/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk \\\n  --device \"model=rango,version=36,locale=en,orientation=portrait\" \\\n  --timeout=300s --project=cloud-vpn-12110\n\n# Secondary: Medium Phone virtual device (API 34, fast feedback)\ngcloud firebase test android run --type=robo \\\n  --app=dragon-scale-vpn/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk \\\n  --device \"model=MediumPhone.arm,version=34\" \\\n  --timeout=300s --project=cloud-vpn-12110\n\n# Full matrix: Pixel 10 Pro Fold + Medium Phone + Pixel Fold (legacy foldable)\ngcloud firebase test android run --type=robo \\\n  --app=dragon-scale-vpn/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk \\\n  --device \"model=rango,version=36\" \\\n  --device \"model=MediumPhone.arm,version=34\" \\\n  --device \"model=felix,version=34\" \\\n  --timeout=300s --project=cloud-vpn-12110\n```\n\n### 2. Running Instrumentation Tests\n\nFor targeted verification of specific features (GeoIP, NetworkMonitor, etc.).\n\n```bash\n# Build test APK first\n$env:JAVA_HOME = \"C:\\Program Files\\Android\\Android Studio\\jbr\"\n.\\gradlew assembleDebug assembleDebugAndroidTest\n\n# Run on Pixel 10 Pro Fold\ngcloud firebase test android run --type=instrumentation \\\n  --app=dragon-scale-vpn/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk \\\n  --test=dragon-scale-vpn/app/build/outputs/apk/androidTest/debug/app-debug-androidTest.apk \\\n  --device \"model=rango,version=36\" \\\n  --timeout=600s --project=cloud-vpn-12110\n```\n\n### 3. Viewing Results\n\n```bash\n# List recent test runs\ngcloud firebase test android list --project=cloud-vpn-12110\n\n# Get detailed results (URL provided after test run)\ngcloud firebase test android results describe <TEST_MATRIX_ID> --project=cloud-vpn-12110\n```\n\n## Device Matrix\n\n| Priority | Model ID | Device Name | API | Type |\n|----------|----------|-------------|-----|------|\n| **Primary** | `rango` | Pixel 10 Pro Fold | 36 | Physical |\n| Secondary | `MediumPhone.arm` | Medium Phone 6.4\" | 34 | Virtual |\n| Foldable Legacy | `felix` | Pixel Fold | 34 | Physical |\n\n## Testing Strategy for Dragon Scale VPN\n\n### What Firebase CAN Test\n- **UI rendering** — Compose layouts, foldable adaptations, theme colors\n- **GeoIP fetch logic** — Network calls to ipapi.co (no VPN bypass needed)\n- **App stability** — Crash detection, ANR detection, memory leaks\n- **Navigation** — Drawer menu, pager swipes, button states\n- **Registration flow** — API calls to control plane (mock or real)\n- **Foldable posture** — Fold/unfold behavior on Pixel 10 Pro Fold\n\n### What Firebase CANNOT Test\n- **Active VPN tunnel** — `VpnService.prepare()` shows a system dialog that can''t be auto-dismissed\n- **VPN bypass networking** — Requires an active WireGuard tunnel\n- **Download/upload stats** — Requires live tunnel traffic\n\n## Integration with Dev Workflow\n\n### The Verification Gate\n\nWhen changes impact UI, networking, or stability:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Build APK\n$env:JAVA_HOME = \"C:\\Program Files\\Android\\Android Studio\\jbr\"; .\\gradlew assembleDebug\n\n# 2. Run robo test on Pixel 10 Pro Fold\ngcloud firebase test android run --type=robo \\\n  --app=dragon-scale-vpn/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk \\\n  --device \"model=rango,version=36\" --project=cloud-vpn-12110\n\n# 3. Review the results URL in the output\n```\n\n### Senior Decision Logic\n\n1. **Discovery (Gemini):** Architect determines the minimal change required.\n2. **Implementation (Gemini):** Execute code changes locally.\n3. **Verification (Firebase):** Run robo/instrumentation tests on Pixel 10 Pro Fold to validate.\n4. **Manual Verification:** Sideload APK on physical Pixel 10 Pro Fold for VPN-specific testing.\n5. **Deployment:** Only push to GitHub after both automated and manual verification pass.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T15:09:09.024Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Testing Agents requiring automated testing on real and virtual Android devices using Firebase Test Lab","zh":"适用于需要在真实和虚拟Android设备上使用Firebase Test Lab进行自动化测试的云测试代理","ja":"Firebase Test Labを使用して実機および仮想Androidデバイスでの自動テストを必要とするクラウドテストエージェントに最適","ko":"Firebase Test Lab을 사용하여 실제 및 가상 Android 디바이스에서 자동 테스트를 수행해야 하는 클라우드 테스트 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de prueba en la nube que requieren pruebas automatizadas en dispositivos Android reales y virtuales utilizando Firebase Test Lab","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de test cloud nécessitant des tests automatisés sur des appareils Android réels et virtuels en utilisant Firebase Test Lab","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Testagenten, die automatisierte Tests auf realen und virtuellen Android-Geräten unter Verwendung von Firebase Test Lab benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Teste em Nuvem que exigem testes automatizados em dispositivos Android reais e virtuais usando o Firebase Test Lab","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов тестирования, требующих автоматизированного тестирования на реальных и виртуальных устройствах Android с помощью Firebase Test Lab","ar":"مثالي لعميل اختبار السحابي الذي يتطلب اختبارات آلية على أجهزة أندرويد حقيقية وافتراضية باستخدام Firebase Test Lab"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run Robo tests, crawl app UI, and detect crashes on devices like the Pixel 10 Pro Fold, utilizing Google''s cloud infrastructure and providing detailed reports including screenshots, logs, and video recordings through Firebase Test Lab''s API","zh":"赋予代理运行Robo测试、爬取应用程序UI、在像Pixel 10 Pro Fold这样的设备上检测崩溃的能力，利用Google的云基础设施，并通过Firebase Test Lab的API提供包括截图、日志和视频录制在内的详细报告","ja":"Roboテストの実行、App UIのクロール、Pixel 10 Pro Foldなどのデバイスでのクラッシュ検出をエージェントに可能にし、Googleのクラウドインフラストラクチャを利用し、Firebase Test LabのAPI経由でスクリーンショット、ログ、ビデオレコーディングを含む詳細レポートを提供する","ko":"에이전트가 Robo 테스트를 실행하고 앱 UI를 크롤링하며 Pixel 10 Pro Fold와 같은 기기에서 충돌을 감지할 수 있도록 하며 Google의 클라우드 인프라를 활용하여 Firebase Test Lab의 API를 통해 스크린샷, 로그 및 비디오 녹화를 포함한 자세한 보고서를 제공하는 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas Robo, rastrear la interfaz de usuario de la aplicación y detectar bloqueos en dispositivos como el Pixel 10 Pro Fold, utilizando la infraestructura en la nube de Google y proporcionando informes detallados que incluyen capturas de pantalla, registros y grabaciones de video a través de la API de Firebase Test Lab","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests Robo, de parcourir l''interface utilisateur de l''application et de détecter les blocages sur des appareils tels que le Pixel 10 Pro Fold, en utilisant l''infrastructure cloud de Google et en fournissant des rapports détaillés incluant des captures d''écran, des journaux et des enregistrements vidéo via l''API de Firebase Test Lab","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Robo-Tests auszuführen, die Benutzeroberfläche der App zu durchlaufen und Abstürze auf Geräten wie dem Pixel 10 Pro Fold zu erkennen, wobei die Cloud-Infrastruktur von Google verwendet und detaillierte Berichte bereitgestellt werden, die Screenshots, Log-Dateien und Videoaufzeichnungen über die API von Firebase Test Lab enthalten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes Robo, rastrear a interface do usuário do aplicativo e detectar falhas em dispositivos como o Pixel 10 Pro Fold, utilizando a infraestrutura em nuvem do Google e fornecendo relatórios detalhados, incluindo capturas de tela, logs e gravações de vídeo por meio da API do Firebase Test Lab","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать тесты Robo, ползать по интерфейсу приложения и обнаруживать сбои на устройствах, таких как Pixel 10 Pro Fold, используя облачную инфраструктуру Google и предоставляя подробные отчеты, включающие скриншоты, журналы и видеозаписи через API Firebase Test Lab","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل اختبارات روبو، وزرع واجهة المستخدم التطبيق، وكشف الأعطال على أجهزة مثل Pixel 10 Pro Fold، باستخدام بنية تحتية سحابية من جوجل وتقديم تقارير مفصلة، بما في ذلك لقطات الشاشة وسجلات وتسجيلات فيديو من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Firebase Test Lab"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Robo tests for crash detection on Android devices","Generating detailed test reports including screenshots and video recordings","Debugging app UI issues on physical devices like the Pixel 10 Pro Fold"],"zh":["为Android设备自动化Robo测试以进行崩溃检测","生成包括截图和视频录制在内的详细测试报告","在像Pixel 10 Pro Fold这样的物理设备上调试应用程序UI问题"],"ja":["Androidデバイスでのクラッシュ検出のためのRoboテストの自動化","スクリーンショットおよびビデオレコーディングを含む詳細テストレポートの生成","Pixel 10 Pro Foldなどの物理デバイスでのApp UIの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["Android 디바이스에서 충돌 감지를 위한 Robo 테스트 자동화","스CREEN샷 및 비디오 녹음을 포함한 자세한 테스트 보고서 생성","Pixel 10 Pro Fold와 같은 물리적 디바이스에서 앱 UI 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas Robo para la detección de bloqueos en dispositivos Android","Generar informes de prueba detallados que incluyen capturas de pantalla y grabaciones de video","Depurar problemas de interfaz de usuario de la aplicación en dispositivos físicos como el Pixel 10 Pro Fold"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests Robo pour la détection de blocages sur les appareils Android","Générer des rapports de test détaillés incluant des captures d''écran et des enregistrements vidéo","Déboguer les problèmes d''interface utilisateur de l''application sur des appareils physiques comme le Pixel 10 Pro Fold"],"de":["Automatisierung von Robo-Tests zur Erkennung von Abstürzen auf Android-Geräten","Erstellung detaillierter Testberichte, die Screenshots und Videoaufzeichnungen enthalten","Fehlerbehebung bei Problemen mit der Benutzeroberfläche der App auf physischen Geräten wie dem Pixel 10 Pro Fold"],"pt":["Automatizar testes Robo para detecção de falhas em dispositivos Android","Gerar relatórios de teste detalhados, incluindo capturas de tela e gravações de vídeo","Depurar problemas de interface do usuário em dispositivos físicos, como o Pixel 10 Pro Fold"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тесты Robo для обнаружения сбоев на устройствах Android","Генерировать подробные отчеты о тестировании, включая скриншоты и видеозаписи","Отладить проблемы интерфейса пользователя на физических устройствах, таких как Pixel 10 Pro Fold"],"ar":["تأتمة اختبارات روبو لاكتشاف الأعطال على أجهزة أندرويد","генерировать تقارير اختبار مفصلة، بما في ذلك لقطات الشاشة وتسجيلات الفيديو","تصحيح أخطاء واجهة المستخدم على الأجهزة المادية، مثل Pixel 10 Pro Fold"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Firebase Test Lab setup and configuration","Limited to testing on Android devices","Needs access to Google Cloud infrastructure"],"zh":["需要设置和配置Firebase Test Lab","仅限于在Android设备上测试","需要访问Google Cloud基础设施"],"ja":["Firebase Test Labの設定と構成が必要","Androidデバイスでのみテスト可能","Google Cloudインフラストラクチャへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Firebase Test Lab 설정 및 구성이 필요","Android 디바이스에서만 테스트 가능","Google Cloud 인프라에 접근이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración y configuración de Firebase Test Lab","Limitado a la prueba en dispositivos Android","Necesita acceso a la infraestructura en la nube de Google"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration et la mise en place de Firebase Test Lab","Limité aux tests sur les appareils Android","Nécessite l''accès à l''infrastructure cloud de Google"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung und Konfiguration von Firebase Test Lab","Begrenzt auf Tests auf Android-Geräten","Benötigt den Zugriff auf die Cloud-Infrastruktur von Google"],"pt":["Exige configuração e setup do Firebase Test Lab","Limitado a testes em dispositivos Android","Necessita de acesso à infraestrutura em nuvem do Google"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации Firebase Test Lab","Ограничен тестированием на устройствах Android","Требует доступа к облачной инфраструктуре Google"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتكوين Firebase Test Lab","محدود للاختبارات على أجهزة أندرويد","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى البنية التحتية السحابية لجوجل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1064f42828c46e31c0c239493e1d59e04405056660fe3c0b4a7f5870b8e299b1","qualityScore":34}');
