dless","Integración con Cloudflare Workers","Uso de CDP para la comunicación","Configuración de perfiles de navegador en OpenClaw","Soporte para WebSocket"],"fr":["Contrôle des navigateurs headless","Intégration avec Cloudflare Workers","Utilisation de CDP pour la communication","Configuration des profils de navigateur dans OpenClaw","Prise en charge de WebSocket"],"de":["Steuerung von headless-Browsern","Integration mit Cloudflare Workers","Verwendung von CDP für die Kommunikation","Konfiguration von Browser-Profilen in OpenClaw","Unterstützung für WebSocket"],"pt":["Controle de navegadores headless via CDP","Integração com Cloudflare Workers","Suporte a WebSocket","Configuração de perfis de navegador com OpenClaw","Geração de screenshots"],"ru":["Контроль безголовых браузеров через CDP","Интеграция с Cloudflare Workers","Поддержка WebSocket","Настройка профилей браузера с OpenClaw","Генерация скриншотов"],"ar":["التحكم في المتصفحات بدون رأس عبر CDP","التكامل مع Cloudflare Workers","دعم WebSocket","تكوين ملفات تعريف المتصفح مع OpenClaw","генерация لقطات الشاشة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare Workers","OpenClaw","浏览器渲染控制","Chrome DevTools Protocol","WebSocket","CDP_SECRET","浏览器(profile)"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workers","OpenClaw","ブラウザレンダリング制御","Chrome DevTools Protocol","WebSocket","CDP_SECRET","ブラウザ(profile)"],"ko":["클라우드플레어 워커","오픈클로","브라우저 렌더링 제어","크롬 개발자 도구 프로토콜","웹소켓","CDP_SECRET","브라우저(프로파일)"],"es":["Cloudflare Browser","headless browser","Cloudflare Workers","CDP","OpenClaw","renderizado de navegador","navegadores headless"],"fr":["Cloudflare Browser","navigateur headless","Cloudflare Workers","CDP","OpenClaw","rendu de navigateur","navigateurs headless"],"de":["Cloudflare Browser","headless Browser","Cloudflare Workers","CDP","OpenClaw","Browser-Renderdienst","headless-Browser"],"pt":["Cloudflare Browser Rendering","CDP","WebSocket","OpenClaw","Cloudflare Workers","navegadores headless","renderização de navegador"],"ru":["Сервис рендеринга браузера Cloudflare","CDP","WebSocket","OpenClaw","Cloudflare Workers","безголовые браузеры","рендеринг браузера"],"ar":["خدمة عرض المتصفح من Cloudflare","CDP","WebSocket","OpenClaw","Cloudflare Workers","المتصفحات بدون رأس","عرض المتصفح"]}},"owner":"cloudflare","repo":"moltworker","repoPath":"cloudflare/moltworker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.666Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloudflare-browser","description":"Control headless Chrome via Cloudflare Browser Rendering CDP WebSocket. Use for screenshots, page navigation, scraping, and video capture when browser automation is needed in a Cloudflare Workers environment. Requires CDP_SECRET env var and cdpUrl configured in browser.profiles.","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Browser Rendering\n\nControl headless browsers via Cloudflare''s Browser Rendering service using CDP (Chrome DevTools Protocol) over WebSocket.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `CDP_SECRET` environment variable set\n- Browser profile configured in openclaw.json with `cdpUrl` pointing to the worker endpoint:\n  ```json\n  \"browser\": {\n    \"profiles\": {\n      \"cloudflare\": {\n        \"cdpUrl\": \"https://your-worker.workers.dev/cdp?secret=...\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Screenshot\n```bas","body":"# Cloudflare Browser Rendering\n\nControl headless browsers via Cloudflare''s Browser Rendering service using CDP (Chrome DevTools Protocol) over WebSocket.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `CDP_SECRET` environment variable set\n- Browser profile configured in openclaw.json with `cdpUrl` pointing to the worker endpoint:\n  ```json\n  \"browser\": {\n    \"profiles\": {\n      \"cloudflare\": {\n        \"cdpUrl\": \"https://your-worker.workers.dev/cdp?secret=...\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Screenshot\n```bash\nnode /path/to/skills/cloudflare-browser/scripts/screenshot.js https://example.com output.png\n```\n\n### Multi-page Video\n```bash\nnode /path/to/skills/cloudflare-browser/scripts/video.js \"https://site1.com,https://site2.com\" output.mp4\n```\n\n## CDP Connection Pattern\n\nThe worker creates a page target automatically on WebSocket connect. Listen for Target.targetCreated event to get the targetId:\n\n```javascript\nconst WebSocket = require(''ws'');\nconst CDP_SECRET = process.env.CDP_SECRET;\nconst WS_URL = `wss://your-worker.workers.dev/cdp?secret=${encodeURIComponent(CDP_SECRET)}`;\n\nconst ws = new WebSocket(WS_URL);\nlet targetId = null;\n\nws.on(''message'', (data) => {\n  const msg = JSON.parse(data.toString());\n  if (msg.method === ''Target.targetCreated'' && msg.params?.targetInfo?.type === ''page'') {\n    targetId = msg.params.targetInfo.targetId;\n  }\n});\n```\n\n## Key CDP Commands\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| Page.navigate | Navigate to URL |\n| Page.captureScreenshot | Capture PNG/JPEG |\n| Runtime.evaluate | Execute JavaScript |\n| Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride | Set viewport size |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Navigate and Screenshot\n```javascript\nawait send(''Page.navigate'', { url: ''https://example.com'' });\nawait new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 3000)); // Wait for render\nconst { data } = await send(''Page.captureScreenshot'', { format: ''png'' });\nfs.writeFileSync(''out.png'', Buffer.from(data, ''base64''));\n```\n\n### Scroll Page\n```javascript\nawait send(''Runtime.evaluate'', { expression: ''window.scrollBy(0, 300)'' });\n```\n\n### Set Viewport\n```javascript\nawait send(''Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride'', {\n  width: 1280,\n  height: 720,\n  deviceScaleFactor: 1,\n  mobile: false\n});\n```\n\n## Creating Videos\n\n1. Capture frames as PNGs during navigation\n2. Use ffmpeg to stitch: `ffmpeg -framerate 10 -i frame_%04d.png -c:v libx264 -pix_fmt yuv420p output.mp4`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- **No target created**: Race condition - wait for Target.targetCreated event with timeout\n- **Commands timeout**: Worker may have cold start delay; increase timeout to 30-60s\n- **WebSocket hangs**: Verify CDP_SECRET matches worker configuration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:21:56.047Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Automation Agents needing headless browser control via Cloudflare Workers and Chrome DevTools Protocol","zh":"非常适合需要通过Cloudflare Workers和Chrome DevTools Protocol进行无头浏览器控制的Web自动化代理","ja":"Cloudflare WorkersおよびChrome DevTools Protocolを介したヘッドレスブラウザ制御を必要とするWeb自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"Cloudflare Workers 및 Chrome DevTools Protocol을 통해 헤드리스 브라우저 제어가 필요한 웹 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización web que necesitan control de navegador headless a través de Cloudflare Workers y Chrome DevTools Protocol","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation web nécessitant un contrôle de navigateur headless via Cloudflare Workers et Chrome DevTools Protocol","de":"Perfekt für Web-Automations-Agents, die eine headless-Browser-Steuerung über Cloudflare Workers und Chrome DevTools Protocol benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação da Web que necessitam de controle de navegador headless via Cloudflare Workers e Protocolo Chrome DevTools","ru":"Идеально подходит для веб-агентов, автоматизации, требующих управления безголовым браузером через Cloudflare Workers и Chrome DevTools Protocol","ar":"مثالي لعميل التutomatiوn الويب الذي يحتاج إلى تحكم متصفح بدون رأس عبر Cloudflare Workers و بروتوكول Chrome DevTools"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to control headless browsers over WebSocket using CDP, enabling advanced web automation and rendering capabilities with Cloudflare''s Browser Rendering service, configured through openclaw.json and utilizing environment variables like CDP_SECRET","zh":"赋予代理通过WebSocket使用CDP控制无头浏览器的能力，实现高级的网页自动化和渲染能力，利用Cloudflare的浏览器渲染服务，通过openclaw.json配置，并使用环境变量如CDP_SECRET","ja":"エージェントがWebSocketを使用してCDPでヘッドレスブラウザを制御する機能を提供し、CloudflareのBrowser Renderingサービスを使用して高度なWeb自動化およびレンダリング機能を実現する。openclaw.jsonで構成し、CDP_SECRETなどの環境変数を使用する","ko":"에이전트가 WebSocket을 사용하여 CDP로 헤드리스 브라우저를 제어할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 고급 웹 자동화 및 렌더링 기능을 구현하며, Cloudflare의 브라우저 렌더링 서비스를 사용하고 openclaw.json을 통해 구성하며 CDP_SECRET와 같은 환경 변수를 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a controlar navegadores headless a través de WebSocket utilizando CDP, lo que permite capacidades de automatización y renderizado web avanzadas con el servicio de renderizado de navegador de Cloudflare, configurado a través de openclaw.json y utilizando variables de entorno como CDP_SECRET","fr":"Permet aux agents de contrôler les navigateurs headless via WebSocket en utilisant CDP, ce qui permet des capacités d''automatisation et de rendu web avancées avec le service de rendu de navigateur Cloudflare, configuré via openclaw.json et utilisant des variables d''environnement comme CDP_SECRET","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, headless-Browser über WebSocket mithilfe von CDP zu steuern, was erweiterte Web-Automatisierungs- und Rendering-Funktionen mit Cloudflares Browser-Rendering-Dienst ermöglicht, der über openclaw.json konfiguriert wird und Umgebungsvariablen wie CDP_SECRET verwendet","pt":"Habilita os agentes a controlar navegadores headless sobre WebSocket usando CDP, permitindo capacidades avançadas de automação da web e renderização com o serviço de Renderização de Navegador da Cloudflare, configurado através de openclaw.json e utilizando variáveis de ambiente como CDP_SECRET","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять безголовыми браузерами через WebSocket с использованием CDP, обеспечивая расширенные возможности веб-автоматизации и рендеринга с помощью сервиса рендеринга браузера Cloudflare, настроенного через openclaw.json и использующего переменные окружения, такие как CDP_SECRET","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من التحكم في المتصفحات بدون رأس عبر WebSocket باستخدام CDP، وتمكين القدرات المتقدمة للتحكم الآلي في الويب وتصيير مع خدمة تصيير المتصفح في Cloudflare، والمكونة من خلال openclaw.json و باستخدام متغيرات بيئة مثل CDP_SECRET"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web interactions through Cloudflare Workers","Rendering web pages headlessly for data extraction","Debugging web applications using Chrome DevTools Protocol"],"zh":["通过Cloudflare Workers实现网页交互的自动化","使用头less方式渲染网页以进行数据提取","使用Chrome DevTools Protocol进行网页应用的调试"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workersを使用したWebインタラクションの自動化","ヘッドレスでWebページをレンダリングしてデータ抽出を行う","Chrome DevTools Protocolを使用したWebアプリケーションのデバッグ"],"ko":["Cloudflare Workers를 사용한 웹 상호작용 자동화","헤드리스로 웹 페이지를 렌더링하여 데이터 추출을 수행","Chrome DevTools Protocol을 사용한 웹 애플리케이션 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de interacciones web a través de Cloudflare Workers","Renderizado de páginas web de forma headless para la extracción de datos","Depuración de aplicaciones web utilizando Chrome DevTools Protocol"],"fr":["Automatisation des interactions web via Cloudflare Workers","Renderisation de pages web de manière headless pour l''extraction de données","Débogage d''applications web en utilisant Chrome DevTools Protocol"],"de":["Automatisierung von Web-Interaktionen über Cloudflare Workers","Headless-Rendering von Webseiten zur Datenerfassung","Fehlersuche in Webanwendungen mit Chrome DevTools Protocol"],"pt":["Automatizar interações da web por meio de Cloudflare Workers","Renderizar páginas da web de forma headless para extração de dados","Depurar aplicações da web usando o Protocolo Chrome DevTools"],"ru":["Автоматизация веб-взаимодействий через Cloudflare Workers","Рендеринг веб-страниц безголовым образом для извлечения данных","Отладка веб-приложений с помощью протокола Chrome DevTools"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في التفاعلات الويب من خلال Cloudflare Workers","تصيير صفحات الويب بدون رأس لاستخراج البيانات","تصحيح أخطاء التطبيقات الويب باستخدام بروتوكول Chrome DevTools"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CDP_SECRET environment variable set","Needs browser profile configured in openclaw.json","Dependent on Cloudflare Workers and Browser Rendering service"],"zh":["需要设置CDP_SECRET环境变量","需要在openclaw.json中配置浏览器配置文件","依赖于Cloudflare Workers和浏览器渲染服务"],"ja":["CDP_SECRET環境変数を設定する必要がある","openclaw.jsonでブラウザプロファイルを構成する必要がある","Cloudflare WorkersおよびBrowser Renderingサービスに依存する"],"ko":["CDP_SECRET 환경 변수를 설정해야 함","openclaw.json에서 브라우저 프로필을 구성해야 함","Cloudflare Workers 및 브라우저 렌더링 서비스에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la variable de entorno CDP_SECRET establecida","Necesita un perfil de navegador configurado en openclaw.json","Dependiente de Cloudflare Workers y del servicio de renderizado de navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite la variable d''environnement CDP_SECRET définie","Nécessite un profil de navigateur configuré dans openclaw.json","Dépendant de Cloudflare Workers et du service de rendu de navigateur"],"de":["Benötigt die Umgebungsvariable CDP_SECRET","Benötigt ein im openclaw.json konfiguriertes Browser-Profil","Abhängig von Cloudflare Workers und Browser-Rendering-Dienst"],"pt":["Requer a variável de ambiente CDP_SECRET definida","Necessita de perfil do navegador configurado em openclaw.json","Dependente de Cloudflare Workers e serviço de Renderização de Navegador"],"ru":["Требует переменной окружения CDP_SECRET","Требует настройки профиля браузера в openclaw.json","Зависит от Cloudflare Workers и сервиса рендеринга браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب متغير بيئة CDP_SECRET معين","يحتاج إلى تكوين ملف تعريف المتصفح في openclaw.json","يعتمد على Cloudflare Workers وخدمة تصيير المتصفح"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"06f8f67410955ff10065b70d306e1c996a3cd12e429346099d495dfacec1f483","qualityScore":34}');
