ding-flow","en":"walkeros-understanding-flow"},"description":{"zh":"Walkeros理解流程是开发人员的开源标签管理器，用于简化标签管理和优化工作流程","ja":"Walkeros Understanding Flowは開発者のためのオープンソースタグマネージャーです","ko":"Walkeros 이해 흐름은 개발자를 위한 오픈소스 태그 매니저로 태그 관리와 워크플로우 최적화를 지원합니다","es":"walkeros-understanding-flow es un administrador de etiquetas de código abierto para desarrolladores que simplifica el flujo de trabajo","fr":"walkeros-understanding-flow est un gestionnaire de balises open-source pour les développeurs qui simplifie le flux de travail","de":"walkeros-understanding-flow ist ein Open-Source-Tag-Manager für Entwickler, der den Arbeitsfluss vereinfacht","pt":"O walkeros-understanding-flow é um gerenciador de tags de código aberto para desenvolvedores, permitindo uma maior flexibilidade e controle","ru":"Walkeros-understanding-flow - открытый тег-менеджер для разработчиков, обеспечивающий большую гибкость и контроль","ar":"walkeros-understanding-flow هو مدير علامات مفتوح المصدر لل مطورين، مما يسمح بمرونة وقوة التحكم أكبر","en":"Open-source tag manager for developers"},"definition":{"en":"Open-source tag manager for developers"},"features":{"zh":["开源标签管理器","简化标签管理","优化工作流程","支持多种标签格式","易于集成和扩展"],"ja":["オープンソースタグマネージャー","タグ管理の簡素化","ワークフローの最適化","複数のタグ形式をサポート","容易に統合と拡張が可能"],"ko":["오픈소스 태그 매니저","태그 관리의 간소화","워크플로우의 최적화","다양한 태그 형식을 지원","쉽게 통합과 확장이 가능"],"es":["Administrador de etiquetas de código abierto","Simplifica el flujo de trabajo para desarrolladores","Permite la personalización de etiquetas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo populares","Documentación y soporte para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Gestionnaire de balises open-source","Simplifie le flux de travail pour les développeurs","Permet la personnalisation des balises","Intégration avec des outils de développement populaires","Documentation et support pour les développeurs"],"de":["Open-Source-Tag-Manager","Vereinfacht den Arbeitsfluss für Entwickler","Ermöglicht die Anpassung von Tags","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Dokumentation und Support für Entwickler"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de tags de código aberto","Flexibilidade e controle para desenvolvedores","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI) intuitiva","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Открытый тег-менеджер для разработчиков","Гибкость и контроль для разработчиков","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Интуитивный интерфейс командной строки (CLI)","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки"],"ar":["مدير علامات مفتوح المصدر لل مطورين","مرونة وقوة التحكم أكبر للمطورين","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) سهلة الاستخدام","دعم بيئات متعددة للتنمية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Walkeros理解流程","开源标签管理器","如何使用Walkeros","什么是标签管理","Walkeros替代品","Walkeros与Google Tag Manager比较","Walkeros安装","Walkeros设置指南"],"ja":["Walkeros Understanding Flow","オープンソースタグマネージャー","Walkerosの使い方","タグマネージャーとは","Walkerosの代替","WalkerosとGoogle Tag Managerの比較","Walkerosのインストール","Walkerosの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Walkeros 이해 흐름","오픈소스 태그 매니저","Walkeros 사용법","태그 매니저란","Walkeros 대안","Walkeros와 Google Tag Manager 비교","Walkeros 설치","Walkeros 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores","cómo usar walkeros-understanding-flow","alternativas a walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow vs Google Tag Manager","instalación de walkeros-understanding-flow","guía de configuración de walkeros-understanding-flow"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs","comment utiliser walkeros-understanding-flow","alternatives à walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow vs Google Tag Manager","installation de walkeros-understanding-flow","guide de configuration de walkeros-understanding-flow"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","wie man walkeros-understanding-flow verwendet","Alternativen zu walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow vs Google Tag Manager","Installation von walkeros-understanding-flow","Konfigurationsanleitung für walkeros-understanding-flow"],"pt":["como usar walkeros-understanding-flow","o que é walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow alternativa","walkeros-understanding-flow vs tag manager","instalar walkeros-understanding-flow","guia de configuração do walkeros-understanding-flow"],"ru":["как использовать walkeros-understanding-flow","что такое walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow альтернатива","walkeros-understanding-flow vs тег-менеджер","установить walkeros-understanding-flow","руководство по настройке walkeros-understanding-flow"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام walkeros-understanding-flow","ما هو walkeros-understanding-flow","بديل walkeros-understanding-flow","walkeros-understanding-flow مقابل مدير العلامات","تثبيت walkeros-understanding-flow","دليل إعداد walkeros-understanding-flow"]}},"owner":"elbwalker","repo":"walkerOS","repoPath":"elbwalker/walkerOS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.668Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"walkeros-understanding-flow","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Understanding walkerOS Flow\n\n## Overview\n\nwalkerOS follows a **Source → Collector → Destination(s)** architecture for\ncomposable, modular event processing.\n\n**Core principle:** Separation of concerns. Each component has one job.\nComponents are composable and replaceable.\n\n## The Flow Pattern\n\n```\nSources → [Pre-Transformers] → Collector → [Post-Transformers] → Destinations\n(Capture)  (source.next)    (Processing) (dest.before)       (Delivery)\n\n- Browser DOM              - Validation   - Valid","body":"# Understanding walkerOS Flow\n\n## Overview\n\nwalkerOS follows a **Source → Collector → Destination(s)** architecture for\ncomposable, modular event processing.\n\n**Core principle:** Separation of concerns. Each component has one job.\nComponents are composable and replaceable.\n\n## The Flow Pattern\n\n```\nSources → [Pre-Transformers] → Collector → [Post-Transformers] → Destinations\n(Capture)  (source.next)    (Processing) (dest.before)       (Delivery)\n\n- Browser DOM              - Validation   - Validation        - Google Analytics\n- DataLayer                - Enrichment   - Enrichment        - Meta Pixel\n- Server HTTP              - Redaction    - Consent check     - Custom API\n- Cloud Functions                         - Routing           - Data Warehouse\n```\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n### Composability\n\nA Flow combines components. You can:\n\n- Use multiple sources feeding one collector\n- Route events to multiple destinations\n- Swap components without changing others\n\n### The Flow Type\n\nSee [packages/core/src/types/flow.ts](../../packages/core/src/types/flow.ts) for\nthe canonical interface.\n\n```typescript\n// Conceptual structure (see source for full type)\ninterface Flow {\n  sources?: Record<string, Source>;\n  transformers?: Record<string, Transformer>;\n  destinations?: Record<string, Destination>;\n  collector?: Collector.InitConfig;\n}\n```\n\n### Universal Push Interface\n\n**All components communicate via `push` functions:**\n\n| Component   | Push Signature                | Purpose               |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| Source      | `push(input) → events`        | Capture external data |\n| Collector   | `push(event) → void`          | Process and route     |\n| Destination | `push(event, context) → void` | Transform and deliver |\n\nThe `elb()` function is an alias for `collector.push` - used for component\nwiring.\n\n### startFlow Helper\n\nSee [packages/collector/src/flow.ts](../../packages/collector/src/flow.ts) for\nthe `startFlow` function.\n\n```typescript\nimport { startFlow } from ''@walkeros/collector'';\n\nconst { collector, elb } = await startFlow({\n  sources: {\n    /* ... */\n  },\n  transformers: {\n    /* ... */\n  },\n  destinations: {\n    /* ... */\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Separation of Concerns\n\n| Concern          | Handled By     | NOT Handled By          |\n| ---------------- | -------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Event capture    | Sources        | Collector, Destinations |\n| Event structure  | Event model    | Components              |\n| Consent checking | Collector      | Sources, Destinations   |\n| Transformation   | Mapping system | Raw push calls          |\n| Delivery         | Destinations   | Sources, Collector      |\n\n## Transformer Chains\n\nTransformers run at two points in the pipeline, configured via `next` and\n`before`:\n\n### Pre-Collector Chain\n\nRuns after source captures event, before collector processing:\n\n**Bundled mode (flow.json):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"sources\": {\n    \"browser\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/web-source-browser\",\n      \"next\": \"validate\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"transformers\": {\n    \"validate\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/transformer-validator\",\n      \"next\": \"enrich\"\n    },\n    \"enrich\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/transformer-enricher\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Integrated mode (TypeScript):**\n\n```typescript\nsources: {\n  browser: {\n    code: sourceBrowser,\n    next: ''validate''\n  }\n},\ntransformers: {\n  validate: {\n    code: transformerValidator,\n    config: { next: ''enrich'' }\n  },\n  enrich: {\n    code: transformerEnrich\n  }\n}\n```\n\nNote: In flow.json, `next` is at the reference level. The CLI bundler\nautomatically moves it into `config.next` for runtime - you don''t need to handle\nthis yourself.\n\n### Post-Collector Chain\n\nRuns after collector enrichment, before destination receives event:\n\n**Bundled mode (flow.json):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"destinations\": {\n    \"gtag\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/web-destination-gtag\",\n      \"before\": \"redact\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"transformers\": {\n    \"redact\": {\n      \"package\": \"@walkeros/transformer-redact\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Integrated mode (TypeScript):**\n\n```typescript\ndestinations: {\n  gtag: {\n    code: destinationGtag,\n    before: ''redact''\n  }\n},\ntransformers: {\n  redact: {\n    code: transformerRedact\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Chain Resolution\n\n- `source.next` → starts pre-collector chain\n- `transformer.next` (flow.json) or `transformer.config.next` (runtime) → links\n  transformers\n- `destination.before` → starts post-collector chain per destination\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [walkeros-understanding-events](../walkeros-understanding-events/SKILL.md) -\n  Event model\n- [walkeros-understanding-sources](../walkeros-understanding-sources/SKILL.md) -\n  Source interface\n- [walkeros-understanding-destinations](../walkeros-understanding-destinations/SKILL.md) -\n  Destination interface\n\n**Package READMEs:**\n\n- [packages/collector/README.md](../../packages/collector/README.md) - Collector\n  details\n\n**Source Files:**\n\n- [packages/collector/src/flow.ts](../../packages/collector/src/flow.ts) -\n  startFlow implementation\n\n**Documentation:**\n\n- [Website: Flow](../../website/docs/getting-started/flow.mdx) - Flow concept\n- [Website: Collector](../../website/docs/collector/index.mdx) - Collector docs\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:22:12.033Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Modular Event Processing Agents seeking composable architecture and separation of concerns.","zh":"适用于模块化事件处理代理，寻求可组合架构和关注点分离。","ja":"モジュラー イベント処理エージェントに適しており、組み合わせ可能なアーキテクチャと関心の分離を求めています。","ko":"모듈형 이벤트 처리 에이전트에 적합하며, 구성 가능한 아키텍처와 관심사 분리를 찾고 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Procesamiento de Eventos Modulares que buscan una arquitectura componible y separación de preocupaciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Traitement d''Événements Modulaires recherchant une architecture composable et une séparation des préoccupations.","de":"Ideal für modulare Ereignisverarbeitungsagenten, die eine komponierbare Architektur und Trennung von Belangen suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Processamento de Eventos Modulares que buscam arquitetura composta e separação de preocupações.","ru":"Идеально для модульных агентов обработки событий, ищущих составную архитектуру и разделение проблем.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات معالجة الحدث المُجمّعة التي تแสวงي هندسة قابلة للتجميع وتنظيم الشواغل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to process events through a Source → Collector → Destination(s) flow, utilizing pre-transformers and post-transformers for data validation and modification, and supports modular event processing with composable and replaceable components.","zh":"赋予代理通过源 → 收集器 → 目标（s）流程处理事件的能力，利用预转换器和后转换器进行数据验证和修改，并支持模块化事件处理具有可组合和可替换组件。","ja":"ソース → コレクター → 宛先（s）フローを介してイベントを処理するエージェントを可能にし、事前変換と事後変換を使用してデータを検証および変更し、モジュラー イベント処理をサポートし、組み合わせ可能で交換可能なコンポーネントを備えています。","ko":"에이전트가 소스 → 수집기 → 대상(s) 흐름을 통해 이벤트를 처리할 수 있도록 하며, 데이터를 검증하고 수정하기 위해 사전 변환기와 사후 변환기를 사용하며, 구성 가능한 구성 요소와 교체 가능한 구성 요소를 갖춘 모듈형 이벤트 처리를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para procesar eventos a través de un flujo Origen → Recolector → Destino(s), utilizando pre-transformadores y post-transformadores para la validación y modificación de datos, y admite el procesamiento de eventos modulares con componentes componibles y reemplazables.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter les événements via un flux Source → Collecteur → Destination(s), en utilisant des pré-transformateurs et des post-transformateurs pour la validation et la modification des données, et prend en charge le traitement d''événements modulaires avec des composants componibles et remplaçables.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Ereignisse durch einen Quelle → Sammler → Ziel(e) Fluss zu verarbeiten, wobei Prä- und Post-Transformer für die Datavalidierung und -modifizierung verwendet werden, und unterstützt modulare Ereignisverarbeitung mit komponierbaren und ersetzlichen Komponenten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes processem eventos por meio de um fluxo de Origem → Coletor → Destino(s), utilizando pré-transformadores e pós-transformadores para validação e modificação de dados, e suporta processamento de eventos modulares com componentes compostos e substituíveis.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность обрабатывать события через поток Источник → Коллектор → Назначение(я), используя пре-трансформеры и пост-трансформеры для валидации и модификации данных, и поддерживает модульную обработку событий с составными и заменяемыми компонентами.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من معالجة الأحداث من خلال تدفق المصدر → جامع → الوجهة(ات)، باستخدام المحولات السابقة والمحولات اللاحقة للتحقق من صحة البيانات وتعديلها، ودعم معالجة الحدث المُجمّعة مع مكونات قابلة للتجميع والاستبدال."},"useCases":{"en":["Composing modular event processing pipelines","Implementing separation of concerns in event handling","Validating and transforming event data using pre and post transformers"],"zh":["组成模块化事件处理管道","在事件处理中实现关注点分离","使用预转换器和后转换器验证和转换事件数据"],"ja":["モジュラー イベント処理パイプラインの構成","イベントハンドリングにおける関心の分離の実装","事前変換と事後変換を使用したイベントデータの検証と変換"],"ko":["모듈형 이벤트 처리 파이프라인 구성","이벤트 처리에서 관심사 분리 구현","이벤트 데이터의 유효성 검사 및 변환을 위한 사전 및 사후 변환기 사용"],"es":["Componer tuberías de procesamiento de eventos modulares","Implementar separación de preocupaciones en el manejo de eventos","Validar y transformar datos de eventos utilizando pre y post transformadores"],"fr":["Composer des pipelines de traitement d''événements modulaires","Mettre en œuvre une séparation des préoccupations dans la gestion des événements","Valider et transformer les données d''événements en utilisant des pré et post-transformateurs"],"de":["Modulare Ereignisverarbeitungspipelines zusammenstellen","Trennung von Belangen in der Ereignisbehandlung implementieren","Ereignisdaten mithilfe von Prä- und Post-Transformern validieren und transformieren"],"pt":["Compor pipelines de processamento de eventos modulares","Implementar separação de preocupações no tratamento de eventos","Validar e transformar dados de eventos usando pré e pós transformadores"],"ru":["Составление модульных конвейеров обработки событий","Реализация разделения проблем при обработке событий","Проверка и преобразование данных событий с помощью пре- и пост-трансформеров"],"ar":["تجميع خطوط أنابيب معالجة الحدث المُجمّعة","تنفيذ تنظيم الشواغل في معالجة الأحداث","التحقق من صحة وتحويل بيانات الأحداث باستخدام المحولات السابقة والمحولات اللاحقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of walkerOS Flow architecture","Limited to event processing use cases","Dependent on component composability and replaceability"],"zh":["需要了解walkerOS Flow架构","仅限事件处理用例","依赖于组件的组合性和可替换性"],"ja":["walkerOS Flowアーキテクチャの理解が必要","イベント処理のユースケースに限定される","コンポーネントの組み合わせ性と交換可能性に依存する"],"ko":["walkerOS Flow 아키텍처에 대한 이해가 필요","이벤트 처리 용례에만 제한","구성 요소의 조합성 및 교체 가능성에 종속"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la arquitectura de walkerOS Flow","Limitado a casos de uso de procesamiento de eventos","Dependiente de la componibilidad y reemplazabilidad de los componentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de l''architecture de walkerOS Flow","Limité à des cas d''utilisation de traitement d''événements","Dépend de la componibilité et de la remplaçabilité des composants"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis der walkerOS Flow-Architektur","Begrenzt auf Ereignisverarbeitungsanwendungsfälle","Abhängig von der Komponierbarkeit und Ersetzbarkeit der Komponenten"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da arquitetura do walkerOS Flow","Limitado a casos de uso de processamento de eventos","Dependente da composabilidade e substituibilidade de componentes"],"ru":["Требует понимания архитектуры walkerOS Flow","Ограничен случаи использования обработки событий","Зависит от составности и заменяемости компонентов"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم هندسة تدفق walkerOS","محدود لحالات استخدام معالجة الأحداث","يعتمد على قابلية التجميع والاستبدال للمكونات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ba6130aed75cca4795fc030c328d2d12620519ffb985d9352ebb275dd8b669c2","qualityScore":34}');
