ストなマルチエージェントオーケストレーション","ワークフローとタスク管理の自動化","開発効率の向上","Claude Code開発のサポート","開発プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["팀 우선의 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션","작업 흐름과 작업 관리의 자동화","개발 효율성의 향상","Claude Code 개발의 지원","개발 프로세스의 간소화"],"es":["Orquestación de agentes para Claude Code","Mejora la colaboración en equipo","Solución de código para desarrolladores","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Automatización de tareas y flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Orchestration multi-agents pour Claude Code","Amélioration de la collaboration d''équipe","Solution de code pour les développeurs","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Automatisation des tâches et des flux de travail"],"de":["Orchestrierung von Multi-Agenten für Claude Code","Verbesserung der Teamzusammenarbeit","Code-Lösung für Entwickler","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Automatisierung von Aufgaben und Workflows"],"pt":["Orquestração de agentes de IA para Claude Code","Integração com equipes para melhorar a produtividade","Gerenciamento de agentes de IA para tarefas complexas","Suporte a múltiplos agentes de IA","Interface de usuário intuitiva para configuração e gerenciamento"],"ru":["Мультиагентная оркестрация для Claude Code","Интеграция с командами для повышения производительности","Управление ИИ Агентами для сложных задач","Поддержка нескольких ИИ Агентов","Интуитивный интерфейс для конфигурации и управления"],"ar":["إدارة الوحدات المتعددة لآي كلود كود","التكامل مع الفرق لتحسين الإنتاجية","إدارة وحدات آي كي للمهام المعقدة","دعم وحدات آي كي متعددة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام لإعداد والإدارة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Ultrawork","什么是团队优先的多智能体编排","Ultrawork替代品","Ultrawork与竞争对手的比较","Ultrawork安装","Ultrawork设置指南","AI智能代理","Claude Code开发"],"ja":["Ultraworkの使い方","チームファーストなマルチエージェントオーケストレーションとは","Ultraworkの代替","Ultraworkと競合製品の比較","Ultraworkのインストール","Ultraworkの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","Claude Code開発"],"ko":["Ultrawork 사용 방법","팀 우선의 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션이란","Ultrawork 대체","Ultrawork와 경쟁 제품 비교","Ultrawork 설치","Ultrawork 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","Claude Code 개발"],"es":["herramientas de ai","orquestación de agentes","desarrollo de código","colaboración en equipo","ultrawork alternativa","instalación de ultrawork","guía de configuración de ultrawork","qué es ultrawork","cómo usar ultrawork"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","orchestration multi-agents","développement de code","collaboration d''équipe","alternative à ultrawork","installation d''ultrawork","guide de configuration d''ultrawork","qu''est-ce qu''ultrawork","comment utiliser ultrawork"],"de":["künstliche intelligenz tools","multi-agenten-orchestrierung","code-entwicklung","teamzusammenarbeit","ultrawork alternative","ultrawork installation","ultrawork konfigurationshandbuch","was ist ultrawork","wie verwendet man ultrawork"],"pt":["orquestração de agentes de IA","como usar Ultrawork","o que é Ultrawork","Ultrawork vs outros agentes de IA","instalar Ultrawork","guia de configuração do Ultrawork","desenvolvimento de agentes de IA com Ultrawork","equipes de desenvolvimento de IA","ferramentas de IA para equipes"],"ru":["Мультиагентная оркестрация","как использовать Ultrawork","что такое Ultrawork","Ultrawork vs другие ИИ Агенты","установить Ultrawork","руководство по конфигурации Ultrawork","разработка ИИ Агентов с помощью Ultrawork","команды разработки ИИ","инструменты ИИ для команд"],"ar":["إدارة الوحدات المتعددة","كيفية استخدام ألتروورك","ما هو ألتروورك","ألتروورك مقابل وحدات آي كي أخرى","تثبيت ألتروورك","دليل إعداد ألتروورك","تطوير وحدات آي كي باستخدام ألتروورك","فرق تطوير آي كي","أدوات آي كي للفرق"]}},"owner":"Yeachan-Heo","repo":"oh-my-claudecode","repoPath":"Yeachan-Heo/oh-my-claudecode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.672Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ultrawork","description":"Parallel execution engine for high-throughput task completion","bodyPreview":"<Purpose>\nUltrawork is a parallel execution engine that runs multiple agents simultaneously for independent tasks. It is a component, not a standalone persistence mode -- it provides parallelism and smart model routing but not persistence, verification loops, or state management.\n</Purpose>\n\n<Use_When>\n- Multiple independent tasks can run simultaneously\n- User says \"ulw\", \"ultrawork\", or wants parallel execution\n- You need to delegate work to multiple agents at once\n- Task benefits from concurre","body":"<Purpose>\nUltrawork is a parallel execution engine that runs multiple agents simultaneously for independent tasks. It is a component, not a standalone persistence mode -- it provides parallelism and smart model routing but not persistence, verification loops, or state management.\n</Purpose>\n\n<Use_When>\n- Multiple independent tasks can run simultaneously\n- User says \"ulw\", \"ultrawork\", or wants parallel execution\n- You need to delegate work to multiple agents at once\n- Task benefits from concurrent execution but the user will manage completion themselves\n</Use_When>\n\n<Do_Not_Use_When>\n- Task requires guaranteed completion with verification -- use `ralph` instead (ralph includes ultrawork)\n- Task requires a full autonomous pipeline -- use `autopilot` instead (autopilot includes ralph which includes ultrawork)\n- There is only one sequential task with no parallelism opportunity -- delegate directly to an executor agent\n- User needs session persistence for resume -- use `ralph` which adds persistence on top of ultrawork\n</Do_Not_Use_When>\n\n<Why_This_Exists>\nSequential task execution wastes time when tasks are independent. Ultrawork enables firing multiple agents simultaneously and routing each to the right model tier, reducing total execution time while controlling token costs. It is designed as a composable component that ralph and autopilot layer on top of.\n</Why_This_Exists>\n\n<Execution_Policy>\n- Fire all independent agent calls simultaneously -- never serialize independent work\n- Always pass the `model` parameter explicitly when delegating\n- Read `docs/shared/agent-tiers.md` before first delegation for agent selection guidance\n- Use `run_in_background: true` for operations over ~30 seconds (installs, builds, tests)\n- Run quick commands (git status, file reads, simple checks) in the foreground\n</Execution_Policy>\n\n<Steps>\n1. **Read agent reference**: Load `docs/shared/agent-tiers.md` for tier selection\n2. **Classify tasks by independence**: Identify which tasks can run in parallel vs which have dependencies\n3. **Route to correct tiers**:\n   - Simple lookups/definitions: LOW tier (Haiku)\n   - Standard implementation: MEDIUM tier (Sonnet)\n   - Complex analysis/refactoring: HIGH tier (Opus)\n4. **Fire independent tasks simultaneously**: Launch all parallel-safe tasks at once\n5. **Run dependent tasks sequentially**: Wait for prerequisites before launching dependent work\n6. **Background long operations**: Builds, installs, and test suites use `run_in_background: true`\n7. **Verify when all tasks complete** (lightweight):\n   - Build/typecheck passes\n   - Affected tests pass\n   - No new errors introduced\n</Steps>\n\n<Tool_Usage>\n- Use `Task(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"haiku\", ...)` for simple changes\n- Use `Task(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", ...)` for standard work\n- Use `Task(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"opus\", ...)` for complex work\n- Use `run_in_background: true` for package installs, builds, and test suites\n- Use foreground execution for quick status checks and file operations\n</Tool_Usage>\n\n<Examples>\n<Good>\nThree independent tasks fired simultaneously:\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"haiku\", prompt=\"Add missing type export for Config interface\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", prompt=\"Implement the /api/users endpoint with validation\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", prompt=\"Add integration tests for the auth middleware\")\n```\nWhy good: Independent tasks at appropriate tiers, all fired at once.\n</Good>\n\n<Good>\nCorrect use of background execution:\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"sonnet\", prompt=\"npm install && npm run build\", run_in_background=true)\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"haiku\", prompt=\"Update the README with new API endpoints\")\n```\nWhy good: Long build runs in background while short task runs in foreground.\n</Good>\n\n<Bad>\nSequential execution of independent work:\n```\nresult1 = Task(executor, \"Add type export\")  # wait...\nresult2 = Task(executor, \"Implement endpoint\")     # wait...\nresult3 = Task(executor, \"Add tests\")              # wait...\n```\nWhy bad: These tasks are independent. Running them sequentially wastes time.\n</Bad>\n\n<Bad>\nWrong tier selection:\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"oh-my-claudecode:executor\", model=\"opus\", prompt=\"Add a missing semicolon\")\n```\nWhy bad: Opus is expensive overkill for a trivial fix. Use executor with Haiku instead.\n</Bad>\n</Examples>\n\n<Escalation_And_Stop_Conditions>\n- When ultrawork is invoked directly (not via ralph), apply lightweight verification only -- build passes, tests pass, no new errors\n- For full persistence and comprehensive architect verification, recommend switching to `ralph` mode\n- If a task fails repeatedly across retries, report the issue rather than retrying indefinitely\n- Escalate to the user when tasks have unclear dependencies or conflicting requirements\n</Escalation_And_Stop_Conditions>\n\n<Final_Checklist>\n- [ ] All parallel tasks completed\n- [ ] Build/typecheck passes\n- [ ] Affected tests pass\n- [ ] No new errors introduced\n</Final_Checklist>\n\n<Advanced>\n## Relationship to Other Modes\n\n```\nralph (persistence wrapper)\n \\-- includes: ultrawork (this skill)\n     \\-- provides: parallel execution only\n\nautopilot (autonomous execution)\n \\-- includes: ralph\n     \\-- includes: ultrawork (this skill)\n```\n\nUltrawork is the parallelism layer. Ralph adds persistence and verification. Autopilot adds the full lifecycle pipeline.\n</Advanced>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:01.826Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-agent Ecosystems needing parallel execution and smart model routing for tasks like Claude Code orchestration.","zh":"适用于需要并行执行和智能模型路由的多代理生态系统，例如Claude Code编排。","ja":"マルチエージェントエコシステムに最適で、Claude Codeのオーケストレーションのようなタスクに並行実行とスマートモデルルーティングが必要です。","ko":"Claude Code 오케스트레이션과 같은 작업에 병렬 실행 및 스마트 모델 라우팅이 필요한 멀티 에이전트 생태계에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para ecosistemas de multiagentes que necesitan ejecución paralela y enrutamiento inteligente de modelos para tareas como la orquestación de Claude Code.","fr":"Parfait pour les écosystèmes multi-agents nécessitant une exécution parallèle et un routage intelligent de modèles pour des tâches comme l''orchestration de Claude Code.","de":"Perfekt für Multiagenten-Ökosysteme, die eine parallele Ausführung und eine intelligente Modellverteilung für Aufgaben wie die Orchestrierung von Claude Code benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Ecossistemas de Multi-agente que necessitam de execução paralela e roteamento de modelo inteligente para tarefas como orquestração de Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для мультиагентных экосистем, требующих параллельного выполнения и умного маршрутизации модели для задач, таких как оркестровка Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي لأنظمة الوسائط متعددة الوكلاء التي تحتاج إلى تنفيذ متوازي وتوجيه نموذج ذكي لمهام مثل أوركسترا Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute multiple independent tasks simultaneously, leveraging parallelism and smart routing for enhanced productivity, while utilizing components like Teams-first Multi-agent orchestration for efficient task delegation and management through protocols and libraries.","zh":"赋予代理执行多个独立任务的能力，利用并行性和智能路由提高生产力，同时利用团队优先的多代理编排等组件，通过协议和库实现高效的任务委托和管理。","ja":"エージェントに複数の独立したタスクを同時に実行する能力を与え、並行性とスマートルーティングを利用して生産性を高め、チーム優先のマルチエージェントオーケストレーションなどのコンポーネントを使用して、プロトコルとライブラリを介してタスクの委任と管理を効率的に行う。","ko":"에이전트가 다중 독립 작업을 동시에 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 병렬성 및 스마트 라우팅을 활용하여 생산성을 향상시키고, 팀 우선 다중 에이전트 오케스트레이션과 같은 구성 요소를 사용하여 프로토콜 및 라이브러리 통해 작업 위임 및 관리를 효율적으로 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar múltiples tareas independientes simultáneamente, aprovechando el paralelismo y el enrutamiento inteligente para una mayor productividad, mientras utiliza componentes como la orquestación de multiagentes de primera equipo para una delegación y gestión de tareas eficientes a través de protocolos y bibliotecas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter plusieurs tâches indépendantes simultanément, en exploitant le parallélisme et le routage intelligent pour une productivité améliorée, tout en utilisant des composants comme l''orchestration multi-agents de première équipe pour une délégation et une gestion de tâches efficaces via des protocoles et des bibliothèques.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mehrere unabhängige Aufgaben gleichzeitig auszuführen, indem es Parallelismus und intelligente Verteilung nutzt, um die Produktivität zu erhöhen, während es Komponenten wie die Teams-erste Multiagenten-Orchestrierung für eine effiziente Aufgabenübertragung und -verwaltung durch Protokolle und Bibliotheken verwendet.","pt":"Habilita agentes a executar várias tarefas independentes simultaneamente, aproveitando o paralelismo e o roteamento inteligente para uma produtividade aprimorada, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza componentes como orquestração de multi-agente em primeira linha para delegação e gerenciamento de tarefas eficientes por meio de protocolos e bibliotecas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять несколько независимых задач одновременно, используя параллелизм и умную маршрутизацию для повышения производительности, а также использует компоненты, такие как оркестровка мультиагентных команд, для эффективной делегации и управления задачами через протоколы и библиотеки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ مهام مستقلة متعددة في وقت واحد، مستفيداً من التمويل والتنقل الذكي لتعزيز الإنتاجية، مع استخدام مكونات مثل أوركسترا الوسائط متعددة الوكلاء أولاً لتفويض المهام وإدارتها بكفاءة من خلال بروتوكولات ومكتبات."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing multiple Claude Code tasks concurrently","Delegating work to multiple agents at once for improved efficiency","Utilizing parallel execution for tasks benefiting from concurrency"],"zh":["同时执行多个Claude Code任务","一次性委托多个代理以提高效率","利用并行执行以实现任务的并发"],"ja":["複数のClaude Codeタスクを同時に実行する","一度に複数のエージェントに仕事を委任して効率を高める","並行実行を利用してタスクの並行性を活用する"],"ko":["여러 Claude Code 작업을 동시에 실행하는 것","한 번에 여러 에이전트에 작업을 위임하여 효율성을 향상시키는 것","병렬 실행을 사용하여 작업의 병렬성을 활용하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar múltiples tareas de Claude Code de forma concurrente","Delegar trabajo a varios agentes al mismo tiempo para mejorar la eficiencia","Utilizar la ejecución paralela para tareas que se benefician de la concurrencia"],"fr":["Exécuter plusieurs tâches de Claude Code de manière concurrente","Déléguer du travail à plusieurs agents en même temps pour améliorer l''efficacité","Utiliser l''exécution parallèle pour les tâches qui bénéficient de la concurrence"],"de":["Mehrere Claude-Code-Aufgaben gleichzeitig ausführen","Arbeit an mehrere Agenten gleichzeitig delegieren, um die Effizienz zu verbessern","Parallele Ausführung für Aufgaben nutzen, die von der Konkurrenz profitieren"],"pt":["Executando várias tarefas de Claude Code concorrentemente","Delegando trabalho para vários agentes de uma vez para melhor eficiência","Utilizando execução paralela para tarefas que se beneficiam da concorrência"],"ru":["Выполняя несколько задач Claude Code одновременно","Делегируя работу нескольким агентам одновременно для повышения эффективности","Используя параллельное выполнение для задач, которые выигрывают от параллелизма"],"ar":["تنفيذ مهام متعددة من Claude Code في وقت واحد","تفويض العمل إلى عدة وكلاء في نفس الوقت لتحسين الكفاءة","استخدام التنفيذ المتوازي للمهام التي تستفيد من التمويل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not provide persistence, verification loops, or state management","Requires compatible agent ecosystem for multi-agent orchestration"],"zh":["不提供持久性、验证循环或状态管理","需要兼容的代理生态系统以实现多代理编排"],"ja":["永続性、検証ループ、または状態管理を提供しない","マルチエージェントオーケストレーションのために互換性のあるエージェントエコシステムが必要"],"ko":["영속성, 검증 루프 또는 상태 관리를 제공하지 않음","다중 에이전트 오케스트레이션을 위해 호환되는 에이전트 생태계가 필요함"],"es":["No proporciona persistencia, bucles de verificación o gestión de estado","Requiere un ecosistema de agentes compatible para la orquestación de multiagentes"],"fr":["Ne fournit pas de persistance, de boucles de vérification ou de gestion d''état","Nécessite un écosystème d''agents compatible pour l''orchestration multi-agents"],"de":["Bietet keine Persistenz, Überprüfungsschleifen oder Statusverwaltung","Benötigt ein kompatibles Agenten-Ökosystem für die Multiagenten-Orchestrierung"],"pt":["Não fornece persistência, loops de verificação ou gerenciamento de estado","Exige um ecossistema de agente compatível para orquestração de multi-agente"],"ru":["Не предоставляет персистентность, петли проверки или управление состоянием","Требует совместимой среды агентов для мультиагентной оркестровки"],"ar":["لا يوفر استمرارية أو حلقات التحقق أو إدارة الحالة","يتطلب نظاماً متوافراً مع وكلاء لتنسيق الوسائط متعددة الوكلاء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a5ca384b8ae5e556296420adb712e41cc6ab2e49088960469d874b587634550e","qualityScore":34}');
