deo único","Ferramenta de IA para edição de vídeo","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Персонализированное видео редактирование","Использование Claude Code для автоматизации","Создание уникального видеоконтента","Инструмент ИИ для редактирования видео","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["تعديل فيديو مخصص","استخدام Claude Code للتحكم الآلي","إنشاء محتوى فيديو فريد","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتعديل الفيديو","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["roughcut AI智能视频编辑工具","Claude Code视频编辑","AI视频编辑工具","如何使用roughcut AI","roughcut AI与其他视频编辑工具的比较","roughcut AI安装教程","roughcut AI设置指南"],"ja":["roughcut AIエージェント","Claude Codeビデオ編集","AIビデオ編集ツール","roughcut AIの使い方","roughcut AIと他のビデオ編集ツールの比較","roughcut AIのインストール方法","roughcut AIの設定ガイド"],"ko":["roughcut AI 에이전트","Claude Code 비디오 편집","AI 비디오 편집 도구","roughcut AI 사용법","roughcut AI와 다른 비디오 편집 도구의 비교","roughcut AI 설치 가이드","roughcut AI 설정 매뉴얼"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","edición de video","Claude Code","desarrollo de video","alternativas a Adobe Premiere","cómo usar roughcut","instalación de roughcut","guía de configuración de roughcut"],"fr":["outils d''IA","édition de vidéo","Claude Code","développement de vidéo","alternatives à Adobe Premiere","comment utiliser roughcut","installation de roughcut","guide de configuration de roughcut"],"de":["KI-Tools","Videobearbeitung","Claude Code","Videoprojektentwicklung","Alternativen zu Adobe Premiere","wie man roughcut verwendet","Installation von roughcut","Konfigurationshandbuch für roughcut"],"pt":["como usar roughcut","o que é roughcut","ferramentas de IA para edição de vídeo","roughcut vs adobe premiere","instalar roughcut","guia de configuração roughcut","alternativas para roughcut","roughcut para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать roughcut","что такое roughcut","инструменты ИИ для редактирования видео","roughcut vs adobe premiere","установить roughcut","руководство по настройке roughcut","альтернативы roughcut","roughcut для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام roughcut","ما هي roughcut","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتعديل الفيديو","roughcut مقابل adobe premiere","تثبيت roughcut","دليل إعداد roughcut","بديلات roughcut","roughcut للمطورين"]}},"owner":"barefootford","repo":"buttercut","repoPath":"barefootford/buttercut","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.679Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"roughcut","description":"Creates video rough cut yaml file for use with Buttercut gem. Concatenates visual transcripts with file markers, creates a roughcut yaml with clip selections, then exports to XML format. Use this skill when users want a roughcut, sequence or scene generated. These are all the same thing, just with different lengths.","bodyPreview":"# Skill: Create Rough Cut\n\nThis skill handles the editorial process of creating rough cut timeline scripts from transcribed video footage. It launches a specialized agent that analyzes transcripts, makes editorial decisions, outputs a structured YAML rough cut, and exports it to Final Cut Pro XML format.\n\n**Note:** This skill is used for both full-length rough cuts (multiple minutes) and short sequences (30-60 seconds).\n\n## Prerequisites Check\n\nBefore launching the roughcut agent, verify all tra","body":"# Skill: Create Rough Cut\n\nThis skill handles the editorial process of creating rough cut timeline scripts from transcribed video footage. It launches a specialized agent that analyzes transcripts, makes editorial decisions, outputs a structured YAML rough cut, and exports it to Final Cut Pro XML format.\n\n**Note:** This skill is used for both full-length rough cuts (multiple minutes) and short sequences (30-60 seconds).\n\n## Prerequisites Check\n\nBefore launching the roughcut agent, verify all transcripts are complete:\n\n1. **Check library exists:**\n   ```bash\n   ls libraries/[library-name]/library.yaml\n   ```\n\n2. **Verify visual transcripts:**\n   Read `libraries/[library-name]/library.yaml` and check that every video entry has both:\n   - `transcript` populated (audio transcript filename)\n   - `visual_transcript` populated (visual descriptions filename)\n\n   If any visual transcripts are missing:\n   - Inform user that transcript processing must be completed first\n   - Ask if they want Claude to finish transcript processing using the `transcribe-audio` and `analyze-video` skills\n   - Do not proceed with roughcut creation until all transcripts are complete\n\n## Launch Roughcut Agent\n\nOnce prerequisites are verified, launch the roughcut creation agent using the Task tool:\n\n```\nTask tool with:\n- subagent_type: \"general-purpose\"\n- description: \"Create rough cut from visual transcripts\"\n- prompt: [See agent prompt template below]\n```\n\n### Agent Prompt Template\n\nWhen launching the agent, provide a detailed prompt with all necessary context:\n\n```\nYou are a video editor AI agent creating a rough cut or sequence for the \"{library_name}\" library.\n\nUSER REQUEST: {what_user_asked_for}\n\nLIBRARY CONTEXT:\n{paste relevant content from library.yaml - footage_summary, user_context, etc.}\n\nYOUR TASK:\n1. Read the roughcut creation instructions from .claude/skills/roughcut/agent_instructions.md\n2. Follow those instructions to create the rough cut\n3. Return the paths to the created YAML and XML files when complete\n\nDELIVERABLES:\n- Rough cut YAML file at: libraries/{library_name}/roughcuts/{roughcut_name}_{datetime}.yaml\n- Exported XML file for user''s chosen video editor\n- Backup created via backup-library skill\n\nBegin by reading the agent instructions file.\n```\n\n## After Agent Completes\n\nWhen the agent returns:\n1. Inform the user of the created roughcut file (the xml file, not the yaml file) and its location\n2. Confirm the rough cut is ready to import into their video editor\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:27.664Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Video Editing Agents requiring automated rough cut timeline scripting from transcribed footage.","zh":"适合需要自动从转录的视频脚本中创建粗略剪辑时间轴的视频编辑代理。","ja":"映像編集エージェントが転写された映像から自動でラフカットのタイムラインスクリプトを作成する必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"자동으로 자막이 달린 영상을粗略한 편집 타임라인 스크립트로 변환해야 하는 비디오 편집 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Edición de Video que requieren una programación de línea de tiempo de corte brusco automatizada a partir de metraje transcrito.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Montage Vidéo nécessitant un script de timeline de coupure brute automatisé à partir de footage transcrit.","de":"Ideal für Video-Bearbeitungs-Agents, die eine automatisierte Grobchnitt-Zeitachsen-Skriptierung aus transkribiertem Footage erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Edição de Vídeo que exigem script de linha do tempo de corte bruto automatizado a partir de footages transcritos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов видеомонтажа, требующих автоматизированного сценария грубой версии временной шкалы из транскрибированных кадров.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحرير الفيديو الذي يتطلب سيناريو زمني قاطع مسودة أوتوماتيكي من مقاطع فيديو محولة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze transcripts, make editorial decisions, and output structured YAML rough cuts, exportable to Final Cut Pro XML format, utilizing specialized agents for efficient video editing workflows.","zh":"赋予代理分析转录、做出编辑决策并输出结构化的YAML粗略剪辑，支持导出到Final Cut Pro XML格式，利用专用代理实现高效的视频编辑工作流程。","ja":"エージェントが転写を分析し、編集上の決定を下し、構造化されたYAMLのラフカットを出力してFinal Cut Pro XML形式でエクスポートすることを可能にし、専用のエージェントを利用して効率的なビデオ編集ワークフローを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 자막을 분석하고 편집 결정을 내리고 구조화된 YAML粗略한 편집을 출력하여 Final Cut Pro XML 형식으로 내보낼 수 있도록 하며,専用 에이전트를 사용하여 효율적인 비디오 편집 워크플ロー를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para analizar transcritos, tomar decisiones editoriales y producir cortes brutos estructurados en formato YAML, exportables al formato XML de Final Cut Pro, utilizando agentes especializados para flujos de trabajo de edición de video eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les transcrits, de prendre des décisions éditoriales et de produire des coupes brutes structurées au format YAML, exportables au format XML de Final Cut Pro, en utilisant des agents spécialisés pour des flux de travail de montage vidéo efficaces.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Transkripte zu analysieren, redaktionelle Entscheidungen zu treffen und strukturierte YAML-Grob Schnitte auszugeben, die in das Final Cut Pro XML-Format exportiert werden können, unter Verwendung spezialisierter Agents für effiziente Video-Bearbeitungs-Workflows.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar transcrições, tomar decisões editoriais e produzir estruturas YAML de cortes brutos, exportáveis para o formato XML do Final Cut Pro, utilizando agentes especializados para fluxos de trabalho de edição de vídeo eficientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать транскрипты, принимать редакторские решения и выдавать структурированные YAML-rough cuts, экспортируемые в формат XML Final Cut Pro, используя специализированные агенты для эффективных рабочих процессов видеомонтажа.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تحليل المحررات، واتخاذ قرارات تحريرية، وإخراج قطع YAML الخشنة، القابلة للتصدير إلى تنسيق XML Final Cut Pro، باستخدام وكلاء متخصصين لتدفقات عمل تحرير الفيديو الفعالة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating rough cut creation for full-length videos","Generating short sequence timelines for social media","Exporting rough cuts to Final Cut Pro for further editing"],"zh":["为全长视频自动创建粗略剪辑","为社交媒体生成短序列时间轴","将粗略剪辑导出到Final Cut Pro进行进一步编辑"],"ja":["長尺映画のためのラフカット自動生成","SNS用のショートシーケンスのタイムライン生成","ラフカットをFinal Cut Proにエクスポートしてさらに編集する"],"ko":["전체 길이 영상에 대한 자동粗略 편집 생성","소셜 미디어를 위한 단순 시퀀스 타임 라인 생성","Final Cut Pro로粗略 편집을 내보내서 추가 편집"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de cortes brutos para videos de larga duración","Generación de timelines de secuencias cortas para redes sociales","Exportación de cortes brutos a Final Cut Pro para edición adicional"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de coupes brutes pour les vidéos de longue durée","Génération de timelines de séquences courtes pour les réseaux sociaux","Exportation de coupes brutes vers Final Cut Pro pour une édition supplémentaire"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Grob Schnitten für Vollvideos","Generierung von Zeitachsen für kurze Sequenzen für soziale Medien","Export von Grob Schnitten zu Final Cut Pro für weitere Bearbeitung"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de cortes brutos para vídeos de comprimento total","Gerar timelines de sequências curtas para mídias sociais","Exportar cortes brutos para o Final Cut Pro para edição adicional"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания грубых версий для видео полной длины","Генерация временных шкал коротких последовательностей для социальных сетей","Экспорт грубых версий в Final Cut Pro для дальнейшего редактирования"],"ar":["تأتمة إنشاء القطع الخشنة للفيديوهات الكاملة","توليد جداول زمنية للترتيبات القصيرة لوسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية","تصدير القطع الخشنة إلى Final Cut Pro لمزيد من التحرير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires transcribed video footage","Outputs in YAML and Final Cut Pro XML formats only"],"zh":["需要转录的视频脚本","仅输出YAML和Final Cut Pro XML格式"],"ja":["転写された映像が必要","YAMLおよびFinal Cut Pro XML形式でのみ出力"],"ko":["자막이 달린 영상을 필요로 함","YAML 및 Final Cut Pro XML 형식만 출력"],"es":["Requiere metraje de video transcrito","Salida en formatos YAML y Final Cut Pro XML solo"],"fr":["Nécessite un footage vidéo transcrit","Sortie uniquement aux formats YAML et Final Cut Pro XML"],"de":["Benötigt transkribiertes Video-Material","Ausgabe nur im YAML- und Final Cut Pro XML-Format"],"pt":["Exige footages de vídeo transcritos","Saídas em formatos YAML e XML do Final Cut Pro apenas"],"ru":["Требует транскрибированных видеокадров","Выдаёт только в форматах YAML и XML Final Cut Pro"],"ar":["يتطلب مقاطع فيديو محولة","الإخراج في تنسيقات YAML و XML Final Cut Pro فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fd2ebc6b090934c74cc3c49506dc9687142f2765a158e69bd3cdb7ebf9afc759","qualityScore":34}');
