ах"],"ar":["اختبار المتصفحات التلقائي","استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين الكفاءة","دعم متصفحات متعددة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تقارير مفصلة عن الاختبارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI"],"ja":["xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI"],"ko":["xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI","xpath-testing - AI"],"es":["cómo usar xpath-testing","qué es un Agente de IA","alternativas a xpath-testing","xpath-testing vs Selenium","instalación de xpath-testing","guía de configuración de xpath-testing"],"fr":["comment utiliser xpath-testing","qu''est-ce qu''un Agent IA","alternatives à xpath-testing","xpath-testing vs Selenium","installation de xpath-testing","guide de configuration de xpath-testing"],"de":["wie man xpath-testing verwendet","was ist ein AI-Tool","Alternativen zu xpath-testing","xpath-testing vs Selenium","Installation von xpath-testing","Konfigurationsanleitung für xpath-testing"],"pt":["como usar xpath-testing","o que é xpath-testing","ferramentas de teste de navegador","xpath-testing vs selenium","instalar xpath-testing","guia de configuração do xpath-testing"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агенты xpath-testing","что такое ИИ агенты xpath-testing","инструменты для тестирования браузеров","ИИ агенты xpath-testing vs selenium","установка ИИ агентов xpath-testing","руководство по настройке ИИ агентов xpath-testing"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة اختبار المتصفحات xpath-testing","ما هي أداة اختبار المتصفحات xpath-testing","أدوات اختبار المتصفحات","أداة اختبار المتصفحات xpath-testing vs selenium","تثبيت أداة اختبار المتصفحات xpath-testing","دليل إعداد أداة اختبار المتصفحات xpath-testing"]}},"owner":"testomatio","repo":"explorbot","repoPath":"testomatio/explorbot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.694Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"xpath-testing","description":"Interactive XPath testing against HTML files in test-data/. Find elements by iteratively querying XPath expressions.","bodyPreview":"# XPath Testing Skill\n\nTest XPath expressions against HTML files in `test-data/` to find specific elements. You play a \"game\" — given a user''s request, iteratively query XPath until you find the right element and a unique XPath for it.\n\n## Rules\n\n- **NEVER read HTML files directly** — only use the CLI tool to query them\n- You may list files in `test-data/` to see what''s available\n- Work iteratively: start broad, then narrow down\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Identify Target\n\nAsk the user:\n- Which HTML fi","body":"# XPath Testing Skill\n\nTest XPath expressions against HTML files in `test-data/` to find specific elements. You play a \"game\" — given a user''s request, iteratively query XPath until you find the right element and a unique XPath for it.\n\n## Rules\n\n- **NEVER read HTML files directly** — only use the CLI tool to query them\n- You may list files in `test-data/` to see what''s available\n- Work iteratively: start broad, then narrow down\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Identify Target\n\nAsk the user:\n- Which HTML file in `test-data/`? (list files if needed)\n- What element are they looking for?\n\n### 2. Explore with Broad Queries\n\nStart with broad XPath patterns to understand the page:\n\n```bash\nbun .claude/skills/xpath-testing/xpath-query.ts test-data/<file> \"//button\"\nbun .claude/skills/xpath-testing/xpath-query.ts test-data/<file> \"//a[@href]\"\nbun .claude/skills/xpath-testing/xpath-query.ts test-data/<file> \"//*[@role]\"\n```\n\n### 3. Narrow Down\n\nUse the tool output to refine your XPath until you find the target element. Run as many queries as needed.\n\n### 4. Present Result\n\nOnce you find the element, present:\n\n1. **Brief explanation** of what the element is\n2. **Element outer HTML** from the tool output\n3. **Unique XPath** that matches exactly 1 element\n\n### 5. Verify Uniqueness\n\n**MANDATORY**: Run the tool one final time with your unique XPath to confirm it returns exactly 1 result. If it returns more than 1, refine further.\n\n## CLI Tool Reference\n\n```bash\nbun .claude/skills/xpath-testing/xpath-query.ts <html-file> <xpath-expression>\n```\n\nExit codes:\n- `0` — elements found\n- `1` — no matches\n- `2` — invalid XPath or error\n\n## XPath Cheat Sheet\n\n### Basic Element Selectors\n```\n//button                          All buttons\n//a[@href]                        All links with href\n//input                           All inputs\n//select                          All select dropdowns\n//form                            All forms\n```\n\n### ARIA and Accessibility\n```\n//*[@role=''button'']               Elements with button role\n//*[@role=''link'']                 Elements with link role\n//*[@role=''navigation'']           Navigation landmarks\n//*[@aria-label]                  Elements with aria-label\n//*[@aria-label=''Close'']          Specific aria-label\n//*[@aria-expanded=''true'']        Expanded elements\n```\n\n### Attribute Matching\n```\n//input[@type=''email'']            Email inputs\n//input[@name=''username'']         Input by name\n//*[@id=''main-content'']           Element by ID\n//*[contains(@class, ''btn'')]      Class contains \"btn\"\n//*[starts-with(@id, ''user-'')]    ID starts with \"user-\"\n```\n\n### Text Content\n```\n//*[text()=''Submit'']              Exact text match\n//*[contains(text(), ''Save'')]     Text contains \"Save\"\n//button[contains(., ''Delete'')]   Button containing \"Delete\" (includes descendants)\n//a[normalize-space()=''Login'']    Link with normalized text \"Login\"\n```\n\n### Structural / Combined\n```\n//form//input[@type=''email'']      Email input inside a form\n//nav//a[@href]                   Links inside nav\n//table//tr                       Table rows\n//*[@role=''dialog'']//button       Buttons inside dialogs\n//ul/li                           Direct child list items\n//div[@class=''modal'']//input      Inputs inside modal div\n```\n\n### Positional\n```\n(//button)[1]                     First button\n(//button)[last()]                Last button\n//ul/li[position()<=3]            First 3 list items\n//table//tr[2]/td[3]              Cell at row 2, col 3\n```\n\n### Logical Operators\n```\n//input[@type=''text'' or @type=''email'']    Text or email inputs\n//button[not(@disabled)]                   Non-disabled buttons\n//*[@role=''button'' and @aria-label]        Buttons with aria-label\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:35:57.532Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Scraping Agents requiring advanced XPath expression testing and validation.","zh":"适用于需要高级XPath表达式测试和验证的Web Scraping Agents。","ja":"Web Scraping Agentsが高度なXPath式のテストと検証を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 XPath 표현식 테스트 및 검증이 필요한 Web Scraping Agents에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Scraping Web que requieren pruebas y validación avanzadas de expresiones XPath.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de scraping Web nécessitant des tests et une validation avancés d''expressions XPath.","de":"Ideal für Web-Scraping-Agents, die erweiterte XPath-Ausdruckstests und -validierungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Web Scraping que exigem testes e validação avançados de expressões XPath.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-скрапинга, требующих продвинутого тестирования и проверки выражений XPath.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات حزمة الويب التي تتطلب اختبارات وتحقق متقدمين للتعبيرات XPath."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to iteratively query XPath expressions against HTML files using a CLI tool, ensuring accurate element selection without directly reading HTML files, leveraging XPath syntax and HTML file analysis in the `test-data/` directory.","zh":"赋予代理程序使用CLI工具迭代地对HTML文件查询XPath表达式的能力，确保在不直接读取HTML文件的情况下准确选择元素，利用XPath语法和`test-data/`目录中的HTML文件分析。","ja":"CLIツールを使用してHTMLファイルに対するXPath式の逐次的なクエリを可能にし、HTMLファイルを直接読み取らずに要素の選択を正確に行うことができるようにし、`test-data/`ディレクトリ内のHTMLファイルの解析とXPath構文を活用します。","ko":"CLI 도구를 사용하여 HTML 파일에 대한 XPath 표현식의 반복 쿼리를 가능하게 하여 HTML 파일을 직접 읽지 않고 요소를 정확하게 선택할 수 있도록 하며, `test-data/` 디렉토리 내의 HTML 파일 분석 및 XPath 구문을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar iterativamente expresiones XPath contra archivos HTML utilizando una herramienta CLI, asegurando una selección de elementos precisa sin leer directamente los archivos HTML, aprovechando la sintaxis XPath y el análisis de archivos HTML en el directorio `test-data/`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger de manière itérative des expressions XPath contre des fichiers HTML à l''aide d''un outil CLI, garantissant une sélection d''éléments précise sans lire directement les fichiers HTML, en exploitant la syntaxe XPath et l''analyse de fichiers HTML dans le répertoire `test-data/`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, XPath-Ausdrücke iterativ gegen HTML-Dateien mit einem CLI-Tool abzufragen, wodurch eine genaue Elementauswahl ohne direktes Lesen von HTML-Dateien gewährleistet wird, indem die XPath-Syntax und die Analyse von HTML-Dateien im Verzeichnis `test-data/` genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a consultarem iterativamente expressões XPath contra arquivos HTML usando uma ferramenta CLI, garantindo a seleção precisa de elementos sem ler diretamente os arquivos HTML, aproveitando a sintaxe XPath e a análise de arquivos HTML no diretório `test-data/`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью итеративно запрашивать выражения XPath против файлов HTML с помощью инструмента CLI, обеспечивая точный выбор элементов без прямого чтения файлов HTML, используя синтаксис XPath и анализ файлов HTML в директории `test-data/`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استعلام التعبيرات XPath بشكل متكرر ضد ملفات HTML باستخدام أداة CLI ، مما يضمن اختيار العناصر بدقة دون قراءة ملفات HTML مباشرة ، باستخدام بناء جملة XPath وتحليل ملفات HTML في الدليل `test-data/`."},"useCases":{"en":["Testing XPath expressions against multiple HTML files","Iteratively refining XPath queries for precise element targeting","Validating unique XPath expressions for specific HTML elements"],"zh":["对多个HTML文件测试XPath表达式","迭代地完善XPath查询以实现精确的元素定位","验证特定HTML元素的唯一XPath表达式"],"ja":["複数のHTMLファイルに対するXPath式のテスト","要素の正確なターゲットを実現するためのXPathクエリの逐次的な改良","特定のHTML要素のユニークなXPath式の検証"],"ko":["여러 개의 HTML 파일에 대한 XPath 표현식 테스트","정확한 요소 대상화를 위한 XPath 쿼리의 반복적인 개선","특정 HTML 요소의 고유한 XPath 표현식의 검증"],"es":["Pruebas de expresiones XPath contra varios archivos HTML","Refinación iterativa de consultas XPath para un objetivo de elementos preciso","Validación de expresiones XPath únicas para elementos HTML específicos"],"fr":["Tests d''expressions XPath contre plusieurs fichiers HTML","Affinement itératif des requêtes XPath pour une cible d''éléments précise","Validation d''expressions XPath uniques pour des éléments HTML spécifiques"],"de":["Tests von XPath-Ausdrücken gegen mehrere HTML-Dateien","Iterative Verfeinerung von XPath-Abfragen für eine präzise Elementzielsetzung","Validierung eindeutiger XPath-Ausdrücke für spezifische HTML-Elemente"],"pt":["Testar expressões XPath contra vários arquivos HTML","Refinar iterativamente consultas XPath para direcionamento de elementos precisos","Validar expressões XPath exclusivas para elementos HTML específicos"],"ru":["Тестировать выражения XPath против нескольких файлов HTML","Итеративно уточнять запросы XPath для точного нацеливания на элементы","Проверять уникальные выражения XPath для определенных элементов HTML"],"ar":["اختبار التعبيرات XPath ضد ملفات HTML متعددة","تحسين استعلامات XPath بشكل متكرر لاستهداف عناصر دقيق","تحقق التعبيرات XPath الفريدة للعناصر HTML المحددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CLI tool access","Limited to HTML files in the `test-data/` directory","Never reads HTML files directly, relying on the CLI tool for queries"],"zh":["需要CLI工具访问","仅限于`test-data/`目录中的HTML文件","从不直接读取HTML文件，依赖CLI工具进行查询"],"ja":["CLIツールへのアクセスが必要","`test-data/`ディレクトリ内のHTMLファイルのみに限定","HTMLファイルを直接読み取ることはなく、クエリにはCLIツールに依存"],"ko":["CLI 도구 액세스가 필요함","`test-data/` 디렉토리 내의 HTML 파일만으로 제한됨","HTML 파일을 직접 읽지 않고 쿼리에는 CLI 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a herramienta CLI","Limitado a archivos HTML en el directorio `test-data/`","Nunca lee archivos HTML directamente, confiando en la herramienta CLI para las consultas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''outil CLI","Limité aux fichiers HTML du répertoire `test-data/`","Ne lit jamais directement les fichiers HTML, en s''appuyant sur l''outil CLI pour les requêtes"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf CLI-Tool","Begrenzt auf HTML-Dateien im Verzeichnis `test-data/`","Liest niemals direkt HTML-Dateien, sich auf das CLI-Tool für Abfragen verlassend"],"pt":["Exige acesso à ferramenta CLI","Limitado a arquivos HTML no diretório `test-data/`","Nunca lê arquivos HTML diretamente, confiando na ferramenta CLI para consultas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к инструменту CLI","Ограничен файлами HTML в директории `test-data/`","Никогда не читает файлы HTML напрямую, полагаясь на инструмент CLI для запросов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أداة CLI","محدود بملفات HTML في الدليل `test-data/`","أبدا لا تقرأ ملفات HTML مباشرة ، اعتمادا على أداة CLI للاستعلامات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"dffaf17d3499e58fd5b1e7a36ee73eb986e8cf7231784f475f0313b106229eed","qualityScore":34}');
