lvm-tooling للمطورين","en":"llvm-tooling"},"description":{"zh":"LLVM工具是一款支持MSVC 2022特性的AI工具，能够帮助开发者提高开发效率","ja":"LLVMツールはMSVC 2022機能と互換性のあるAIツールで、開発効率を向上させることができます","ko":"LLVM 툴은 MSVC 2022 기능과 호환되는 AI 툴로 개발자에게 효율적인 개발 환경을 제공합니다","es":"llvm-tooling es una bifurcación de LLVM con compatibilidad explícita con MSVC 2022. Ofrece funcionalidades avanzadas para el desarrollo de software","fr":"llvm-tooling est une bifurcation de LLVM avec une compatibilité explicite avec MSVC 2022. Il offre des fonctionnalités avancées pour le développement de logi...","de":"llvm-tooling ist eine Abspaltung von LLVM mit expliziter Kompatibilität mit MSVC 2022. Es bietet erweiterte Funktionen für die Softwareentwicklung","pt":"O llvm-tooling é uma fork do LLVM com compatibilidade explícita com recursos do MSVC 2022, permitindo melhorias no desenvolvimento.","ru":"llvm-tooling - это форк LLVM с явной совместимостью с функциями MSVC 2022, позволяющий улучшить разработку.","ar":"llvm-tooling هو فرع من LLVM مع توافق صريح مع ميزات MSVC 2022، مما يسمح بتحسين التطوير.","en":"LLVM fork with explicit compatibility with MSVC 2022 features."},"definition":{"en":"LLVM fork with explicit compatibility with MSVC 2022 features."},"features":{"zh":["支持MSVC 2022特性","基于LLVM的AI工具","提高开发效率","兼容多种开发环境","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["MSVC 2022機能をサポート","LLVMベースのAIツール","開発効率を向上","複数の開発環境と互換性","簡単に使用して統合"],"ko":["MSVC 2022 기능 지원","LLVM 기반의 AI 툴","개발 효율성 향상","다양한 개발 환경과 호환","쉽게 사용하고 통합"],"es":["Compatibilidad con MSVC 2022","Funcionalidades avanzadas de LLVM","Mejora del rendimiento del código","Soporte para desarrollo de software","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo existentes"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec MSVC 2022","Fonctionnalités avancées de LLVM","Amélioration des performances du code","Prise en charge du développement de logiciels","Intégration avec des outils de développement existants"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit MSVC 2022","Erweiterte Funktionen von LLVM","Leistungsverbesserung des Codes","Unterstützung für die Softwareentwicklung","Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Compatibilidade explícita com recursos do MSVC 2022","Melhorias no desenvolvimento com o LLVM","Ferramenta de IA para otimizar o código","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas","Integração com outros tools de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Явная совместимость с функциями MSVC 2022","Улучшения в разработке с помощью LLVM","ИИ инструмент для оптимизации кода","Поддержка нескольких платформ","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["توافق صريح مع ميزات MSVC 2022","تحسينات في التطوير باستخدام LLVM","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتحسين الكود","دعم منصات متعددة","دمج مع أدوات تطوير أخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LLVM工具","MSVC 2022","AI工具","开发效率","LLVM教程","MSVC 2022下载","AI开发工具","LLVM安装","MSVC 2022功能"],"ja":["LLVMツール","MSVC 2022","AIツール","開発効率","LLVMチュートリアル","MSVC 2022ダウンロード","AI開発ツール","LLVMインストール","MSVC 2022機能"],"ko":["LLVM 툴","MSVC 2022","AI 툴","개발 효율성","LLVM 튜토리얼","MSVC 2022 다운로드","AI 개발 툴","LLVM 설치","MSVC 2022 기능"],"es":["llvm-tooling","MSVC 2022","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","cómo usar llvm-tooling","llvm-tooling vs GCC","instalación de llvm-tooling","guía de configuración de llvm-tooling"],"fr":["llvm-tooling","MSVC 2022","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","comment utiliser llvm-tooling","llvm-tooling vs GCC","installation de llvm-tooling","guide de configuration de llvm-tooling"],"de":["llvm-tooling","MSVC 2022","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","wie man llvm-tooling verwendet","llvm-tooling vs GCC","Installation von llvm-tooling","Konfigurationsanleitung für llvm-tooling"],"pt":["como usar llvm-tooling","o que é llvm-tooling","llvm-tooling vs llvm","llvm-tooling alternative","llvm-tooling install","guia de setup do llvm-tooling","desenvolvimento com llvm-tooling","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать llvm-tooling","что такое llvm-tooling","llvm-tooling vs llvm","llvm-tooling альтернатива","llvm-tooling установка","руководство по настройке llvm-tooling","разработка с помощью llvm-tooling","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام llvm-tooling","ما هو llvm-tooling","llvm-tooling مقابل llvm","بديل llvm-tooling","تثبيت llvm-tooling","دليل إعداد llvm-tooling","التطوير باستخدام llvm-tooling","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"backengineering","repo":"llvm-msvc","repoPath":"backengineering/llvm-msvc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.704Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"llvm-tooling","description":"Expertise in LLVM tooling development including Clang plugins, LLDB debugger extensions, Clangd/LSP, and LibTooling. Use this skill when building source code analysis tools, refactoring tools, debugger extensions, or IDE integrations.","bodyPreview":"# LLVM Tooling Skill\n\nThis skill covers development of tools using LLVM/Clang infrastructure for source code analysis, debugging, and IDE integration.\n\n## Clang Plugin Development\n\n### Plugin Architecture\nClang plugins are dynamically loaded libraries that extend Clang''s functionality during compilation.\n\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/ASTConsumer.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/RecursiveASTVisitor.h\"\n\nclass MyVisitor : public clang::RecursiveASTVisitor<MyVi","body":"# LLVM Tooling Skill\n\nThis skill covers development of tools using LLVM/Clang infrastructure for source code analysis, debugging, and IDE integration.\n\n## Clang Plugin Development\n\n### Plugin Architecture\nClang plugins are dynamically loaded libraries that extend Clang''s functionality during compilation.\n\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/ASTConsumer.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/RecursiveASTVisitor.h\"\n\nclass MyVisitor : public clang::RecursiveASTVisitor<MyVisitor> {\npublic:\n    bool VisitFunctionDecl(clang::FunctionDecl *FD) {\n        llvm::outs() << \"Found function: \" << FD->getName() << \"\\n\";\n        return true;\n    }\n};\n\nclass MyConsumer : public clang::ASTConsumer {\n    MyVisitor Visitor;\npublic:\n    void HandleTranslationUnit(clang::ASTContext &Context) override {\n        Visitor.TraverseDecl(Context.getTranslationUnitDecl());\n    }\n};\n\nclass MyPlugin : public clang::PluginASTAction {\nprotected:\n    std::unique_ptr<clang::ASTConsumer> CreateASTConsumer(\n        clang::CompilerInstance &CI, llvm::StringRef) override {\n        return std::make_unique<MyConsumer>();\n    }\n    \n    bool ParseArgs(const clang::CompilerInstance &CI,\n                   const std::vector<std::string> &args) override {\n        return true;\n    }\n};\n\nstatic clang::FrontendPluginRegistry::Add<MyPlugin>\n    X(\"my-plugin\", \"My custom plugin description\");\n```\n\n### Running Clang Plugins\n```bash\n# Build plugin\nclang++ -shared -fPIC -o MyPlugin.so MyPlugin.cpp \\\n    $(llvm-config --cxxflags --ldflags)\n\n# Run plugin\nclang -Xclang -load -Xclang ./MyPlugin.so \\\n      -Xclang -plugin -Xclang my-plugin \\\n      source.cpp\n```\n\n## LibTooling\n\n### Standalone Tools\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Tooling/CommonOptionsParser.h\"\n#include \"clang/Tooling/Tooling.h\"\n#include \"clang/ASTMatchers/ASTMatchFinder.h\"\n\nusing namespace clang::tooling;\nusing namespace clang::ast_matchers;\n\n// Define matcher\nauto functionMatcher = functionDecl(hasName(\"targetFunction\")).bind(\"func\");\n\n// Callback handler\nclass FunctionCallback : public MatchFinder::MatchCallback {\npublic:\n    void run(const MatchFinder::MatchResult &Result) override {\n        if (auto *FD = Result.Nodes.getNodeAs<FunctionDecl>(\"func\")) {\n            llvm::outs() << \"Found: \" << FD->getQualifiedNameAsString() << \"\\n\";\n        }\n    }\n};\n\nint main(int argc, const char **argv) {\n    auto ExpectedParser = CommonOptionsParser::create(argc, argv, MyCategory);\n    ClangTool Tool(ExpectedParser->getCompilations(),\n                   ExpectedParser->getSourcePathList());\n    \n    FunctionCallback Callback;\n    MatchFinder Finder;\n    Finder.addMatcher(functionMatcher, &Callback);\n    \n    return Tool.run(newFrontendActionFactory(&Finder).get());\n}\n```\n\n### AST Matchers Reference\n```cpp\n// Declaration matchers\nfunctionDecl()           // Match function declarations\nvarDecl()               // Match variable declarations\nrecordDecl()            // Match struct/class/union\nfieldDecl()             // Match class fields\ncxxMethodDecl()         // Match C++ methods\ncxxConstructorDecl()    // Match constructors\n\n// Expression matchers\ncallExpr()              // Match function calls\nbinaryOperator()        // Match binary operators\nunaryOperator()         // Match unary operators\nmemberExpr()            // Match member access\n\n// Narrowing matchers\nhasName(\"name\")         // Filter by name\nhasType(asString(\"int\")) // Filter by type\nisPublic()              // Filter by access specifier\nhasAnyParameter(...)    // Match parameters\n\n// Traversal matchers\nhasDescendant(...)      // Match anywhere in subtree\nhasAncestor(...)        // Match in parent chain\nhas(...)                // Match direct children\nforEach(...)            // Match all children\n```\n\n## LLDB Extension Development\n\n### Python Commands\n```python\nimport lldb\n\ndef my_command(debugger, command, result, internal_dict):\n    \"\"\"Custom LLDB command implementation\"\"\"\n    target = debugger.GetSelectedTarget()\n    process = target.GetProcess()\n    thread = process.GetSelectedThread()\n    frame = thread.GetSelectedFrame()\n    \n    # Get variable value\n    var = frame.FindVariable(\"my_var\")\n    result.AppendMessage(f\"my_var = {var.GetValue()}\")\n\ndef __lldb_init_module(debugger, internal_dict):\n    debugger.HandleCommand(\n        ''command script add -f my_module.my_command my_cmd'')\n```\n\n### Scripted Process\n```python\nclass MyScriptedProcess(lldb.SBScriptedProcess):\n    def __init__(self, target, args):\n        super().__init__(target, args)\n        \n    def get_thread_with_id(self, tid):\n        # Return thread info\n        pass\n    \n    def get_registers_for_thread(self, tid):\n        # Return register context\n        pass\n    \n    def read_memory_at_address(self, addr, size):\n        # Read memory\n        pass\n```\n\n### LLDB GUI Extensions\n- **visual-lldb**: GUI frontend for LLDB\n- **vegvisir**: Browser-based LLDB GUI\n- **lldbg**: Lightweight native GUI\n- **CodeLLDB**: VSCode debugger extension\n\n## Clangd / Language Server Protocol\n\n### Custom LSP Extensions\n```cpp\n// Implementing custom code actions\nclass MyCodeActionProvider {\npublic:\n    std::vector<CodeAction> getCodeActions(\n        const TextDocumentIdentifier &File,\n        const Range &Range,\n        const CodeActionContext &Context) {\n        \n        std::vector<CodeAction> Actions;\n        \n        // Add custom refactoring action\n        CodeAction Action;\n        Action.title = \"Extract to function\";\n        Action.kind = \"refactor.extract\";\n        \n        // Define workspace edits\n        WorkspaceEdit Edit;\n        // ... populate edits\n        Action.edit = Edit;\n        \n        Actions.push_back(Action);\n        return Actions;\n    }\n};\n```\n\n### Clangd Configuration\n```yaml\n# .clangd configuration file\nCompileFlags:\n  Add: [-xc++, -std=c++17]\n  Remove: [-W*]\n\nDiagnostics:\n  ClangTidy:\n    Add: [modernize-*, performance-*]\n    Remove: [modernize-use-trailing-return-type]\n\nIndex:\n  Background: Build\n```\n\n## Source-to-Source Transformation\n\n### Clang Rewriter\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Rewrite/Core/Rewriter.h\"\n\nclass MyRewriter : public RecursiveASTVisitor<MyRewriter> {\n    Rewriter &R;\n    \npublic:\n    MyRewriter(Rewriter &R) : R(R) {}\n    \n    bool VisitFunctionDecl(FunctionDecl *FD) {\n        // Add comment before function\n        R.InsertTextBefore(FD->getBeginLoc(), \"// Auto-generated\\n\");\n        \n        // Replace function name\n        R.ReplaceText(FD->getLocation(), \n                      FD->getName().size(), \"new_name\");\n        \n        return true;\n    }\n};\n```\n\n### RefactoringTool\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Tooling/Refactoring.h\"\n\nclass MyRefactoring : public RefactoringCallback {\npublic:\n    void run(const MatchFinder::MatchResult &Result) override {\n        // Generate replacements\n        Replacement Rep(\n            *Result.SourceManager,\n            CharSourceRange::getTokenRange(Range),\n            \"new_text\");\n        \n        Replacements.insert(Rep);\n    }\n};\n```\n\n## Notable Tools Built with LLVM Tooling\n\n### Analysis Tools\n- **cppinsights**: C++ template instantiation visualization\n- **ClangBuildAnalyzer**: Build time analysis\n- **clazy**: Qt-specific static analysis\n\n### Refactoring Tools\n- **clang-rename**: Symbol renaming\n- **clang-tidy**: Linting and auto-fixes\n- **include-what-you-use**: Include optimization\n\n### Code Generation\n- **classgen**: Extract type info for IDA\n- **constexpr-everything**: Auto-apply constexpr\n- **clang-expand**: Inline function expansion\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use AST Matchers**: More readable than manual traversal\n2. **Preserve Formatting**: Use Rewriter carefully to maintain style\n3. **Handle Macros**: Be aware of macro expansion locations\n4. **Test Thoroughly**: Edge cases in C++ are numerous\n5. **Provide Good Diagnostics**: Clear error messages improve usability\n\n## Resources\n\nSee Clang Plugins, Clangd/Language Server, and LLDB sections in README.md for comprehensive tool listings.\n\n## Getting Detailed Information\n\nWhen you need detailed and up-to-date resource links, tool lists, or project references, fetch the latest data from:\n\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/gmh5225/awesome-llvm-security/refs/heads/main/README.md\n```\n\nThis README contains comprehensive curated lists of:\n- Clang plugins and extensions (Clang Plugins section)\n- Language server implementations (Clangd/Language Server section)\n- LLDB debugger tools and GUIs (LLDB section)\n- Static analysis and refactoring tools\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:41:51.291Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced Clang plugin development and LLVM tooling capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Clang插件开发和LLVM工具功能的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード分析エージェントが高度なClangプラグイン開発とLLVMツール機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Clang 플러그인 개발 및 LLVM 툴링 기능이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan desarrollo avanzado de plugins de Clang y capacidades de herramientas de LLVM.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant un développement avancé de plugins Clang et des capacités d''outillage LLVM.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine erweiterte Clang-Plugin-Entwicklung und LLVM-Tooling-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de desenvolvimento avançado de plugins Clang e capacidades de ferramentas LLVM.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа кода, которым требуются продвинутые возможности разработки плагинов Clang и инструментов LLVM.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير متقدم لملحقات Clang وقدرات أدوات LLVM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend Clang''s functionality during compilation using dynamically loaded libraries, leveraging clang::RecursiveASTVisitor and clang::ASTConsumer for source code analysis and debugging, while integrating with MSVC 2022 features.","zh":"赋予代理在编译期间使用动态加载库扩展Clang的功能，利用clang::RecursiveASTVisitor和clang::ASTConsumer进行源代码分析和调试，同时集成MSVC 2022功能。","ja":"動的にロードされたライブラリを使用してコンパイル中にClangの機能を拡張するエージェントを可能にし、clang::RecursiveASTVisitorとclang::ASTConsumerを使用してソースコード分析とデバッグを行い、MSVC 2022機能と統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 동적으로 로드된 라이브러리를 사용하여 컴파일 중에 Clang의 기능을 확장할 수 있도록 하며, clang::RecursiveASTVisitor 및 clang::ASTConsumer를 사용하여 소스 코드 분석 및 디버깅을 수행하고, MSVC 2022 기능과 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extender la funcionalidad de Clang durante la compilación utilizando bibliotecas cargadas dinámicamente, aprovechando clang::RecursiveASTVisitor y clang::ASTConsumer para el análisis y depuración de código fuente, mientras se integra con las características de MSVC 2022.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre les fonctionnalités de Clang pendant la compilation en utilisant des bibliothèques chargées dynamiquement, en exploitant clang::RecursiveASTVisitor et clang::ASTConsumer pour l''analyse et le débogage du code source, tout en s''intégrant aux fonctionnalités de MSVC 2022.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Funktionalität von Clang während der Kompilierung mithilfe dynamisch geladener Bibliotheken zu erweitern, indem clang::RecursiveASTVisitor und clang::ASTConsumer für die Quellcode-Analyse und -Fehlersuche genutzt werden, während sie sich in die Funktionen von MSVC 2022 integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender a funcionalidade do Clang durante a compilação usando bibliotecas carregadas dinamicamente, aproveitando clang::RecursiveASTVisitor e clang::ASTConsumer para análise e depuração de código-fonte, além de integrar com recursos do MSVC 2022.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расширить функциональность Clang во время компиляции с помощью динамически загружаемых библиотек, используя clang::RecursiveASTVisitor и clang::ASTConsumer для анализа и отладки исходного кода, а также интегрируя с функциями MSVC 2022.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تمديد وظائف Clang خلال الترجمة باستخدام المكتبات المحملة ديناميكيًا، واستخدام clang::RecursiveASTVisitor و clang::ASTConsumer لتحليل وتصحيح الشفرة المصدرية، بالإضافة إلى التكامل مع ميزات MSVC 2022."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing custom Clang plugins for static code analysis","Creating IDE integrations using LLVM tooling","Debugging complex C++ codebases with Clang-based tools"],"zh":["为静态代码分析开发自定义Clang插件","使用LLVM工具创建IDE集成","使用基于Clang的工具调试复杂的C++代码库"],"ja":["静的コード分析のためのカスタムClangプラグインの開発","LLVMツールを使用したIDE統合の作成","Clangベースのツールを使用した複雑なC++コードベースのデバッグ"],"ko":["정적 코드 분석을 위한 사용자 지정 Clang 플러그인 개발","LLVM 툴링을 사용한 IDE 통합 생성","Clang 기반 도구를 사용한 복잡한 C++ 코드베이스 디버깅"],"es":["Desarrollar plugins de Clang personalizados para el análisis de código estático","Crear integraciones de IDE utilizando herramientas de LLVM","Depurar código C++ complejo con herramientas basadas en Clang"],"fr":["Développer des plugins Clang personnalisés pour l''analyse de code statique","Créer des intégrations d''IDE en utilisant les outils de LLVM","Déboguer des bases de code C++ complexes avec des outils basés sur Clang"],"de":["Entwicklung benutzerdefinierter Clang-Plugins für die statische Code-Analyse","Erstellung von IDE-Integrationen unter Verwendung von LLVM-Tools","Fehlersuche in komplexen C++-Codebasen mit Clang-basierten Tools"],"pt":["Desenvolver plugins personalizados do Clang para análise de código estático","Criar integrações de IDE usando ferramentas LLVM","Depurar código-fonte C++ complexo com ferramentas baseadas em Clang"],"ru":["Разработка пользовательских плагинов Clang для статического анализа кода","Создание интеграций IDE с помощью инструментов LLVM","Отладка сложных баз кода C++ с помощью инструментов на основе Clang"],"ar":["إنشاء ملحقات Clang مخصصة لتحليل الشفرة الثابت","إنشاء تكاملات بيئة التطوير المتكاملة باستخدام أدوات LLVM","تصحيح أخطاء الشفرة المصدرية المكتوبة بلغة C++ المعقدة باستخدام أدوات تعتمد على Clang"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires C++ programming knowledge","Compatibility limited to MSVC 2022 features","Dependent on LLVM/Clang infrastructure"],"zh":["需要C++编程知识","兼容性仅限于MSVC 2022功能","依赖于LLVM/Clang基础设施"],"ja":["C++プログラミングの知識が必要","互換性はMSVC 2022機能に限定される","LLVM/Clangインフラストラクチャに依存する"],"ko":["C++ 프로그래밍 지식 필요","호환성은 MSVC 2022 기능으로 제한됨","LLVM/Clang 인프라스트럭처에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de programación en C++","Compatibilidad limitada a las características de MSVC 2022","Dependiente de la infraestructura de LLVM/Clang"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en programmation C++","Compatibilité limitée aux fonctionnalités de MSVC 2022","Dépendant de l''infrastructure LLVM/Clang"],"de":["Benötigt C++-Programmierkenntnisse","Kompatibilität beschränkt auf MSVC 2022-Funktionen","Abhängig von der LLVM/Clang-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de programação em C++","Compatibilidade limitada a recursos do MSVC 2022","Dependente da infraestrutura LLVM/Clang"],"ru":["Требуется знание программирования на C++","Совместимость ограничена функциями MSVC 2022","Зависит от инфраструктуры LLVM/Clang"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بلغة برمجة C++","التوافق مقيد بميزات MSVC 2022","يعتمد على بنية تحتية LLVM/Clang"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"382d6821ce259cd3d39184233072f00c3a7ae84d222c1de1f4df76e070e33d6e","qualityScore":34}');
