izzle-ORM은 Electron을 기반으로 하는 음악 매니저로, 강력한 음악 관리 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Drizzle-orm es una herramienta de gestión de música construida con electron, ideal para desarrolladores que buscan una solución de código abierto","fr":"Drizzle-orm est un outil de gestion de musique construit avec electron, idéal pour les développeurs qui recherchent une solution open source","de":"Drizzle-orm ist ein Musikmanagement-Tool, das mit electron entwickelt wurde, ideal für Entwickler, die eine Open-Source-Lösung suchen","pt":"O drizzle-orm é uma ferramenta de IA para desenvolvedores que buscam criar um music manager em Electron","ru":"ИИ Агент drizzle-orm для разработки музыкального менеджера на Electron","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي drizzle-orm لمطوري مدير الموسيقى باستخدام Electron","en":"music manager built in electron"},"definition":{"en":"music manager built in electron"},"features":{"zh":["基于Electron的音乐管理器","提供强大的音乐管理功能","支持多种音乐格式","易于使用的界面","高效的音乐管理"],"ja":["Electronを使用した音楽マネージャー","強力な音楽管理機能を提供","複数の音楽形式をサポート","使いやすいインターフェース","効率的な音楽管理"],"ko":["Electron을 기반으로 하는 음악 매니저","강력한 음악 관리 기능을 제공","다양한 음악 형식을 지원","사용하기 쉬운 인터페이스","효율적인 음악 관리"],"es":["Gestión de bibliotecas de música","Reproducción de música con electron","Código abierto y personalizable","Integración con otras herramientas de desarrollo","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva"],"fr":["Gestion de bibliothèques de musique","Lecture de musique avec electron","Code open source et personnalisable","Intégration avec d''autres outils de développement","Interface utilisateur intuitive"],"de":["Musikbibliotheksverwaltung","Musikwiedergabe mit electron","Open-Source-Code und anpassbar","Integration mit anderen Entwicklungstools","Intuitive Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de music manager em Electron","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Gerenciamento de bibliotecas de música","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo"],"ru":["Разработка музыкального менеджера на Electron","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов пользователя","Управление библиотеками музыки","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов"],"ar":["تطوير مدير موسيقى باستخدام Electron","التكامل مع تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","إدارة مكتبات الموسيقى","دعم عدة صيغ الملفات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Drizzle-ORM是什么","如何使用Drizzle-ORM","Drizzle-ORM音乐管理器","Electron音乐管理器","音乐管理工具","Drizzle-ORM安装","Drizzle-ORM设置指南"],"ja":["Drizzle-ORMとは","Drizzle-ORMの使い方","Drizzle-ORM音楽マネージャー","Electron音楽マネージャー","音楽管理ツール","Drizzle-ORMのインストール","Drizzle-ORMの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Drizzle-ORM이란","Drizzle-ORM 사용법","Drizzle-ORM 음악 매니저","Electron 음악 매니저","음악 관리 도구","Drizzle-ORM 설치","Drizzle-ORM 설정 가이드"],"es":["drizzle-orm","herramientas de música","electron","código abierto","gestión de música","alternativas a drizzle-orm","drizzle-orm vs otras herramientas","instalación de drizzle-orm","guía de configuración de drizzle-orm"],"fr":["drizzle-orm","outils de musique","electron","code open source","gestion de musique","alternatives à drizzle-orm","drizzle-orm vs autres outils","installation de drizzle-orm","guide de configuration de drizzle-orm"],"de":["drizzle-orm","Musiktools","electron","Open-Source-Code","Musikmanagement","Alternativen zu drizzle-orm","drizzle-orm vs andere Tools","Installation von drizzle-orm","Konfigurationsanleitung für drizzle-orm"],"pt":["como usar drizzle-orm","o que é drizzle-orm","drizzle-orm vs outras ferramentas","instalar drizzle-orm","guia de setup do drizzle-orm","desenvolvimento de music manager","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores"," Electron para desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["как использовать drizzle-orm","что такое drizzle-orm","drizzle-orm vs другие инструменты","установить drizzle-orm","руководство по настройке drizzle-orm","разработка музыкального менеджера","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","Electron для разработки приложений"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام drizzle-orm","ما هي drizzle-orm","drizzle-orm مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت drizzle-orm","دليل إعداد drizzle-orm","تطوير مدير الموسيقى","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","Electron لتطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"jvegaf","repo":"harmony","repoPath":"jvegaf/harmony","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.706Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"drizzle-orm","description":"Type-safe SQL ORM for TypeScript with zero runtime overhead","bodyPreview":"# Drizzle ORM\n\nModern TypeScript-first ORM with zero dependencies, compile-time type safety, and SQL-like syntax. Optimized for edge runtimes and serverless environments.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\n# Core ORM\nnpm install drizzle-orm\n\n# Database driver (choose one)\nnpm install pg            # PostgreSQL\nnpm install mysql2        # MySQL\nnpm install better-sqlite3 # SQLite\n\n# Drizzle Kit (migrations)\nnpm install -D drizzle-kit\n```\n\n### Basic Setup\n\n```typescript\n// db/schema.ts\nimp","body":"# Drizzle ORM\n\nModern TypeScript-first ORM with zero dependencies, compile-time type safety, and SQL-like syntax. Optimized for edge runtimes and serverless environments.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\n# Core ORM\nnpm install drizzle-orm\n\n# Database driver (choose one)\nnpm install pg            # PostgreSQL\nnpm install mysql2        # MySQL\nnpm install better-sqlite3 # SQLite\n\n# Drizzle Kit (migrations)\nnpm install -D drizzle-kit\n```\n\n### Basic Setup\n\n```typescript\n// db/schema.ts\nimport { pgTable, serial, text, timestamp } from ''drizzle-orm/pg-core'';\n\nexport const users = pgTable(''users'', {\n  id: serial(''id'').primaryKey(),\n  email: text(''email'').notNull().unique(),\n  name: text(''name'').notNull(),\n  createdAt: timestamp(''created_at'').defaultNow(),\n});\n\n// db/client.ts\nimport { drizzle } from ''drizzle-orm/node-postgres'';\nimport { Pool } from ''pg'';\nimport * as schema from ''./schema'';\n\nconst pool = new Pool({ connectionString: process.env.DATABASE_URL });\nexport const db = drizzle(pool, { schema });\n```\n\n### First Query\n\n```typescript\nimport { db } from ''./db/client'';\nimport { users } from ''./db/schema'';\nimport { eq } from ''drizzle-orm'';\n\n// Insert\nconst newUser = await db\n  .insert(users)\n  .values({\n    email: ''user@example.com'',\n    name: ''John Doe'',\n  })\n  .returning();\n\n// Select\nconst allUsers = await db.select().from(users);\n\n// Where\nconst user = await db.select().from(users).where(eq(users.id, 1));\n\n// Update\nawait db.update(users).set({ name: ''Jane Doe'' }).where(eq(users.id, 1));\n\n// Delete\nawait db.delete(users).where(eq(users.id, 1));\n```\n\n## Schema Definition\n\n### Column Types Reference\n\n| PostgreSQL    | MySQL         | SQLite      | TypeScript |\n| ------------- | ------------- | ----------- | ---------- |\n| `serial()`    | `serial()`    | `integer()` | `number`   |\n| `text()`      | `text()`      | `text()`    | `string`   |\n| `integer()`   | `int()`       | `integer()` | `number`   |\n| `boolean()`   | `boolean()`   | `integer()` | `boolean`  |\n| `timestamp()` | `datetime()`  | `integer()` | `Date`     |\n| `json()`      | `json()`      | `text()`    | `unknown`  |\n| `uuid()`      | `varchar(36)` | `text()`    | `string`   |\n\n### Common Schema Patterns\n\n```typescript\nimport { pgTable, serial, text, varchar, integer, boolean, timestamp, json, unique } from ''drizzle-orm/pg-core'';\n\nexport const users = pgTable(\n  ''users'',\n  {\n    id: serial(''id'').primaryKey(),\n    email: varchar(''email'', { length: 255 }).notNull().unique(),\n    passwordHash: varchar(''password_hash'', { length: 255 }).notNull(),\n    role: text(''role'', { enum: [''admin'', ''user'', ''guest''] }).default(''user''),\n    metadata: json(''metadata'').$type<{ theme: string; locale: string }>(),\n    isActive: boolean(''is_active'').default(true),\n    createdAt: timestamp(''created_at'').defaultNow().notNull(),\n    updatedAt: timestamp(''updated_at'').defaultNow().notNull(),\n  },\n  table => ({\n    emailIdx: unique(''email_unique_idx'').on(table.email),\n  }),\n);\n\n// Infer TypeScript types\ntype User = typeof users.$inferSelect;\ntype NewUser = typeof users.$inferInsert;\n```\n\n## Relations\n\n### One-to-Many\n\n```typescript\nimport { pgTable, serial, text, integer } from ''drizzle-orm/pg-core'';\nimport { relations } from ''drizzle-orm'';\n\nexport const authors = pgTable(''authors'', {\n  id: serial(''id'').primaryKey(),\n  name: text(''name'').notNull(),\n});\n\nexport const posts = pgTable(''posts'', {\n  id: serial(''id'').primaryKey(),\n  title: text(''title'').notNull(),\n  authorId: integer(''author_id'')\n    .notNull()\n    .references(() => authors.id),\n});\n\nexport const authorsRelations = relations(authors, ({ many }) => ({\n  posts: many(posts),\n}));\n\nexport const postsRelations = relations(posts, ({ one }) => ({\n  author: one(authors, {\n    fields: [posts.authorId],\n    references: [authors.id],\n  }),\n}));\n\n// Query with relations\nconst authorsWithPosts = await db.query.authors.findMany({\n  with: { posts: true },\n});\n```\n\n### Many-to-Many\n\n```typescript\nexport const users = pgTable(''users'', {\n  id: serial(''id'').primaryKey(),\n  name: text(''name'').notNull(),\n});\n\nexport const groups = pgTable(''groups'', {\n  id: serial(''id'').primaryKey(),\n  name: text(''name'').notNull(),\n});\n\nexport const usersToGroups = pgTable(\n  ''users_to_groups'',\n  {\n    userId: integer(''user_id'')\n      .notNull()\n      .references(() => users.id),\n    groupId: integer(''group_id'')\n      .notNull()\n      .references(() => groups.id),\n  },\n  table => ({\n    pk: primaryKey({ columns: [table.userId, table.groupId] }),\n  }),\n);\n\nexport const usersRelations = relations(users, ({ many }) => ({\n  groups: many(usersToGroups),\n}));\n\nexport const groupsRelations = relations(groups, ({ many }) => ({\n  users: many(usersToGroups),\n}));\n\nexport const usersToGroupsRelations = relations(usersToGroups, ({ one }) => ({\n  user: one(users, { fields: [usersToGroups.userId], references: [users.id] }),\n  group: one(groups, { fields: [usersToGroups.groupId], references: [groups.id] }),\n}));\n```\n\n## Queries\n\n### Filtering\n\n```typescript\nimport { eq, ne, gt, gte, lt, lte, like, ilike, inArray, isNull, isNotNull, and, or, between } from ''drizzle-orm'';\n\n// Equality\nawait db.select().from(users).where(eq(users.email, ''user@example.com''));\n\n// Comparison\nawait db.select().from(users).where(gt(users.id, 10));\n\n// Pattern matching\nawait db.select().from(users).where(like(users.name, ''%John%''));\n\n// Multiple conditions\nawait db\n  .select()\n  .from(users)\n  .where(and(eq(users.role, ''admin''), gt(users.createdAt, new Date(''2024-01-01''))));\n\n// IN clause\nawait db\n  .select()\n  .from(users)\n  .where(inArray(users.id, [1, 2, 3]));\n\n// NULL checks\nawait db.select().from(users).where(isNull(users.deletedAt));\n```\n\n### Joins\n\n```typescript\nimport { eq } from ''drizzle-orm'';\n\n// Inner join\nconst result = await db\n  .select({\n    user: users,\n    post: posts,\n  })\n  .from(users)\n  .innerJoin(posts, eq(users.id, posts.authorId));\n\n// Left join\nconst result = await db\n  .select({\n    user: users,\n    post: posts,\n  })\n  .from(users)\n  .leftJoin(posts, eq(users.id, posts.authorId));\n\n// Multiple joins with aggregation\nimport { count, sql } from ''drizzle-orm'';\n\nconst result = await db\n  .select({\n    authorName: authors.name,\n    postCount: count(posts.id),\n  })\n  .from(authors)\n  .leftJoin(posts, eq(authors.id, posts.authorId))\n  .groupBy(authors.id);\n```\n\n### Pagination & Sorting\n\n```typescript\nimport { desc, asc } from ''drizzle-orm'';\n\n// Order by\nawait db.select().from(users).orderBy(desc(users.createdAt));\n\n// Limit & offset\nawait db.select().from(users).limit(10).offset(20);\n\n// Pagination helper\nfunction paginate(page: number, pageSize: number = 10) {\n  return db\n    .select()\n    .from(users)\n    .limit(pageSize)\n    .offset(page * pageSize);\n}\n```\n\n## Transactions\n\n```typescript\n// Auto-rollback on error\nawait db.transaction(async (tx) => {\n  await tx.insert(users).values({ email: ''user@example.com'', name: ''John'' });\n  await tx.insert(posts).values({ title: ''First Post'', authorId: 1 });\n  // If any query fails, entire transaction rolls back\n});\n\n// Manual control\nconst tx = db.transaction(async (tx) => {\n  const user = await tx.insert(users).values({ ... }).returning();\n\n  if (!user) {\n    tx.rollback();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  await tx.insert(posts).values({ authorId: user.id });\n});\n```\n\n## Migrations\n\n### Drizzle Kit Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// drizzle.config.ts\nimport type { Config } from ''drizzle-kit'';\n\nexport default {\n  schema: ''./db/schema.ts'',\n  out: ''./drizzle'',\n  dialect: ''postgresql'',\n  dbCredentials: {\n    url: process.env.DATABASE_URL!,\n  },\n} satisfies Config;\n```\n\n### Migration Workflow\n\n```bash\n# Generate migration\nnpx drizzle-kit generate\n\n# View SQL\ncat drizzle/0000_migration.sql\n\n# Apply migration\nnpx drizzle-kit migrate\n\n# Introspect existing database\nnpx drizzle-kit introspect\n\n# Drizzle Studio (database GUI)\nnpx drizzle-kit studio\n```\n\n### Example Migration\n\n```sql\n-- drizzle/0000_initial.sql\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS \"users\" (\n  \"id\" serial PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n  \"email\" varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  \"name\" text NOT NULL,\n  \"created_at\" timestamp DEFAULT now() NOT NULL,\n  CONSTRAINT \"users_email_unique\" UNIQUE(\"email\")\n);\n```\n\n## Navigation\n\n### Detailed References\n\n- **[🏗️ Advanced Schemas](./references/advanced-schemas.md)** - Custom types, composite keys, indexes, constraints, multi-tenant patterns. Load when designing complex database schemas.\n\n- **[🔍 Query Patterns](./references/query-patterns.md)** - Subqueries, CTEs, raw SQL, prepared statements, batch operations. Load when optimizing queries or handling complex filtering.\n\n- **[⚡ Performance](./references/performance.md)** - Connection pooling, query optimization, N+1 prevention, prepared statements, edge runtime integration. Load when scaling or optimizing database performance.\n\n- **[🔄 vs Prisma](./references/vs-prisma.md)** - Feature comparison, migration guide, when to choose Drizzle over Prisma. Load when evaluating ORMs or migrating from Prisma.\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Stop and reconsider if:**\n\n- Using `any` or `unknown` for JSON columns without type annotation\n- Building raw SQL strings without using `sql` template (SQL injection risk)\n- Not using transactions for multi-step data modifications\n- Fetching all rows without pagination in production queries\n- Missing indexes on foreign keys or frequently queried columns\n- Using `select()` without specifying columns for large tables\n\n## Performance Benefits vs Prisma\n\n| Metric              | Drizzle           | Prisma                |\n| ------------------- | ----------------- | --------------------- |\n| **Bundle Size**     | ~35KB             | ~230KB                |\n| **Cold Start**      | ~10ms             | ~250ms                |\n| **Query Speed**     | Baseline          | ~2-3x slower          |\n| **Memory**          | ~10MB             | ~50MB                 |\n| **Type Generation** | Runtime inference | Build-time generation |\n\n## Integration\n\n- **typescript-core**: Type-safe schema inference with `satisfies`\n- **nextjs-core**: Server Actions, Route Handlers, Middleware integration\n- **Database Migration**: Safe schema evolution patterns\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWhen using Drizzle, these skills enhance your workflow:\n\n- **prisma**: Alternative ORM comparison: Drizzle vs Prisma trade-offs\n- **typescript**: Advanced TypeScript patterns for type-safe queries\n- **nextjs**: Drizzle with Next.js Server Actions and API routes\n- **sqlalchemy**: SQLAlchemy patterns for Python developers learning Drizzle\n\n[Full documentation available in these skills if deployed in your bundle]\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:42:08.109Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript-first AI Agents needing advanced database management with zero dependencies and compile-time type safety.","zh":"适合需要高级数据库管理且零依赖和编译时类型安全的TypeScript-first AI Agents。","ja":"ゼロな依存関係とコンパイル時型安全性を必要とするTypeScript-first AIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"제로 종속성 및 컴파일 타임 유형 안전성이 필요한 TypeScript-first AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para los agentes de inteligencia artificial de TypeScript que necesitan una administración de base de datos avanzada con cero dependencias y seguridad de tipo en tiempo de compilación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle de TypeScript qui ont besoin d''une gestion de base de données avancée avec zéro dépendances et une sécurité de type en temps de compilation.","de":"Perfekt für TypeScript-erste KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Datenbankverwaltung mit null Abhängigkeiten und Kompilierzeit-Typsicherheit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA primeiro em TypeScript que precisam de gerenciamento de banco de dados avançado com zero dependências e segurança de tipo em tempo de compilação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, основанных на TypeScript, требующих продвинутого управления базами данных с нулевыми зависимостями и безопасностью типов во время компиляции.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يأتون أولاً مع TypeScript الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة قواعد البيانات المتقدمة مع لا يوجد تبعيات وأمان النوع في وقت الترجمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with databases using SQL-like syntax, optimized for edge runtimes and serverless environments, supporting PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQLite through libraries like pg, mysql2, and better-sqlite3.","zh":"使得代理可以使用类似SQL的语法与数据库交互，针对边缘运行时和无服务器环境进行优化，通过诸如pg、mysql2和better-sqlite3等库支持PostgreSQL、MySQL和SQLite。","ja":"エージェントがSQLのような構文を使用してデータベースとやり取りできるようにし、エッジランタイムとサーバーレス環境向けに最適化され、pg、mysql2、better-sqlite3などのライブラリを介してPostgreSQL、MySQL、SQLiteをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 SQL과 같은 구문을 사용하여 데이터베이스와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하며, 에지 런타임 및 서버리스 환경을 최적화하고 pg, mysql2 및 better-sqlite3와 같은 라이브러리를 통해 PostgreSQL, MySQL 및 SQLite를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con bases de datos utilizando una sintaxis similar a SQL, optimizada para entornos de tiempo de ejecución de edge y servidores sin servidor, y que admite PostgreSQL, MySQL y SQLite a través de bibliotecas como pg, mysql2 y better-sqlite3.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec des bases de données en utilisant une syntaxe similaire à SQL, optimisée pour les environnements de runtime de edge et les environnements serveurless, et prend en charge PostgreSQL, MySQL et SQLite via des bibliothèques comme pg, mysql2 et better-sqlite3.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, mit Datenbanken über eine SQL-ähnliche Syntax zu interagieren, die für Edge-Laufzeiten und serverlose Umgebungen optimiert ist und PostgreSQL, MySQL und SQLite über Bibliotheken wie pg, mysql2 und better-sqlite3 unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagir com bancos de dados usando sintaxe semelhante ao SQL, otimizada para ambientes de tempo de execução de borda e sem servidor, com suporte a PostgreSQL, MySQL e SQLite por meio de bibliotecas como pg, mysql2 e better-sqlite3.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью взаимодействовать с базами данных с помощью синтаксиса, похожего на SQL, оптимизированного для краевых сред выполнения и бессерверных сред, поддерживающих PostgreSQL, MySQL и SQLite через библиотеки như pg, mysql2 и better-sqlite3.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التفاعل مع قواعد البيانات باستخدام بناء جملة يشبه SQL، يتم تحسينه لبيئات وقت التشغيل الحرج وبيئات بدون خادم، مع دعم PostgreSQL و MySQL و SQLite من خلال مكتبات مثل pg و mysql2 و better-sqlite3."},"useCases":{"en":["Building serverless database applications","Migrating database schemas with Drizzle Kit","Optimizing database queries for edge runtimes"],"zh":["构建无服务器数据库应用程序","使用Drizzle Kit迁移数据库模式","针对边缘运行时优化数据库查询"],"ja":["サーバーレスデータベースアプリケーションの構築","Drizzle Kitを使用したデータベーススキーマの移行","エッジランタイム向けのデータベースクエリの最適化"],"ko":["서버리스 데이터베이스 애플리케이션 빌드","Drizzle Kit를 사용한 데이터베이스 스키마 마이그레이션","에지 런타임을 위한 데이터베이스 쿼리 최적화"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones de base de datos sin servidor","Migrar esquemas de base de datos con Drizzle Kit","Optimizar consultas de base de datos para tiempos de ejecución de edge"],"fr":["Construire des applications de base de données sans serveur","Migrer des schémas de base de données avec Drizzle Kit","Optimiser les requêtes de base de données pour les temps d''exécution de edge"],"de":["Serverlose Datenbankanwendungen erstellen","Datenbankschemata mit Drizzle Kit migrieren","Datenbankabfragen für Edge-Laufzeiten optimieren"],"pt":["Construir aplicações de banco de dados sem servidor","Migrar esquemas de banco de dados com Drizzle Kit","Otimizar consultas de banco de dados para tempos de execução de borda"],"ru":["Построение бессерверных приложений базы данных","Миграция схем базы данных с помощью Drizzle Kit","Оптимизация запросов базы данных для краевых сред выполнения"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات قواعد البيانات بدون خادم","نقل مخططات قواعد البيانات مع Drizzle Kit","تحسين استفسارات قواعد البيانات لأوقات التشغيل الحرج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation","Limited to supported databases (PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite)"],"zh":["需要npm安装","仅限支持的数据库（PostgreSQL、MySQL、SQLite）"],"ja":["npmのインストールが必要","サポート対象のデータベース（PostgreSQL、MySQL、SQLite）に限定される"],"ko":["npm 설치가 필요함","지원되는 데이터베이스(PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite)로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación de npm","Limitado a bases de datos admitidas (PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm","Limité aux bases de données prises en charge (PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite)"],"de":["Benötigt npm-Installation","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Datenbanken (PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite)"],"pt":["Requer instalação do npm","Limitado a bancos de dados com suporte (PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite)"],"ru":["Требует установки npm","Ограничен поддерживаемыми базами данных (PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm","محدود بقواعد البيانات المدعومة (PostgreSQL و MySQL و SQLite)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"61d1f731a9f3e0b764d66a8a1416c8da4c9fa7d30bc796349e3a0ff891d7da1f","qualityScore":34}');
