지 관리","Git 워크플로우 통합","아름다운 인터페이스","확장 가능한 아키텍처"],"es":["Interfaz web autohospedada","Gestión de almacenamiento S3 compatible","Control total sobre tus archivos","Integración con Git","Seguridad y escalabilidad"],"fr":["Interface web autonome","Gestion de stockage S3 compatible","Contrôle total sur vos fichiers","Intégration avec Git","Sécurité et évolutivité"],"de":["Selbstgehostete Web-Oberfläche","Verwaltung von S3-kompatiblen Speicher","Vollständige Kontrolle über Ihre Dateien","Integration mit Git","Sicherheit und Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["Interface web auto-hospedada","Gerenciamento de armazenamento S3-compatível","Otimização de fluxos de trabalho","Integração com Git","Segurança e controle de acesso"],"ru":["Красивый веб-интерфейс","Управление хранилищами S3","Оптимизация рабочих процессов","Интеграция с Git","Безопасность и контроль доступа"],"ar":["واجهة ويب ذاتية الاستضافة","إدارة تخزين S3 المتوافق","تحسين تدفقات العمل","التكامل مع Git","الأمان ومراقبة الوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用S3管理Git工作流","什么是S3管理Git工作流","S3管理Git工作流替代品","S3管理Git工作流与竞争对手的比较","S3管理Git工作流安装指南","S3管理Git工作流设置教程","Git工作流管理工具","S3兼容存储管理解决方案"],"ja":["S3マネージャーGitワークフローの使用方法","S3マネージャーGitワークフローとは","S3マネージャーGitワークフローの代替品","S3マネージャーGitワークフローと競合製品の比較","S3マネージャーGitワークフローのインストールガイド","S3マネージャーGitワークフローの設定チュートリアル","Gitワークフローマネージャー","S3互換ストレージ管理ソリューション"],"ko":["S3 관리 Git 워크플로우 사용 방법","S3 관리 Git 워크플로우란","S3 관리 Git 워크플로우 대체品","S3 관리 Git 워크플로우와 경쟁사 제품 비교","S3 관리 Git 워크플로우 설치 가이드","S3 관리 Git 워크플로우 설정 튜토리얼","Git 워크플로우 관리자","S3 호환 스토리지 관리 솔루션"],"es":["herramientas de AI para almacenamiento","s3manager-git-workflow tutorial","alternativas a s3manager-git-workflow","cómo usar s3manager-git-workflow","instalación de s3manager-git-workflow","guía de configuración de s3manager-git-workflow","s3manager-git-workflow vs otros herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour stockage","tutoriel s3manager-git-workflow","alternatives à s3manager-git-workflow","comment utiliser s3manager-git-workflow","installation de s3manager-git-workflow","guide de configuration de s3manager-git-workflow","s3manager-git-workflow vs autres outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für Speicher","s3manager-git-workflow-Tutorial","Alternativen zu s3manager-git-workflow","wie man s3manager-git-workflow verwendet","Installation von s3manager-git-workflow","Konfigurationsanleitung für s3manager-git-workflow","s3manager-git-workflow vs andere KI-Tools"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","s3manager-git-workflow","armazenamento s3","como usar s3manager-git-workflow","otimização de fluxos de trabalho","alternativas ao s3manager-git-workflow","s3manager-git-workflow vs minio","instalação do s3manager-git-workflow","guia de configuração do s3manager-git-workflow"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","s3manager-git-workflow","хранилища s3","как использовать s3manager-git-workflow","оптимизация рабочих процессов","альтернативы s3manager-git-workflow","s3manager-git-workflow vs minio","установка s3manager-git-workflow","руководство по настройке s3manager-git-workflow"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","s3manager-git-workflow","تخزين s3 المتوافق","كيفية استخدام s3manager-git-workflow","تحسين تدفقات العمل","بديلات s3manager-git-workflow","s3manager-git-workflow vs minio","تثبيت s3manager-git-workflow","دليل إعداد s3manager-git-workflow"]}},"owner":"Rudra370","repo":"s3manager","repoPath":"Rudra370/s3manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.714Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"s3manager-git-workflow","description":"MANDATORY git workflow for S3 Manager project. Triggers when asked to implement features, fix bugs, refactor code, make changes, or write tests. ENFORCES critical rules that must NEVER be violated.","bodyPreview":"# S3 Manager Git Workflow\n\nThis skill contains CRITICAL rules that MUST be followed for any code changes to the S3 Manager project.\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL RULES - NEVER VIOLATE\n\n### Rule 1: ALWAYS Work on `dev` Branch\n```bash\n# Before making ANY code changes, run:\ngit checkout dev\n\n# If dev doesn''t exist:\ngit checkout -b dev\n```\n- **NEVER** commit directly to `main`\n- **NEVER** create branches from `main`\n- **NEVER** merge to `main` — the user handles this manually\n\n### Rule 2: NEVER Commit Without Exp","body":"# S3 Manager Git Workflow\n\nThis skill contains CRITICAL rules that MUST be followed for any code changes to the S3 Manager project.\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL RULES - NEVER VIOLATE\n\n### Rule 1: ALWAYS Work on `dev` Branch\n```bash\n# Before making ANY code changes, run:\ngit checkout dev\n\n# If dev doesn''t exist:\ngit checkout -b dev\n```\n- **NEVER** commit directly to `main`\n- **NEVER** create branches from `main`\n- **NEVER** merge to `main` — the user handles this manually\n\n### Rule 2: NEVER Commit Without Explicit Permission\n- **ALWAYS ask**: \"Should I commit these changes?\"\n- Wait for explicit \"yes\" or \"commit them\" before running `git commit`\n- Do NOT use `git add -f` for gitignored files\n- The user handles commits and pushes\n\n### Rule 3: E2E Test-First Workflow (MANDATORY)\nFor ANY new feature or bug fix:\n\n1. **Write E2E test FIRST** — before touching implementation code\n   - Tests are in `/e2e/test_runner.py`\n   - Add test method to `S3ManagerE2ETests` class\n\n2. **Run test (expect failure)**\n   ```bash\n   cd /root/code/s3manager/e2e && python3 test_runner.py\n   ```\n\n3. **Implement the fix/feature**\n\n4. **Run test again (expect success)**\n   ```bash\n   cd /root/code/s3manager/e2e && python3 test_runner.py\n   ```\n\n5. **Ask permission to commit**\n\n## Workflow Checklist\n\nBefore starting any code change:\n- [ ] `git checkout dev` — on dev branch\n- [ ] Write E2E test first (if feature/fix)\n- [ ] Run test — confirm it fails\n- [ ] Implement change\n- [ ] Run test — confirm it passes\n- [ ] Ask user: \"Should I commit these changes?\"\n\n## Trigger Phrases\n\nThis skill activates when user says things like:\n- \"Fix this bug\"\n- \"Implement feature X\"\n- \"Add Y functionality\"\n- \"Refactor Z\"\n- \"Write a test for...\"\n- \"Update the code to...\"\n- Any request involving code changes\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Check current branch\ngit branch --show-current\n\n# Checkout dev (or create if missing)\ngit checkout dev 2>/dev/null || git checkout -b dev\n\n# Run E2E tests\ncd /root/code/s3manager/e2e && python3 test_runner.py\n\n# Run fast E2E tests (truncate DB, ~10s faster)\nmake test-fast\n```\n\n## Project Context\n\n- **Backend**: FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + PostgreSQL\n- **Frontend**: React + Material-UI + Vite\n- **Tests**: Playwright E2E tests in `/e2e/`\n- **Default S3**: MinIO (no AWS credentials needed for testing)\n- **Working directory**: `/root/code/s3manager`\n\n## Reminder\n\n**STOP and CHECK**: Am I on `dev` branch? Have I asked permission before committing?\n\nIf the user explicitly says \"commit this\" or \"commit these changes\" — then commit. Otherwise, ask first.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:46:34.274Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring strict Git workflow management for S3-compatible storage projects.","zh":"适用于需要严格的 Git 工作流管理的 DevOps 代理，用于 S3 兼容存储项目。","ja":"DevOps エージェントが S3 互換ストレージ プロジェクトの厳格な Git ワークフロー管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"S3 호환 스토리지 프로젝트용 엄격한 Git 워크플로 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de DevOps que requieren una gestión de flujo de trabajo de Git estricta para proyectos de almacenamiento compatible con S3.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une gestion stricte du flux de travail Git pour les projets de stockage compatibles S3.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine strikte Git-Workflow-Verwaltung für S3-kompatible Speicherprojekte erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que exigem gestão rigorosa de fluxo de trabalho do Git para projetos de armazenamento compatíveis com S3.","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих строгого управления рабочим процессом Git для проектов хранилищ, совместимых с S3.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذي يتطلب إدارة مشروع Git صارمة لمشاريع التخزين المتوافقة مع S3."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce critical Git rules, ensuring all code changes are made on the ''dev'' branch and never committed without proper review, utilizing Git protocols and S3-compatible storage interfaces.","zh":"赋予代理人执行关键 Git 规则的能力，确保所有代码更改都在 ''dev'' 分支上进行，并且在没有适当审查的情况下永远不会提交，利用 Git 协议和 S3 兼容存储接口。","ja":"エージェントが重要な Git ルールを適用する力を与え、すべてのコード変更が ''dev'' ブランチで行われ、適切なレビューなしにコミットされることは決してないことを保証する、Git プロトコルと S3 互換ストレージ インターフェイスを利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 중요한 Git 규칙을 적용할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 모든 코드 변경이 ''dev'' 브랜치에서 수행되고 적절한 검토 없이 커밋되는 경우가 절대 없도록 보장하며, Git 프로토콜 및 S3 호환 스토리지 인터페이스를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar reglas de Git críticas, asegurando que todos los cambios de código se realicen en la rama ''dev'' y nunca se confirmen sin una revisión adecuada, utilizando protocolos de Git y interfaces de almacenamiento compatibles con S3.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des règles Git critiques, en garantissant que tous les changements de code sont effectués sur la branche ''dev'' et jamais validés sans une revue appropriée, en utilisant les protocoles Git et les interfaces de stockage compatibles S3.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, kritische Git-Regeln durchzusetzen, um sicherzustellen, dass alle Code-Änderungen auf dem ''dev''-Zweig vorgenommen werden und niemals ohne ordnungsgemäße Überprüfung committet werden, unter Verwendung von Git-Protokollen und S3-kompatiblen Speicher-Schnittstellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes impeçam regras Git críticas, garantindo que todas as alterações de código sejam feitas na branch ''dev'' e nunca sejam comprometidas sem revisão apropriada, utilizando protocolos Git e interfaces de armazenamento compatíveis com S3.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение критических правил Git, гарантируя, что все изменения кода производятся в ветке ''dev'' и никогда не коммитятся без надлежащего рассмотрения, используя протоколы Git и интерфейсы хранилищ, совместимых с S3.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء pouvoir فرض القواعد الحيوية لجيت، ويضمن أن يتم إجراء جميع التعديلات على الشفرة على فرع ''dev'' وألا يتم الالتزام بها أبدا بدون مراجعة مناسبة، باستخدام بروتوكولات جيت وواجهات تخزين متوافقة مع S3."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing Git workflow rules for S3 Manager projects","Automating branch management for dev and main branches","Validating commit history for S3-compatible storage projects"],"zh":["执行 S3 Manager 项目的 Git 工作流规则","自动化 ''dev'' 和 ''main'' 分支的管理","验证 S3 兼容存储项目的提交历史"],"ja":["S3 マネージャー プロジェクトの Git ワークフロー ルールの適用","dev ブランチと main ブランチの自動化された管理","S3 互換ストレージ プロジェクトのコミット履歴の検証"],"ko":["S3 매니저 프로젝트의 Git 워크플로 규칙 적용","dev 및 main 브랜치의 자동화된 관리","S3 호환 스토리지 프로젝트의 커밋 기록 검증"],"es":["Aplicar reglas de flujo de trabajo de Git para proyectos de S3 Manager","Automatizar la gestión de ramas para las ramas ''dev'' y ''main''","Validar el historial de confirmaciones para proyectos de almacenamiento compatible con S3"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des règles de flux de travail Git pour les projets de S3 Manager","Automatiser la gestion des branches pour les branches ''dev'' et ''main''","Valider l''historique des validations pour les projets de stockage compatibles S3"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Git-Workflow-Regeln für S3-Manager-Projekte","Automatisieren der Verwaltung von Zweigen für ''dev''- und ''main''-Zweige","Validieren des Commit-Verlaufs für S3-kompatible Speicherprojekte"],"pt":["Aplicação de regras de fluxo de trabalho do Git para projetos do Gerenciador S3","Automatização da gestão de branch para branches dev e main","Validação do histórico de compromissos para projetos de armazenamento compatíveis com S3"],"ru":["Применение правил рабочего процесса Git для проектов менеджера S3","Автоматизация управления ветками для веток dev и main","Проверка истории коммитов для проектов хранилищ, совместимых с S3"],"ar":["تطبيق قواعد سير عمل جيت لمشاريع مدير S3","أتمتة إدارة الفرع لفرعي dev و main","التحقق من سجل الالتزام لمشاريع التخزين المتوافقة مع S3"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git version control system","Limited to S3-compatible storage projects","Manual merge to ''main'' branch required"],"zh":["需要 Git 版本控制系统","仅限 S3 兼容存储项目","需要手动合并到 ''main'' 分支"],"ja":["Git バージョン管理システムが必要","S3 互換ストレージ プロジェクトのみ","''main'' ブランチへの手動マージが必要"],"ko":["Git 버전 관리 시스템 필요","S3 호환 스토리지 프로젝트만 해당","''main'' 브랜치로의 수동 병합 필요"],"es":["Requiere sistema de control de versiones Git","Limitado a proyectos de almacenamiento compatible con S3","Se requiere fusión manual en la rama ''main''"],"fr":["Nécessite un système de contrôle de version Git","Limité aux projets de stockage compatibles S3","Fusion manuelle dans la branche ''main'' requise"],"de":["Benötigt Git-versionskontrollsystem","Begrenzt auf S3-kompatible Speicherprojekte","Manuelle Zusammenführung in den ''main''-Zweig erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige sistema de controle de versão Git","Limitado a projetos de armazenamento compatíveis com S3","Mesclagem manual para branch ''main'' necessária"],"ru":["Требует системы контроля версий Git","Ограничен проектами хранилищ, совместимых с S3","Требуется ручной мердж в ветку ''main''"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام التحكم في الإصدار جيت","محدود بمشاريع التخزين المتوافقة مع S3","مطلوب دمج يدوي إلى فرع ''main''"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0d06e5a603fc392ffe2c1faf032f51afcc6d29d324da1d727b36b9e74b89f1d8","qualityScore":34}');
