et","Überprüfung vor Abschluss","Threadbilt v0","PierceDesk Application","Alternativen zu KI-Agents","Installationsanleitungen für KI-Agents","Konfiguration von KI-Agents"],"pt":["como usar verificação antes de conclusão","o que é verificação antes de conclusão","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","alternativas para PierceDesk","PierceDesk vs Threadbilt","instalar Threadbilt v0","guia de setup para PierceDesk","melhorias de produtividade para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать верификацию перед завершением","что такое верификация перед завершением","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","альтернативы для PierceDesk","PierceDesk vs Threadbilt","установить Threadbilt v0","руководство по настройке для PierceDesk","улучшение производительности для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام التحقق قبل الإكمال","ما هو التحقق قبل الإكمال","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديل لبرنامج PierceDesk","PierceDesk مقابل Threadbilt","تثبيت Threadbilt v0","دليل الإعداد لبرنامج PierceDesk","تحسين الإنتاجية للمطورين"]}},"owner":"RockwallJMC","repo":"Threadbilt-v0","repoPath":"RockwallJMC/Threadbilt-v0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.720Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"verification-before-completion","description":"Use when about to claim work is complete, fixed, or passing, before committing changes - requires running verification commands and confirming output before making any success claims; evidence before assertions always","bodyPreview":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n**DONT run npx playwright in the background, run in terminal for visibility**\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it pa","body":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n**DONT run npx playwright in the background, run in terminal for visibility**\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing satisfaction:\n\n1. IDENTIFY: What command proves this claim?\n2. RUN: Execute the FULL command (fresh, complete)\n3. READ: Full output, check exit code, count failures\n4. VERIFY: Does output confirm the claim?\n   - If NO: State actual status with evidence\n   - If YES: State claim WITH evidence\n5. ONLY THEN: Make the claim\n\nSkip any step = lying, not verifying\n```\n\n## Common Failures\n\n| Claim                 | Requires                        | Not Sufficient                 |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| Tests pass            | Test command output: 0 failures | Previous run, \"should pass\"    |\n| Linter clean          | Linter output: 0 errors         | Partial check, extrapolation   |\n| Build succeeds        | Build command: exit 0           | Linter passing, logs look good |\n| Bug fixed             | Test original symptom: passes   | Code changed, assumed fixed    |\n| Regression test works | Red-green cycle verified        | Test passes once               |\n| Agent completed       | VCS diff shows changes          | Agent reports \"success\"        |\n| Requirements met      | Line-by-line checklist          | Tests passing                  |\n\n## Red Flags - STOP\n\n- Using \"should\", \"probably\", \"seems to\"\n- Expressing satisfaction before verification (\"Great!\", \"Perfect!\", \"Done!\", etc.)\n- About to commit/push/PR without verification\n- Trusting agent success reports\n- Relying on partial verification\n- Thinking \"just this once\"\n- Tired and wanting work over\n- **ANY wording implying success without having run verification**\n\n## Rationalization Prevention\n\n| Excuse                                  | Reality                |\n| --------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| \"Should work now\"                       | RUN the verification   |\n| \"I''m confident\"                         | Confidence ≠ evidence  |\n| \"Just this once\"                        | No exceptions          |\n| \"Linter passed\"                         | Linter ≠ compiler      |\n| \"Agent said success\"                    | Verify independently   |\n| \"I''m tired\"                             | Exhaustion ≠ excuse    |\n| \"Partial check is enough\"               | Partial proves nothing |\n| \"Different words so rule doesn''t apply\" | Spirit over letter     |\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n**Tests:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run test command] [See: 34/34 pass] \"All tests pass\"\n❌ \"Should pass now\" / \"Looks correct\"\n```\n\n**Regression tests (TDD Red-Green):**\n\n```\n✅ Write → Run (pass) → Revert fix → Run (MUST FAIL) → Restore → Run (pass)\n❌ \"I''ve written a regression test\" (without red-green verification)\n```\n\n**Build:**\n\n```\n✅ [Run build] [See: exit 0] \"Build passes\"\n❌ \"Linter passed\" (linter doesn''t check compilation)\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n```\n✅ Re-read plan → Create checklist → Verify each → Report gaps or completion\n❌ \"Tests pass, phase complete\"\n```\n\n**Agent delegation:**\n\n```\n✅ Agent reports success → Check VCS diff → Verify changes → Report actual state\n❌ Trust agent report\n```\n\n## Why This Matters\n\nFrom 24 failure memories:\n\n- your human partner said \"I don''t believe you\" - trust broken\n- Undefined functions shipped - would crash\n- Missing requirements shipped - incomplete features\n- Time wasted on false completion → redirect → rework\n- Violates: \"Honesty is a core value. If you lie, you''ll be replaced.\"\n\n## When To Apply\n\n**ALWAYS before:**\n\n- ANY variation of success/completion claims\n- ANY expression of satisfaction\n- ANY positive statement about work state\n- Committing, task completion\n- Moving to next task\n- Delegating to agents\n\n**Rule applies to:**\n\n- Exact phrases\n- Paraphrases and synonyms\n- Implications of success\n- ANY communication suggesting completion/correctness\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**No shortcuts for verification.**\n\nRun the command. Read the output. THEN claim the result.\n\nThis is non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:51:33.331Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents requiring rigorous testing and validation protocols, such as those utilizing npx playwright for end-to-end testing.","zh":"非常适合需要严格测试和验证协议的开发代理，例如使用npx playwright进行端到端测试的代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが厳格なテストと検証プロトコルを必要とする場合に最適です。たとえば、npx playwrightを使用したエンドツーエンドテストを行う場合など。","ko":"严格한 테스트와 검증 프로토콜이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어, npx playwright를 사용한 종단 간 테스트를 수행하는 경우 등에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que requieren protocolos de prueba y validación rigurosos, como aquellos que utilizan npx playwright para pruebas de extremo a extremo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant des protocoles de test et de validation rigoureux, tels que ceux utilisant npx playwright pour les tests de bout en bout.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsagenten, die strenge Test- und Validierungsprotokolle erfordern, wie z.B. solche, die npx playwright für End-to-End-Tests verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem protocolos rigorosos de teste e validação, como aqueles que utilizam npx playwright para testes de ponta a ponta.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих строгих протоколов тестирования и проверки, таких как те, которые используют npx playwright для тестирования от начала до конца.","ar":"مثالي لوكيلاء التطوير الذين يتطلبون بروتوكولات اختبار وتحقق صارمة، مثل تلك التي تستخدم npx playwright لاختبار من النهاية إلى النهاية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a strict verification-before-completion protocol, ensuring claims of completion are always backed by fresh evidence, leveraging terminal-run commands for visibility and adherence to the Iron Law of verification.","zh":"赋予代理人执行严格的验证前完成协议的能力，确保完成的声明始终由最新的证据支持，利用终端运行命令以提高可见性和遵守验证铁律。","ja":"エージェントが完了前の厳格な検証プロトコルを実施する能力を提供し、完了の主張が常に最新の証拠によって裏付けられることを保証する。ターミナル実行コマンドを使用して可視性と検証鉄則への遵守を確保する。","ko":"에이전트가 완료 이전에 엄격한 검증 프로토콜을 시행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 완료 주장이 항상 최신 증거에 의해 뒷받침되도록 보장한다. 터미널에서 실행하는 명령어를 사용하여 가시성과 검증 철칙의 준수를 보장한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar un protocolo de verificación estricto antes de la finalización, asegurando que las reclamaciones de finalización estén siempre respaldadas por pruebas frescas, utilizando comandos de ejecución en terminal para visibilidad y adherencia a la Ley de Hierro de verificación.","fr":"Habilite les agents à appliquer un protocole de vérification strict avant l''achèvement, en garantissant que les allégations d''achèvement sont toujours étayées par des preuves fraîches, en utilisant des commandes d''exécution de terminal pour la visibilité et le respect de la Loi de Fer de vérification.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ein strenges Verifizierungsprotokoll vor der Fertigstellung durchzusetzen, sicherzustellen, dass Fertigstellungsansprüche immer durch frische Beweise gestützt werden, indem Terminal-Befehle für Sichtbarkeit und Einhaltung des Eisernen Gesetzes der Überprüfung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor um protocolo estrito de verificação-antes-de-conclusão, garantindo que as alegações de conclusão sejam sempre respaldadas por evidências frescas, utilizando comandos de terminal para visibilidade e aderência à Lei de Ferro da verificação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить строгий протокол проверки до завершения, гарантируя, что заявления об завершении всегда подтверждаются свежими доказательствами, используя команды терминала для видимости и соблюдения Железного Закона проверки.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من فرض بروتوكول صارم للتحقق قبل الإكمال، مما يضمن أن تدعم ادعاءات الإكمال دائمًا بالدليل الطازج، باستخدام أوامر الطرفية للرؤية والامتثال لقانون الحديد للتحقق."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating completion claims with fresh verification evidence","Automating end-to-end testing with npx playwright","Enforcing the Iron Law in development workflows"],"zh":["使用最新的验证证据验证完成声明","使用npx playwright自动化端到端测试","在开发工作流中强制执行验证铁律"],"ja":["最新の検証証拠を使用して完了の主張を検証する","npx playwrightを使用してエンドツーエンドテストを自動化する","開発ワークフローで検証鉄則を強制する"],"ko":["최신 검증 증거를 사용하여 완료 주장을 검증하는 것","npx playwright를 사용하여 종단 간 테스트를 자동화하는 것","개발 워크플ロー에서 검증 철칙을 강제하는 것"],"es":["Validar reclamaciones de finalización con pruebas de verificación frescas","Automatizar pruebas de extremo a extremo con npx playwright","Aplicar la Ley de Hierro en flujos de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Valider les allégations d''achèvement avec des preuves de vérification fraîches","Automatiser les tests de bout en bout avec npx playwright","Appliquer la Loi de Fer dans les flux de travail de développement"],"de":["Fertigstellungsansprüche mit frischen Verifizierungsnachweisen validieren","End-to-End-Tests mit npx playwright automatisieren","Das Eiserne Gesetz in Entwicklungsworkflows durchsetzen"],"pt":["Validar alegações de conclusão com evidências de verificação frescas","Automatizar testes de ponta a ponta com npx playwright","Impor a Lei de Ferro em fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Проверка заявлений об завершении с помощью свежих доказательств проверки","Автоматизация тестирования от начала до конца с помощью npx playwright","Обеспечение соблюдения Железного Закона в рабочих процессах разработки"],"ar":["التحقق من ادعاءات الإكمال مع أدلة تحقق طازجة","آليّة اختبار من النهاية إلى النهاية باستخدام npx playwright","فرض قانون الحديد في سير عمل التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the Iron Law","Must run verification commands in terminal for visibility","Violations of the protocol are considered violations of its spirit"],"zh":["需要遵守验证铁律","必须在终端中运行验证命令以提高可见性","违反协议被视为违反其精神"],"ja":["検証鉄則への遵守が必要","可視性のためにターミナルで検証コマンドを実行する必要がある","プロトコルの違反はその精神の違反と見なされる"],"ko":["검증 철칙을 준수해야 함","가시성을 위해 터미널에서 검증 명령어를 실행해야 함","프로토콜違反은 그 정신을 위반한 것으로 간주됨"],"es":["Requiere adherencia a la Ley de Hierro","Debe ejecutar comandos de verificación en terminal para visibilidad","Violaciones del protocolo se consideran violaciones de su espíritu"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à la Loi de Fer","Doit exécuter des commandes de vérification dans le terminal pour la visibilité","Les violations du protocole sont considérées comme des violations de son esprit"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des Eisernen Gesetzes","Muss Überprüfungsbefehle im Terminal ausführen, um Sichtbarkeit zu gewährleisten","Verstöße gegen das Protokoll gelten als Verstöße gegen seinen Geist"],"pt":["Exige aderência à Lei de Ferro","Deve executar comandos de verificação no terminal para visibilidade","Violações do protocolo são consideradas violações do seu espírito"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения Железного Закона","Должно запускать команды проверки в терминале для видимости","Нарушения протокола считаются нарушениями его духа"],"ar":["يتطلب الامتثال لقانون الحديد","يجب تشغيل أوامر التحقق في الطرفية للرؤية","يعتبر انتهاكات البروتوكول انتهاكات لروحه"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7a65cc77597a6796efe4538ba53e1c28231d180e95187b2726c0f08e8aec2d5e","qualityScore":34}');
