wicklungsumgebungen","Detaillierte Berichte über die Code-Erosion"],"pt":["Medição de erosão de código","Refinamento iterativo de especificações","Detecção de erros em código","Análise de código com IA","Otimização de desempenho de código"],"ru":["Измерение эрозии кода","Итеративное уточнение спецификаций","Обнаружение ошибок в коде","Анализ кода с помощью ИИ","Оптимизация производительности кода"],"ar":["قياس تآكل الكود","التنقية المتكررة للمواصفات","اكتشاف الأخطاء في الكود","تحليل الكود باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين أداء الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Checkpoint Ambiguity Review","什么是SlopCodeBench","AI工具Checkpoint Ambiguity Review","Checkpoint Ambiguity Review替代品","SlopCodeBench安装","代码腐蚀测量工具","AI驱动的代码优化","Checkpoint Ambiguity Review教程"],"ja":["Checkpoint Ambiguity Reviewの使い方","SlopCodeBenchとは","AIエージェントCheckpoint Ambiguity Review","Checkpoint Ambiguity Reviewの代替","SlopCodeBenchのインストール","コードの腐敗測定ツール","AI駆動のコード最適化","Checkpoint Ambiguity Reviewのチュートリアル"],"ko":["체크포인트 애매성 검토 사용법","SlopCodeBench란","AI 에이전트 체크포인트 애매성 검토","체크포인트 애매성 검토 대체","SlopCodeBench 설치","코드 부패 측정 도구","AI 기반 코드 최적화","체크포인트 애매성 검토 튜토리얼"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de IA","qué es la revisión de ambigüedad de puntos de control","SlopCodeBench alternativa","SlopCodeBench vs otros herramientas de código","instalación de SlopCodeBench","guía de configuración de SlopCodeBench","herramientas de IA para desarrollo","análisis de código con herramientas de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''IA","qu''est-ce que la revue de l''ambiguïté des points de contrôle","SlopCodeBench alternative","SlopCodeBench vs autres outils de code","installation de SlopCodeBench","guide de configuration de SlopCodeBench","outils d''IA pour le développement","analyse de code avec des outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist die Überprüfung von Checkpoint-Mehrdeutigkeit","SlopCodeBench-Alternative","SlopCodeBench vs andere Code-Tools","Installation von SlopCodeBench","Konfigurationsanleitung für SlopCodeBench","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","Code-Analyse mit KI-Tools"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","revisão de ambiguidade de checkpoint","medir erosão de código","refinamento iterativo de especificações","detecção de erros em código","SlopCodeBench","como usar SlopCodeBench","o que é revisão de ambiguidade de checkpoint"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ","проверка неоднозначности checkpoint","измерить эрозию кода","итеративное уточнение спецификаций","обнаружение ошибок в коде","SlopCodeBench","как использовать SlopCodeBench","что такое проверка неоднозначности checkpoint"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مراجعة الغموض في نقطة التأكيد","قياس تآكل الكود","التنقية المتكررة للمواصفات","اكتشاف الأخطاء في الكود","SlopCodeBench","كيفية استخدام SlopCodeBench","ما هي مراجعة الغموض في نقطة التأكيد"]}},"owner":"SprocketLab","repo":"slop-code-bench","repoPath":"SprocketLab/slop-code-bench","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.741Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"checkpoint-ambiguity-review","description":"Review checkpoint specs and tests to identify tests that encode ambiguous interpretations rather than explicit requirements. Use when asked to check checkpoint_N.md against test_checkpoint_N.py, when auditing tests for ambiguity, or when reviewing snapshot eval failures for interpretive issues.","bodyPreview":"# Checkpoint Ambiguity Review\n\n## Overview\n\nReview a checkpoint''s spec and tests to find tests that enforce a reasonable but\nnon-explicit interpretation, and report those cases with rationale and fixes.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Collect inputs\n\n- Problem name and checkpoint number (N).\n- Test file path(s) and checkpoint spec path (if not provided, infer):\n  - Spec: `problems/{problem}/checkpoint_{N}.md`\n  - Tests: `problems/{problem}/tests/test_checkpoint_{N}.py`\n  - Also scan `problems/{problem}/tes","body":"# Checkpoint Ambiguity Review\n\n## Overview\n\nReview a checkpoint''s spec and tests to find tests that enforce a reasonable but\nnon-explicit interpretation, and report those cases with rationale and fixes.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Collect inputs\n\n- Problem name and checkpoint number (N).\n- Test file path(s) and checkpoint spec path (if not provided, infer):\n  - Spec: `problems/{problem}/checkpoint_{N}.md`\n  - Tests: `problems/{problem}/tests/test_checkpoint_{N}.py`\n  - Also scan `problems/{problem}/tests/conftest.py` and\n    `problems/{problem}/tests/data/` if they influence expectations.\n- Optional: snapshot path for ambiguity verification.\n\n### 2) Read the spec and tests\n\n- Extract explicit requirements from the spec.\n- Map each test assertion to a specific spec clause or an implied behavior.\n- Note any test assumptions that are not spelled out in the spec.\n\n### 3) Flag ambiguous interpretations\n\nOnly report tests that enforce an interpretation that could reasonably differ\ngiven the spec wording. Do not report tests that are simply incorrect against\nexplicit requirements.\n\nCommon ambiguity cues:\n- Output ordering when the spec does not mandate order.\n- Tie-breaking rules that are unstated.\n- Whitespace, casing, or formatting details not defined by the spec.\n- Rounding or precision requirements not defined.\n- Error handling for invalid inputs when not specified.\n- Boundary behavior (inclusive/exclusive) not stated.\n- Default values or optional fields not defined.\n- Determinism or randomness expectations not specified.\n- Multiple reasonable data structure representations (list vs set, map order).\n\n### 4) Optional snapshot verification\n\nIf a snapshot is provided, run:\n\n```bash\nslop-code --quiet eval-snapshot {snapshot} -p {problem} -o /tmp/eval -c {N} -e configs/environments/docker-python3.12-uv.yaml --json\n```\n\nUse failures to corroborate ambiguity, not to invent it. A failing test is\nambiguous only if the spec supports multiple reasonable interpretations.\n\n### 5) Report format\n\nUse the following structure for each ambiguous test:\n\n```\n## {test name} ({path}::{node_id})\n\n**Why:** {spec language + alternate interpretation that could be valid}\n**Fix:** {proposed test relaxation or spec clarification}\n```\n\nKeep entries concise and actionable. If no ambiguity is found, state that\nclearly (e.g., \"No ambiguity issues found.\").\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:06:12.008Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced specification refinement and ambiguity detection capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级规范细化和模糊性检测能力的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード分析エージェントが高度な仕様の洗練と曖昧さの検出機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"코드 분석 에이전트가 고급 사양 정제 및 모호성 감지 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan una refinación de especificaciones avanzada y capacidades de detección de ambigüedad.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant une raffinement de spécifications avancé et des capacités de détection d''ambiguïté.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine erweiterte Spezifikationsfeinabstimmung und Ambiguitätserkennungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de refino de especificação avançado e capacidades de detecção de ambiguidade.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Кодов, которым требуются продвинутые уточнения спецификаций и возможности обнаружения неоднозначностей.","ar":" مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى تحسين مواصفات متقدم واكتشاف الغموض."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review checkpoint specifications and tests, identifying and reporting cases of non-explicit interpretation and providing fixes. It leverages code analysis libraries like SlopeCodeBench to measure code erosion under iterative specification refinement.","zh":"赋予代理查看检查点规范和测试的能力，识别和报告非明确解释的案例，并提供修复。它利用代码分析库，如SlopeCodeBench，来衡量代码在迭代规范细化下的侵蚀。","ja":"チェックポイントの仕様とテストを確認するエージェントを可能にし、非明確な解釈のケースを特定して報告し、修復を提供します。コード分析ライブラリのSlopeCodeBenchを利用して、コードの侵食を繰り返し仕様の洗練の下で測定します。","ko":"체크포인트 사양 및 테스트를 검토할 수 있는 에이전트를 활성화하여 명시적이지 않은 해석의 경우를 식별하고 보고하고 수정을 제공합니다. 코드 분석 라이브러리인 SlopeCodeBench를 활용하여 반복적인 사양 정제 하에서 코드의 침식 度를 측정합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes revisar las especificaciones y pruebas de los puntos de control, identificar y informar sobre casos de interpretación no explícita y proporcionar soluciones. Se aprovecha bibliotecas de análisis de código como SlopeCodeBench para medir la erosión del código bajo la refinación iterativa de especificaciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de revoir les spécifications et les tests de points de contrôle, d''identifier et de signaler les cas d''interprétation non explicite et de fournir des correctifs. Il tire parti de bibliothèques d''analyse de code comme SlopeCodeBench pour mesurer l''érosion du code sous la révision itérative des spécifications.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Checkpoint-Spezifikationen und -Tests zu überprüfen, Fälle nicht expliziter Interpretation zu identifizieren und zu melden sowie Korrekturen bereitzustellen. Es nutzt Code-Analyse-Bibliotheken wie SlopeCodeBench, um die Code-Erosion unter iterativer Spezifikationsfeinabstimmung zu messen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisar especificações de pontos de verificação e testes, identificando e relatando casos de interpretação não explícita e fornecendo soluções. Ele aproveita bibliotecas de análise de código, como SlopeCodeBench, para medir a erosão do código sob o refino iterativo da especificação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью просматривать спецификации контрольных точек и тестов, выявлять и сообщать о случаях неявной интерпретации, а также предоставлять исправления. Он использует библиотеки анализа кода, такие как SlopeCodeBench, для измерения эрозии кода при итеративном уточнении спецификации.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من مراجعة مواصفات نقاط التحقق والاختبارات، وتحديد الحالات التي يُستخدم فيها التفسير غير الصريح وتقديم تقارير وتقديم إصلاحات. إنه يستفيد من مكتبات تحليل الشفرة مثل SlopeCodeBench لقياس تآكل الشفرة تحت تحسين المواصفات المتكرر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ambiguity detection in code specifications","Generating reports of non-explicit interpretations and providing fixes","Debugging code erosion issues under iterative specification refinement"],"zh":["自动检测代码规范中的模糊性","生成非明确解释的报告并提供修复","调试迭代规范细化下的代码侵蚀问题"],"ja":["コード仕様の曖昧さの自動検出","非明確な解釈の報告と修復の提供","反復的な仕様の洗練の下でのコードの侵食の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["코드 사양의 모호성 자동 감지","명시적이지 않은 해석의 보고서 생성 및 수정 제공","반복적인 사양 정제 하에서 코드 침식 문제의 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la detección de ambigüedad en las especificaciones de código","Generar informes de interpretaciones no explícitas y proporcionar soluciones","Depurar problemas de erosión de código bajo la refinación iterativa de especificaciones"],"fr":["Automatiser la détection d''ambiguïté dans les spécifications de code","Générer des rapports d''interprétations non explicites et fournir des correctifs","Déboguer les problèmes d''érosion de code sous la révision itérative des spécifications"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erkennung von Ambiguität in Code-Spezifikationen","Erstellen von Berichten über nicht explizite Interpretationen und Bereitstellen von Korrekturen","Beheben von Code-Erosionsproblemen unter iterativer Spezifikationsfeinabstimmung"],"pt":["Automatizar a detecção de ambiguidade em especificações de código","Gerar relatórios de interpretações não explícitas e fornecer soluções","Depurar problemas de erosão de código sob o refino iterativo da especificação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обнаружение неоднозначностей в спецификациях кода","Генерировать отчеты о неявных интерпретациях и предоставлять исправления","Отлаживать проблемы эрозии кода при итеративном уточнении спецификации"],"ar":["تأتمتة اكتشاف الغموض في مواصفات الشفرة","генерировать تقارير عن التفسيرات غير الصريحة وتقديم إصلاحات","تصحيح أخطاء تآكل الشفرة تحت تحسين المواصفات المتكرر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to problem and test file paths","Limited to Python-based code analysis"],"zh":["需要访问问题和测试文件路径","仅限于基于Python的代码分析"],"ja":["問題およびテストファイルのパスへのアクセスが必要","Pythonベースのコード分析に限定される"],"ko":["문제 및 테스트 파일 경로에 대한 액세스가 필요","Python 기반의 코드 분석에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los caminos de archivos de problemas y pruebas","Limitado a análisis de código basado en Python"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux chemins de fichiers de problèmes et de tests","Limité à l''analyse de code basée sur Python"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Problem- und Testdateipfade","Begrenzt auf Python-basierte Code-Analyse"],"pt":["Requer acesso a caminhos de arquivos de problemas e testes","Limitado à análise de código baseada em Python"],"ru":["Требует доступа к путям файлов задач и тестов","Ограничен анализом кода на основе Python"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مسارات ملفات المشاكل والاختبارات","محدود بتحليل الشفرة المبني على Python"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9fe11cc04eba1fa7dac9842ba3d40b74cc3986fe396c90aabb89a6f9b416dcf2","qualityScore":34}');
