","Utilisation de GPT3 pour améliorer l''efficacité des tests","Intégration avec Go pour les développeurs","Tests automatisés pour les modèles de langage","Analyse des résultats pour améliorer la précision des modèles"],"de":["Implementierung von Rauchtests für Sprachmodelle","Verwendung von GPT3 zur Verbesserung der Effizienz der Tests","Integration mit Go für Entwickler","Automatisierte Tests für Sprachmodelle","Analyse der Ergebnisse zur Verbesserung der Genauigkeit der Modelle"],"pt":["Testes de inferência em Golang","Integração com GPT3","Melhoria da eficiência do desenvolvimento","Ferramenta de linha de comando","Suporte a desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Тестирование вывода на Golang","Интеграция с GPT3","Повышение эффективности разработки","Инструмент командной строки","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["اختبارات الاستدلال في الجولانج","التكامل مع جبت3","تحسين كفاءة التطوير","أداة سطر الأوامر","دعم المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用inference-smoke-tests","什么是inference-smoke-tests","inference-smoke-tests替代品","inference-smoke-tests安装","inference-smoke-tests设置指南","golang GPT3工具","AI模型测试","AI模型优化"],"ja":["inference-smoke-testsの使い方","inference-smoke-testsとは","inference-smoke-testsの代替","inference-smoke-testsのインストール","inference-smoke-testsの設定ガイド","golang GPT3ツール","AIモデルをテストする","AIモデルを最適化する"],"ko":["inference-smoke-tests 사용법","inference-smoke-tests란","inference-smoke-tests 대체품","inference-smoke-tests 설치","inference-smoke-tests 설정 가이드","golang GPT3 툴","AI 모델 테스트","AI 모델 최적화"],"es":["herramientas de inferencia para pruebas de humo","GPT3 en Go","desarrollo de modelos de lenguaje","pruebas automatizadas para modelos de lenguaje","cómo utilizar GPT3 en Go","herramientas de desarrollo para modelos de lenguaje","alternativas a GPT3","GPT3 vs otros modelos de lenguaje","instalación de GPT3 en Go","guía de configuración de GPT3 en Go"],"fr":["outils d''inférence pour tests de fumée","GPT3 en Go","développement de modèles de langage","tests automatisés pour les modèles de langage","comment utiliser GPT3 en Go","outils de développement pour les modèles de langage","alternatives à GPT3","GPT3 vs autres modèles de langage","installation de GPT3 en Go","guide de configuration de GPT3 en Go"],"de":["Inferenz-Tools für Rauchtests","GPT3 in Go","Entwicklung von Sprachmodellen","automatisierte Tests für Sprachmodelle","wie man GPT3 in Go verwendet","Entwicklungstools für Sprachmodelle","Alternativen zu GPT3","GPT3 vs andere Sprachmodelle","Installation von GPT3 in Go","Konfigurationsanleitung für GPT3 in Go"],"pt":["inference-smoke-tests","Golang","GPT3","testes de inferência","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","como usar inference-smoke-tests","inference-smoke-tests vs outros testes"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","inference-smoke-tests","Golang","GPT3","тестирование вывода","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","как использовать inference-smoke-tests","inference-smoke-tests против других тестов"],"ar":["وحدات الاستدلال","inference-smoke-tests","الجولانج","جبت3","اختبارات الاستدلال","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","كيفية استخدام inference-smoke-tests","inference-smoke-tests مقابل اختبارات أخرى"]}},"owner":"go-go-golems","repo":"geppetto","repoPath":"go-go-golems/geppetto","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.746Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"inference-smoke-tests","description":"Run repeatable inference smoke tests using geppetto/pinocchio example binaries (single-pass, streaming, tool-loop, OpenAI Responses thinking) including tmux-driven TUI tests. Use when refactors touch InferenceState/Session/EngineBuilder, tool calling loop, event sinks, provider request formatting, or when you need a quick does inference still work? checklist.","bodyPreview":"# Inference Smoke Tests\n\n## Quick Start (Recommended)\n\nRun the fast suite (geppetto non-TUI + pinocchio agent TUI) via the bundled script:\n\n```bash\nbash geppetto/.codex/skills/inference-smoke-tests/scripts/run_smoke.sh --quick\n```\n\nIf you need the full manual checklist, open:\n\n`geppetto/.codex/skills/inference-smoke-tests/references/playbook.md`\n\n## Preconditions\n\n- Ensure `OPENAI_API_KEY` is set (for OpenAI Chat + OpenAI Responses).\n- Ensure Claude credentials are available (e.g. `ANTHROPIC_API","body":"# Inference Smoke Tests\n\n## Quick Start (Recommended)\n\nRun the fast suite (geppetto non-TUI + pinocchio agent TUI) via the bundled script:\n\n```bash\nbash geppetto/.codex/skills/inference-smoke-tests/scripts/run_smoke.sh --quick\n```\n\nIf you need the full manual checklist, open:\n\n`geppetto/.codex/skills/inference-smoke-tests/references/playbook.md`\n\n## Preconditions\n\n- Ensure `OPENAI_API_KEY` is set (for OpenAI Chat + OpenAI Responses).\n- Ensure Claude credentials are available (e.g. `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`) if you want the Claude tool-calling smoke step to pass.\n- Ensure `tmux` is installed (required for non-interactive TUI runs).\n- Expect costs: these tests make real API calls.\n\n## Workflow Decision Tree\n\n1) Validate provider “thinking” streaming (Responses)?\n- Run `geppetto/cmd/examples/openai-tools` in `--mode thinking`.\n\n2) Validate tool loop orchestration?\n- Run `geppetto/cmd/examples/generic-tool-calling`.\n\n3) Validate Bubble Tea TUI event flow (thinking deltas + final)?\n- Run `pinocchio/cmd/agents/simple-chat-agent` in tmux.\n\n4) Validate Claude tool calling?\n- Run `geppetto/cmd/examples/claude-tools` with `--ai-api-type claude --ai-engine claude-haiku-4-5`.\n\n5) Validate multi-turn chat state persistence?\n- Run pinocchio TUI chat in tmux (manual) and/or pinocchio webchat in browser (manual).\n\n## What “Benefits From InferenceState” (Rules of Thumb)\n\nAlready benefits (multi-turn, cancel-sensitive, tool-loop, strict provider validation):\n- pinocchio TUI chat (`pinocchio/cmd/pinocchio … --chat`)\n- pinocchio agent TUI (`pinocchio/cmd/agents/simple-chat-agent …`)\n- pinocchio webchat (`pinocchio/cmd/web-chat`)\n- geppetto example runners that execute via `geppetto/pkg/inference/core.Session`\n\nCould benefit (optional; mainly consistency/cancel):\n- `pinocchio/cmd/examples/simple-redis-streaming-inference` (transport-focused; currently `eng.RunInference` direct)\n- `pinocchio/cmd/examples/simple-chat` (exercises PinocchioCommand runner; could benefit indirectly if that runner standardizes on `InferenceState`)\n\nDoes not apply (not an inference runner):\n- `geppetto/cmd/examples/citations-event-stream`\n\n## Troubleshooting (Common Failure Modes)\n\n### “OpenAI Responses 400” errors\n- Re-run with higher logging:\n  - Add `--log-level debug --with-caller` where supported.\n- Confirm you’re using the correct provider mode:\n  - `--ai-api-type openai-responses`\n- If the error mentions invalid parameter support (e.g., `temperature` unsupported), it’s model-dependent; reduce parameters and retry.\n\n### TUI doesn’t submit the prompt\n- Some TUIs submit on `Tab` (not `Enter`).\n- Always capture logs to a file and confirm inference actually ran (look for `EventPartialCompletionStart`, `EventFinal`).\n\n## References\n\nWhen you need copy/paste commands for the full sweep, read:\n- `geppetto/.codex/skills/inference-smoke-tests/references/playbook.md`\n\nWhen you need to find new example entry points, search:\n\n```bash\nrg -n \"cmd/examples\" -S geppetto/cmd/examples pinocchio/cmd/examples\nrg -n \"cmd/agents\" -S pinocchio/cmd/agents\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:09:50.244Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing comprehensive inference smoke testing capabilities with golang GPT3 tooling","zh":"适用于像 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI Agent，需要使用 golang GPT3 工具进行全面推理烟雾测试的能力","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code などの AI エージェントに適しており、golang GPT3 ツールを使用した包括的な推論煙霧テスト機能が必要","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, golang GPT3 툴을 사용한 포괄적인 추론 스모크 테스트 기능이 필요","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de prueba de inferencia integral con herramientas de golang GPT3","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant des capacités de test d''inférence complète avec les outils golang GPT3","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die umfassende Inferenz-Testfunktionen mit golang GPT3-Tooling benötigen","pt":"Ideal para AI Agents como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades abrangentes de teste de fumaça de inferência com ferramentas golang GPT3","ru":"Идеально подходит для AI Agents, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуются комплексные возможности дымового тестирования вывода с использованием инструментов golang GPT3","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor وWindsurf وClaude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات شاملة لاختبار الدخان للاستدلال باستخدام أدوات golang GPT3"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run fast inference smoke tests via bundled scripts, leveraging OpenAI API and Claude credentials for robust testing, including geppetto non-TUI and pinocchio agent TUI interactions","zh":"通过捆绑的脚本使代理能够快速运行推理烟雾测试，利用 OpenAI API 和 Claude 凭证进行强大的测试，包括 geppetto 非 TUI 和 pinocchio 代理 TUI 交互","ja":"バンドルされたスクリプトを使用してエージェントが推論煙霧テストを迅速に実行できるようにし、OpenAI API と Claude 凭证を使用して geppetto の非 TUI と pinocchio エージェントの TUI インタラクションを含む強力なテストを実行","ko":"번들된 스크립트를 통해 에이전트가 추론 스모크 테스트를 빠르게 실행할 수 있도록 하며, OpenAI API와 Claude 자격 증명을 사용하여 geppetto의 비 TUI 및 pinocchio 에이전트 TUI 상호 작용을 포함한 강력한 테스트를 수행","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar pruebas de inférence rápidas mediante scripts empaquetados, aprovechando la API de OpenAI y las credenciales de Claude para pruebas robustas, incluyendo interacciones de agentes geppetto no-TUI y pinocchio TUI","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests d''inférence rapides via des scripts empaquetés, en exploitant l''API OpenAI et les informations d''identification de Claude pour des tests robustes, y compris les interactions d''agents geppetto non-TUI et pinocchio TUI","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, schnelle Inferenz-Tests über gebündelte Skripte durchzuführen, indem es die OpenAI-API und die Claude-Anmeldeinformationen für robuste Tests nutzt, einschließlich der Interaktionen von geppetto- und pinocchio-Agenten, die nicht TUI und TUI sind","pt":"Capacita os agentes a executar testes de fumaça de inferência rápidos por meio de scripts agrupados, aproveitando a API da OpenAI e as credenciais da Claude para testes robustos, incluindo interações geppetto non-TUI e pinocchio agent TUI","ru":"Позволяет агентам запускать быстрые дымовые тесты вывода с помощью bundled скриптов, используя API OpenAI и учетные данные Claude для надежного тестирования, включая взаимодействия geppetto non-TUI и pinocchio agent TUI","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تشغيل اختبارات دخان استدلال سريعة عبر البرامج النصية المجمعة، والاستفادة من واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI وأوراق اعتماد Claude لإجراء اختبارات قوية، بما في ذلك تفاعلات geppetto غير TUI ووكيل pinocchio TUI"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating inference testing for OpenAI Chat and OpenAI Responses","Validating Claude API credentials for seamless integration","Running comprehensive smoke tests for geppetto and pinocchio agents"],"zh":["自动化 OpenAI 聊天和 OpenAI 响应的推理测试","验证 Claude API 凭证以实现无缝集成","运行 geppetto 和 pinocchio 代理的全面烟雾测试"],"ja":["OpenAI チャットと OpenAI レスポンスの推論テストを自動化","Claude API 凭证を検証してシームレスな統合を実現","geppetto と pinocchio エージェントの包括的な煙霧テストを実行"],"ko":["OpenAI 채팅 및 OpenAI 응답의 추론 테스트 자동화","Claude API 자격 증명을 검증하여 무제한 통합을 구현","geppetto 및 pinocchio 에이전트의 포괄적인 스모크 테스트 실행"],"es":["Automatizar las pruebas de inferencia para OpenAI Chat y OpenAI Responses","Validar las credenciales de la API de Claude para una integración sin problemas","Ejecutar pruebas de humo integrales para los agentes geppetto y pinocchio"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests d''inférence pour OpenAI Chat et OpenAI Responses","Valider les informations d''identification de l''API Claude pour une intégration transparente","Exécuter des tests de fumée complets pour les agents geppetto et pinocchio"],"de":["Automatisieren von Inferenztests für OpenAI Chat und OpenAI Responses","Validieren der Claude-API-Anmeldeinformationen für eine nahtlose Integration","Durchführen umfassender Rauchtests für geppetto- und pinocchio-Agents"],"pt":["Automatização de testes de inferência para OpenAI Chat e OpenAI Responses","Validação de credenciais da API da Claude para integração perfeita","Execução de testes de fumaça abrangentes para agentes geppetto e pinocchio"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования вывода для OpenAI Chat и OpenAI Responses","Проверка учетных данных API Claude для беспрепятственной интеграции","Запуск комплексных дымовых тестов для агентов geppetto и pinocchio"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار الاستدلال لـ OpenAI Chat وOpenAI Responses","التحقق من أوراق اعتماد Claude API لدمج سلس","تشغيل اختبارات دخان شاملة لوكلاء geppetto وpinocchio"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI API Key","Needs Claude credentials","Dependent on golang GPT3 tooling"],"zh":["需要 OpenAI API 密钥","需要 Claude 凭证","依赖于 golang GPT3 工具"],"ja":["OpenAI API キーが必要","Claude 凭证が必要","golang GPT3 ツールに依存"],"ko":["OpenAI API 키가 필요","Claude 자격 증명이 필요","golang GPT3 툴에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una clave de API de OpenAI","Necesita credenciales de Claude","Dependiente del tooling de golang GPT3"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé API OpenAI","Nécessite des informations d''identification de Claude","Dépend du tooling golang GPT3"],"de":["Benötigt einen OpenAI-API-Schlüssel","Benötigt Claude-Anmeldeinformationen","Abhängig vom golang GPT3-Tooling"],"pt":["Requer chave de API da OpenAI","Necessita de credenciais da Claude","Dependente de ferramentas golang GPT3"],"ru":["Требуется ключ API OpenAI","Требуются учетные данные Claude","Зависит от инструментов golang GPT3"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI","يحتاج إلى أوراق اعتماد Claude","يعتمد على أدوات golang GPT3"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b1e5a1a2e041efb51c0f42d3de84ed0a0b33dfd8ad0b1b5cd7c81bececb9dc1a"