:"Claude est un agent de code IA qui améliore les performances des applications React","de":"Claude ist ein KI-Code-Agent, der die Leistung von React-Anwendungen verbessert","pt":"Otimize o desempenho do React com agentes de IA e ferramentas de código","ru":"Оптимизируйте производительность React с помощью ИИ Агентов и кода","ar":"تحسين أداء ري액ت باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ووكلاء الويب","en":"Claude code skills and agents"},"definition":{"en":"Claude code skills and agents"},"features":{"zh":["自动代码优化","性能监控和分析","AI驱动的优化建议","支持React和其他框架","易于集成和使用"],"ja":["自動コード最適化","パフォーマンス監視と分析","AI駆動の最適化提案","Reactおよびその他のフレームワークをサポート","簡単に統合および使用"],"ko":["자동 코드 최적화","성능 모니터링 및 분석","AI驱动의 최적화 제안","React 및 기타 프레임워크 지원","쉽게 통합 및 사용"],"es":["Optimización de rendimiento de React","Mejora de la eficiencia del código","Análisis de rendimiento con IA","Recomendaciones de optimización personalizadas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo de React"],"fr":["Optimisation des performances de React","Amélioration de l''efficacité du code","Analyse des performances avec l''IA","Recommandations d''optimisation personnalisées","Intégration avec les outils de développement de React"],"de":["Leistungsoptimierung von React","Verbesserung der Code-Effizienz","Leistungsanalyse mit KI","Personalisierte Optimierungsempfehlungen","Integration mit React-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Otimização de código","Análise de desempenho","Ferramentas de IA para melhorar a eficiência","Integração com React","Melhoria da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Оптимизация кода","Анализ производительности","ИИ инструменты для улучшения эффективности","Интеграция с React","Улучшение пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تحسين الكود","تحليل الأداء","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين الكفاءة","التكامل مع ري액ت","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React性能优化","AI智能代理","如何使用React优化工具","React优化工具比较","React性能优化教程","React应用程序性能监控","React代码优化最佳实践"],"ja":["Reactパフォーマンス最適化","AIエージェント","React最適化ツールの使用方法","React最適化ツールの比較","Reactパフォーマンス最適化チュートリアル","Reactアプリケーションのパフォーマンス監視","Reactコード最適化ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["React 성능 최적화","AI 에이전트","React 최적화 도구 사용법","React 최적화 도구 비교","React 성능 최적화 튜토리얼","React 애플리케이션 성능 모니터링","React 코드 최적화 베스트 프랙티스"],"es":["optimización de React","agentes de IA para desarrollo","mejora de rendimiento de aplicaciones","cómo usar Claude para React","alternativas a Claude para React","instalación de Claude para React","guía de configuración de Claude para React"],"fr":["optimisation de React","agents IA pour le développement","amélioration des performances des applications","comment utiliser Claude pour React","alternatives à Claude pour React","installation de Claude pour React","guide de configuration de Claude pour React"],"de":["Reaktionsleistungsoptimierung","KI-Agents für Entwicklung","Leistungsverbesserung von Anwendungen","wie man Claude für React verwendet","Alternativen zu Claude für React","Installation von Claude für React","Konfigurationsanleitung für Claude für React"],"pt":["otimização de react","ferramentas de ia para react","melhorar desempenho react","react performance optimization","como usar react com ia","react vs angular","instalar react","guia de configuração react"],"ru":["оптимизация react","ИИ инструменты для react","улучшить производительность react","react производительность оптимизация","как использовать react с ии","react vs angular","установить react","руководство по настройке react"],"ar":["تحسين أداء ري액ت","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لري액ت","تحسين كفاءة ري액ت","ري액ت تحسين الأداء","كيفية استخدام ري액ت مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","ري액ت مقابل أنجولار","تثبيت ري액ت","دليل إعداد ري액ت"]}},"owner":"CJHarmath","repo":"claude-agents-skills","repoPath":"CJHarmath/claude-agents-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.763Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-performance","description":"Performance optimization for React web applications. Use when optimizing renders, implementing virtualization, memoizing components, or debugging performance issues.","bodyPreview":"# React Performance (Web)\n\n## Problem Statement\n\nReact performance issues often stem from unnecessary re-renders, unoptimized lists, and expensive computations on the main thread. Understanding React''s rendering behavior is key to building performant applications.\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Memoization\n\n### useMemo - Expensive Computations\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoize expensive calculation\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = useMemo(() => {\n  return items\n    .filter(item => item.active)\n    .sort((a,","body":"# React Performance (Web)\n\n## Problem Statement\n\nReact performance issues often stem from unnecessary re-renders, unoptimized lists, and expensive computations on the main thread. Understanding React''s rendering behavior is key to building performant applications.\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Memoization\n\n### useMemo - Expensive Computations\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoize expensive calculation\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = useMemo(() => {\n  return items\n    .filter(item => item.active)\n    .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score)\n    .slice(0, 100);\n}, [items]);\n\n// ❌ WRONG: Recalculates every render\nconst sortedAndFilteredItems = items\n  .filter(item => item.active)\n  .sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score);\n\n// ❌ WRONG: Memoizing simple access (overhead > benefit)\nconst userName = useMemo(() => user.name, [user.name]);\n```\n\n**When to use useMemo:**\n- Array transformations (filter, sort, map chains)\n- Object creation passed to memoized children\n- Computations with O(n) or higher complexity\n\n### useCallback - Stable Function References\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable callback for child props\nconst handleClick = useCallback((id: string) => {\n  setSelectedId(id);\n}, []);\n\n// Pass to memoized child\n<MemoizedItem onClick={handleClick} />\n\n// ❌ WRONG: useCallback with unstable deps\nconst handleClick = useCallback((id: string) => {\n  doSomething(unstableObject); // unstableObject changes every render\n}, [unstableObject]); // Defeats the purpose\n```\n\n**When to use useCallback:**\n- Callbacks passed to memoized children\n- Callbacks in dependency arrays\n- Event handlers that would cause child re-renders\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: React.memo\n\n```typescript\n// Wrap components that receive stable props\nconst ItemCard = memo(function ItemCard({\n  item,\n  onSelect\n}: Props) {\n  return (\n    <div onClick={() => onSelect(item.id)}>\n      <h3>{item.name}</h3>\n      <p>{item.price}</p>\n    </div>\n  );\n});\n\n// Custom comparison for complex props\nconst ItemCard = memo(\n  function ItemCard({ item, onSelect }: Props) {\n    // ...\n  },\n  (prevProps, nextProps) => {\n    // Return true if props are equal (skip re-render)\n    return (\n      prevProps.item.id === nextProps.item.id &&\n      prevProps.item.price === nextProps.item.price\n    );\n  }\n);\n```\n\n**When to use React.memo:**\n- List item components\n- Components receiving stable primitive props\n- Components that render frequently but rarely change\n\n**When NOT to use:**\n- Components that always receive new props\n- Simple components (overhead > benefit)\n- Root-level pages\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: List Virtualization\n\nFor long lists, render only visible items using react-window or react-virtualized.\n\n```typescript\nimport { FixedSizeList } from ''react-window'';\n\nfunction VirtualizedList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {\n  const Row = ({ index, style }: { index: number; style: React.CSSProperties }) => (\n    <div style={style}>\n      <ItemCard item={items[index]} />\n    </div>\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <FixedSizeList\n      height={600}\n      width=\"100%\"\n      itemCount={items.length}\n      itemSize={80}\n    >\n      {Row}\n    </FixedSizeList>\n  );\n}\n\n// Variable height items\nimport { VariableSizeList } from ''react-window'';\n\nfunction VariableList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {\n  const getItemSize = (index: number) => {\n    return items[index].expanded ? 200 : 80;\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <VariableSizeList\n      height={600}\n      width=\"100%\"\n      itemCount={items.length}\n      itemSize={getItemSize}\n    >\n      {Row}\n    </VariableSizeList>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**When to virtualize:**\n- Lists with 100+ items\n- Complex item components\n- Scrollable containers with many children\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Zustand Selector Optimization\n\n**Problem:** Selecting entire store causes re-render on any state change.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Re-renders on ANY store change\nconst store = useAppStore();\n// or\nconst { items, loading, filters, ... } = useAppStore();\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Only re-renders when selected values change\nconst items = useAppStore((s) => s.items);\nconst loading = useAppStore((s) => s.loading);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Multiple values with shallow comparison\nimport { useShallow } from ''zustand/react/shallow'';\n\nconst { items, loading } = useAppStore(\n  useShallow((s) => ({\n    items: s.items,\n    loading: s.loading\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Avoiding Re-Renders\n\n### Object/Array Stability\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: New object every render\n<ChildComponent style={{ padding: 10 }} />\n<ChildComponent config={{ enabled: true }} />\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable reference\nconst style = useMemo(() => ({ padding: 10 }), []);\nconst config = useMemo(() => ({ enabled: true }), []);\n\n<ChildComponent style={style} />\n<ChildComponent config={config} />\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Or define outside component\nconst style = { padding: 10 };\n\nfunction Parent() {\n  return <ChildComponent style={style} />;\n}\n```\n\n### Children Stability\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Inline function creates new element each render\n<Parent>\n  {() => <Child />}\n</Parent>\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Stable element\nconst child = useMemo(() => <Child />, [deps]);\n<Parent>{child}</Parent>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Code Splitting\n\n```typescript\nimport { lazy, Suspense } from ''react'';\n\n// Lazy load components\nconst Dashboard = lazy(() => import(''./pages/Dashboard''));\nconst Settings = lazy(() => import(''./pages/Settings''));\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Suspense fallback={<Loading />}>\n      <Routes>\n        <Route path=\"/dashboard\" element={<Dashboard />} />\n        <Route path=\"/settings\" element={<Settings />} />\n      </Routes>\n    </Suspense>\n  );\n}\n\n// Named exports\nconst Dashboard = lazy(() =>\n  import(''./pages/Dashboard'').then(module => ({\n    default: module.Dashboard\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Debouncing and Throttling\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMemo } from ''react'';\nimport { debounce, throttle } from ''lodash-es'';\n\n// Debounce - wait until user stops typing\nfunction SearchInput({ onSearch }: { onSearch: (query: string) => void }) {\n  const debouncedSearch = useMemo(\n    () => debounce(onSearch, 300),\n    [onSearch]\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <input\n      type=\"text\"\n      onChange={(e) => debouncedSearch(e.target.value)}\n    />\n  );\n}\n\n// Throttle - limit how often function runs\nfunction InfiniteScroll({ onLoadMore }: { onLoadMore: () => void }) {\n  const throttledLoad = useMemo(\n    () => throttle(onLoadMore, 1000),\n    [onLoadMore]\n  );\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handleScroll = () => {\n      if (nearBottom()) {\n        throttledLoad();\n      }\n    };\n\n    window.addEventListener(''scroll'', handleScroll);\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(''scroll'', handleScroll);\n  }, [throttledLoad]);\n\n  return <div>...</div>;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Image Optimization\n\n```typescript\n// Lazy load images\n<img\n  src={imageUrl}\n  loading=\"lazy\"\n  alt=\"Description\"\n/>\n\n// With intersection observer for more control\nfunction LazyImage({ src, alt }: { src: string; alt: string }) {\n  const [isVisible, setIsVisible] = useState(false);\n  const imgRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n      ([entry]) => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          setIsVisible(true);\n          observer.disconnect();\n        }\n      },\n      { rootMargin: ''100px'' }\n    );\n\n    if (imgRef.current) {\n      observer.observe(imgRef.current);\n    }\n\n    return () => observer.disconnect();\n  }, []);\n\n  return (\n    <div ref={imgRef}>\n      {isVisible ? (\n        <img src={src} alt={alt} />\n      ) : (\n        <div className=\"placeholder\" />\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// Next.js Image component (if using Next.js)\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n\n<Image\n  src={imageUrl}\n  alt=\"Description\"\n  width={400}\n  height={300}\n  placeholder=\"blur\"\n  blurDataURL={blurHash}\n/>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Web Workers for Heavy Computation\n\n```typescript\n// worker.ts\nself.onmessage = (e: MessageEvent<{ data: number[] }>) => {\n  const result = heavyComputation(e.data.data);\n  self.postMessage(result);\n};\n\n// Component\nfunction DataProcessor({ data }: { data: number[] }) {\n  const [result, setResult] = useState(null);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const worker = new Worker(new URL(''./worker.ts'', import.meta.url));\n\n    worker.onmessage = (e) => {\n      setResult(e.data);\n    };\n\n    worker.postMessage({ data });\n\n    return () => worker.terminate();\n  }, [data]);\n\n  return result ? <Results data={result} /> : <Loading />;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern: Detecting Re-Renders\n\n### React DevTools Profiler\n\n1. Open React DevTools\n2. Go to Profiler tab\n3. Click record, interact, stop\n4. Review \"Flamegraph\" for render times\n5. Look for components rendering unnecessarily\n\n### why-did-you-render\n\n```typescript\n// Setup in development\nimport React from ''react'';\n\nif (process.env.NODE_ENV === ''development'') {\n  const whyDidYouRender = require(''@welldone-software/why-did-you-render'');\n  whyDidYouRender(React, {\n    trackAllPureComponents: true,\n  });\n}\n\n// Mark specific component for tracking\nItemCard.whyDidYouRender = true;\n```\n\n### Console Logging\n\n```typescript\n// Quick check for re-renders\nfunction ItemCard({ item }: Props) {\n  console.log(''ItemCard render:'', item.id);\n  // ...\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Checklist\n\nBefore shipping:\n\n- [ ] Large lists are virtualized\n- [ ] List items are memoized with `React.memo`\n- [ ] Callbacks passed to items use `useCallback`\n- [ ] Zustand selectors are specific (not whole store)\n- [ ] Images use lazy loading\n- [ ] Heavy routes are code-split\n- [ ] No inline object/function props to memoized children\n- [ ] Profiler shows no unnecessary re-renders\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| List scroll lag | Virtualize list, memoize items |\n| Component re-renders too often | Check selector specificity, memoize props |\n| Slow initial render | Code split, reduce bundle size |\n| Memory growing | Check for event listener cleanup, state accumulation |\n| UI freezes on interaction | Move computation to web worker or defer |\n\n---\n\n## Relationship to Other Skills\n\n- **react-zustand-patterns**: Selector optimization patterns\n- **react-async-patterns**: Proper async handling prevents re-render loops\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:16:20.832Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents focused on optimizing React applications for faster rendering and improved user experience.","zh":"适用于专注于优化React应用以实现更快渲染和改善用户体验的前端代理。","ja":"Reactアプリケーションのレンダリングを高速化し、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを改善することに焦点を当てたフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 애플리케이션의 렌더링을 최적화하여 더 빠른 렌더링과 사용자 경험 개선을 중점으로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend centrados en optimizar aplicaciones React para un renderizado más rápido y una mejor experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend axés sur l''optimisation des applications React pour un rendu plus rapide et une expérience utilisateur améliorée.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die sich auf die Optimierung von React-Anwendungen für ein schnelleres Rendern und eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung konzentrieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend focados na otimização de aplicações React para renderização mais rápida e experiência do usuário melhorada.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, ориентированных на оптимизацию приложений React для более быстрой отрисовки и улучшения пользовательского опыта.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يركز على تحسين تطبيقات React لتجربة مستخدم محسنة وأوقات عرض أسرع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React performance by minimizing unnecessary re-renders, leveraging memoization with useMemo, and offloading expensive computations, resulting in faster and more efficient applications using React''s rendering behavior and libraries like TypeScript.","zh":"通过最小化不必要的重新渲染，利用useMemo进行记忆化，并卸载昂贵的计算，从而使React应用程序更快、更高效，利用React的渲染行为和TypeScript等库。","ja":"不要な再描画を最小限に抑え、useMemoによるメモ化を活用し、高価な計算をオフロードすることで、Reactアプリケーションを高速化し、効率化します。Reactの描画動作やTypeScriptなどのライブラリを利用します。","ko":"불필요한 재 렌더링을 최소화하고, useMemo를 사용한 메모화 및 비용이 많이 드는 계산을 오프로드하여 React 애플리케이션을 더 빠르고 효율적으로 만드는 것을 가능하게 하며, React의 렌더링 동작 및 TypeScript 등의 라이브러리를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar el rendimiento de React minimizando las re-renderezas innecesarias, aprovechando la memorización con useMemo y descargando cálculos costosos, lo que resulta en aplicaciones más rápidas y eficientes que utilizan el comportamiento de renderizado de React y bibliotecas como TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances de React en minimisant les ré-rendus inutiles, en exploitant la mémorisation avec useMemo et en déchargeant les calculs coûteux, ce qui aboutit à des applications plus rapides et plus efficaces utilisant le comportement de rendu de React et des bibliothèques comme TypeScript.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Leistung von React zu optimieren, indem sie unnötige Neu-Renderings minimieren, Memoisierung mit useMemo nutzen und teure Berechnungen auslagern, was zu schnelleren und effizienteren Anwendungen führt, die das Rendering-Verhalten von React und Bibliotheken wie TypeScript nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desempenho do React minimizando re-renderizações desnecessárias, utilizando a memoização com useMemo e transferindo computações caras, resultando em aplicações mais rápidas e eficientes que usam o comportamento de renderização do React e bibliotecas como o TypeScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать производительность React, минимизируя ненужные повторные рендеринги, используя мемоизацию с useMemo и выгружая дорогие вычисления, в результате чего получаются более быстрые и эффективные приложения, использующие поведение рендеринга React и библиотеки, такие как TypeScript.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين أداء React عن طريق تقليل إعادة العرض غير الضرورية، واستخدام التخزين المسبق مع useMemo، وتنزيل الحسابات المكلفة، مما يؤدي إلى تطبيقات أسرع وأكثر كفاءة تستخدم سلوك العرض في React ومكتبات مثل TypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React component re-renders","Implementing memoization for expensive computations","Debugging performance issues in React applications"],"zh":["优化React组件的重新渲染","为昂贵的计算实现记忆化","调试React应用程序的性能问题"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントの再描画を最適化する","高価な計算のメモ化を実装する","Reactアプリケーションのパフォーマンスの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트의 재 렌더링을 최적화하는 것","비용이 많이 드는 계산을 위한 메모화를 구현하는 것","React 애플리케이션의 성능 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar las re-renderezas de componentes React","Implementar la memorización para cálculos costosos","Depurar problemas de rendimiento en aplicaciones React"],"fr":["Optimiser les ré-rendus de composants React","Mettre en œuvre la mémorisation pour les calculs coûteux","Déboguer les problèmes de performances dans les applications React"],"de":["Optimieren des Neu-Renderings von React-Komponenten","Implementieren der Memoisierung für teure Berechnungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Leistungsproblemen in React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Otimização de re-renderizações de componentes React","Implementação de memoização para computações caras","Depuração de problemas de desempenho em aplicações React"],"ru":["Оптимизация повторных рендерингов компонентов React","Реализация мемоизации для дорогих вычислений","Отладка проблем с производительностью в приложениях React"],"ar":["تحسين إعادة عرض مكونات React","تنفيذ التخزين المسبق لحسابات مكلفة","تصحيح أخطاء أداء التطبيقات React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of React''s rendering behavior","Limited to React-based applications"],"zh":["需要了解React的渲染行为","仅限于基于React的应用程序"],"ja":["Reactの描画動作の理解が必要","Reactベースのアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["React의 렌더링 동작에 대한 이해가 필요","React 기반 애플리케이션에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del comportamiento de renderizado de React","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en React"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du comportement de rendu de React","Limité aux applications basées sur React"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis des Rendering-Verhaltens von React","Begrenzt auf React-basierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do comportamento de renderização do React","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em React"],"ru":["Требует понимания поведения рендеринга React","Ограничен приложениями, основанными на React"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم سلوك العرض في React","محدود للتطبيقات المستندة إلى React"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e2dffa4237f1554cae41c3b4d13cc3658b649bfdd82b4c27f4720be4ca0a23a2","qualityScore":34}');
