com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Создание игр Capture the Flag более сложных и эмоциональных","Помощь в создании игр более сложных и интересных","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["تạo jogos de Capture the Flag أكثر تحديًا ومرضيًا","مساعدة في tạo jogos de Capture the Flag أكثر تحديًا ومرضيًا","التعاون مع أدوات تطوير أخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体expectations","捕获旗帜游戏开发","如何使用AI智能体","AI智能体和游戏开发","expectations安装","expectations设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェントexpectations","キャプチャー・ザ・フラッグゲーム開発","AIエージェントの使用方法","AIエージェントとゲーム開発","expectationsインストール","expectations設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 expectations","캡처 더 플래그 게임 개발","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트와 게임 개발","expectations 설치","expectations 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de IA","qué es Expectativas","Expectativas alternativa","Expectativas vs otros agentes de IA","instalación de Expectativas","guía de configuración de Expectativas","juegos de estrategia con IA","desarrollo de juegos con Expectativas"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils IA","qu''est-ce que Attentes","Attentes alternative","Attentes vs autres agents IA","installation d''Attentes","guide de configuration d''Attentes","jeux de stratégie avec IA","développement de jeux avec Attentes"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist Erwartungen","Erwartungen-Alternative","Erwartungen vs andere KI-Agents","Installation von Erwartungen","Einrichtungsanleitung für Erwartungen","Strategie-Spiele mit KI","Entwicklung von Spielen mit Erwartungen"],"pt":["Expectations","AI Agent","Jogos de Capture the Flag","Desenvolvimento de jogos","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Criação de jogos"],"ru":["Expectations","ИИ Агент","Игры Capture the Flag","Разработка игр","Инструменты разработки","Создание игр"],"ar":["Expectations","AI Agent","جuegos de Capture the Flag","تطوير الألعاب","أدوات تطوير","تạo الألعاب"]}},"owner":"jscriptcoder","repo":"jshack.me","repoPath":"jscriptcoder/jshack.me","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.765Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expectations","description":"Working expectations and documentation practices. Use when capturing learnings or understanding how to work with this codebase.","bodyPreview":"# Expectations\n\n## When Working with Code\n\n1. **Think deeply** before making any edits\n2. **Understand the full context** of the code and requirements\n3. **Ask clarifying questions** when requirements are ambiguous\n4. **Think from first principles** - don''t make assumptions\n5. **Assess refactoring after every green** - but only refactor if it adds value\n6. **Keep project docs current** - Update CLAUDE.md when introducing meaningful changes\n\n## Documentation Framework\n\n**At the end of every signi","body":"# Expectations\n\n## When Working with Code\n\n1. **Think deeply** before making any edits\n2. **Understand the full context** of the code and requirements\n3. **Ask clarifying questions** when requirements are ambiguous\n4. **Think from first principles** - don''t make assumptions\n5. **Assess refactoring after every green** - but only refactor if it adds value\n6. **Keep project docs current** - Update CLAUDE.md when introducing meaningful changes\n\n## Documentation Framework\n\n**At the end of every significant change, ask: \"What do I wish I''d known at the start?\"**\n\nDocument if ANY of these are true:\n\n- Would save future developers >30 minutes\n- Prevents a class of bugs or errors\n- Reveals non-obvious behavior or constraints\n- Captures architectural rationale or trade-offs\n- Documents domain-specific knowledge\n- Identifies effective patterns or anti-patterns\n- Clarifies tool setup or configuration gotchas\n\n## Types of Learnings to Capture\n\n- **Gotchas**: Unexpected behavior discovered (e.g., \"API returns null instead of empty array\")\n- **Patterns**: Approaches that worked particularly well\n- **Anti-patterns**: Approaches that seemed good but caused problems\n- **Decisions**: Architectural choices with rationale and trade-offs\n- **Edge cases**: Non-obvious scenarios that required special handling\n- **Tool knowledge**: Setup, configuration, or usage insights\n\n## Documentation Format\n\n```markdown\n#### Gotcha: [Descriptive Title]\n\n**Context**: When this occurs\n**Issue**: What goes wrong\n**Solution**: How to handle it\n\n// CORRECT - Solution\nconst example = \"correct approach\";\n\n// WRONG - What causes the problem\nconst wrong = \"incorrect approach\";\n```\n\n## Code Change Principles\n\n- **Start with a failing test** - always. No exceptions.\n- After making tests pass, always assess refactoring opportunities\n- After refactoring, verify all tests and static analysis pass, then commit\n- Respect the existing patterns and conventions\n- Maintain test coverage for all behavior changes\n- Keep changes small and incremental\n- Ensure all TypeScript strict mode requirements are met\n- Provide rationale for significant design decisions\n\n**If you find yourself writing production code without a failing test, STOP immediately and write the test first.**\n\n## Communication\n\n- Be explicit about trade-offs in different approaches\n- Explain the reasoning behind significant design decisions\n- Flag any deviations from guidelines with justification\n- Suggest improvements that align with these principles\n- When unsure, ask for clarification rather than assuming\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:16:55.669Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring meticulous code analysis and documentation practices.","zh":"适合需要严格代码分析和文档实践的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビュー代理が徹底的なコード分析とドキュメント作成を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 철저한 코드 분석과 문서 작성 관행을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que requieren un análisis y prácticas de documentación de código meticulosos.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Revue de Code nécessitant une analyse et des pratiques de documentation de code minutieuses.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die eine sorgfältige Code-Analyse und Dokumentationspraktiken erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem análise e práticas de documentação de código meticulosas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, требующих тщательного анализа кода и практик документирования.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكود الذين يتطلبون تحليل شديد للكود وممارسات توثيق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to think critically from first principles, assess refactoring needs, and maintain up-to-date project documentation using CLAUDE.md, ensuring high-quality code edits and meaningful changes.","zh":"赋予代理从第一原则批判性思考、评估重构需求并使用CLAUDE.md维护最新的项目文档，确保高质量的代码编辑和有意义的更改。","ja":"エージェントが第一原則から批判的に考え、リファクタリングの必要性を評価し、CLAUDE.mdを使用して最新のプロジェクトドキュメントを維持し、高品質のコード編集と意味のある変更を保証する。","ko":"에이전트가 처음부터 비판적으로 생각하고 리팩토링의 필요성을 평가하며 CLAUDE.md를 사용하여 최신 프로젝트 문서를 유지하고 고품질의 코드 편집과 의미 있는 변경을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a pensar críticamente desde primeros principios, evaluar necesidades de refactorización y mantener la documentación del proyecto actualizada utilizando CLAUDE.md, garantizando ediciones de código de alta calidad y cambios significativos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réfléchir de manière critique à partir de principes premiers, d''évaluer les besoins de refactoring et de maintenir à jour la documentation du projet en utilisant CLAUDE.md, garantissant des modifications de code de haute qualité et des changements significatifs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, kritisch von ersten Prinzipien aus zu denken, die Notwendigkeit von Refactoring zu bewerten und die Projekt-Dokumentation mithilfe von CLAUDE.md auf dem neuesten Stand zu halten, um hochwertige Code-Änderungen und sinnvolle Änderungen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pensar criticamente a partir de princípios fundamentais, avaliar as necessidades de refatoração e manter a documentação do projeto atualizada usando CLAUDE.md, garantindo edições de código de alta qualidade e alterações significativas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью критически мыслить с первых принципов, оценивать потребность в рефакторинге и поддерживать актуальную документацию проекта с помощью CLAUDE.md, обеспечивая высококачественные правки кода и значимые изменения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التفكير النقدي من المبادئ الأساسية ، وتقييم احتياجات إعادة الهيكلة ، وضمان توثيق مشروع محدث باستخدام CLAUDE.md ، مما يضمن تحريرات عالية الجودة للكود والتغييرات المهمة"},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring code for improved readability","Generating documentation for new features","Assessing code quality after each iteration"],"zh":["为提高可读性而重构代码","为新功能生成文档","评估每次迭代后的代码质量"],"ja":["可読性を向上させるためにコードをリファクタリングする","新しい機能のドキュメントを生成する","各イテレーションの後のコード品質を評価する"],"ko":["가독성을 개선하기 위해 코드를 리팩토링하는 것","새로운 기능에 대한 문서 생성","각 반복后的 코드 품질 평가"],"es":["Reestructuración de código para mejorar la legibilidad","Generación de documentación para nuevas características","Evaluación de la calidad del código después de cada iteración"],"fr":["Réorganisation du code pour améliorer la lisibilité","Génération de documentation pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités","Évaluation de la qualité du code après chaque itération"],"de":["Umstrukturierung von Code zur Verbesserung der Lesbarkeit","Generierung von Dokumentation für neue Funktionen","Bewertung der Code-Qualität nach jeder Iteration"],"pt":["Refatoração de código para melhor legibilidade","Geração de documentação para recursos novos","Avaliação da qualidade do código após cada iteração"],"ru":["Рефакторинг кода для улучшения читаемости","Генерация документации для новых функций","Оценка качества кода после каждой итерации"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة الكود لتحسين القابلية للقراءة","توليد توثيق للسمات الجديدة","تقييم جودة الكود بعد كل تكرار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of coding principles","Needs access to project documentation files like CLAUDE.md"],"zh":["需要了解编码原则","需要访问项目文档文件，如CLAUDE.md"],"ja":["コーディング原則の理解が必要","CLAUDE.mdなどのプロジェクトドキュメントファイルへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["코딩 원칙을 이해해야 함","CLAUDE.md와 같은 프로젝트 문서 파일에 접근할 필요가 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de principios de codificación","Necesita acceso a archivos de documentación del proyecto como CLAUDE.md"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de codage","A besoin d''un accès aux fichiers de documentation du projet comme CLAUDE.md"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis von Codierungsprinzipien","Benötigt Zugriff auf Projekt-Dokumentationsdateien wie CLAUDE.md"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de codificação","Necessita acesso a arquivos de documentação do projeto como CLAUDE.md"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов кодирования","Требует доступа к файлам документации проекта, таким как CLAUDE.md"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ الترميز","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى ملفات توثيق المشروع مثل CLAUDE.md"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"983a131cb32f1b697d9ae2db44c7cbfc426e0f42de8eeffa6aaed17f31dc4f71","qualityScore":34}');
