ss/Selenium)"],"zh":["仅限于TypeScript/JavaScript、Python和C#语言","需要项目语言自动检测功能","依赖于支持的框架（Playwright/Cypress/Selenium）"],"ja":["TypeScript/JavaScript、Python、C#言語に限定される","プロジェクト言語の自動検出機能が必要","サポートされているフレームワーク（Playwright/Cypress/Selenium）に依存する"],"ko":["TypeScript/JavaScript, Python 및 C# 언어로 제한됨","프로젝트 언어 자동 감지 기능이 필요함","지원되는 프레임워크(Playwright/Cypress/Selenium)에 의존함"],"es":["Limitado a los lenguajes TypeScript/JavaScript, Python y C#","Requiere la capacidad de detección automática del lenguaje del proyecto","Dependiente de los marcos de trabajo compatibles (Playwright/Cypress/Selenium)"],"fr":["Limité aux langages TypeScript/JavaScript, Python et C#","Nécessite la capacité de détection automatique du langage du projet","Dépend des frameworks pris en charge (Playwright/Cypress/Selenium)"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die Sprachen TypeScript/JavaScript, Python und C#","Erfordert die Fähigkeit zur automatischen Erkennung der Projekt-Sprache","Abhängig von unterstützten Frameworks (Playwright/Cypress/Selenium)"],"pt":["Limitado às linguagens TypeScript/JavaScript, Python e C#","Requer capacidade de detecção automática de linguagem do projeto","Dependente dos quadros suportados (Playwright/Cypress/Selenium)"],"ru":["Ограничен поддержкой языков TypeScript/JavaScript, Python и C#","Требует возможности автоматического обнаружения языка проекта","Зависит от поддерживаемых фреймворков (Playwright/Cypress/Selenium)"],"ar":["محدود باللغات TypeScript/JavaScript و Python و C#","يتطلب khảية الكشف التلقائي عن لغة المشروع","يعتمد على الإطارات المدعومة (Playwright/Cypress/Selenium)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ef4845f61a0f72981cef1b96b8856b8ce2d22e5b7f809a03c0a2bfed89cb2a2b","qualityScore":34}');
