rnal Researcher альтернатива","External Researcher vs другие инструменты","установить External Researcher","руководство по настройке External Researcher"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام الباحث الخارجي","ما هي الجاذبية المعاكسة","بديل الباحث الخارجي","الباحث الخارجي مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت الباحث الخارجي","دليل إعداد الباحث الخارجي"]}},"owner":"totoroyyb","repo":"amag","repoPath":"totoroyyb/amag","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.958Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"external-researcher","description":"External knowledge retrieval — official docs, OSS examples, and best practices via web search","bodyPreview":"# External Researcher\n\nProtocol for finding authoritative external knowledge. When activated, shift into reference-finding mode: search official docs, find production OSS examples, and surface concrete guidance — not tutorials, not blog posts.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Working with an unfamiliar library, framework, or tool\n- User mentions a specific external dependency\n- Best practices needed for a library decision\n- Finding OSS implementations to learn from before designing something\n- \"How do I","body":"# External Researcher\n\nProtocol for finding authoritative external knowledge. When activated, shift into reference-finding mode: search official docs, find production OSS examples, and surface concrete guidance — not tutorials, not blog posts.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Working with an unfamiliar library, framework, or tool\n- User mentions a specific external dependency\n- Best practices needed for a library decision\n- Finding OSS implementations to learn from before designing something\n- \"How do I use [library] correctly?\" or \"What does [framework feature] actually do?\"\n\n**Key trigger phrases:**\n- \"How do I use [library]?\"\n- \"What''s the best practice for [framework feature]?\"\n- \"Why does [external dependency] behave this way?\"\n- \"Find examples of [technology] usage\"\n- Working with an npm/pip/cargo package you haven''t used before\n\n**Loaded by:**\n- `/plan` Step 1 (Build from Scratch, Architecture, Research intents)\n- `/ultrawork` for unfamiliar technology\n- Default behavior when user mentions external library\n\n## Core Pattern\n\nAlways prefer in this order:\n1. **Official docs** — canonical API reference, config options, migration guides\n2. **Production OSS** (1000+ stars) — real implementations, not tutorials\n3. **Changelog/issues** — for gotchas, breaking changes, known bugs\n\nNever cite:\n- Personal blog posts as authoritative (as supplementary evidence only)\n- Tutorials as API reference\n- Stack Overflow as the primary source for library design decisions\n\n## Search Patterns\n\n### For Library/Framework Docs\n\n```\nsearch_web(\"{library} official documentation API reference\")\nsearch_web(\"{library} {specific feature} best practices\")\nread_url_content({official_docs_url})\n```\n\nFocus on:\n- API signatures with parameter types and defaults\n- Recommended usage patterns\n- Pitfalls and common mistakes sections\n- Version compatibility (check if docs match the version in use)\n\n### For Production OSS Examples\n\n```\nsearch_web(\"{feature} site:github.com stars:>1000\")\nsearch_web(\"{library} example implementation production\")\n```\n\nFocus on:\n- Architecture choices, not surface-level patterns\n- Edge case handling\n- Error strategies\n- What 2-3 quality implementations have in common (consensus pattern)\n\n### For Gotchas and Migration\n\n```\nsearch_web(\"{library} {version} breaking changes migration\")\nsearch_web(\"{library} common mistakes pitfalls\")\n```\n\nFocus on:\n- API changes between versions\n- Performance gotchas\n- Security considerations\n\n## Synthesis Format\n\n```\nSource: [URL — official docs / OSS / other]\nKey finding: [What to do / API signature / pattern]\nPitfall: [What to avoid]\nVersion note: [Any version-specific considerations]\nConfidence: HIGH (official docs) / MEDIUM (OSS pattern) / LOW (community)\n```\n\n## Quality Bar\n\n- Always verify the version of docs matches the project''s dependency version\n- When official docs and OSS patterns conflict — follow official docs, note the discrepancy\n- Production code (GitHub, verified OSS) > tutorials > blog posts\n- Cite the specific URL + section, not just \"I found online\"\n- If docs are ambiguous: note it explicitly, don''t fabricate certainty\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:13:28.455Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring advanced external knowledge retrieval for library and framework research","zh":"非常适合需要高级外部知识检索以进行库和框架研究的AI Agent，如Claude Code和AutoGPT","ja":"ライブラリとフレームワークの調査のために高度な外部知識検索を必要とするClaude CodeやAutoGPTなどのAIエージェントに最適です","ko":"라이브러리 및 프레임워크 연구를 위한 고급 외부 지식 검색이 필요한 Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에 이상적입니다","es":"Ideal para AI Agents como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren recuperación avanzada de conocimiento externo para investigación de bibliotecas y frameworks","fr":"Idéal pour les AI Agents comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant une récupération avancée de connaissances externes pour la recherche de bibliothèques et frameworks","de":"Ideal für AI Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte externe Wissensbeschaffung für die Recherche von Bibliotheken und Frameworks benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que exigem recuperação avançada de conhecimento externo para pesquisa de bibliotecas e frameworks","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих продвинутого извлечения внешних знаний для исследования библиотек и фреймворков","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذي يتطلب إعادة استرجاع معرفة خارجية متقدمة لبحث المكتبات وإطار العمل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to surface concrete guidance from official documentation and production OSS examples, leveraging protocols for finding authoritative external knowledge on specific libraries, frameworks, and tools, and facilitating best practices for library decisions","zh":"使Agent能够从官方文档和生产OSS示例中提取具体指导，利用协议查找特定库、框架和工具的权威外部知识，并促进库决策的最佳实践","ja":"エージェントが公式ドキュメントと本番OSSの例から具体的なガイダンスを提供できるようにし、特定のライブラリ、フレームワーク、ツールに関する信頼できる外部知識を見つけるためのプロトコルを活用し、ライブラリ決定のベストプラクティスを促進します","ko":"에이전트가 공식 문서와 프로덕션 OSS 예제에서 구체적인 지침을 제공할 수 있도록 하여, 특정 라이브러리, 프레임워크 및 도구에 대한 권위 있는 외부 지식을 찾기 위한 프로토콜을 활용하고 라이브러리 결정을 위한 모범 사례를 용이하게 합니다","es":"Empodera a los agentes para obtener orientación concreta de documentación oficial y ejemplos OSS de producción, aprovechando protocolos para encontrar conocimiento externo autoritativo sobre bibliotecas, frameworks y herramientas específicas, y facilitando las mejores prácticas para decisiones de bibliotecas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''obtenir des conseils concrets à partir de la documentation officielle et d''exemples OSS en production, exploitant des protocoles pour trouver des connaissances externes autoritatives sur des bibliothèques, frameworks et outils spécifiques, et facilitant les meilleures pratiques pour les décisions concernant les bibliothèques","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, konkrete Anleitungen aus offizieller Dokumentation und Produktions-OSS-Beispielen zu finden, nutzt Protokolle zur Suche nach autoritativem externem Wissen zu spezifischen Bibliotheken, Frameworks und Tools und erleichtert Best Practices für Bibliotheksentscheidungen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer orientação concreta a partir da documentação oficial e exemplos de OSS de produção, aproveitando protocolos para encontrar conhecimento externo autorizado sobre bibliotecas, frameworks e ferramentas específicas, e facilitando as melhores práticas para decisões de bibliotecas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предоставлять конкретные рекомендации из официальной документации и примеров OSS производства, используя протоколы для нахождения авторитетных внешних знаний о конкретных библиотеках, фреймворках и инструментах, и облегчая лучшие практики для решений о библиотеках","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من توفير إرشادات ملموسة من الوثائق الرسمية وأمثلة OSS الإنتاجية، واستخدام بروتوكولات العثور على معرفة خارجية موثوقة حول المكتبات وإطارات العمل والأدوات المحددة، وتسهيل أفضل الممارسات لقرارات المكتبات"},"useCases":{"en":["Searching official documentation for unfamiliar libraries","Finding production OSS examples for specific external dependencies","Determining best practices for library decisions"],"zh":["搜索不熟悉库的官方文档","查找特定外部依赖项的生产OSS示例","确定库决策的最佳实践"],"ja":["不慣れなライブラリの公式ドキュメントを検索する","特定の外部依存関係の本番OSSの例を見つける","ライブラリ決定のベストプラクティスを決定する"],"ko":["익숙하지 않은 라이브러리의 공식 문서 검색","특정 외부 종속성에 대한 프로덕션 OSS 예제 찾기","라이브러리 결정을 위한 모범 사례 결정"],"es":["Búsqueda de documentación oficial para bibliotecas no familiares","Búsqueda de ejemplos OSS de producción para dependencias externas específicas","Determinación de mejores prácticas para decisiones de bibliotecas"],"fr":["Recherche de documentation officielle pour des bibliothèques non familières","Recherche d''exemples OSS en production pour des dépendances externes spécifiques","Détermination des meilleures pratiques pour les décisions concernant les bibliothèques"],"de":["Suche in offizieller Dokumentation für unbekannte Bibliotheken","Finden von Produktions-OSS-Beispielen für spezifische externe Abhängigkeiten","Ermittlung von Best Practices für Bibliotheksentscheidungen"],"pt":["Pesquisar documentação oficial para bibliotecas desconhecidas","Encontrar exemplos de OSS de produção para dependências externas específicas","Determinar as melhores práticas para decisões de bibliotecas"],"ru":["Поиск официальной документации для незнакомых библиотек","Поиск примеров OSS производства для конкретных внешних зависимостей","Определение лучших практик для решений о библиотеках"],"ar":["البحث في الوثائق الرسمية للمكتبات غير المعروفة","العثور على أمثلة OSS الإنتاجية للتبعيات الخارجية المحددة","تحديد أفضل الممارسات لقرارات المكتبات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires internet access for searching external resources","Limited to publicly available official documentation and OSS examples"],"zh":["需要互联网访问以搜索外部资源","仅限于公开的官方文档和OSS示例"],"ja":["外部リソースを検索するにはインターネットアクセスが必要","公開されている公式ドキュメントとOSSの例に限定される"],"ko":["외부 리소스 검색을 위해 인터넷 액세스 필요","공개적으로 사용 가능한 공식 문서 및 OSS 예제로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a internet para buscar recursos externos","Limitado a documentación oficial públicamente disponible y ejemplos OSS"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Internet pour rechercher des ressources externes","Limité à la documentation officielle publiquement disponible et aux exemples OSS"],"de":["Erfordert Internetzugang für die Suche in externen Ressourcen","Beschränkt auf öffentlich verfügbare offizielle Dokumentation und OSS-Beispiele"],"pt":["Exige acesso à internet para pesquisar recursos externos","Limitado à documentação oficial e exemplos de OSS publicamente disponíveis"],"ru":["Требует доступа к интернету для поиска внешних ресурсов","Ограничен официальной документацией и примерами OSS, доступными публично"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الإنترنت للبحث عن الموارد الخارجية","محدود بالوثائق الرسمية وأمثلة OSS المتاحة للجمهور"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d9901c96e73452cf9409ee2e2b115890e672d4e5f956d1edd3c239d28bf0b1af","qualityScore":34}');
