der Entwicklung mit KI-Agenten","Nutze Fähigkeiten von KI-Agenten, um Aufgaben zu automatisieren","Entwickeln Sie robustere und skalierbare Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de hooks personalizados para desenvolvimento Centaur","Integração com Task Graph para melhorar a produtividade","Suporte a desenvolvimento em React, Python e Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI) para facilidade de uso","Compatibilidade com diferentes ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских хуков для разработки Centaur","Интеграция с Task Graph для повышения производительности","Поддержка разработки на React, Python и Node.js","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI) для простоты использования","Совместимость с различными средами разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء hooks مخصصة لتطوير Centaur","التكامل مع Task Graph لتحسين الإنتاجية","دعم التطوير بلغات React و Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) لسهولة الاستخدام","التوافق مع بيئات التطوير المختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["create-hook 教程","Task Graph Centaur Development","AIエージェント create-hook","React create-hook","Node.js create-hook","create-hook 安装","create-hook Setup Guide"],"ja":["create-hook チュートリアル","Task Graph Centaur Development","AIエージェント create-hook","React create-hook","Node.js create-hook","create-hook インストール","create-hook セットアップガイド"],"ko":["create-hook 튜토리얼","Task Graph Centaur Development","AI 에이전트 create-hook","React create-hook","Node.js create-hook","create-hook 설치","create-hook 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo crear hooks con agentes de IA","qué es el desarrollo Centauro","alternativas a create-hook","create-hook vs otras herramientas de IA","instalación de create-hook","guía de configuración de create-hook","desarrollo de aplicaciones con agentes de IA","herramientas de IA para desarrollo de software"],"fr":["comment créer des hooks avec les outils d''IA","qu''est-ce que le développement Centaure","alternatives à create-hook","create-hook vs d''autres outils d''IA","installation de create-hook","guide de configuration de create-hook","développement d''applications avec les outils d''IA","outils d''IA pour le développement de logiciels"],"de":["wie man Hooks mit KI-Agenten erstellt","was ist die Centaur-Entwicklung","alternativen zu create-hook","create-hook vs andere KI-Tools","installation von create-hook","konfigurationsanleitung für create-hook","entwicklung von anwendungen mit KI-Agenten","KI-Tools für die softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["como usar create-hook","o que é create-hook","create-hook vs outras ferramentas","instalar create-hook","guia de configuração do create-hook","desenvolvimento Centaur com create-hook","Task Graph e create-hook","create-hook para desenvolvedores","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvimento"],"ru":["как использовать create-hook","что такое create-hook","create-hook vs другие инструменты","установить create-hook","руководство по настройке create-hook","разработка Centaur с create-hook","Task Graph и create-hook","create-hook для разработчиков","инструменты ИИ для разработки"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام إنشاء Hook","ما هو إنشاء Hook","إنشاء Hook مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت إنشاء Hook","دليل إعداد إنشاء Hook","تطوير Centaur مع إنشاء Hook","Task Graph وإنشاء Hook","إنشاء Hook للمطورين","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير"]}},"owner":"danalexilewis","repo":"taskgraph","repoPath":"danalexilewis/taskgraph","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T12:49:15Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-hook","description":"Creates or adds Cursor agent lifecycle hooks. Use when the user asks to create a hook, add a hook, set up a lifecycle hook, or automate something on agent stop, afterFileEdit, afterAgentResponse, or other Cursor hook events. Hooks live in .cursor/hooks/ and are registered in .cursor/hooks.json.","bodyPreview":"# Create Hook\n\n**You** (the lead) do the work. Do not dispatch sub-agents.\n\n**Type:** Utility skill (procedural, no agentic lead or sub-agents).\n\nAdds a Cursor lifecycle hook: a script that runs when a specific agent event fires. Hooks are project-level only (`.cursor/hooks/` and `.cursor/hooks.json`).\n\n## 1. Choose the lifecycle event\n\nRegister the hook under one of these keys in `hooks.json`:\n\n| Event                                           | When it runs                          |\n| -------","body":"# Create Hook\n\n**You** (the lead) do the work. Do not dispatch sub-agents.\n\n**Type:** Utility skill (procedural, no agentic lead or sub-agents).\n\nAdds a Cursor lifecycle hook: a script that runs when a specific agent event fires. Hooks are project-level only (`.cursor/hooks/` and `.cursor/hooks.json`).\n\n## 1. Choose the lifecycle event\n\nRegister the hook under one of these keys in `hooks.json`:\n\n| Event                                           | When it runs                          |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `stop`                                          | When the agent stops (end of turn)    |\n| `afterFileEdit`                                 | After the agent edits a file          |\n| `afterAgentResponse`                            | After the agent sends a response      |\n| `beforeSubmitPrompt`                            | Before the user''s prompt is submitted |\n| `beforeReadFile` / `afterShellExecution` / etc. | See Cursor docs for full list         |\n\n## 2. Add the script\n\n- **Path**: `.cursor/hooks/<name>.js` (or `.sh` if shell). Use a clear name (e.g. `memory-reminder.js`, `on-stop.js`).\n- **Runtime**: Node.js is typical; command in `hooks.json` is run with Cursor''s working directory set so that `node hooks/<name>.js` resolves (run from `.cursor`).\n- **Input**: The hook receives a single JSON object on **stdin**. Read it like this:\n\n```javascript\nlet input = \"\";\nprocess.stdin.setEncoding(\"utf8\");\nprocess.stdin.on(\"data\", (chunk) => {\n  input += chunk;\n});\nprocess.stdin.on(\"end\", () => {\n  const payload = JSON.parse(input);\n  const roots = payload.workspace_roots || [process.cwd()];\n  const root = path.resolve(roots[0]); // repo root\n  // ... use root for paths like path.join(root, ''.cursor'', ''next-step.md'')\n});\n```\n\n- **Payload**: Often includes `workspace_roots` (array of repo roots). Use the first root as the project root for paths. Event-specific payloads may include `file_path`, `prompt`, etc.\n- **Output**: Hook can write files (e.g. `.cursor/next-step.md`), log to stderr, or exit; avoid writing to stdout if the protocol expects JSON there.\n- **Shebang**: Start Node scripts with `#!/usr/bin/env node`.\n\n## 3. Register in hooks.json\n\n- **Path**: `.cursor/hooks.json`\n- **Format**:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"hooks\": {\n    \"stop\": [\n      { \"command\": \"node hooks/on-stop.js\" },\n      { \"command\": \"node hooks/my-new-hook.js\" }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n- Append to the array for the chosen event; do not remove existing hooks unless the user asks to replace them.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Script created under `.cursor/hooks/<name>.js` (or `.sh`)\n- [ ] Script reads JSON from stdin and uses `workspace_roots` for repo root when needed\n- [ ] Entry added to `.cursor/hooks.json` under the correct event key\n- [ ] Command is `node hooks/<name>.js` (or `./hooks/<name>.sh`); path is relative to `.cursor`\n\n## Reference\n\n- Existing hooks in this repo: `.cursor/hooks/on-stop.js`, `.cursor/hooks/after-file-edit.js`, `.cursor/hooks/memory-reminder.js` — use them as patterns for stdin handling and `path.join(root, ...)`.\n- Project memory (`.cursor/memory.md`) notes that new hooks should be added under `.cursor/hooks/` and registered in `.cursor/hooks.json`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T04:01:20.161Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cursor-based agents requiring customized lifecycle event handling and automation","zh":"适用于需要自定义生命周期事件处理和自动化的基于光标的代理","ja":"カーソルベースのエージェントがカスタマイズされたライフサイクルイベントのハンドリングと自動化を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"커스어베이스 에이전트가 사용자 정의 라이프사이클 이벤트 처리 및 자동화가 필요한 경우 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes basados en cursor que requieren un control de eventos de ciclo de vida personalizado y automatización","fr":"Idéal pour les agents basés sur curseur nécessitant une gestion d''événements de cycle de vie personnalisée et une automatisation","de":"Ideal für Cursor-basierte Agenten, die eine benutzerdefinierte Lebenszyklus-Ereignisbehandlung und Automatisierung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes baseados em Cursor que exigem tratamento de eventos de ciclo de vida personalizados e automação","ru":"Идеально для агентов, основанных на Cursor, требующих настраиваемого обработки событий жизненного цикла и автоматизации","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستندة إلى Cursor التي تتطلب обработة أحداث دورة الحياة المخصصة والتحكم الآلي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute scripts at specific lifecycle events, leveraging hooks.json configuration and .cursor/hooks/ directory management, enabling seamless integration with project-level workflows","zh":"赋予代理在特定生命周期事件中执行脚本的能力，利用hooks.json配置和.cursor/hooks/目录管理，实现与项目级工作流的无缝集成","ja":"特定ライフサイクルイベントでスクリプトを実行するエージェントの能力を提供し、hooks.jsonの設定と.cursor/hooks/ディレクトリの管理を活用して、プロジェクトレベルのワークフローとのシームレスな統合を可能にします","ko":"특정 라이프사이클 이벤트에서 스크립트를 실행하는 에이전트의 기능을 제공하여 hooks.json 설정 및 .cursor/hooks/ 디렉토리 관리를 활용하여 프로젝트 수준의 워크플로와의無縫な統合을 가능하게 함","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar scripts en eventos de ciclo de vida específicos, aprovechando la configuración hooks.json y la gestión del directorio .cursor/hooks/, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con flujos de trabajo a nivel de proyecto","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des scripts à des événements de cycle de vie spécifiques, en exploitant la configuration hooks.json et la gestion du répertoire .cursor/hooks/, permettant ainsi une intégration transparente avec les flux de travail au niveau du projet","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Skripte bei bestimmten Lebenszyklus-Ereignissen auszuführen, indem es die Konfiguration hooks.json und die Verwaltung des Verzeichnisses .cursor/hooks/ nutzt, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Projekt-Workflows ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar scripts em eventos de ciclo de vida específicos, aproveitando a configuração hooks.json e gerenciamento do diretório .cursor/hooks/, permitindo integração sem problemas com fluxos de trabalho de nível de projeto","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять скрипты на конкретных событиях жизненного цикла, используя конфигурацию hooks.json и управление каталогом .cursor/hooks/, что обеспечивает беспрепятственную интеграцию с рабочими процессами проекта","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل البرامج النصية في أحداث دورة الحياة المحددة، مستفيداً من تكوين hooks.json وإدارة دليل .cursor/hooks/، مما يسمح بالتكامل السلس مع سير عمل المستوى المشروع"},"useCases":{"en":["Registering hooks for agent initialization","Automating tasks on agent shutdown","Debugging agent events using custom hooks"],"zh":["注册代理初始化的钩子","在代理关闭时自动执行任务","使用自定义钩子调试代理事件"],"ja":["エージェント初期化のフックを登録する","エージェントのシャットダウン時にタスクを自動実行する","カスタムフックを使用してエージェントイベントをデバッグする"],"ko":["에이전트 초기화에 대한 훅 등록","에이전트 종료 시 작업 자동화","사용자 정의 훅을 사용한 에이전트 이벤트 디버깅"],"es":["Registrar ganchos para la inicialización del agente","Automatizar tareas en el apagado del agente","Depurar eventos de agente utilizando ganchos personalizados"],"fr":["Enregistrer des hooks pour l''initialisation de l''agent","Automatiser des tâches à l''arrêt de l''agent","Déboguer les événements d''agent en utilisant des hooks personnalisés"],"de":["Hooks für die Initialisierung des Agents registrieren","Aufgaben beim Herunterfahren des Agents automatisieren","Agenten-Ereignisse mithilfe benutzerdefinierter Hooks debuggen"],"pt":["Registro de ganchos para inicialização do agente","Automatização de tarefas no encerramento do agente","Depuração de eventos de agente usando ganchos personalizados"],"ru":["Регистрация хуков для инициализации агента","Автоматизация задач при завершении работы агента","Отладка событий агента с помощью пользовательских хуков"],"ar":["تسجيل Hooks للتهيئة الأولية للوكيل","أتمتة المهام عند إغلاق الوكيل","تصحيح أخطاء أحداث الوكيل باستخدام Hooks مخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Project-level hooks only","Requires .cursor/hooks/ and .cursor/hooks.json setup"],"zh":["仅限项目级钩子","需要.cursor/hooks/和.cursor/hooks.json设置"],"ja":["プロジェクトレベルのフックのみ",".cursor/hooks/および.cursor/hooks.jsonの設定が必要"],"ko":["프로젝트 수준의 훅만 해당",".cursor/hooks/ 및 .cursor/hooks.json 설정 필요"],"es":["Ganchos solo a nivel de proyecto","Requiere configuración de .cursor/hooks/ y .cursor/hooks.json"],"fr":["Hooks uniquement au niveau du projet","Nécessite la configuration de .cursor/hooks/ et .cursor/hooks.json"],"de":["Hooks nur auf Projekt-Ebene","Benötigt .cursor/hooks/- und .cursor/hooks.json-Setup"],"pt":["Ganchos apenas de nível de projeto","Exige configuração .cursor/hooks/ e .cursor/hooks.json"],"ru":["Хуки только уровня проекта","Требует настройки .cursor/hooks/ и .cursor/hooks.json"],"ar":["Hooks فقط على مستوى المشروع","يتطلب إعداد .cursor/hooks/ و .cursor/hooks.json"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8aecc143d229b5bba50e69adbd6fa885bd9f8c3d8aab0c45e94c68f53f5f2f67","qualityScore":34}');
