ion de projet","développement de logiciels avec des outils de planification de projet","outils de planification de projet pour les équipes de développement"],"de":["wie man Projektplanungstools verwendet","was ist AI-Projektplanung","Alternativen zu Projektplanungstools","Projektplanungstools vs Trello","Installation von Projektplanungstools","Einrichtungsanleitung für Projektplanungstools","Software-Entwicklung mit Projektplanungstools","Projektplanungstools für Entwicklerteams"],"pt":["como usar project-planner","o que é project-planner","project-planner alternativa","project-planner vs trello","instalar project-planner","guia de configuração do project-planner","ferramentas de inteligência artificial para desenvolvimento"],"ru":["как использовать планировщик проектов","что такое планировщик проектов","планировщик проектов альтернатива","планировщик проектов vs trello","установить планировщик проектов","руководство по настройке планировщика проектов","инструменты ИИ для разработки"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مخطط المشروع","ما هو مخطط المشروع","مخطط المشروع بديل","مخطط المشروع vs trello","تثبيت مخطط المشروع","دليل إعداد مخطط المشروع","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتطوير"]}},"owner":"jeffwweee","repo":"dev-workspace","repoPath":"jeffwweee/dev-workspace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T13:13:22.736Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-planner","description":"Task planning and management for dev-workspace projects. Manages tasks.json with task creation, status updates, dependency tracking, and priority management. Use for creating new tasks, updating task status, managing task dependencies, re-prioritizing work, and any changes to tasks.json.","bodyPreview":"# Project Planner\n\n## Overview\n\nManages task planning, tracking, and updates to tasks.json. Handles task dependencies, priorities, and status updates.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Create Task Plan\n\nCreate a new task with appropriate priority and dependencies:\n\n```bash\n/skill project-planner --plan \"Task description\"\n```\n\nOutput: Creates task in tasks.json with auto-generated ID.\n\n### Update Task Status\n\nUpdate task status in tasks.json:\n\n```bash\n/skill project-planner --update-task TASK-001 --status comple","body":"# Project Planner\n\n## Overview\n\nManages task planning, tracking, and updates to tasks.json. Handles task dependencies, priorities, and status updates.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Create Task Plan\n\nCreate a new task with appropriate priority and dependencies:\n\n```bash\n/skill project-planner --plan \"Task description\"\n```\n\nOutput: Creates task in tasks.json with auto-generated ID.\n\n### Update Task Status\n\nUpdate task status in tasks.json:\n\n```bash\n/skill project-planner --update-task TASK-001 --status completed --passes true\n```\n\nSee [conventions.md](../references/conventions.md#task-status-values) for status values.\n\n### List Tasks\n\nShow all tasks with status and dependencies:\n\n```bash\n/skill project-planner --list-tasks\n```\n\n### Add Dependency\n\nCreate dependency relationship between tasks:\n\n```bash\n/skill project-planner --add-dependency TASK-002 --depends-on TASK-001\n```\n\n## Task Schema\n\nSee [conventions.md](../references/conventions.md#task-schema) for complete schema.\n\n## Priority Levels\n\nSee [conventions.md](../references/conventions.md#task-priority-levels) for priority definitions.\n\n## Dependency Rules\n\n1. **NEVER create circular dependencies** - Task A depends on B, B depends on A\n2. **ALWAYS validate dependencies exist** - Check referenced task IDs exist\n3. **DEPENDENT tasks auto-block** - Task B blocked until Task A completes\n4. **UPDATES unlock dependents** - Marking Task A complete unblocks Task B\n\n## Return Contract\n\nSee [return-contract.md](../references/return-contract.md).\n\n## Safety Rules\n\n1. **NEVER delete tasks** - Mark as `cancelled` instead\n2. **ALWAYS update updatedAt** - Set timestamp on every modification\n3. **ALWAYS set passes=true** - Only when task is truly complete\n4. **NEVER skip validation** - Check dependencies exist before adding\n5. **ALWAYS preserve structure** - Maintain JSON schema integrity\n\nSee [safety-rules.md](../references/safety-rules.md#write-operations) for patterns.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- **If tasks.json doesn''t exist**: Create with empty tasks array, set version: \"1.0.0\", notify user\n- **If dependency doesn''t exist**: Report error with missing task ID, do not add, suggest valid task IDs\n- **If circular dependency detected**: Report the cycle (A -> B -> C -> A), do not apply changes\n\nSee [error-handling.md](../references/error-handling.md) for patterns.\n\n## Example\n\n```\nUser: /skill project-planner --update-task TASK-001 --status completed --passes true\n\nStatus: SUCCESS\n\nSummary:\n- Updated TASK-001 status to completed\n- Set passes=true for TASK-001\n- Unblocked dependent tasks: TASK-002, TASK-003\n\nFiles changed:\n- tasks.json\n\nCommands run:\n- None (direct file edit)\n\nEvidence:\n- TASK-001: completed (passes=true)\n- TASK-002: pending (previously blocked)\n- TASK-003: pending (previously blocked)\n\nNext recommended:\n- node bin/dw.js pick-next\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T15:07:16.870Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing project organization and task dependency handling capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要项目组织和任务依赖处理能力的任务管理代理。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントがプロジェクトの組織化とタスクの依存関係の処理能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"프로젝트 조직 및 작업 종속성 처리 기능이 필요한 작업 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de tareas que necesitan organización de proyectos y capacidad de gestión de dependencias de tareas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de tâches nécessitant une organisation de projet et des capacités de gestion de dépendances de tâches.","de":"Perfekt für Task-Management-Agents, die Projektorganisation und Aufgabenabhängigkeitsverwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que necessitam de organização de projetos e capacidades de manipulação de dependência de tarefas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, которым необходимы организация проектов и возможности обработки зависимостей задач.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المهام الذي يحتاج إلى تنظيم المشروع ومعالجة الإعتماد بين المهام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage task planning, tracking, and updates using JSON files, handling task dependencies, priorities, and status updates via commands like --plan and --update-task.","zh":"使代理能够使用JSON文件管理任务规划、跟踪和更新，处理任务依赖、优先级和状态更新，通过诸如--plan和--update-task的命令。","ja":"エージェントがJSONファイルを使用してタスクの計画、追跡、更新を管理し、タスクの依存関係、優先順位、ステータスの更新を--planや--update-taskなどのコマンドで処理できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 JSON 파일을 사용하여 작업 계획, 추적, 업데이트를 관리하고 작업 종속성, 우선 순위, 상태 업데이트를 --plan 및 --update-task와 같은 명령으로 처리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar la planificación de tareas, el seguimiento y las actualizaciones mediante archivos JSON, gestionando dependencias de tareas, prioridades y actualizaciones de estado mediante comandos como --plan y --update-task.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer la planification de tâches, le suivi et les mises à jour à l''aide de fichiers JSON, en gérant les dépendances de tâches, les priorités et les mises à jour de statut via des commandes comme --plan et --update-task.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Aufgabenplanung, Nachverfolgung und Updates mithilfe von JSON-Dateien zu verwalten, wobei Aufgabenabhängigkeiten, Prioritäten und Statusupdates über Befehle wie --plan und --update-task gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o planejamento de tarefas, o rastreamento e as atualizações usando arquivos JSON, manipulando dependências de tarefas, prioridades e atualizações de status por meio de comandos como --plan e --update-task.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять планированием задач, отслеживанием и обновлениями с помощью файлов JSON, обрабатывая зависимости задач, приоритеты и обновления статуса с помощью команд, таких как --plan и --update-task.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل إمكانية إدارة تخطيط المهام وتتبعها وتحديثها باستخدام ملفات JSON، ومعالجة الإعتماد بين المهام والأولويات وتحديث الحالة عبر أوامر مثل --plan و --update-task."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new task plans with dependencies","Updating task status in tasks.json files","Tracking task priorities and status updates"],"zh":["使用依赖关系创建新任务计划","在tasks.json文件中更新任务状态","跟踪任务优先级和状态更新"],"ja":["依存関係を使用して新しいタスク計画を作成する","tasks.jsonファイルでタスクのステータスを更新する","タスクの優先順位とステータスの更新を追跡する"],"ko":["의존 관계를 사용하여 새로운 작업 계획을 생성하는 것","tasks.json 파일에서 작업 상태를 업데이트하는 것","작업의 우선 순위 및 상태 업데이트를 추적하는 것"],"es":["Creación de nuevos planes de tareas con dependencias","Actualización del estado de la tarea en archivos tasks.json","Seguimiento de prioridades y actualizaciones de estado de las tareas"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux plans de tâches avec dépendances","Mise à jour du statut de la tâche dans les fichiers tasks.json","Suivi des priorités et des mises à jour de statut des tâches"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Aufgabenpläne mit Abhängigkeiten","Aktualisierung des Aufgabenstatus in tasks.json-Dateien","Nachverfolgung von Prioritäten und Statusupdates von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Criar novos planos de tarefas com dependências","Atualizar o status da tarefa em arquivos tasks.json","Rastrear prioridades e atualizações de status das tarefas"],"ru":["Создание новых планов задач с зависимостями","Обновление статуса задачи в файлах tasks.json","Отслеживание приоритетов и обновлений статуса задач"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط مهام جديدة مع الإعتماد بينها","تحديث حالة المهمة في ملفات tasks.json","تتبع الأولويات وتحديثات الحالة للمهام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires tasks.json file access","Limited to text-based command interactions"],"zh":["需要访问tasks.json文件","仅限于基于文本的命令交互"],"ja":["tasks.jsonファイルへのアクセスが必要","テキストベースのコマンド交互に限定される"],"ko":["tasks.json 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요함","텍스트 기반 명령 상호 작용으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo tasks.json","Limitado a interacciones de comandos basados en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au fichier tasks.json","Limité aux interactions de commande basées sur du texte"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die tasks.json-Datei","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Befehlsinteraktionen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao arquivo tasks.json","Limitado a interações de comando baseadas em texto"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу tasks.json","Ограничен текстовыми интеракциями команд"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف tasks.json","محدود بالتفاعلات النصية للأوامر"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"396a3b144e537142b23c73f7a888c36ee00e46874e2ee0616946668111587e16","qualityScore":34}');
