und Networking","Ressourcen zum Lernen von Python, React und Node.js","Zugang zu Entwicklungstools wie CLI und Agent"],"pt":["Aplicações de cursos personalizadas","Registros de eventos e gerenciamento de presença","Comunidades de aprendizado e fóruns de discussão","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento como React e Node.js","Suporte a linguagens de programação como Python e CLI"],"ru":["Пользовательские приложения курсов","Регистрация мероприятий и управление посещаемостью","Обучающие сообщества и форумы обсуждения","Интеграция с инструментами разработки как React и Node.js","Поддержка языков программирования как Python и CLI"],"ar":["تطبيقات دورات مخصصة","تسجيلات الفعاليات و إدارة الحضور","مجتمعات التعلم و مناقشات المنتدى","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير مثل React و Node.js","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل Python و CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用start-dev","什么是AI智能工具","start-dev替代品","start-dev与其他开发者工具的比较","start-dev安装","start-dev设置指南","开发者教育平台","AI智能工具开发"],"ja":["start-devの使い方","AIエージェントとは","start-devの代替","start-devと他の開発者ツールの比較","start-devのインストール","start-devの設定ガイド","開発者教育プラットフォーム","AIエージェント開発"],"ko":["start-dev 사용법","AI 에이전트란","start-dev 대체","start-dev와 다른 개발자 도구 비교","start-dev 설치","start-dev 설정 가이드","개발자 교육 플랫폼","AI 에이전트 개발"],"es":["cómo usar start-dev","qué es start-dev","alternativas a start-dev","start-dev vs Udemy","instalación de start-dev","guía de configuración de start-dev","desarrollo de aplicaciones con start-dev","cursos de Python en start-dev"],"fr":["comment utiliser start-dev","qu''est-ce que start-dev","alternatives à start-dev","start-dev vs Udemy","installation de start-dev","guide de configuration de start-dev","développement d''applications avec start-dev","cours de Python sur start-dev"],"de":["wie man start-dev verwendet","was ist start-dev","alternativen zu start-dev","start-dev vs Udemy","installation von start-dev","anleitung zur konfiguration von start-dev","entwicklung von anwendungen mit start-dev","python-kurse auf start-dev"],"pt":["como usar start-dev","o que é start-dev","start-dev alternativa","start-dev vs plataforma de educação","instalar start-dev","guia de configuração do start-dev","desenvolvimento de aplicações com start-dev","start-dev para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать start-dev","что такое start-dev","start-dev альтернатива","start-dev vs платформа образования","установить start-dev","руководство по настройке start-dev","разработка приложений с start-dev","start-dev для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام start-dev","ما هي start-dev","بديل start-dev","start-dev مقابل منصة التعليم","تثبيت start-dev","دليل إعداد start-dev","تطوير التطبيقات مع start-dev","start-dev للمطورين"]}},"owner":"eduhub-org","repo":"eduhub","repoPath":"eduhub-org/eduhub","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.796Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"start-dev","description":"Start EduHub development environment with Docker. Use when the user asks to start dev server, run locally, start development, or set up the environment.","bodyPreview":"# Start Development Environment\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# From project root\ndocker compose up\n```\n\nThis starts all services:\n- **Frontend**: http://localhost:5000 (edu-hub), http://localhost:5001 (rent-a-scientist)\n- **Hasura Console**: http://localhost:8080\n- **Keycloak**: http://localhost:28080\n\n## Individual Services\n\n```bash\n# Start specific services\ndocker compose up frontend-nx hasura\n\n# Start in background\ndocker compose up -d\n\n# View logs for specific service\ndocker compose logs -f fron","body":"# Start Development Environment\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# From project root\ndocker compose up\n```\n\nThis starts all services:\n- **Frontend**: http://localhost:5000 (edu-hub), http://localhost:5001 (rent-a-scientist)\n- **Hasura Console**: http://localhost:8080\n- **Keycloak**: http://localhost:28080\n\n## Individual Services\n\n```bash\n# Start specific services\ndocker compose up frontend-nx hasura\n\n# Start in background\ndocker compose up -d\n\n# View logs for specific service\ndocker compose logs -f frontend-nx\n```\n\n## Service Overview\n\n| Service | Port | Description |\n|---------|------|-------------|\n| frontend-nx | 5000, 5001 | Next.js apps |\n| hasura | 8080 | GraphQL API |\n| keycloak | 28080 | Authentication |\n| db_hasura | 5432 | PostgreSQL |\n| node_functions | 42000-42024 | Serverless functions |\n| python_functions | 42025-42026 | Python functions |\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Rebuild containers\n```bash\ndocker compose up --build\n```\n\n### Reset database\n```bash\ndocker compose down -v\ndocker compose up\n```\n\n### Stop all services\n```bash\ndocker compose down\n```\n\n## Hasura Console\n\nRun locally for migrations (not in Docker):\n```bash\ncd backend\nhasura console --admin-secret myadminsecretkey\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:28:29.493Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing comprehensive development environment setup with Docker and Hasura","zh":"非常适合需要利用 Docker 和 Hasura 设置全面开发环境的 Full Stack Agent","ja":"Docker と Hasura を使用した包括的な開発環境のセットアップを必要とする Full Stack Agent に最適です","ko":"Docker 및 Hasura를 사용한 포괄적인 개발 환경 설정이 필요한 Full Stack Agent에 완벽합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan un entorno de desarrollo integral con Docker y Hasura","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''un environnement de développement complet avec Docker et Hasura","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine umfassende Entwicklungsumgebung mit Docker und Hasura benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de um ambiente de desenvolvimento abrangente com Docker e Hasura","ru":"Идеально для агентов Full Stack, которым требуется комплексная среда разработки с Docker и Hasura","ar":"مثالي لعميلات الويب الكاملة التي تحتاج إلى إعداد بيئة تطوير شاملة مع Docker و Hasura"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to rapidly deploy and manage multi-service applications using Docker Compose, Hasura Console, and Keycloak, streamlining development with efficient service management and logging capabilities via protocols like HTTP","zh":"使 Agent 能够使用 Docker Compose、Hasura Console 和 Keycloak 快速部署和管理多服务应用程序，通过 HTTP 等协议实现高效的服务管理和日志记录功能，从而简化开发流程","ja":"Docker Compose、Hasura Console、および Keycloak を使用して、マルチサービスアプリケーションを迅速にデプロイおよび管理する能力を Agent に付与し、HTTP などのプロトコルによる効率的なサービス管理とロギング機能により開発を効率化します","ko":"Docker Compose, Hasura Console 및 Keycloak을 사용하여 다중 서비스 애플리케이션을 빠르게 배포하고 관리할 수 있는 능력을 Agent에 부여하며, HTTP와 같은 프로토콜을 통한 효율적인 서비스 관리 및 로깅 기능으로 개발 과정을 간소화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para implementar y gestionar rápidamente aplicaciones de varios servicios utilizando Docker Compose, Hasura Console y Keycloak, racionalizando el desarrollo con una gestión de servicios eficiente y capacidades de registro a través de protocolos como HTTP","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer et de gérer rapidement des applications à plusieurs services en utilisant Docker Compose, Hasura Console et Keycloak, en rationalisant le développement avec une gestion de services efficace et des capacités de journalisation via des protocoles comme HTTP","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, mehrservicige Anwendungen mit Docker Compose, Hasura Console und Keycloak schnell zu bereitstellen und zu verwalten, wodurch die Entwicklung durch effizientes Service-Management und Protokollierungsfunktionen über Protokolle wie HTTP rationalisiert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar e gerenciar rapidamente aplicações de vários serviços usando Docker Compose, Hasura Console e Keycloak, racionalizando o desenvolvimento com gerenciamento eficiente de serviços e capacidades de registro por meio de protocolos como HTTP","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью быстро развертывать и управлять многосервисными приложениями с помощью Docker Compose, Hasura Console и Keycloak, оптимизируя разработку за счет эффективного управления сервисами и возможностей ведения журнала через протоколы, такие как HTTP","ar":"تمكّن العميل من نشر وإدارة تطبيقات متعددة الخدمات بسرعة باستخدام Docker Compose و Hasura Console و Keycloak، وتبسيط التطوير بفضل إدارة الخدمات الكفء وقدرات التسجيل عبر بروتوكولات مثل HTTP"},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing development environments with Docker Compose","Managing multiple services like Frontend and Hasura Console","Debugging applications using Docker logs"],"zh":["使用 Docker Compose 初始化开发环境","管理多个服务，如 Frontend 和 Hasura Console","使用 Docker 日志调试应用程序"],"ja":["Docker Compose を使用した開発環境の初期化","Frontend や Hasura Console などの複数のサービスの管理","Docker ログを使用したアプリケーションのデバッグ"],"ko":["Docker Compose를 사용한 개발 환경 초기화","Frontend 및 Hasura Console과 같은 여러 서비스 관리","Docker 로그를 사용한 애플리케이션 디버깅"],"es":["Inicialización de entornos de desarrollo con Docker Compose","Gestión de varios servicios como Frontend y Hasura Console","Depuración de aplicaciones mediante registros de Docker"],"fr":["Initialisation des environnements de développement avec Docker Compose","Gestion de plusieurs services comme Frontend et Hasura Console","Débogage des applications à l''aide des journaux Docker"],"de":["Initialisierung von Entwicklungsumgebungen mit Docker Compose","Verwaltung mehrerer Dienste wie Frontend und Hasura Console","Fehlerbehebung von Anwendungen mithilfe von Docker-Protokollen"],"pt":["Inicializar ambientes de desenvolvimento com Docker Compose","Gerenciar vários serviços como Frontend e Hasura Console","Depurar aplicações usando logs do Docker"],"ru":["Инициализировать среды разработки с помощью Docker Compose","Управлять несколькими сервисами, такими как Frontend и Hasura Console","Отлаживать приложения, используя журналы Docker"],"ar":["تهيئة بيئات التطوير مع Docker Compose","إدارة خدمات متعددة مثل Frontend و Hasura Console","تصحيح الأخطاء في التطبيقات باستخدام سجلات Docker"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker installation","Limited to services defined in Docker Compose configuration"],"zh":["需要安装 Docker","仅限于 Docker Compose 配置中定义的服务"],"ja":["Docker のインストールが必要","Docker Compose 構成で定義されたサービスに限定される"],"ko":["Docker 설치 필요","Docker Compose 구성에 정의된 서비스로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Docker","Limitado a los servicios definidos en la configuración de Docker Compose"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Docker","Limité aux services définis dans la configuration de Docker Compose"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Docker","Begrenzt auf die in der Docker-Compose-Konfiguration definierten Dienste"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Docker","Limitado aos serviços definidos na configuração do Docker Compose"],"ru":["Требуется установка Docker","Ограничен сервисами, определёнными в конфигурации Docker Compose"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Docker","محدود بالخدمات المحددة في تكوين Docker Compose"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e5c05594bc94c88dfe5445ad031ec69ba277880ca579c40252beb054708ee78c","qualityScore":33}');
