て競争する","ko":"Melee AI 토너먼트에서는 Moltbots 참가자가 Slippi 네트워크 플레이를 통해 경쟁합니다","es":"Moltbots es una herramienta de AI para torneos de Melee que permite a los luchadores competir en Slippi netplay","fr":"Moltbots est un outil d''IA pour les tournois de Melee qui permet aux combattants de compétir sur Slippi netplay","de":"Moltbots ist ein KI-Tool für Melee-Turniere, das es Kämpfern ermöglicht, über Slippi-Netzspiel zu konkurrieren","pt":"O troubleshoot é uma habilidade de IA que melhora a competição em torneios de luta com Moltbots e Slippi netplay","ru":"Troubleshoot - это навык ИИ, который улучшает соревнование в турнирах по боям с Moltbots и Slippi netplay","ar":"تروبleshoot هو مهارة ذكاء اصطناعي تحسن المنافسة في المباريات القتالية مع Moltbots و Slippi netplay","en":"Melee AI tournaments for Moltbots — pluggable fighters compete over Slippi netplay"},"definition":{"en":"Melee AI tournaments for Moltbots — pluggable fighters compete over Slippi netplay"},"features":{"zh":["Melee AI锦标赛支持","Moltbots参与者竞争","Slippi网游集成","AI智能体排除故障","实时竞争支持"],"ja":["Melee AIトーナメントのサポート","Moltbots参加者の競争","Slippiネットプレイの統合","AIエージェントのトラブルシューティング","リアルタイム競争のサポート"],"ko":["Melee AI 토너먼트 지원","Moltbots 참가자 경쟁","Slippi 네트워크 플레이 통합","AI 에이전트 문제 해결","실시간 경쟁 지원"],"es":["Torneos de Melee en línea","Luchadores personalizables","Competición en Slippi netplay","Integración con herramientas de AI","Análisis de datos de competición"],"fr":["Tournois de Melee en ligne","Combattants personnalisables","Compétition sur Slippi netplay","Intégration avec des outils d''IA","Analyse de données de compétition"],"de":["Melee-Turniere online","Anpassbare Kämpfer","Wettbewerb über Slippi-Netzspiel","Integration mit KI-Tools","Datenanalyse von Wettbewerben"],"pt":["Melhoria da competição em torneios de luta","Integração com Moltbots e Slippi netplay","Análise de desempenho de lutadores","Otimização de estratégias de luta","Suporte a múltiplos modos de jogo"],"ru":["Улучшение соревнования в турнирах по боям","Интеграция с Moltbots и Slippi netplay","Анализ результатов боев","Оптимизация стратегий боя","Поддержка нескольких режимов игры"],"ar":["تحسين المنافسة في المباريات القتالية","التكامل مع Moltbots و Slippi netplay","تحليل أداء المقاتلين","تحسين استراتيجيات القتال","دعم أنماط لعب متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体","Melee AI锦标赛","Moltbots","Slippi网游","AI排除故障","如何使用AI智能体","AI智能体是什么","Melee AI锦标赛安装","Moltbots设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Melee AIトーナメント","Moltbots","Slippiネットプレイ","AIエージェントのトラブルシューティング","AIエージェントの使用方法","AIエージェントとは","Melee AIトーナメントのインストール","Moltbotsの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Melee AI 토너먼트","Moltbots","Slippi 네트워크 플레이","AI 에이전트 문제 해결","AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","Melee AI 토너먼트 설치","Moltbots 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para Melee","torneos de Melee en línea","cómo usar Moltbots","Moltbots vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de Moltbots","guía de configuración de Moltbots","Melee AI","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para juegos"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour Melee","tournois de Melee en ligne","comment utiliser Moltbots","Moltbots vs autres outils d''IA","installation de Moltbots","guide de configuration de Moltbots","Melee IA","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour jeux"],"de":["KI-Tools für Melee","Melee-Turniere online","wie man Moltbots verwendet","Moltbots vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von Moltbots","Konfigurationsanleitung für Moltbots","Melee KI","KI-Tools für Spiele"],"pt":["como usar troubleshoot","o que é troubleshoot","troubleshoot vs Moltbots","instalar troubleshoot","guia de configuração do troubleshoot","troubleshoot para torneios de luta","melhorias de desempenho com troubleshoot","estratégias de luta com troubleshoot"],"ru":["как использовать troubleshoot","что такое troubleshoot","troubleshoot vs Moltbots","установка troubleshoot","руководство по настройке troubleshoot","troubleshoot для турниров по боям","улучшение производительности с troubleshoot","стратегии боя с troubleshoot"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام تروبleshoot","ما هو تروبleshoot","تروبleshoot مقابل Moltbots","تثبيت تروبleshoot","دليل إعداد تروبleshoot","تروبleshoot للمباريات القتالية","تحسين الأداء مع تروبleshoot","استراتيجيات القتال مع تروبleshoot"]}},"owner":"ScavieFae","repo":"nojohns","repoPath":"ScavieFae/nojohns","stars":8,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T23:42:48Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"troubleshoot","description":"Diagnose No Johns setup issues. Checks Python, Dolphin, ISO, arena connectivity, and common problems.","bodyPreview":"# Setup Troubleshooter\n\nDiagnose and fix common No Johns setup problems. Run each check in order\nand report findings at the end.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. System Check\n\n```bash\n# OS and architecture\nuname -a\n\n# Python version (must be 3.12.x, NOT 3.13)\npython3.12 --version 2>/dev/null || python3 --version\n\n# Check if venv exists\nls -la .venv/bin/python 2>/dev/null && echo \"Venv OK\" || echo \"PROBLEM: No .venv found\"\n\n# Check venv Python version\n.venv/bin/python --version 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n**Expected:** Py","body":"# Setup Troubleshooter\n\nDiagnose and fix common No Johns setup problems. Run each check in order\nand report findings at the end.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. System Check\n\n```bash\n# OS and architecture\nuname -a\n\n# Python version (must be 3.12.x, NOT 3.13)\npython3.12 --version 2>/dev/null || python3 --version\n\n# Check if venv exists\nls -la .venv/bin/python 2>/dev/null && echo \"Venv OK\" || echo \"PROBLEM: No .venv found\"\n\n# Check venv Python version\n.venv/bin/python --version 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n**Expected:** Python 3.12.x. If 3.13, pyenet won''t build. If no venv, user\nneeds `python3.12 -m venv .venv`.\n\n### 2. Package Check\n\n```bash\n# libmelee (critical — the Dolphin interface)\n.venv/bin/python -c \"import melee; print(''libmelee OK'')\" 2>&1\n\n# pyenet (libmelee dependency — C extension, common build failure)\n.venv/bin/python -c \"import enet; print(''pyenet OK'')\" 2>&1\n\n# nojohns CLI\n.venv/bin/python -m nojohns.cli list-fighters 2>&1\n\n# TensorFlow (only needed for Phillip)\n.venv/bin/python -c \"import tensorflow as tf; print(f''TF {tf.__version__} OK'')\" 2>&1\n\n# slippi-ai (Phillip runtime)\n.venv/bin/python -c \"import slippi_ai; print(''slippi-ai OK'')\" 2>&1\n```\n\n**Common failures:**\n- `import enet` fails → pyenet build issue. See `docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md` \"pyenet Build Failure\"\n  - macOS fix: `LDFLAGS=\"-L/opt/homebrew/lib -lenet\" CFLAGS=\"-I/opt/homebrew/include\" .venv/bin/pip install --no-cache-dir --no-binary :all: pyenet`\n  - Linux fix: `sudo apt install -y libenet-dev && .venv/bin/pip install --force-reinstall pyenet`\n- `import melee` fails → libmelee not installed. Run `.venv/bin/pip install -e .`\n- `import tensorflow` fails with `mutex lock` → TF 2.20 on macOS ARM. Fix: `.venv/bin/pip install \"tensorflow==2.18.1\" \"tf-keras==2.18.0\"`\n\n### 3. Config Check\n\n```bash\n# Config file exists\ncat ~/.nojohns/config.toml 2>/dev/null || echo \"PROBLEM: No config.toml — run ''nojohns setup melee''\"\n```\n\nVerify these fields in `~/.nojohns/config.toml`:\n\n- **`dolphin_path`**: Must exist and contain \"netplay\" in the path string (libmelee validates this)\n  - macOS: `~/Library/Application Support/Slippi Launcher/netplay`\n  - Linux: `~/.config/Slippi Launcher/netplay`\n- **`iso_path`**: Must exist and be >500MB (a real Melee ISO is ~1.3GB)\n- **`connect_code`**: Format `XXXX#NNN` (4 letters, hash, 1-3 digits). Avoid codes with ''9'' on macOS Sequoia.\n\n```bash\n# Verify Dolphin path exists\nDOLPHIN_PATH=$(python3 -c \"\nimport tomllib\nwith open(''$HOME/.nojohns/config.toml'', ''rb'') as f:\n    c = tomllib.load(f)\nprint(c.get(''games'', {}).get(''melee'', {}).get(''dolphin_path'', ''NOT SET''))\n\" 2>/dev/null)\necho \"Dolphin path: $DOLPHIN_PATH\"\nls \"$DOLPHIN_PATH\" 2>/dev/null && echo \"Path OK\" || echo \"PROBLEM: Path does not exist\"\n\n# Verify ISO exists and check size\nISO_PATH=$(python3 -c \"\nimport tomllib\nwith open(''$HOME/.nojohns/config.toml'', ''rb'') as f:\n    c = tomllib.load(f)\nprint(c.get(''games'', {}).get(''melee'', {}).get(''iso_path'', ''NOT SET''))\n\" 2>/dev/null)\necho \"ISO path: $ISO_PATH\"\nls -la \"$ISO_PATH\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"PROBLEM: ISO file not found\"\n```\n\n### 4. Dolphin Check\n\n```bash\n# macOS: Check Gatekeeper isn''t blocking Dolphin\n# (only relevant on macOS)\nif [[ \"$(uname)\" == \"Darwin\" ]]; then\n    DOLPHIN_APP=\"$HOME/Library/Application Support/Slippi Launcher/netplay/Slippi Dolphin.app\"\n    if [ -d \"$DOLPHIN_APP\" ]; then\n        echo \"Dolphin app found\"\n        xattr -l \"$DOLPHIN_APP\" 2>/dev/null | grep -q quarantine && \\\n            echo \"PROBLEM: Gatekeeper quarantine active. Fix: xattr -cr \\\"$DOLPHIN_APP\\\"\" || \\\n            echo \"Gatekeeper OK\"\n    else\n        echo \"PROBLEM: Dolphin.app not found at expected location\"\n        echo \"Open Slippi Launcher and let it download Dolphin\"\n    fi\nfi\n\n# Linux: Check Dolphin binary exists\nif [[ \"$(uname)\" == \"Linux\" ]]; then\n    NETPLAY_DIR=\"$HOME/.config/Slippi Launcher/netplay\"\n    if [ -d \"$NETPLAY_DIR\" ]; then\n        echo \"Slippi netplay dir found\"\n        find \"$NETPLAY_DIR\" -name \"dolphin-emu\" -o -name \"*.AppImage\" 2>/dev/null\n    else\n        echo \"PROBLEM: Slippi netplay directory not found\"\n    fi\nfi\n```\n\n### 5. Phillip Check\n\n```bash\n# Model weights exist\nMODEL=\"fighters/phillip/models/all_d21_imitation_v3.pkl\"\nif [ -f \"$MODEL\" ]; then\n    SIZE=$(wc -c < \"$MODEL\")\n    echo \"Model weights: $SIZE bytes\"\n    if [ \"$SIZE\" -lt 1000000 ]; then\n        echo \"PROBLEM: Model file too small — may be corrupted\"\n    else\n        echo \"Model OK\"\n    fi\nelse\n    echo \"PROBLEM: Model weights not found. Run: nojohns setup melee phillip\"\nfi\n\n# slippi-ai installed\nif [ -d \"fighters/phillip/slippi-ai\" ]; then\n    echo \"slippi-ai repo OK\"\nelse\n    echo \"PROBLEM: slippi-ai not cloned. Run: nojohns setup melee phillip\"\nfi\n```\n\n### 6. Network Check\n\n```bash\n# Arena reachable\nARENA_URL=$(python3 -c \"\nimport tomllib\nwith open(''$HOME/.nojohns/config.toml'', ''rb'') as f:\n    c = tomllib.load(f)\nprint(c.get(''arena'', {}).get(''url'', ''https://nojohns-arena-production.up.railway.app''))\n\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"https://nojohns-arena-production.up.railway.app\")\n\necho \"Arena URL: $ARENA_URL\"\ncurl -s --max-time 5 \"$ARENA_URL/health\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"PROBLEM: Arena unreachable\"\n```\n\n### 7. Known Issues Reference\n\nIf the checks above pass but things still don''t work, check these known issues\nin `docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md`:\n\n| Symptom | Issue | Fix |\n|---------|-------|-----|\n| Connect codes with ''9'' fail on Sequoia | Position 3 bug | Use a code without ''9'' |\n| Netplay freezes at stock loss | Rollback desync | Set `online_delay=6` |\n| Phillip doesn''t move in netplay | Missing `on_game_start` | Update to latest code |\n| `mutex lock failed` on TF import | TF 2.20 bug on ARM | Install TF 2.18.1 |\n| `Unknown path` from libmelee | Path missing \"netplay\" | Use Slippi Launcher''s netplay dir |\n| Menu stuck on 2nd+ match | libmelee state leak | Use subprocess per match |\n| CSS stuck at character select | Intermittent | Kill and restart matchmake |\n\n### 8. Report\n\nAfter running all checks, print a summary:\n\n```\n=== No Johns Setup Diagnostic ===\nSystem:     [OS, arch, Python version]\nPackages:   [OK / PROBLEMS: list]\nConfig:     [OK / PROBLEMS: list]\nDolphin:    [OK / PROBLEMS: list]\nPhillip:    [OK / PROBLEMS: list]\nNetwork:    [OK / PROBLEMS: list]\n\n[For each PROBLEM, include the specific fix command]\n```\n\nIf everything passes: \"Setup looks good. Try `nojohns fight random do-nothing` for a smoke test.\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:35:46.571Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for System Administration Agents needing advanced troubleshooting capabilities for Python environments and network setups.","zh":"非常适合需要高级故障排除功能的 Python 环境和网络设置的系统管理代理。","ja":"Python 環境とネットワーク設定の高度なトラブルシューティング機能を必要とするシステム管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Python 환경과 네트워크 설정에 대한 고급 트러블슈팅 기능이 필요한 시스템 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de administración de sistemas que necesitan capacidades de solución de problemas avanzadas para entornos de Python y configuraciones de red.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''administration de système nécessitant des capacités de dépannage avancées pour les environnements Python et les configurations réseau.","de":"Perfekt für Systemadministration-Agenten, die erweiterte Fehlersuchfunktionen für Python-Umgebungen und Netzwerkeinstellungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Administração de Sistema que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de solução de problemas para ambientes Python e configurações de rede.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов системного администрирования, которым необходимы расширенные возможности поиска и устранения неисправностей для сред Python и настроек сети.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الإداريين للنظام الذين يحتاجون إلى возможات متقدمة لتحليل الأعطال لبيئات Python وإعدادات الشبكة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to diagnose and fix common setup problems using Unix commands like uname and Python version checks, ensuring seamless operation over protocols like Slippi netplay.","zh":"赋予代理诊断和修复常见设置问题的能力，使用 Unix 命令如 uname 和 Python 版本检查，确保在 Slippi 网络游戏等协议上进行无缝操作。","ja":"Unix コマンド (uname など) と Python バージョン チェックを使用して、一般的なセットアップの問題を診断して修復するエージェントを可能にし、Slippi ネットプレイなどのプロトコル上でのシームレスな運用を確保します。","ko":"Unix 명령어(uame 등)와 Python 버전 확인을 사용하여 일반적인 설정 문제를 진단하고 수정할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, Slippi 네트워크 게임과 같은 프로토콜에서 원활한 작동을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diagnosticar y solucionar problemas de configuración comunes utilizando comandos de Unix como uname y comprobaciones de versión de Python, asegurando una operación sin problemas a través de protocolos como Slippi netplay.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diagnostiquer et de résoudre des problèmes de configuration courants en utilisant des commandes Unix comme uname et des vérifications de version Python, garantissant un fonctionnement sans problème sur des protocoles tels que Slippi netplay.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, gemeinsame Konfigurationsprobleme mithilfe von Unix-Befehlen wie uname und Python-Versionenprüfungen zu diagnostizieren und zu beheben, und stellt einen reibungslosen Betrieb über Protokolle wie Slippi netplay sicher.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a diagnosticar e corrigir problemas de configuração comuns usando comandos Unix como uname e verificações de versão do Python, garantindo operação sem interrupções sobre protocolos como Slippi netplay.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью диагностировать и исправлять общие проблемы настройки с помощью команд Unix, таких как uname, и проверок версии Python, обеспечивая бесперебойную работу по протоколам, таким как Slippi netplay.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تشخيص ومعالجة مشاكل الإعداد الشائعة باستخدام أوامر Unix مثل uname وعمليات فحص إصدار Python، مما يضمن التشغيل السلس عبر بروتوكولات مثل Slippi netplay."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging Python version inconsistencies","Identifying missing virtual environment setups","Troubleshooting network connectivity issues for melee AI tournaments"],"zh":["调试 Python 版本不一致问题","识别缺失的虚拟环境设置","排除 melee AI锦标赛的网络连接问题"],"ja":["Python バージョンの不一致をデバッグする","仮想環境設定が不足していることを特定する","melee AI トーナメントのネットワーク接続の問題をトラブルシューティングする"],"ko":["Python 버전 불일치 문제를 디버깅하는 것","가상 환경 설정이不足한 것을 식별하는 것","melee AI 토너먼트의 네트워크 연결 문제를 트러블슈팅하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de inconsistencias de versión de Python","Identificación de entornos virtuales de configuración que faltan","Solución de problemas de conectividad de red para torneos de inteligencia artificial de melee"],"fr":["Débogage des incohérences de version Python","Identification des configurations d''environnement virtuel manquantes","Dépannage des problèmes de connectivité réseau pour les tournois d''intelligence artificielle de melee"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Python-Versioneninkonsistenzen","Identifizierung fehlender virtueller Umgebungs-einstellungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Netzwerkverbindungsproblemen für melee-KI-Turniere"],"pt":["Depuração de inconsistências de versão do Python","Identificação de configurações de ambiente virtual ausentes","Solução de problemas de conectividade de rede para torneios de IA de melee"],"ru":["Отладка несоответствий версий Python","Определение отсутствующих настроек виртуальной среды","Устранение неполадок сети для турниров melee ИИ"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء عدم تطابق إصدار Python","تحديد الإعدادات الناقصة للبيئة الافتراضية","معالجة مشاكل الاتصال الشبكي لمنافسات الذكاء الاصطناعي melee"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Unix-like operating system","Python 3.12.x compatibility","Venv setup necessary"],"zh":["需要类 Unix 操作系统","Python 3.12.x 兼容性","Venv 设置必要"],"ja":["Unix 系列のオペレーティングシステムが必要","Python 3.12.x との互換性","Venv の設定が必要"],"ko":["Unix와 유사한 운영 체제가 필요","Python 3.12.x 호환성","Venv 설정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere un sistema operativo similar a Unix","Compatibilidad con Python 3.12.x","Configuración de Venv necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite un système d''exploitation de type Unix","Compatibilité Python 3.12.x","Configuration Venv nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt ein Unix-ähnliches Betriebssystem","Python 3.12.x-Kompatibilität","Venv-Setup erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer sistema operacional semelhante ao Unix","Compatibilidade com Python 3.12.x","Configuração de Venv necessária"],"ru":["Требуется операционная система, подобная Unix","Совместимость с Python 3.12.x","Необходима настройка Venv"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام تشغيل شبيه بنظام Unix","توافق مع Python 3.12.x","إعداد Venv ضروري"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"92eec89571bf7a53ca1fe8a2a19214309cf79f125dff1001f650eb341e7a2412","qualityScore":33}');
