on. Enables AI assistants to interact with LogicMonitor monitoring data through structured tools."},"features":{"zh":["实现LogicMonitor REST API v3集成","支持AI助手与监控数据的结构化交互","提高运维效率","提供结构化工具","支持MCP服务器"],"ja":["LogicMonitor REST API v3を統合","AIアシスタントと監視データの構造化ツールによる相互作用","運用効率の向上","構造化ツールの提供","MCPサーバーのサポート"],"ko":["LogicMonitor REST API v3 통합","AI 어시스턴트와 모니터링 데이터의 구조화된 상호 작용","운용 효율성 향상","구조화된 도구 제공","MCP 서버 지원"],"es":["Integración con la API de LogicMonitor REST v3","Interacción con datos de monitoreo estructurados","Compatibilidad con asistentes de AI","Herramientas de monitoreo estructuradas","Soporte para la integración de MCP"],"fr":["Intégration avec l''API LogicMonitor REST v3","Interaction avec des données de surveillance structurées","Compatibilité avec les assistants d''IA","Outils de surveillance structurés","Support pour l''intégration de MCP"],"de":["Integration mit der LogicMonitor-REST-API v3","Interaktion mit strukturierten Überwachungsdaten","Kompatibilität mit AI-Assistenten","Strukturierte Überwachungstools","Unterstützung für die Integration von MCP"],"pt":["Integração com API REST v3 do LogicMonitor","Acesso a dados de monitoramento estruturados","Suporte a assistentes de IA para automação","Ferramentas de monitoramento personalizáveis","Compatibilidade com servidores MCP"],"ru":["Интеграция с API REST v3 LogicMonitor","Доступ к структурированным данным мониторинга","Поддержка ИИ-агентов для автоматизации","Настраиваемые инструменты мониторинга","Совместимость с серверами MCP"],"ar":["التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST v3 من LogicMonitor","الوصول إلى بيانات المراقبة المنظمة","دعم الأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتحكم الآلي","أدوات مراقبة قابلة للتخصيص","التوافق مع خوادم MCP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["lm-portal","LogicMonitor REST API v3","AI智能代理","结构化交互","运维效率","MCP服务器","如何使用lm-portal","lm-portal安装","lm-portal设置"],"ja":["lm-portal","LogicMonitor REST API v3","AIエージェント","構造化ツール","運用効率","MCPサーバー","lm-portalの使い方","lm-portalのインストール","lm-portalの設定"],"ko":["lm-portal","LogicMonitor REST API v3","AI 에이전트","구조화된 도구","운용 효율성","MCP 서버","lm-portal 사용법","lm-portal 설치","lm-portal 설정"],"es":["herramientas de AI","integración de LogicMonitor","API de LogicMonitor REST v3","asistentes de AI","monitoreo de servidores","herramientas de monitoreo","guias de instalación de lm-portal","alternativas a lm-portal"],"fr":["outils d''IA","intégration de LogicMonitor","API LogicMonitor REST v3","assistants d''IA","surveillance de serveurs","outils de surveillance","guides d''installation de lm-portal","alternatives à lm-portal"],"de":["KI-Tools","Integration von LogicMonitor","LogicMonitor-REST-API v3","AI-Assistenten","Überwachung von Servern","Überwachungstools","Installationsanleitungen für lm-portal","Alternativen zu lm-portal"],"pt":["como usar lm-portal","o que é lm-portal","alternativas ao lm-portal","lm-portal vs outras ferramentas","instalar lm-portal","guia de configuração do lm-portal","ferramentas de ia para monitoramento","integração com api rest"],"ru":["как использовать lm-portal","что такое lm-portal","альтернативы lm-portal","lm-portal vs другие инструменты","установить lm-portal","руководство по настройке lm-portal","инструменты ИИ для мониторинга","интеграция с api rest"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام lm-portal","ما هو lm-portal","بديلات lm-portal","lm-portal مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت lm-portal","دليل إعداد lm-portal","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لمراقبة","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST"]}},"owner":"ryanmat","repo":"mcp-server-logicmonitor","repoPath":"ryanmat/mcp-server-logicmonitor","stars":3,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T15:08:24Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"lm-portal","description":"Portal-wide health overview -- alert breakdown, collector status, active SDTs, alert clusters, noise scoring, and down devices.","bodyPreview":"# LogicMonitor Portal Health Overview\n\nYou are a portal health analyst for LogicMonitor. Your job is to produce a\nportal-wide health snapshot suitable for shift handoffs, morning standups, or\non-call situation reports.\n\n## Argument Parsing\n\n- **hours_back** — Lookback window in hours (default: 4)\n\nIf no argument is provided, use a 4-hour window.\n\n## Workflow\n\nExecute these steps in order. Present findings incrementally.\n\n### Step 1: Alert Landscape\n\nGet the overall alert picture.\n\n1. Call `get_a","body":"# LogicMonitor Portal Health Overview\n\nYou are a portal health analyst for LogicMonitor. Your job is to produce a\nportal-wide health snapshot suitable for shift handoffs, morning standups, or\non-call situation reports.\n\n## Argument Parsing\n\n- **hours_back** — Lookback window in hours (default: 4)\n\nIf no argument is provided, use a 4-hour window.\n\n## Workflow\n\nExecute these steps in order. Present findings incrementally.\n\n### Step 1: Alert Landscape\n\nGet the overall alert picture.\n\n1. Call `get_alert_statistics` for the lookback window to get time-bucketed trends.\n2. Call `get_alerts` with `cleared=false` and `severity>=3` (critical) to get the\n   critical alert list.\n\nPresent a severity breakdown:\n\n```\n| Severity | Active | Trend ({hours_back}h) |\n|----------|--------|-----------------------|\n| Critical |   N    | rising/stable/falling |\n| Error    |   N    | rising/stable/falling |\n| Warning  |   N    | rising/stable/falling |\n| Total    |   N    |                       |\n```\n\nFlag if critical count is rising or above a notable threshold.\n\n### Step 2: Collector Status\n\nCall `get_collectors` to get all collector statuses.\n\nCategorize collectors:\n\n```\n| Status   | Count | Collectors          |\n|----------|-------|---------------------|\n| Up       |   N   |                     |\n| Down     |   N   | [list if any]       |\n| Degraded |   N   | [list if any]       |\n```\n\nIf any collectors are down, this is a high-priority finding. Down collectors\nmean monitored devices behind them are blind.\n\n### Step 3: Maintenance Windows\n\nCall `get_active_sdts` to get currently active scheduled downtime windows.\n\nPresent active SDTs:\n\n```\n| Type    | Target          | Started    | Ends       | Comment    |\n|---------|-----------------|------------|------------|------------|\n| Device  | [name]          | [time]     | [time]     | [comment]  |\n| Group   | [name]          | [time]     | [time]     | [comment]  |\n```\n\nNote: Alerts from SDT-covered resources are suppressed. If many critical alerts\ncoincide with SDT expirations, flag potential alert storms on SDT end.\n\n### Step 4: Alert Clustering\n\nCall `correlate_alerts` scoped to critical alerts from the lookback window.\n\nPresent the top 5 clusters:\n\n```\n## Top Alert Clusters\n\n1. **[common factor]** — N alerts\n   - [resource]: [alert summary]\n   - [resource]: [alert summary]\n   - Hypothesis: [likely root cause]\n\n2. ...\n```\n\nIdentify common factors: shared device group, shared datasource, shared collector,\ntemporal burst.\n\nIf no clusters are found, note that critical alerts appear independent.\n\n### Step 5: Noise Assessment\n\nCall `score_alert_noise` for the portal-wide alert set.\n\nReport:\n- Overall noise score (0-100)\n- Noise level: High (>70) / Moderate (40-70) / Low (<40)\n- Top noise offenders (alert rules, datasources, or device groups generating\n  the most noise)\n\nIf noise is high, recommend specific tuning actions.\n\n### Step 6: Down Devices\n\nCall `get_devices` filtered to `status=dead` (down/dead devices).\n\nPresent down devices:\n\n```\n| Device          | Groups            | Collector | Down Since |\n|-----------------|-------------------|-----------|------------|\n| [name]          | [group path]      | [id]      | [time]     |\n```\n\nApply heuristic: if >20 devices are down AND they share a collector, flag this\nas a likely collector issue rather than individual device failures.\n\nIf no devices are down, report that.\n\n### Step 7: Portal Summary\n\nCompile a shift-handoff-ready summary:\n\n```\n## Portal Health Snapshot — [timestamp]\n\n### Status: [GREEN / YELLOW / RED]\n\nCriteria:\n- GREEN: No critical alerts rising, all collectors up, noise < 40\n- YELLOW: Some critical alerts, or moderate noise, or degraded collectors\n- RED: Critical alerts rising, or collectors down, or noise > 70\n\n### Key Numbers\n- Active alerts: N (C critical, E error, W warning)\n- Collectors: N up, N down, N degraded\n- Active SDTs: N\n- Down devices: N\n- Noise score: NN/100\n\n### Key Concerns\n1. [Most important finding requiring action]\n2. [Second most important finding]\n3. [Third most important finding]\n\n### Recommended Actions\n1. [Highest priority action]\n2. [Second priority action]\n3. [Third priority action]\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T01:37:55.226Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for DevOps Monitoring Agents requiring real-time infrastructure health analysis and alert triage.","zh":"对于需要实时基础设施健康分析和警报分类的DevOps监控代理至关重要。","ja":"リアルタイムのインフラ健全性分析とアラートトリアージを必要とするDevOpsモニタリングエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"실시간 인프라 상태 분석 및 알림 분류가 필요한 DevOps 모니터링 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de monitoreo de DevOps que requieren análisis de salud de infraestructura en tiempo real y triage de alertas.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de surveillance DevOps nécessitant une analyse de la santé des infrastructures en temps réel et un triage d''alertes.","de":"Wesentlich für DevOps-Überwachungsagenten, die eine Echtzeit-Infrastrukturgesundheitsanalyse und eine Warnungs-Triage erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Monitoramento DevOps que exigem análise de saúde de infraestrutura em tempo real e triagem de alertas.","ru":"Необходим для агентов мониторинга DevOps, требующих анализа состояния инфраструктуры в режиме реального времени и классификации оповещений.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات وكيلات مراقبة DevOps التي تتطلب تحليل حالة البنية التحتية في الوقت الفعلي وترشيح التنبيهات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables AI assistants to directly query LogicMonitor''s REST API v3 for comprehensive monitoring data, providing structured tools for portal-wide health analysis and alert landscape assessment. This integration allows agents to automate shift handoffs and generate detailed situation reports without manual dashboard navigation.","zh":"使AI助手能够直接查询LogicMonitor的REST API v3以获取全面的监控数据，为整个门户的健康分析和警报态势评估提供结构化工具。此集成允许代理自动化轮班交接，并在无需手动导航仪表板的情况下生成详细的情况报告。","ja":"AIアシスタントがLogicMonitorのREST API v3を直接クエリし、包括的なモニタリングデータを取得できるようにし、ポータル全体の健全性分析とアラート状況評価のための構造化ツールを提供します。この統合により、エージェントは手動でのダッシュボード操作なしに、シフト引き継ぎを自動化し、詳細な状況報告書を生成できます。","ko":"AI 어시스턴트가 LogicMonitor의 REST API v3를 직접 쿼리하여 포괄적인 모니터링 데이터를 얻고, 포털 전반의 상태 분석 및 알림 상황 평가를 위한 구조화된 도구를 제공합니다. 이 통합을 통해 에이전트는 수동 대시보드 탐색 없이 교대 근무 인수를 자동화하고 상세한 상황 보고서를 생성할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los asistentes de IA consultar directamente la API REST v3 de LogicMonitor para obtener datos de monitoreo completos, proporcionando herramientas estructuradas para el análisis de salud y la evaluación del paisaje de alertas en todo el portal. Esta integración permite a los agentes automatizar la entrega de turnos y generar informes de situación detallados sin navegación manual en el panel de control.","fr":"Permet aux assistants IA d''interroger directement l''API REST v3 de LogicMonitor pour obtenir des données de surveillance complètes, fournissant des outils structurés pour l''analyse de la santé et l''évaluation du paysage d''alertes sur l''ensemble du portail. Cette intégration permet aux agents d''automatiser les passations de service et de générer des rapports de situation détaillés sans navigation manuelle dans le tableau de bord.","de":"Ermöglicht es AI-Assistenten, direkt auf die LogicMonitor-REST-API v3 zuzugreifen, um umfassende Überwachungsdaten zu erhalten, und bietet strukturierte Tools für die Gesundheitsanalyse und die Bewertung der Warnungslandschaft im gesamten Portal. Diese Integration ermöglicht es Agenten, Schichtübergaben zu automatisieren und detaillierte Lageberichte ohne manuelle Dashboard-Navigation zu erstellen.","pt":"Permite que os assistentes de IA consultem diretamente a API REST v3 do LogicMonitor para obtenção de dados de monitoramento abrangentes, fornecendo ferramentas estruturadas para análise de saúde em toda a portal e avaliação do cenário de alertas. Essa integração permite que os agentes automatizem a transferência de turnos e gerem relatórios de situação detalhados sem navegação manual no painel.","ru":"Позволяет ассистентам ИИ напрямую запрашивать API REST v3 LogicMonitor для получения комплексных данных мониторинга, предоставляя структурированные инструменты для анализа состояния портала и оценки ландшафта оповещений. Этот интеграция позволяет агентам автоматизировать передачу смен и генерировать подробные отчеты о ситуации без ручной навигации по панели.","ar":"يسمح للمساعدين الذكيين بالاستفسار مباشرة إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST v3 من LogicMonitor للحصول على بيانات مراقبة شاملة ، وتوفير أدوات منظمة لتحليل الصحة على مدار البوابة وتقييم مشهد التنبيهات. تسمح هذه الإضافة للوكيلات بتحسين نقل التحول وتوليد تقارير حالة مفصلة بدون التنقل اليدوي في لوحة القيادة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating portal-wide health snapshots for shift handoffs","Triaging alert landscapes during on-call incidents","Producing morning standup reports with 4-hour lookback windows","Automating situation reports for critical monitoring events"],"zh":["生成用于轮班交接的整个门户健康快照","在值班事件期间对警报态势进行分类","生成具有4小时回溯窗口的晨会报告","为关键监控事件自动生成情况报告"],"ja":["シフト引き継ぎのためのポータル全体の健全性スナップショットの生成","オンコールインシデント中のアラート状況のトリアージ","4時間のルックバックウィンドウを使用した朝のスタンドアップレポートの作成","重大なモニタリングイベントに対する状況報告の自動生成"],"ko":["교대 근무 인수를 위한 포털 전반 상태 스냅샷 생성","온콜 사건 발생 시 알림 상황 분류","4시간 회고 기간을 포함한 아침 스탠드업 보고서 생성","중요 모니터링 이벤트에 대한 상황 보고서 자동 생성"],"es":["Generar instantáneas de salud a nivel de portal para la entrega de turnos","Triar el paisaje de alertas durante incidentes de llamada","Producir informes de reunión matutina con ventanas de retroceso de 4 horas","Automatizar informes de situación para eventos de monitoreo críticos"],"fr":["Générer des instantanés de santé à l''échelle du portail pour les passations de service","Trier le paysage d''alertes pendant les incidents de appel","Produire des rapports de réunion matinale avec des fenêtres de rétrospection de 4 heures","Automatiser les rapports de situation pour les événements de surveillance critiques"],"de":["Erstellen von Gesundheitsschnappschüssen auf Portalebene für Schichtübergaben","Triagieren der Warnungslandschaft während On-Call-Incidenten","Erstellen von Morgenstandup-Berichten mit 4-Stunden-Rückblickfenstern","Automatisieren von Lageberichten für kritische Überwachungsereignisse"],"pt":["Gerar imagens de saúde em toda a portal para transferência de turnos","Classificar paisagens de alertas durante incidentes de chamada","Produzir relatórios de reunião matutina com janelas de olhar para trás de 4 horas","Automatizar relatórios de situação para eventos de monitoramento críticos"],"ru":["Генерировать снимки состояния портала для передачи смен","Классифицировать ландшафты оповещений во время инцидентов вызова","Производить отчеты утреннего собрания с окном обзора 4 часов","Автоматизировать отчеты о ситуации для критических событий мониторинга"],"ar":["توليد لقطات صحية على مدار البوابة لنقل التحول","ترشيح مناظير التنبيهات خلال حوادث الاتصال","إنتاج تقارير اجتماع الصباح مع نوافذ استعراض 4 ساعات","توليد تقارير حالة آليّة لأحداث المراقبة الحرجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LogicMonitor REST API v3 access credentials","Limited to 4-hour default lookback window without parameter override","Dependent on LogicMonitor''s API availability and rate limits"],"zh":["需要LogicMonitor REST API v3访问凭据","在没有参数覆盖的情况下，默认回溯窗口限制为4小时","依赖于LogicMonitor API的可用性和速率限制"],"ja":["LogicMonitor REST API v3のアクセス認証情報が必要","パラメータオーバーライドなしではデフォルトで4時間のルックバックウィンドウに制限される","LogicMonitor APIの可用性とレート制限に依存"],"ko":["LogicMonitor REST API v3 접근 자격 증명 필요","매개변수 재정의 없이는 기본 4시간 회고 기간으로 제한됨","LogicMonitor API 가용성 및速率 제한에 의존"],"es":["Requiere credenciales de acceso a la API REST v3 de LogicMonitor","Limitado a una ventana de retroceso predeterminada de 4 horas sin anulación de parámetros","Dependiente de la disponibilidad y los límites de velocidad de la API de LogicMonitor"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations d''identification d''accès à l''API REST v3 de LogicMonitor","Limité à une fenêtre de rétrospection par défaut de 4 heures sans contournement de paramètres","Dépend de la disponibilité et des limites de débit de l''API de LogicMonitor"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriffsberechtigungen für die LogicMonitor-REST-API v3","Begrenzt auf ein Standard-Rückblickfenster von 4 Stunden ohne Parameterüberschreibung","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit und den Rate Limits der LogicMonitor-API"],"pt":["Exige credenciais de acesso à API REST v3 do LogicMonitor","Limitado a janela de olhar para trás de 4 horas por defeito sem anulação de parâmetro","Dependente da disponibilidade e limites de taxa da API do LogicMonitor"],"ru":["Требует учетных данных доступа к API REST v3 LogicMonitor","Ограничен окном обзора 4 часов по умолчанию без переопределения параметра","Зависит от доступности и ограничений скорости API LogicMonitor"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات اعتماد الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST v3 من LogicMonitor","محدود بنافذة استعراض 4 ساعات افتراضيًا بدون إلغاء معامل","يعتمد على توافر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وحدود معدل LogicMonitor"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"35c784679387c24d846e4087a55d0134a63a883ed13ccab05c7cbbcd24949ab4","qualityScore":33}');
