es 배포 지원","풀스택 모노리포","상업용 애플리케이션을 빠르게 구축","프론트엔드 스타일 레이아웃 지원"],"es":["Integración de TypeSpec para contratos API","Despliegue en Kubernetes para escalabilidad","Arquitectura de monorepo para eficiencia","Soporte para aplicaciones de comercio rápido","Flexibilidad para personalización y ampliación"],"fr":["Intégration de TypeSpec pour les contrats API","Déploiement sur Kubernetes pour la scalabilité","Architecture de monorepo pour l''efficacité","Prise en charge des applications de commerce rapide","Flexibilité pour la personnalisation et l''extension"],"de":["Integration von TypeSpec für API-Verträge","Bereitstellung in Kubernetes für Skalierbarkeit","Monorepo-Architektur für Effizienz","Unterstützung für Schnellhandels-Apps","Flexibilität für Anpassung und Erweiterung"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento fullstack","Contratos API TypeSpec","Deploy no Kubernetes","Interface de usuário personalizada","Comércio rápido e escalável"],"ru":["Полный стек разработки","Контракты API TypeSpec","Развертывание в Kubernetes","Пользовательский интерфейс","Быстрый и масштабируемый коммерция"],"ar":["تطوير فول ستاك","عقود API TypeSpec","نشر Kubernetes","واجهة مستخدم مخصصة","تجارة سريعة وقابلة للتوسيع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能前端布局工具","TypeSpec API合同","Kubernetes部署","全栈monorepo","快速构建商业应用","前端样式布局","AI工具","前端开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント フロントエンドスタイルレイアウト","TypeSpec API契約","Kubernetesデプロイ","フルスタックmonorepo","商業アプリケーションを迅速に構築","フロントエンドスタイルレイアウト","AIエージェント","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 프론트엔드 스타일 레이아웃","TypeSpec API 계약","Kubernetes 배포","풀스택 모노리포","상업용 애플리케이션을 빠르게 구축","프론트엔드 스타일 레이아웃","AI 에이전트","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["cómo usar frontend-style-layout","qué es un monorepo de frontend-style-layout","herramientas de AI para comercio rápido","alternativas a frontend-style-layout","frontend-style-layout vs otros frameworks","instalación de frontend-style-layout","guía de configuración de frontend-style-layout"],"fr":["comment utiliser frontend-style-layout","qu''est-ce qu''un monorepo de frontend-style-layout","outils d''IA pour le commerce rapide","alternatives à frontend-style-layout","frontend-style-layout vs d''autres frameworks","installation de frontend-style-layout","guide de configuration de frontend-style-layout"],"de":["wie man frontend-style-layout verwendet","was ist ein frontend-style-layout-Monorepo","KI-Tools für Schnellhandel","Alternativen zu frontend-style-layout","frontend-style-layout vs andere Frameworks","Installation von frontend-style-layout","Konfigurationsanleitung für frontend-style-layout"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para frontend","como usar TypeSpec","o que é comércio rápido","alternativas para React","guia de instalação do Kubernetes","tutoriais de desenvolvimento fullstack"],"ru":["ИИ агенты для frontend","как использовать TypeSpec","что такое быстрый коммерция","альтернативы для React","руководство по установке Kubernetes","уроки полного стека разработки"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للواجهة الأمامية","كيفية استخدام TypeSpec","ما هو التجارة السريعة","بديلات لرياكت","دليل تركيب Kubernetes","دروس تطوير فول ستاك"]}},"owner":"p-iknow","repo":"fullstack-forge","repoPath":"p-iknow/fullstack-forge","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T14:46:47Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-style-layout","description":"Apply consistent styling and layout patterns with Tailwind v4. Use when building page layouts, choosing spacing methods, implementing responsive images, or migrating Tailwind v3 classes to v4. Covers Section Compound Pattern, spacing selection, CLS-free responsive images, and v4 class changes.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Style & Layout Patterns\n\nTailwind v4 styling patterns for this project. Covers page structure, spacing, responsive images, and v3→v4 migration.\n\n## 1. Section Compound Pattern\n\nExpress page layout structure explicitly using semantic HTML + Tailwind classes at the usage site.\n\n```tsx\n// ✅ Layout structure visible at a glance\nconst OrderListPage = () => (\n  <main className=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col\">\n    <header className=\"sticky top-0 z-10 bg-white border-b border-gray-200\">\n      <O","body":"# Frontend Style & Layout Patterns\n\nTailwind v4 styling patterns for this project. Covers page structure, spacing, responsive images, and v3→v4 migration.\n\n## 1. Section Compound Pattern\n\nExpress page layout structure explicitly using semantic HTML + Tailwind classes at the usage site.\n\n```tsx\n// ✅ Layout structure visible at a glance\nconst OrderListPage = () => (\n  <main className=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col\">\n    <header className=\"sticky top-0 z-10 bg-white border-b border-gray-200\">\n      <OrderListHeader />\n    </header>\n\n    <section className=\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-4 px-4 py-6\">\n      <OrderFilterBar />\n      <OrderList />\n    </section>\n\n    <footer className=\"sticky bottom-0 bg-white border-t border-gray-200 px-4 py-3\">\n      <OrderListFooterActions />\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n)\n```\n\n### What to Expose vs. Hide\n\n| Expose at usage site                    | Hide in component                  |\n| --------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| Layout structure (flex, grid, position) | Reusable styles (button variants)  |\n| Page-specific spacing and sizing        | Internal implementation details    |\n| Semantic HTML structure                 | Complexity outside current concern |\n\n- Reusable styles (buttons, cards) → abstract into components.\n- Page layout → write directly at the usage site in `screens/` pages.\n\n## 2. Spacing Selection Guide\n\n### Three Methods\n\n**flex gap** — Default for Flexbox containers:\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n  <OrderCard />\n  <OrderCard />\n</div>\n```\n\n**space-y / space-x** — Sibling elements with consistent spacing:\n\n```tsx\n<ul className=\"space-y-3\">\n  <li>\n    <ReviewItem />\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <ReviewItem />\n  </li>\n</ul>\n```\n\n**Explicit spacer div** — Single specific gap (e.g., from design spec):\n\n```tsx\n<div>\n  <OrderHeader />\n  <div className=\"h-8\" /> {/* 32px explicit gap */}\n  <OrderContent />\n</div>\n```\n\n### Decision Flow\n\n```\nNeed spacing?\n├── Inside Flexbox container?  → flex gap\n├── Repeating sibling spacing? → space-y / space-x\n├── Single explicit gap (from design spec)? → spacer div\n└── Complex conditional spacing? → individual margin/padding\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- Use gap inside flex containers to avoid margin collapsing.\n\n## 3. Responsive Images — CLS Prevention\n\nUse `aspect-ratio` + `relative` container to maintain original ratio responsively.\n\n```tsx\n// ✅ Basic responsive image\nconst Illustration = () => (\n  <div className=\"flex justify-center\">\n    <div className=\"relative w-full aspect-[327/200]\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/illustrations/order-complete.png\"\n        alt=\"Order complete\"\n        className=\"object-contain w-full h-full\"\n        loading=\"eager\"\n      />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n)\n\n// ✅ With max-width constraint\nconst Thumbnail = ({ src, alt }: { src: string; alt: string }) => (\n  <div className=\"relative w-full max-w-sm aspect-square\">\n    <img src={src} alt={alt} className=\"object-cover w-full h-full rounded-lg\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </div>\n)\n```\n\n### Key Properties\n\n| Property                          | Purpose                         |\n| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `relative`                        | Positioning anchor for children |\n| `aspect-[W/H]`                    | Maintain ratio (prevents CLS)   |\n| `w-full`                          | Fill parent width               |\n| `object-contain` / `object-cover` | Image fit mode                  |\n\n### Loading Strategy\n\n- `loading=\"eager\"`: Above-the-fold images (LCP optimization)\n- `loading=\"lazy\"`: Below-the-fold images (initial load optimization)\n\n## 4. Tailwind v4 Class Changes\n\n> This project uses **Tailwind v4**. Do NOT use v3 syntax.\n\n### Import Syntax\n\n```css\n/* ❌ v3 (forbidden) */\n@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n/* ✅ v4 */\n@import ''tailwindcss'';\n```\n\n### Class Migration Table\n\n| v3 (forbidden) | v4 (use this) |\n| -------------- | ------------- |\n| `shadow-sm`    | `shadow-xs`   |\n| `shadow`       | `shadow-sm`   |\n| `ring`         | `ring-3`      |\n| `blur`         | `blur-sm`     |\n| `rounded`      | `rounded-sm`  |\n\nReference: [Tailwind v4 Upgrade Guide](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/upgrade-guide)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:44:01.533Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Fullstack Agents needing efficient frontend styling and layout management with Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要高效前端样式和布局管理的Fullstack Agents，使用Tailwind CSS。","ja":"フルスタックエージェントが効率的なフロントエンドスタイリングとレイアウト管理を必要とする場合に適しています。Tailwind CSSを使用します。","ko":"전체 스택 에이전트가 효율적인 프론트엔드 스타일링 및 레이아웃 관리를 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. Tailwind CSS를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Fullstack que necesitan un estilo y gestión de diseño frontend eficientes con Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Fullstack ayant besoin d''un style et d''une gestion de mise en page frontend efficaces avec Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Fullstack-Agents, die eine effiziente Frontend-Styling und Layoutverwaltung mit Tailwind CSS benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Fullstack que precisam de estilização de frontend eficiente e gerenciamento de layout com Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Fullstack, которым требуется эффективная стилизация frontend и управление макетом с помощью Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميلين Fullstack الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق واجهة المستخدم الأمامية فعال و إدارة تخطيط مع Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create responsive and structured page layouts using semantic HTML and Tailwind classes, facilitating seamless v3 to v4 migrations and efficient styling patterns for quick-commerce apps.","zh":"赋予代理创建响应式和结构化页面布局的能力，使用语义HTML和Tailwind类，促进从v3到v4的无缝迁移和快速商务应用的高效样式模式。","ja":"エージェントが、意味のあるHTMLとTailwindクラスを使用して、レスポンシブで構造化されたページレイアウトを作成する機能を提供します。v3からv4への無縫な移行と、クイックコマースアプリの効率的なスタイルパターンを促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 의미 있는 HTML과 Tailwind 클래스를 사용하여 반응형 및 구조화된 페이지 레이아웃을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. v3에서 v4로의 무шов한 마이그레이션과 빠른 상업 애플리케이션의 효율적인 스타일 패턴을 촉진합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear diseños de página responsivos y estructurados utilizando HTML semántico y clases de Tailwind, facilitando migraciones sin problemas de v3 a v4 y patrones de estilo eficientes para aplicaciones de comercio rápido.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des mises en page de page responsives et structurées en utilisant du HTML sémantique et des classes Tailwind, facilitant les migrations sans problème de v3 à v4 et des modèles de style efficaces pour les applications de commerce rapide.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, responsive und strukturierte Seitenaufbauten mit semantischem HTML und Tailwind-Klassen zu erstellen, wodurch nahtlose Migrationen von v3 auf v4 und effiziente Styling-Muster für Quick-Commerce-Apps erleichtert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar layouts de página responsivos e estruturados usando HTML semântico e classes Tailwind, facilitando migrações sem problemas da versão 3 para a 4 e padrões de estilização eficientes para aplicativos de comércio rápido.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отзывчивые и структурированные макеты страниц, используя семантический HTML и классы Tailwind, что облегчает беспроблемное обновление с версии 3 на 4 и эффективные шаблоны стилизации для быстрых коммерческих приложений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تخطيطات صفحة مستجيبة ومتكاملة باستخدام HTML دلالية وفصول Tailwind، و تسهيل الانتقال السلس من الإصدار 3 إلى 4 و أنماط تنسيق فعالة لتطبيقات التجارة السريعة."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Section Compound Patterns for explicit page structure","Generating responsive images with optimized spacing","Migrating existing layouts from Tailwind v3 to v4"],"zh":["为显式页面结构实现节组合模式","生成具有优化间距的响应式图像","将现有布局从Tailwind v3迁移到v4"],"ja":["明示的なページ構造のためのセクション複合パターンの実装","最適化されたスペーシングを持つレスポンシブ画像の生成","既存のレイアウトをTailwind v3からv4に移行"],"ko":["명시적인 페이지 구조를 위한 섹션 컴파운드 패턴 구현","최적화된 간격을 가진 반응형 이미지 생성","기존 레이아웃을 Tailwind v3에서 v4로 마이그레이션"],"es":["Implementar patrones de compuestos de sección para una estructura de página explícita","Generar imágenes responsivas con espaciado optimizado","Migrar diseños de página existentes de Tailwind v3 a v4"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des modèles de composants de section pour une structure de page explicite","Générer des images responsives avec un espacement optimisé","Migrer les mises en page de page existantes de Tailwind v3 à v4"],"de":["Implementierung von Sektions-Compound-Mustern für eine explizite Seitenstruktur","Erzeugen von responsiven Bildern mit optimiertem Abstand","Migration von bestehenden Layouts von Tailwind v3 auf v4"],"pt":["Implementar padrões compostos de seção para estrutura de página explícita","Gerar imagens responsivas com espaçamento otimizado","Migrar layouts existentes do Tailwind v3 para v4"],"ru":["Реализация составных шаблонов разделов для явной структуры страницы","Генерация отзывчивых изображений с оптимизированным пробелом","Миграция существующих макетов из Tailwind v3 в v4"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنماط مركبة للقسم من أجل هيكل صفحة صريح","генерация صور مستجيب مع مسافات محسّنة","هجرة تخطيطات موجودة من Tailwind v3 إلى v4"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Tailwind CSS and semantic HTML","Specific to Tailwind v4 styling patterns","Limited to frontend styling and layout management"],"zh":["需要Tailwind CSS和语义HTML的知识","特定于Tailwind v4样式模式","仅限于前端样式和布局管理"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSと意味のあるHTMLの知識が必要","Tailwind v4スタイルパターンに特有","フロントエンドスタイリングとレイアウト管理に限定"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS와 의미 있는 HTML에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","Tailwind v4 스타일 패턴에 특정","프론트엔드 스타일링 및 레이아웃 관리에만 محدود"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Tailwind CSS y HTML semántico","Específico de patrones de estilo de Tailwind v4","Limitado a la gestión de estilo y diseño frontend"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de Tailwind CSS et de HTML sémantique","Spécifique aux modèles de style de Tailwind v4","Limité à la gestion de style et de mise en page frontend"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Tailwind CSS und semantischem HTML","Spezifisch für Tailwind-v4-Styling-Muster","Begrenzt auf Frontend-Styling und Layoutverwaltung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Tailwind CSS e HTML semântico","Específico para padrões de estilização Tailwind v4","Limitado à estilização e gerenciamento de layout de frontend"],"ru":["Требует знания Tailwind CSS и семантического HTML","Конкретно для шаблонов стилизации Tailwind v4","Ограничен стилизацией и управлением макетом frontend"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Tailwind CSS و HTML دلالية","نوعي لأنماط تنسيق Tailwind v4","محدود بالتنسيق وإدارة التخطيط لواجهة المستخدم الأمامية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"53d8cab0a1ffb030d12bbd61ffa6d11e4370fb34fbf68985bac76b03b14f8ade","qualityScore":33}');
